68=>['Draeeen Inchuntment','Remufe-a un inchuntment frum taerget fue-a. Iff un inchuntment is remufed, yuoo gaeeen 8...17 Inergy und 40...120 Heaelt.','Remufes un inchuntment frum taerget fue-a. Remufael iffffect: yuoo gaeeen 8...17 Inergy und 40...120 Heaelt.'],
69=>['Shaetter Inchuntment','Remufe-a un inchuntment frum taerget fue-a. Iff un inchuntment is remufed, thaet fue-a taekes 14...100 daemaege-a.','Remufes un inchuntment frum taerget fue-a. Remufael iffffect: deaels 14...100 daemaege-a. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
72=>['Ilementael Reseestunce-a','Fur 30...90 secunds, Yuoo gaeeen +40 aermur aegaeeenst ilementael daemaege-a, boot yuoo luse-a 24...12 aermur aegaeeenst physeecael daemaege-a.','(30...90 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +40 aermur aegaeeenst ilementael daemaege-a. Yuoo haefe-a -24...12 aermur aegaeeenst physeecael daemaege-a.'],
73=>['Physeecael Reseestunce-a','Fur 30...90 secunds, Yuoo gaeeen +40 aermur aegaeeenst physeecael daemaege-a, boot yuoo luse-a 24...12 aermur aegaeeenst ilementael daemaege-a.','(30...90 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +40 aermur aegaeeenst physeecael daemaege-a. Yuoo haefe-a -24...12 aermur aegaeeenst ilementael daemaege-a.'],
74=>['Ichu','Fur 30 secunds, Ichu is replaeced veet zee next skeell yuoo use-a. Ichu aects aes thees skeell fur 30 secunds.','(30 secunds.) Ichu becumes zee next skeell yuoo use-a (30 secunds).'],
75=>['Aercune-a Ichu','Iff yuoo caest a spell in zee next 20 secunds, Aercune-a Ichu is replaeced veet thaet spell fur 20 secunds. Aercune-a Ichu inds premaetoorely iff yuoo use-a a nun-spell skeell.','(20 secunds.) Aercune-a Ichu becumes zee next spell yuoo use-a (20 secunds). Thees inchuntment inds iff yuoo use-a uny skeell thaet is nut a spell.'],
76=>['Imaegeened Boordee','Fur 8...20 secunds, taerget fue-a mufes 50% slooer.','(8...20 secunds.) Taerget fue-a mufes 50% slooer.'],
77=>['Chaeus Sturm','Creaete-a a Chaeus Sturm aet taerget fue-a\'s lucaeshun thaet laests fur 10 secunds. Iaech secund, fues aedjaecent tu thees lucaeshun taeke-a 5...25 daemaege-a und luse-a 0...2 Inergy.','Deaels 5...25 daemaege-a und cooses 0...2 Inergy luss iaech secund (10 secunds). Heets fues aedjaecent tu taerget\'s ineeteeael lucaeshun. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
78=>['Ipeedemeec','Spreaed aell negaeteefe-a cundeeshuns und zeeur remaeeeneeng dooraeshuns frum taerget fue-a tu aell fues aedjaecent tu yuoor taerget.','Cundeeshuns oon taerget fue-a trunsffer tu aedjaecent fues.'],
79=>['Inergy Draeeen','Taerget fue-a luses 2...9 Inergy. Yuoo gaeeen 3 Inergy fur iaech pueent ooff Inergy lust.','Cooses 2...9 Inergy luss. Yuoo gaeeen 3 Inergy fur iaech pueent ooff Inergy lust.'],
80=>['Inergy Taep','Taerget fue-a luses 4...7 Inergy. Yuoo gaeeen 2 Inergy fur iaech pueent ooff Inergy lust.','Cooses 4...7 Inergy luss. Yuoo gaeeen 2 Inergy fur iaech pueent ooff Inergy lust. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
81=>['Aercune-a Theeefery','Fur 5...35 secunds, oone-a rundum spell is deesaebled fur taerget fue-a, und Aercune-a Theeefery is replaeced by thaet spell.','(5...35 secunds.) Deesaebles oone-a rundum spell. Thees skeell becumes thaet spell.'],
82=>['Muntra ooff Recaell','Fur 20 secunds, yuoo gaeeen nu beneffeet frum it. Yuoo gaeeen 10...25 Inergy vhee Muntra ooff Recaell inds.','(20 secunds.) Ind iffffect: yuoo gaeeen 10...25 Inergy.'],
83=>['Uneemaete-a Bune-a Hurrur','Ixplueet neaerest curpse-a tu uneemaete-a a lefel 1...17 bune-a hurrur.','Creaetes a lefel 1...17 bune-a hurrur. Ixplueets a fresh curpse-a.'],
84=>['Uneemaete-a Bune-a Feeend','Ixplueet neaerest curpse-a tu uneemaete-a a lefel 1...17 bune-a feeend. Bune-a feeends cun aettaeck aet runge-a.','Creaetes a lefel 1...17 bune-a feeend thaet cun aettaeck aet runge-a. Ixplueets a fresh curpse-a.'],
85=>['Uneemaete-a Bune-a Meeneeuns','Ixplueet neaerest curpse-a tu uneemaete-a tvu lefel 0...12 bune-a meeneeuns.','Creaetes tvu lefel 0...12 bune-a meeneeuns. Ixplueets a fresh curpse-a.'],
86=>['Grent\'s Baelunce-a','Iff taerget fue-a haes mure-a Heaelt thun yuoo, yuoo gaeeen haelff zee deefffference-a (up tu yuoor maexeemoom Heaelt), und thaet fue-a luses un iqooael aemuoont. Iff thees fue-a haes less Heaelt thun yuoo, yuoo luse-a haelff zee deefffference-a, und thaet fue-a gaeeens un iqooael aemuoont.','Yuoo gaeeen Heaelt iqooael tu haelff zee deefffference-a betveee yuoo und taerget, und thees fue-a luses un iqooael aemuoont. Iff thees fue-a haes less Heaelt thun yuoo, yuoo luse-a haelff zee deefffference-a und thaet fue-a gaeeens un iqooael aemuoont.'],
87=>['Feraeta\'s Gaeze-a','Iff taerget husteele-a uneemaeted undeaed haes a maester, its bund tu its maester is brukee, maekeeng it husteele-a tu aell oozeer creaetoores. Iff it haed nu maester, yuoo becume-a its maester und heael it fur 60...80. (50% faeeeloore-a chunce-a veet Deaet Maegeec 4 oor less.)','Maeke-a taerget undeaed serfunt maesterless. Iff it is aelreaedy maesterless, yuoo becume-a its maester und heael it fur 60...80. 50% faeeeloore-a chunce-a unless Deaet Maegeec 5 oor mure-a.'],
88=>['Feraeta\'s Oora','Aell husteele-a uneemaeted undeaed in zee aerea becume-a buoond tu yuoo. Feraeta\'s Oora inds aeffter 120...300 secunds. Vhee Feraeta\'s Oora inds, yuoo luse-a yuoor bund veet uny undeaed buoond tu yuoo. (50% faeeeloore-a chunce-a veet Deaet Maegeec 4 oor less.)','(120...300 secunds.) Becume-a maester ooff aell husteele-a undeaed serfunts in zee aerea. Ind iffffect: yuoor undeaed serfunts becume-a maesterless. 50% faeeeloore-a chunce-a unless Deaet Maegeec 5 oor mure-a.'],
89=>['Deaethly Cheell','Taerget fue-a is stroock fur 5...50 culd daemaege-a. Iff thaet fue-a\'s Heaelt is aebufe-a 50%, yuoo deael un aeddeeshunael 5...50 shaedoo daemaege-a.','Deaels 5...50 culd daemaege-a. Deaels 5...50 mure-a daemaege-a iff taerget fue-a vaes aebufe-a 50% Heaelt.'],
90=>['Feraeta\'s Saecreeffeece-a','Fur 5...10 secunds, yuoor undeaed aelleees gaeeen +10 Heaelt regeneraeshun. Aell cundeeshuns aere-a remufed frum thuse-a aelleees und trunsfferred tu yuoo. Iff thees spell is sooccessffool und yuoo haefe-a cuntrul ooff 3 oor fooer meeneeuns, Feraeta\'s Saecreeffeece-a instuntly rechaerges.','(5...10 secunds.) 10 undeaed aelleeed serfunts gaeeen +10 Heaelt regeneraeshun. Instuntly rechaerges iff yuoo haefe-a cuntrul ooff 3 oor fooer serfunts. Trunsffers aell cundeeshuns frum thuse-a serfunts tu yuoo.'],
91=>['Vell ooff Pooer','Ixplueet neaerest curpse-a oor saecreeffeece-a 66% heaelt tu creaete-a a Vell ooff Pooer aet thaet lucaeshun. Fur 10...30 secunds, aelleees veetheen zee aerea ooff Vell ooff Pooer gaeeen +1...6 Heaelt regeneraeshun und +2 Inergy regeneraeshun.','(10...30 secunds.) Aelleees in thees vell haefe-a +1...6 Heaelt regeneraeshun und +2 Inergy regeneraeshun. Ixplueets a fresh curpse-a oor saecreeffeeces 66% heaelt.'],
92=>['Vell ooff Bluud','Ixplueet neaerest curpse-a oor saecreeffeece-a 66% heaelt tu creaete-a a Vell ooff Bluud aet its lucaeshun. Fur 8...20 secunds, aelleees in thaet aerea receeefe-a +1...6 Heaelt regeneraeshun.','(8...20 secunds.) Aelleees in thees vell haefe-a +1...6 Heaelt regeneraeshun. Ixplueets a fresh curpse-a oor saecreeffeeces 66% heaelt.'],
93=>['Vell ooff Sooffffereeng','Ixplueet neaerest curpse-a oor saecreeffeece-a 66% heaelt tu creaete-a a Vell ooff Sooffffereeng aet its lucaeshun. Fur 10...30 secunds, fues in thaet aerea sooffffer -1...6 Heaelt degeneraeshun.','(10...30 secunds.) Fues in thees vell haefe-a -1...6 Heaelt degeneraeshun. Ixplueets a fresh curpse-a oor saecreeffeeces 66% heaelt.'],
94=>['Vell ooff zee Pruffune-a','Ixplueet neaerest curpse-a oor saecreeffeece-a 66% heaelt tu creaete-a a Vell ooff zee Pruffune-a aet its lucaeshun. Fur 8...20 secunds, fues in thaet aerea aere-a streepped ooff aell inchuntments und cunnut be-a zee taerget ooff foorzeer inchuntments. (50% faeeeloore-a chunce-a veet Deaet Maegeec 4 oor less.)','(8...20 secunds.) Fues in thees vell luse-a aell inchuntments und cunnut be-a zee taerget ooff foorzeer inchuntments. Ixplueets a fresh curpse-a oor saecreeffeeces 66% heaelt. 50% faeeeloore-a chunce-a unless Deaet Maegeec 5 oor mure-a.'],
95=>['Pootreed Ixpluseeun','Zee curpse-a neaerest yuoor taerget ixpludes, sendeeng oooot a shuckvaefe-a thaet deaels 24...120 daemaege-a tu neaerby fues.','Ixpludes a curpse-a, deaeleeng 24...120 daemaege-a tu fues neaer it. Ixplueets a fresh curpse-a.'],
96=>['Suool Feaest','Ixplueet neaerest curpse-a tu gaeeen 50...280 Heaelt.','Yuoo gaeeen 50...280 Heaelt. Ixplueets a fresh curpse-a.'],
97=>['Necruteec Traefersael','Ixplueet a rundum curpse-a oor saecreeffeece-a 30...20% heaelt tu telepurt tu taerget fue-a\'s lucaeshun. Yuoo becume-a Deeseaesed fur 6 secunds und aell neaerby fues becume-a Pueesuned fur 5...20 secunds.','Ixplueet a rundum curpse-a oor saecreeffeece-a 30...20% heaelt tu telepurt tu taerget fue-a\'s lucaeshun. Yuoo becume-a Deeseaesed fur 6 secunds und aell neaerby fues becume-a Pueesuned fur 5...20 secunds.'],
98=>['Cunsoome-a Curpse-a','Ixplueet a rundum taerget. Yuoo telepurt tu thaet curpse-a\'s lucaeshun und gaeeen 25...100 Heaelt und 5...20 Inergy.','Telepurt tu a curpse-a\'s lucaeshun. Yuoo gaeeen 25...100 Heaelt und 5...20 Inergy. Ixplueets a fresh curpse-a.'],
99=>['Paeraeseeteec Bund','Fur 20 secunds, taerget fue-a sooffffers -1 Heaelt degeneraeshun. Zee caester is heaeled fur 30...120 vhee Paeraeseeteec Bund inds.','(20 secunds.) Cooses -1 Heaelt degeneraeshun. Ind iffffect: yuoo aere-a heaeled fur 30...120 Heaelt.'],
100=>['Suool Baerbs','Fur 30 secunds, taerget fue-a taekes 15...30 daemaege-a vhee un inchuntment oor hex is caest oon thaet taerget. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(30 secunds.) Deaels 15...30 daemaege-a vhee un inchuntment oor hex is caest oon taerget fue-a.'],
101=>['Baerbs','Fur 30 secunds, taerget fue-a taekes 4...16 mure-a daemaege-a vhee heet by physeecael daemaege-a.','(30 secunds.) Taerget fue-a taekes 4...16 daemaege-a vhenefer it taekes physeecael daemaege-a.'],
102=>['Shaedoo Streeke-a','Taerget fue-a taekes 12...48 shaedoo daemaege-a. Iff thaet fue-a\'s Heaelt is aebufe-a 50%, yuoo steael up tu 12...48 Heaelt.','Deaels 12...48 daemaege-a. Steael up tu 12...48 Heaelt iff thees fue-a vaes aebufe-a 50% Heaelt.'],
103=>['Preece-a ooff Faeeeloore-a','Fur 30 secunds, taerget fue-a haes a 25% chunce-a tu meess veet aettaecks und taekes 1...46 daemaege-a vhenefer thaet fue-a faeeels tu heet in cumbaet.','(30 secunds.) 25% chunce-a tu meess. Taerget fue-a taekes 1...46 daemaege-a vhenefer it faeeels tu heet.'],
104=>['Deaet Nufa','Fur 30 secunds, iff taerget aelly deees, aell aedjaecent fues taeke-a 26...100 daemaege-a und aere-a Pueesuned fur 15 secunds. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(30 secunds.) Deaels 26...100 daemaege-a und inffleects Pueesuned cundeeshun (15 secunds) oon aedjaecent fues iff taerget aelly deees.'],
105=>['Deaethly Svaerm','Deaethly Svaerm fleees oooot slooly und streekes fur 30...90 culd daemaege-a oon up tu three-a taergets in zee aerea. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Deaethly Svaerm fleees oooot slooly und deaels 30...90 culd daemaege-a. Heets tvu aeddeeshunael fues in zee aerea.'],
106=>['Rutteeng Flesh','Taerget fleshy fue-a becumes Deeseaesed fur 10...25 secunds, slooly luseeng Heaelt.','Inffleects Deeseaesed cundeeshun (10...25 secunds).'],
107=>['Furoolence-a','Iff taerget fue-a vaes aelreaedy sooffffereeng frum a cundeeshun, thaet fue-a sooffffers frum Deeseaese-a, Pueesun, und Veaekness fur 3...15 secunds.','Inffleects Deeseaese-a, Pueesun, und Veaekness cundeeshuns (3...15 secunds). Nu iffffect unless thees fue-a aelreaedy haed a cundeeshun.'],
108=>['Sooffffereeng','Fur 6...30 secunds, taerget fue-a und aell neaerby fues sooffffer -0...3 Heaelt degeneraeshun.','Aelsu hexes fues neaer taerget (6...30 secunds). Zeese-a fues haefe-a -0...3 Heaelt degeneraeshun.'],
109=>['Leeffe-a Seephun','Fur 12...24 secunds, taerget fue-a sooffffers -1...3 Heaelt degeneraeshun, und yuoo gaeeen +1...3 Heaelt regeneraeshun.','(12...24 secunds.) Taerget fue-a haes -1...3 Heaelt degeneraeshun. Yuoo haefe-a +1...3 Heaelt regeneraeshun.'],
110=>['Unhuly Feaest','Steael up tu 10...65 Heaelt frum up tu 1...4 fues in zee aerea.','Steaels 10...65 Heaelt frum 1...4 fue-as in zee aerea aeruoond yuoo.'],
111=>['Aevaekee zee Bluud','Fur 20...44 secunds, yuoo gaeeen +2 Bluud Maegeec und +2 Coorses, boot vhenefer yuoo saecreeffeece-a Heaelt, yuoo saecreeffeece-a 50% mure-a thun zee nurmael aemuoont.','(20...44 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +2 Bluud Maegeec und Coorses. Saecreeffeece-a 50% mure-a Heaelt thun nurmael.'],
112=>['Desecraete-a Inchuntments','Taerget fue-a und aell neaerby fues taeke-a 6...60 shaedoo daemaege-a und 4...20 shaedoo daemaege-a fur iaech inchuntment oon zeem.','Deaels 6...60 daemaege-a tu taerget und neaerby fues. Deaels 4...20 mure-a daemaege-a fur iaech inchuntment oon zeem.'],
113=>['Taeeented Flesh','Fur 20...44 secunds, aelleees in zee aerea aere-a immoone-a tu deeseaese-a, und unyune-a streekeeng thuse-a aelleees in melee-a becumes Deeseaesed fur 3...15 secunds.','(20...44 secunds.) Fues vhu heet aelleees in zee aerea veet melee-a becume-a Deeseaesed (3...15 secunds); thees aelly is immoone-a tu Deeseaese-a.'],
114=>['Oora ooff zee Leech','Aell curpses veetheen iaershut aere-a ixplueeted und yuoo uneemaete-a a lefel 1...17 bune-a hurrur ploos oone-a fur iaech curpse-a ixplueeted in thees vaey. Fur 5...45 secunds, yuoor Deaet Maegeec aettreeboote-a is increaesed by +1.','Ixplueet aell curpses in iaershut. Uneemaetes a lefel 1...17 bune-a hurrur, ploos oone-a fur iaech ixplueeted curpse-a. Yuoo haefe-a +1 Deaet Maegeec (5...45 secunds).'],
115=>['Bluud Renooael','Fur 7 secunds, yuoo gaeeen +3...6 Heaelt regeneraeshun. Vhee Bluud Renooael inds, yuoo gaeeen 40...190 Heaelt.','(7 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +3...6 Heaelt regeneraeshun. Ind iffffect: heaels yuoo fur 40...190.'],
116=>['Daerk Oora','Fur 30 secunds, vhenefer taerget aelly saecreeffeeces Heaelt, Daerk Oora deaels 5...50 shaedoo daemaege-a tu aedjaecent fues, und yuoo luse-a 5...20 Heaelt.','(30 secunds.) Deaels 5...50 daemaege-a tu aedjaecent fues vhenefer taerget aelly saecreeffeeces Heaelt. Daemaege-a cust: yuoo luse-a 5...20 Heaelt.'],
117=>['Inffeeble-a','Taerget sooffffers frum Veaekness fur 10...30 secunds.','Inffleects Veaekness cundeeshun (10...30 secunds).'],
118=>['Inffeebleeng Bluud','Taerget fue-a und aell neaerby fues sooffffer frum Veaekness fur 5...20 secunds. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Inffleects Veaekness cundeeshun (5...20 secunds) oon thees fue-a und neaerby fues.'],
119=>['Bluud is Pooer','Fur 10 secunds, taerget oozeer aelly gaeeens +3...6 Inergy regeneraeshun.','(10 secunds.) +3...6 Inergy regeneraeshun. Cunnut selff-taerget.'],
120=>['Bluud ooff zee Maester','Aell ooff yuoor undeaed aelleees aere-a heaeled fur 30...116 Heaelt. Yuoo saecreeffeece-a un aeddeeshunael 2% maexeemoom Heaelt per meeneeun heaeled in thees vaey.','Heaels yuoor undeaed serfunts fur 30...116. Heaeleeng cust: +2% Heaelt saecreeffeece-a per serfunt heaeled.'],
121=>['Speeteffool Spureet','Fur 10...25 secunds, vhenefer taerget fue-a aettaecks oor uses a skeell, Speeteffool Spureet deaels 15...45 shaedoo daemaege-a tu thaet fue-a und aell aedjaecent aelleees ooff thaet fue-a.','(10...25 secunds.) Deaels 15...45 daemaege-a tu taerget und aedjaecent fues vhenefer thees fue-a aettaecks oor uses a skeell.'],
122=>['Maeleegn Interfenshun','Fur 5...20 secunds, taerget fue-a receeefes 20% less beneffeet frum heaeleeng. Iff taerget fue-a deees vheele-a hexed veet Maeleegn Interfenshun, a lefel 1...17 maesterless bune-a hurrur is soommuned.','(5...20 secunds.) Taerget fue-a receeefes 20% less frum heaeleeng. Iff thees fue-a deees vheele-a sooffffereeng frum thees hex, a lefel 1...17 maesterless bune-a hurrur is soommuned.'],
123=>['Inseedeeuoos Paeraeseete-a','Fur 5...15 secunds, vhenefer taerget fue-a heets veet un aettaeck, yuoo steael up tu 15...45 Heaelt frum thaet fue-a.','(5...15 secunds.) Steael 15...45 Heaelt vhenefer taerget fue-a heets veet un aettaeck.'],
124=>['Speenael Sheefers','Fur 10...40 secunds, vhenefer taerget fue-a is stroock fur culd daemaege-a vheele-a useeng a skeell, thaet fue-a is interroopted, und yuoo luse-a 8...3 Inergy oor Speenael Sheefers inds.','(10...40 secunds.) Culd daemaege-a interroopts taerget fue-a\'s skeells. Interroopshun cust: yuoo luse-a 8...3 Inergy oor Speenael Sheefers inds.'],
125=>['Veezeer','Fur 5...35 secunds, taerget fue-a sooffffers -2...4 Heaelt degeneraeshun und -1 Inergy degeneraeshun. Iff taerget fue-a\'s Inergy reaeches 0, thaet fue-a taekes 15...75 daemaege-a und Veezeer inds.','(5...35 secunds.) Cooses -2...4 Heaelt degeneraeshun und -1 Inergy degeneraeshun. Deaels 15...75 daemaege-a iff taerget fue-a\'s Inergy drups tu 0. Inds iff thees fue-a\'s Inergy drups tu 0.'],
126=>['Leeffe-a Trunsffer','Fur 6...12 secunds, taerget fue-a und aedjaecent fues sooffffer -3...8 Heaelt degeneraeshun, vheech yuoo gaeeen aes Heaelt regeneraeshun.','Aelsu hexes fues aedjaecent tu taerget (6...12 secunds). Cooses -3...8 Heaelt degeneraeshun. Yuoo haefe-a +3...8 Heaelt regeneraeshun.'],
127=>['Maerk ooff Soobferseeun','Fur 6 secunds, zee next teeme-a taerget fue-a caests a spell thaet taergets un aelly ooff thaet fue-a, zee spell faeeels und yuoo steael up tu 10...92 Heaelt frum thaet fue-a.','(6 secunds.) Taerget fue-a\'s next spell faeeels und yuoo steael 10...92 Heaelt. Nu iffffect unless thees fue-a\'s spell taergeted oone-a ooff its aelleees.'],
128=>['Suool Leech','Fur 10 secunds, vhenefer taerget fue-a caests a spell, yuoo steael up tu 16...80 Heaelt frum thaet fue-a. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(10 secunds.) Steael 16...80 Heaelt vhenefer taerget fue-a caests a spell.'],
129=>['Deffeele-a Flesh','Fur 5...35 secunds, taerget fue-a gaeeens oonly tvu-thurds Heaelt frum heaeleeng. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(5...35 secunds.) Redooces heaeleeng taerget fue-a receeefes by 33%. Oonly skeells veet zee vurd "heael" in zee descreepshun aere-a aeffffected.'],
130=>['Demuneec Flesh','Fur 30...60 secunds, vhenefer yuoo use-a a skeell thaet taergets a fue-a, yuoo deael 5...20 shaedoo daemaege-a tu aell oozeer fues aedjaecent tu yuoo.','(30...60 secunds.) Vhee useeng a skeell oon a fue-a, deael 5...20 shaedoo daemaege-a tu aell oozeer fues aedjaecent tu yuoo.'],
131=>['Baerbed Seegnet','Yuoo inffleect Bleedeeng fur 3...15 secunds oon taerget fue-a und aell aedjaecent fues.','Taerget und aedjaecent fues sooffffer frum Bleedeeng (3...15 secunds).'],
132=>['Plaegooe-a Seegnet','Trunsffer aell negaeteefe-a cundeeshuns veet 100...200% ooff zeeur remaeeeneeng dooraeshuns frum yuoorselff tu taerget fue-a. (50% faeeeloore-a chunce-a veet Coorses 4 oor less.)','Trunsffers aell cundeeshuns veet 100...200% ooff zeeur remaeeeneeng dooraeshuns frum yuoorselff tu taerget fue-a. 50% faeeeloore-a chunce-a unless Coorses 5 oor mure-a.'],
133=>['Daerk Paect','Deael 20...60 shaedoo daemaege-a tu taerget fue-a.','Deaels 20...60 daemaege-a.'],
134=>['Oorder ooff Paeeen','Fur 5 secunds, vhenefer a paerty member heets a fue-a veet physeecael daemaege-a, thaet paerty member dues +3...16 daemaege-a.','Inchunts aell paerty members (5 secunds). 3...16 mure-a daemaege-a vhenefer zeese-a paerty members heet veet physeecael daemaege-a.'],
135=>['Faeeenzeeaertedness','Fur zee next 4...18 secunds, taerget fue-a aettaecks 50% slooer, und thaet fue-a sooffffers -1...3 Heaelt degeneraeshun.','(4...18 secunds.) Taerget fue-a aettaecks 50% slooer und haes -1...3 Heaelt degeneraeshun.'],
136=>['Shaedoo ooff Feaer','Taerget fue-a und aell aedjaecent fues aettaeck 50% slooer fur zee next 5...30 secunds.','Aelsu hexes fues aedjaecent tu taerget (5...30 secunds). Zeey aettaeck 50% slooer.'],
137=>['Reegur Murtees','Fur 8...20 secunds, taerget fue-a cunnut bluck.','(8...20 secunds.) Taerget fue-a cunnut bluck.'],
138=>['Daerk Bund','Fur zee next 30...60 secunds, vhenefer yuoo receeefe-a daemaege-a, yuoor clusest meeneeun sooffffers 75% ooff thaet daemaege-a fur yuoo.','(30...60 secunds.) Trunsffers 75% ooff incumeeng daemaege-a frum yuoo tu yuoor neaerest serfunt.'],
139=>['Inffoose-a Cundeeshun','Fur zee next 15...60 secunds, vhenefer yuoo receeefe-a a cundeeshun, thaet cundeeshun is trunsfferred tu yuoor clusest meeneeun insteaed.','(15...60 secunds.) Vhenefer yuoo receeefe-a a cundeeshun, it trunsffers frum yuoo tu yuoor clusest undeaed serfunt.'],
140=>['Maelaeeese-a','Fur 5...35 secunds, taerget fue-a sooffffers -1 Inergy degeneraeshun und yuoo sooffffer -1 Heaelt degeneraeshun. Iff taerget fue-a\'s Inergy reaeches 0, thaet fue-a taekes 5...50 daemaege-a und Maelaeeese-a inds. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(5...35 secunds.) Cooses -1 Inergy degeneraeshun. Deaels 5...50 daemaege-a iff taerget fue-a\'s Inergy drups tu 0. Yuoo haefe-a -1 Heaelt degeneraeshun. Inds iff thees fue-a\'s Inergy drups tu 0.'],
141=>['Rend Inchuntments','Remufe-a 5...9 inchuntments frum taerget fue-a. Fur iaech Munk inchuntment remufed, yuoo luse-a 55...25 Heaelt.','Remufes 5...9 inchuntments frum taerget fue-a. Remufael cust: yuoo luse-a 55...25 Heaelt fur iaech Munk inchuntment remufed.'],
142=>['Leengereeng Coorse-a','Fur 6...30 secunds, taerget fue-a und aell neaerby fues sooffffer -1...4 Heaelt degeneraeshun, und receeefe-a 25% less beneffeet frum heaeleeng.','(6...30 secunds.) Taerget und neaerby fues haefe-a -1...4 Heaelt degeneraeshun und receeefe-a 25% less beneffeet frum heaeleeng.'],
143=>['Streep Inchuntment','Remufe-a 0...2 inchuntments frum taerget fue-a. Iff un inchuntment is remufed, yuoo steael 5...65 Heaelt.','Remufes 0...2 inchuntments frum taerget fue-a. Remufael iffffect: yuoo steael 5...65 Heaelt.'],
144=>['Cheelblaeeens','Yuoo becume-a Pueesuned fur 10 secunds. Fues in zee aerea ooff yuoor taerget aere-a stroock fur 10...44 culd daemaege-a und luse-a 1...2 inchuntments.','Deaels 10...44 culd daemaege-a tu fues in zee aerea aeruoond yuoor taerget; remufes 1...2 inchuntments frum zeese-a fues. Yuoo aere-a Pueesuned (10 secunds).'],
145=>['Seegnet ooff Aeguny','Yuoo sooffffer frum Bleedeeng fur 25 secunds. Aell neaerby fues taeke-a 10...70 daemaege-a.','Deaels 10...70 daemaege-a tu fues neaer yuoo. Yuoo begeen Bleedeeng (25 secunds).'],
146=>['Ooffffereeng ooff Bluud','Yuoo gaeeen 8...20 Inergy.','Yuoo gaeeen 8...20 Inergy.'],
147=>['Daerk Foory','Fur 5 secunds, vhenefer uny paerty member heets veet un aettaeck, thaet paerty member gaeeens oone-a heet ooff aedrenaeleene-a. (50% faeeeloore-a chunce-a veet Bluud Maegeec ooff 4 oor less.)','Inchunts paerty members (5 secunds). Zeese-a paerty members gaeeen oone-a streeke-a ooff aedrenaeleene-a iaech teeme-a zeey heet veet un aettaeck. 50% faeeeloore-a chunce-a unless Bluud Maegeec 5 oor mure-a.'],
148=>['Oorder ooff zee Faempure-a','Fur 5 secunds, vhenefer a paerty member vhu is nut under zee iffffects ooff unuzeer Necrumuncer inchuntment heets a fue-a veet physeecael daemaege-a, thaet paerty member steaels up tu 3...16 Heaelt.','Inchunts aell paerty members (5 secunds.) Zeese-a paerty members steael 3...16 Heaelt veet iaech physeecael daemaege-a aettaeck. Paerty members under unuzeer Necrumuncer inchuntment aere-a nut aeffffected.'],
149=>['Plaegooe-a Sendeeng','Trunsffer 1...3 negaeteefe-a cundeeshuns und their remaeeeneeng dooraeshuns frum yuoorselff tu taerget fue-a und aell aedjaecent fues.','Trunsffer 1...3 cundeeshuns und their remaeeeneeng dooraeshuns frum yuoorselff tu taerget fue-a und aell aedjaecent fues.'],
150=>['Maerk ooff Paeeen','Fur 30 secunds, vhenefer taerget fue-a taekes physeecael daemaege-a, Maerk ooff Paeeen deaels 10...40 shaedoo daemaege-a tu aedjaecent fues.','(30 secunds.) Deaels 10...40 daemaege-a tu aedjaecent fues vhenefer taerget fue-a taekes physeecael daemaege-a.'],
151=>['Feaest ooff Curroopshun','Taerget fue-a und aell aedjaecent fues aere-a stroock fur 16...80 shaedoo daemaege-a. Yuoo steael up tu 8...40 Heaelt frum iaech stroock fue-a vhu is sooffffereeng frum a hex.','Deaels 16...80 daemaege-a tu taerget und aedjaecent fues. Steael 8...40 Heaelt frum iaech hexed fue-a.'],
152=>['Taeste-a ooff Deaet','Steael up tu 100...400 Heaelt frum taerget uneemaeted undeaed aelly.','Steaels 100...400 Heaelt frum aelleeed undeaed serfunt.'],
153=>['Faempureec Gaeze-a','Steael up tu 18...60 Heaelt frum taerget fue-a.','Steaels 18...60 Heaelt.'],
154=>['Plaegooe-a Tuooch','Trunsffer 1...3 negaeteefe-a cundeeshuns und their remaeeeneeng dooraeshuns frum yuoorselff tu taerget tuooched fue-a.','Trunsffers 1...3 cundeeshuns frum yuoorselff tu taerget fue-a.'],
155=>['Feele-a Tuooch','Tuooch taerget fue-a tu deael 20...65 daemaege-a.','Deaels 20...65 daemaege-a.'],
156=>['Faempureec Tuooch','Tuooch taerget fue-a tu steael up tu 29...74 Heaelt.','Steaels 29...74 Heaelt.'],
157=>['Bluud Reetooael','Fur 8...14 secunds, taerget tuooched aelly gaeeens +3 Inergy regeneraeshun. Bluud Reetooael cunnut be-a used oon zee caester.','(8...14 secunds.) +3 Inergy regeneraeshun. Cunnut selff-taerget.'],
158=>['Tuooch ooff Aeguny','Taerget tuooched fue-a taekes 20...58 shaedoo daemaege-a.','Deaels 20...58 daemaege-a.'],
159=>['Veaekee Aermur','Taerget fue-a und fues aedjaecent tu yuoor taerget haefe-a Craecked Aermur fur 5...20 secunds.','Aelsu aeffffects aedjaecent fues. Inffleects Craecked Aermur cundeeshun (5...20 secunds).'],
160=>['Veendburne-a Speed','Fur 5...13 secunds, taerget aelly mufes 33% faester.','(5...13 secunds.) Taerget aelly mufes 33% faester.'],
162=>['Gaele-a','Knuck doon taerget fue-a fur 2 secunds. (50% faeeeloore-a chunce-a veet Aeur Maegeec 4 oor less.)','Cooses knuck-doon. 50% faeeeloore-a chunce-a unless Aeur Maegeec 5 oor mure-a.'],
163=>['Vhurlveend','Aell aedjaecent fues taeke-a 15...75 culd daemaege-a. Aettaeckeeng fues stroock by Vhurlveend aere-a knucked doon. Iff yuoo aere-a Oofercaest, thees spell streekes neaerby insteaed ooff aedjaecent.','Heets fues aedjaecent tu yuoo. Deaels 15...75 culd daemaege-a. Cooses knuck-doon tu aettaeckeeng fues. Streekes neaerby insteaed ooff aedjaecent iff Oofercaest.'],
164=>['Ilementael Aettoonement','Fur 25...60 secunds, yuoo aere-a aettooned tu Aeur, Fure-a, Vaeter, und Iaert und gaeeen +1...2 tu zeese-a aettreebootes. Yuoo gaeeen 1 Inergy ploos 50% ooff zee baese-a Inergy cust ooff zee skeell iaech teeme-a yuoo use-a maegeec aessuceeaeted veet uny ooff zeese-a ilements.','(25...60 secunds.) Yuoor ilementael aettreebootes aere-a increaesed by +1...2. Yuoo gaeeen 1 ploos 50% ooff zee baese-a Inergy cust ooff uny Aeur, Fure-a, Vaeter, und Iaert Maegeec skeells yuoo use-a.'],
165=>['Aermur ooff Iaert','Fur 30 secunds, yuoo gaeeen 24...60 aermur, boot mufe-a 50...14% slooer. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(30 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +24...60 aermur. Yuoo mufe-a 50...14% slooer.'],
166=>['Keeneteec Aermur','Fur 12 secunds, yuoo gaeeen +20...80 aermur. Vhenefer yuoo caest a spell, Keeneteec Aermur is renooed fur 12 secunds.','(12 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +20...80 aermur. Renooael bunoos: caest a spell.'],
167=>['Iroopshun','Coose-a un Iroopshun aet taerget fue-a\'s lucaeshun. Iaech secund fur 5 secunds, fues neaer thees lucaeshun aere-a stroock fur 10...40 iaert daemaege-a und aere-a Bleended fur 10 secunds.','Deaels 10...40 iaert daemaege-a iaech secund (5 secunds). Heets fues neaer taerget\'s ineeteeael lucaeshun. Inffleects Bleendness cundeeshun (10 secunds).'],
168=>['Maegneteec Oora','Fur 1...8 secunds, yuoo bluck zee next aettaeck aegaeeenst yuoo und deael 10...50 daemaege-a tu yuoor aettaecker. Iff yuoo aere-a Oofercaest, aell paerty members in iaershut aere-a aelsu inchunted.','(1...8 secunds.) Bluck zee next aettaeck aegaeeenst yuoo und refflect 10...50 daemaege-a tu zee aettaecker. Iff yuoo aere-a Oofercaest, inchunt paerty members in iaershut.'],
169=>['Iaert Aettoonement','Fur 36...60 secunds, yuoo aere-a aettooned tu Iaert. Yuoo gaeeen 1 Inergy ploos 30% ooff zee baese-a Inergy cust ooff zee skeell iaech teeme-a yuoo use-a Iaert Maegeec.','(36...60 secunds.) Yuoo gaeeen 1 Inergy ploos 30% ooff zee Inergy cust vhee yuoo use-a un Iaert Maegeec skeell.'],
170=>['Iaerthqooaeke-a','Yuoo infuke-a un Iaerthqooaeke-a aet taerget fue-a\'s lucaeshun. Aell fues neaer thees lucaeshun aere-a knucked doon und aere-a stroock fur 26...100 iaert daemaege-a.','Deaels 26...100 iaert daemaege-a. Aelsu heets fues neaer taerget. Cooses knuck-doon.'],
171=>['Stuneeng','Send oooot a laerge-a stune-a, streekeeng taerget fue-a fur 45...105 iaert daemaege-a iff it heets. Iff Stuneeng heets a fue-a sooffffereeng frum Veaekness, thaet fue-a is knucked doon.','Prujecteele-a: deaels 45...105 iaert daemaege-a. Cooses knuck-doon iff taerget fue-a is Veaekened.'],
172=>['Stune-a Daeggers','Send oooot tvu Stune-a Daeggers. Iaech Stune-a Daegger streekes taerget fue-a fur 8...33 iaert daemaege-a iff it heets. Iff yuoo aere-a Oofercaest, iaech prujecteele-a inffleects Bleedeeng fur 1...5 secunds.','Tvu prujecteeles: iaech deaels 8...33 iaert daemaege-a. Iff Oofercaest, coose-a Bleedeeng fur 1...5 secunds.'],
173=>['Graespeeng Iaert','Fur 5...20 secunds, aell neaerby fues mufe-a 50% slooer.','Hexes fues neaer yuoo (5...20 secunds). Zeese-a fues mufe-a 50% slooer. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
174=>['Aefftershuck','Neaerby fues aere-a stroock fur 15...85 iaert daemaege-a. Knucked doon fues aere-a stroock fur 15...85 aeddeeshunael iaert daemaege-a.','Deaels 15...85 iaert daemaege-a tu neaerby fues. Deaels 15...85 mure-a iaert daemaege-a tu knucked doon fues.'],
175=>['Vaerd Aegaeeenst Ilements','Yuoo creaete-a a Vaerd Aegaeeenst Ilements aet yuoor coorrent lucaeshun. Fur 8...20 secunds, nun-spureet aelleees in thees aerea gaeeen +24 aermur aegaeeenst ilementael daemaege-a.','(8...20 secunds.) Aelleees in thees vaerd haefe-a +24 aermur aegaeeenst ilementael daemaege-a. Spureets aere-a unaeffffected.'],
176=>['Vaerd Aegaeeenst Melee-a','Yuoo creaete-a a Vaerd Aegaeeenst Melee-a aet yuoor coorrent lucaeshun. Fur 5...20 secunds, nun-spureet aelleees in thees aerea haefe-a a 50% chunce-a tu bluck melee-a aettaecks.','(5...20 secunds.) Aelleees in thees vaerd haefe-a a 50% chunce-a tu bluck melee-a aettaecks. Aelleeed spureets aere-a nut aeffffected.'],
177=>['Vaerd Aegaeeenst Fues','Yuoo creaete-a a Vaerd Aegaeeenst Fues aet yuoor coorrent lucaeshun. Fur 8...20 secunds, nun-spureet fues in thees aerea mufe-a 50% slooer.','(8...20 secunds.) Fues in thees vaerd mufe-a 50% slooer. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
178=>['Izeer Prudeegy','Luse-a aell inchuntments. Fur 8...20 secunds, yuoo gaeeen +6 Inergy regeneraeshun. Vhee Izeer Prudeegy inds, yuoo luse-a 2 Heaelt fur iaech pueent ooff Inergy yuoo haefe-a.','(8...20 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +6 Inergy regeneraeshun. Ind iffffect: luse-a 2 Heaelt fur iaech pueent ooff Inergy yuoo haefe-a. Luse-a aell inchuntments.'],
179=>['Incendeeaery Bunds','Aeffter 3 secunds, taerget fue-a und aell neaerby fues aere-a stroock fur 20...80 fure-a daemaege-a und aere-a set oon fure-a fur 1...3 secunds. Aecteefaetes iaerly iff taerget fue-a deees.','(3 secunds.) Ind iffffect: deaels 20...80 fure-a daemaege-a und inffleects Boorneeng cundeeshun (1...3 secunds) tu fues neaer yuoor taerget. Aelsu treeggers iff fue-a deees.'],
180=>['Oora ooff Resturaeshun','Fur 60 secunds, yuoo gaeeen 0...1 Inergy und aere-a heaeled fur 200...500% ooff zee Inergy cust iaech teeme-a yuoo caest a spell. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(60 secunds.) Yuoo gaeeen 0...1 Inergy und aere-a heaeled fur 200...500% ooff zee Inergy cust iaech teeme-a yuoo caest a spell.'],
181=>['Izeer Renooael','Fur 5...20 secunds, iaech teeme-a yuoo caest a spell, yuoo gaeeen 1...4 Inergy und 5...20 Heaelt fur iaech inchuntment oon yuoo.','(5...20 secunds.) Iaech teeme-a yuoo caest a spell, yuoo gaeeen 1...4 Inergy und 5...20 Heaelt fur iaech inchuntment oon yuoo.'],
182=>['Cunjoore-a Flaeme-a','Fur 60 secunds, iff yuoo\'re-a veeeldeeng a fure-a veaepun, yuoor aettaecks streeke-a fur un aeddeeshunael 5...20 fure-a daemaege-a.','(60 secunds.) Yuoor aettaecks heet fur +5...20 fure-a daemaege-a. Nu iffffect unless yuoor veaepun deaels fure-a daemaege-a.'],
183=>['Inffernu','Aell aedjaecent fues aere-a stroock fur 30...135 fure-a daemaege-a.','Deaels 30...135 fure-a daemaege-a tu fues aedjaecent tu yuoo.'],
184=>['Fure-a Aettoonement','Fur 36...60 secunds, yuoo aere-a aettooned tu Fure-a. Yuoo gaeeen 1 Inergy ploos 30% ooff zee baese-a Inergy cust ooff zee skeell iaech teeme-a yuoo use-a Fure-a Maegeec.','(36...60 secunds.) Yuoo gaeeen 1 Inergy ploos 30% ooff zee Inergy cust vhee yuoo use-a a Fure-a Maegeec skeell.'],
185=>['Meend Boorn','Taerget fue-a und aell aedjaecent fues taeke-a 15...60 fure-a daemaege-a. Iff yuoo haefe-a mure-a Inergy thun taerget fue-a, thaet fue-a und aell aedjaecent fues taeke-a un aeddeeshunael 15...60 fure-a daemaege-a und aere-a set oon fure-a fur 1...10 secunds.','Deaels 15...60 fure-a daemaege-a. Iff yuoo haefe-a mure-a Inergy thun taerget fue-a, deaels 15...60 mure-a fure-a daemaege-a und inffleects Boorneeng (1...10 secunds). Aelsu heets aedjaecent fues.'],
186=>['Furebaell','Send oooot a baell ooff fure-a thaet streekes taerget fue-a und aell neaerby fues fur 7...112 fure-a daemaege-a.','Prujecteele-a: deaels 7...112 fure-a daemaege-a tu taerget und neaerby fues.'],
187=>['Meteur','Taerget fue-a und aell aedjaecent fues aere-a stroock fur 7...112 fure-a daemaege-a und knucked doon. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Deaels 7...112 fure-a daemaege-a und cooses knuck-doon. Aelsu heets fues aedjaecent tu taerget fue-a.'],
188=>['Flaeme-a Boorst','Aell neaerby fues aere-a stroock fur 15...120 fure-a daemaege-a.','Deaels 15...120 fure-a daemaege-a tu aell fues neaer yuoo.'],
189=>['Rudgurt\'s Infucaeshun','Taerget fue-a und aell neaerby fues aere-a stroock fur 15...120 fure-a daemaege-a und set oon fure-a fur 1...3 secunds.','Deaels 15...120 fure-a daemaege-a. Aelsu aeffffects fues neaer yuoor taerget. Inffleects Boorneeng cundeeshun (1...3 secunds).'],
190=>['Maerk ooff Rudgurt','Taerget fue-a und aell neaerby fues aere-a hexed veet Maerk ooff Rudgurt. Fur 10...35 secunds, vhenefer iaech fue-a is stroock fur fure-a daemaege-a, thaet fue-a is set oon fure-a fur 1...4 secunds.','Aelsu hexes fues neaer yuoor taerget (10...35 secunds). Inffleects Boorneeng cundeeshun (1...4 secunds) vhee zeese-a fues taeke-a fure-a daemaege-a. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
191=>['Immulaete-a','Taerget fue-a is stroock fur 20...75 fure-a daemaege-a und is set oon fure-a fur 1...3 secunds.','Deaels 20...75 fure-a daemaege-a. Inffleects Boorneeng cundeeshun (1...3 secunds).'],
192=>['Meteur Shooer','Creaete-a a Meteur Shooer aet taerget fue-a\'s lucaeshun. Fur 9 secunds, fues aedjaecent tu thaet lucaeshun aere-a stroock fur 7...112 fure-a daemaege-a und knucked doon ifery 3 secunds.','Deaels 7...112 fure-a daemaege-a und cooses knuck-doon ifery 3 secunds (9 secunds). Heets fues aedjaecent tu taerget\'s ineeteeael lucaeshun.'],
193=>['Phueneex','A feeery Phueneex reeses aet yuoor lucaeshun und fleees oooot tu yuoor taerget, ixpludeeng oon impaect. Thees ixpluseeun streekes yuoor taerget und neaerby fues fur 10...60 fure-a daemaege-a. Iff yuoo aere-a Oofercaest, aelleees in zee blaest raedeeoos aere-a heaeled fur 20...80 Heaelt. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Prujecteele-a: deaels 10...60 fure-a daemaege-a tu taerget und neaerby fues. Heaels aelleees fur 20...80 iff yuoo aere-a Oofercaest.'],
194=>['Flaere-a','Send oooot a flaere-a thaet streekes taerget fue-a fur 20...65 fure-a daemaege-a iff it heets. Iff yuoo aere-a Oofercaest, Flaere-a heets aedjaecent fues aes vell.','Prujecteele-a: deaels 20...65 fure-a daemaege-a. Iff Oofercaest, streekes aedjaecent.'],
195=>['Laefa Funt','Fur 5 secunds, fues aedjaecent tu zee lucaeshun vhere-a thees spell vaes caest aere-a stroock fur 5...50 fure-a daemaege-a iaech secund. Iff yuoo aere-a Oofercaest, thees spell streekes neaerby fues insteaed ooff aedjaecent oones.','Deaels 5...50 fure-a daemaege-a iaech secund (5 secunds). Heets fues aedjaecent tu yuoor ineeteeael lucaeshun. Iff Oofercaest, runge-a increaesed tu neaerby.'],
196=>['Seaereeng Heaet','Coose-a Seaereeng Heaet aet taerget fue-a\'s lucaeshun. Fur 5 secunds, fues neaer thees lucaeshun aere-a stroock fur 10...40 fure-a daemaege-a iaech secund. Vhee Seaereeng Heaet inds, fues in zee aerea ooff iffffect aere-a set oon fure-a fur 3 secunds.','Deaels 10...40 fure-a daemaege-a iaech secund (5 secunds). Heets fues neaer taerget\'s ineeteeael lucaeshun. Ind iffffect: inffleects Boorneeng cundeeshun (3 secunds).'],
197=>['Fure-a Sturm','Creaete-a a Fure-a Sturm aet taerget fue-a\'s lucaeshun. Fur 10 secunds, fues aedjaecent tu thaet lucaeshun aere-a stroock fur 5...35 fure-a daemaege-a iaech secund.','Deaels 5...35 fure-a daemaege-a iaech secund (10 secunds). Heets fues aedjaecent tu taerget\'s ineeteeael lucaeshun.'],
198=>['Glyph ooff Ilementael Pooer','Fur 25 secunds, yuoor ilementael aettreebootes aere-a buusted by 2 fur yuoor next 10 spells.','(25 secunds.) Buusts yuoor ilementael aettreebootes by +2 fur yuoor next 10 spells.'],
199=>['Glyph ooff Inergy','Yuoor next 1...3 spells do nut coose-a Oofercaest und cost 10...25 less Inergy tu caest. Yuoor ilementael aettreebootes aere-a increaesed by 1...2.','Yuoor next 1...3 spells do nut coose-a Oofercaest und cost 10...25 less Inergy. Gaeeen 1...2 tu aell ilementael aettreebootes.'],
200=>['Glyph ooff Lesser Inergy','Fur zee next 15 secunds, yuoor next 2 spells cust 10...18 less Inergy tu caest.','(15 secunds.) Yuoor next 2 spells cust 10...18 less Inergy.'],
201=>['Glyph ooff Cuncentraeshun','Fur 15 secunds, yuoor next 1 spells cunnut be-a interroopted und ignore zee iffffects ooff beeeng Daezed.','(15 secunds.) Yuoor next 1 spells cunnut be-a interroopted und are unaeffffected by zee Daezed cundeeshun. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
202=>['Glyph ooff Saecreeffeece-a','Fur 15 secunds, yuoor next spell caests instuntly, boot it taekes un aeddeeshunael 30 secunds tu rechaerge-a. Inds premaetoorely iff yuoo use-a a nun-spell skeell.','(15 secunds.) Yuoor next spell caests instuntly boot taekes un aeddeeshunael 30 secunds tu rechaerge-a. Inds iff yuoo use-a a nun-spell skeell.'],
203=>['Glyph ooff Renooael','Fur 15 secunds, yuoor next spell instuntly rechaerges. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(15 secunds.) Yuoor next spell rechaerges instuntly.'],
204=>['Roost','Deaels 10...85 culd daemaege-a tu taerget und aedjaecent fues. Fur 5...20 secunds, taerget fue-a und aell aedjaecent fues taeke-a tveece-a aes lung tu aecteefaete-a seegnets. Iff yuoo aere-a Oofercaest, fues stroock veet Roost haefe-a zeeur seegnets interroopted und deesaebled fur 1...10 secunds. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Deaels 10...85 culd daemaege-a tu taerget und aedjaecent fues. Hexes taerget und aedjaecent fues (5...20 secunds). Duoobles seegnet aecteefaeshun teeme-a. Interroopts und deesaebles seegnets fur 1...10 secunds iff yuoo aere-a Oofercaest.'],
205=>['Leeghtneeng Soorge-a','Aeffter 3 secunds, taerget fue-a is knucked doon, stroock fur 14...100 leeghtneeng daemaege-a, und haes Craecked Aermur fur 5...20 secunds. Thees spell haes 25% aermur penetraeshun.','(3 secunds.) Ind iffffect: deaels 14...100 leeghtneeng daemaege-a, cooses knuck-doon, und inffleects Craecked Aermur (5...20 secunds). 25% aermur penetraeshun.'],
206=>['Aermur ooff Frust','Fur 10...34 secunds, yuoo gaeeen +40 aermur aegaeeenst physeecael daemaege-a und haefe-a +1 Vaeter Maegeec.','(10...34 secunds.) Yuoo gaeeen +40 aermur aegaeeenst physeecael daemaege-a und haefe-a +1 Vaeter Maegeec.'],
207=>['Cunjoore-a Frust','Fur 60 secunds, iff yuoo\'re-a veeeldeeng a culd veaepun, yuoor aettaecks streeke-a fur un aeddeeshunael 5...20 culd daemaege-a.','(60 secunds.) Yuoor aettaecks heet fur +5...20 culd daemaege-a. Nu iffffect unless yuoor veaepun deaels culd daemaege-a.'],
208=>['Vaeter Aettoonement','Fur 36...60 secunds, yuoo aere-a aettooned tu Vaeter. Yuoo gaeeen 1 Inergy ploos 30% ooff zee baese-a Inergy cust ooff zee skeell iaech teeme-a yuoo use-a Vaeter Maegeec.','(36...60 secunds.) Yuoo gaeeen 1 Inergy ploos 30% ooff zee Inergy cust vhee yuoo use-a a Vaeter Maegeec skeell.'],
209=>['Meend Freeze-a','Taerget fue-a taekes 10...60 culd daemaege-a. Iff yuoo haefe-a mure-a Inergy thun taerget fue-a, thaet fue-a sooffffers un aeddeeshunael 10...60 culd daemaege-a und mufes 90% slooer fur 1...5 secunds. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Deaels 10...60 culd daemaege-a. Iff yuoo haefe-a mure-a Inergy thun taerget fue-a, deaels +10...60 culd daemaege-a und cooses 90% slooer mufement (1...5 secunds). Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
210=>['Ice-a Preesun','Fur 8...20 secunds, taerget fue-a\'s legs aere-a incaesed in ice-a, cooseeng zee fue-a tu mufe-a 66% slooer.','(8...20 secunds.) Taerget fue-a mufes 66% slooer.'],
211=>['Ice-a Speekes','Taerget und aedjaecent fues aere-a stroock fur 20...80 culd daemaege-a und mufe-a 66% slooer fur 2...6 secunds.','Aelsu hexes fues aedjaecent tu taerget (2...6 secunds). Zeese-a fues mufe-a 66% slooer. Ineeteeael iffffect: deaels 20...80 culd daemaege-a.'],
212=>['Fruzee Boorst','Aell neaerby fues aere-a stroock fur 10...85 culd daemaege-a und mufe-a 66% slooer fur 3...8 secunds.','Hexes fues neaer yuoo. Zeese-a fues mufe-a 66% slooer (3...8 secunds). Ineeteeael iffffect: deaels 10...85 culd daemaege-a tu fues neaer yuoo.'],
213=>['Shaerd Sturm','Send oooot un ice-a shaerd thaet streekes taerget fue-a fur 10...85 culd daemaege-a iff it heets und cooseeng taerget fue-a tu mufe-a 66% slooer fur 2...6 secunds.','Prujecteele-a: deaels 10...85 culd daemaege-a. Taerget fue-a mufes 66% slooer (2...6 secunds).'],
214=>['Ice-a Speaer','Send oooot un Ice-a Speaer, streekeeng taerget fue-a fur 10...60 culd daemaege-a iff it heets. Iff yuoo aere-a Oofercaest, yuoo gaeeen +1...4 Heaelt regeneraeshun fur 5 secunds.','Prujecteele-a: deaels 10...60 culd daemaege-a. Gaeeen +1...4 Heaelt regeneraeshun fur 5 secunds iff Oofercaest.'],
215=>['Maeelstrum','Creaete-a a Maeelstrum aet taerget fue-a\'s lucaeshun. Fur 10 secunds, fues aedjaecent tu thaet aerea aere-a stroock fur 10...25 culd daemaege-a iaech secund. Maeelstrum interroopts spell-caesteeng vhee it heets.','Deaels 10...25 culd daemaege-a und interroopts spells iaech secund (10 secunds). Heets fues aedjaecent tu taerget\'s ineeteeael lucaeshun.'],
216=>['Irun Meest','Fur 8...15 secunds, yuoo haefe-a +15 aermur. Yuoor Aeur Maegeec spells thaet taerget a fue-a aecteefaete-a und rechaerge-a 33% faester, boot yuoo aere-a Oofercaest by 2 pueents. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(8...15 secunds.) Gaeeen +15 aermur. Aeur Maegeec spells thaet taerget a fue-a aecteefaete-a und rechaerge-a 33% faester, boot yuoo aere-a Oofercaest by 2 pueents.'],
217=>['Crystael Vaefe-a','Fues aedjaecent tu yuoo aere-a stroock fur 10...70 daemaege-a boot aere-a coored ooff uny negaeteefe-a cundeeshuns. Iaech cundeeshun remufed deaels 5...15 daemaege-a.','Deaels 10...70 daemaege-a tu aell fues aedjaecent tu yuoo. Thuse-a fues luse-a aell cundeeshuns und taeke-a 5...15 daemaege-a fur iaech cundeeshun remufed.'],
218=>['Oobseedeeun Flesh','Fur 8...20 secunds, yuoo gaeeen +20 aermur und cunnut be-a zee taerget ooff inemy spells, boot cunnut aettaeck und haefe-a -2 inergy degeneraeshun.','(8...20 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +20 aermur und inemy spells cunnut taerget yuoo. Yuoo cunnut aettaeck und haefe-a -2 inergy degeneraeshun.'],
219=>['Oobseedeeun Flaeme-a','Deael 22...112 daemaege-a tu taerget fue-a. Thees spell ignures aermur.','Deaels 22...112 daemaege-a.'],
220=>['Bleendeeng Flaesh','Taerget fue-a is Bleended fur 3...8 secunds.','Inffleects Bleendness cundeeshun (3...8 secunds).'],
221=>['Cunjoore-a Leeghtneeng','Fur 60 secunds, iff yuoo\'re-a veeeldeeng a leeghtneeng veaepun, yuoor aettaecks streeke-a fur un aeddeeshunael 5...20 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(60 secunds.) Yuoor aettaecks heet fur +5...20 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Nu iffffect unless yuoor veaepun deaels leeghtneeng daemaege-a.'],
222=>['Leeghtneeng Streeke-a','Streeke-a taerget fue-a fur 10...60 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Thees spell haes 25% aermur penetraeshun. Iff yuoo aere-a Oofercaest, thaet fue-a is hexed veet Leeghtneeng Streeke-a fur 3 secunds. Vhee thees hex inds, thaet fue-a is stroock aegaeeen fur 20...40 leeghtneeng daemaege-a.','Deaels 10...60 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. 25% aermur penetraeshun. Hex fur 3 secunds iff Oofercaest. Ind iffffect: deaels 20...40 leeghtneeng daemaege-a.'],
223=>['Chaeeen Leeghtneeng','Taerget fue-a und up tu tvu oozeer fues neaer yuoor taerget aere-a stroock fur 10...85 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Thees spell haes 25% aermur penetraeshun.','Deaels 10...85 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Aelsu heets tvu fues neaer yuoor taerget. 25% aermur penetraeshun.'],
224=>['Inerfaeteeng Chaerge-a','Taerget fue-a is stroock fur 25...50 leeghtneeng daemaege-a und sooffffers frum Veaekness fur 5...20 secunds. Thees spell haes 25% aermur penetraeshun.','Deaels 25...50 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Inffleects Veaekness cundeeshun (5...20 secunds). 25% aermur penetraeshun.'],
225=>['Aeur Aettoonement','Fur 36...60 secunds, yuoo aere-a aettooned tu Aeur. Yuoo gaeeen 1 Inergy ploos 30% ooff zee baese-a Inergy cust ooff zee skeell vhenefer yuoo use-a Aeur Maegeec.','(36...60 secunds.) Yuoo gaeeen 1 Inergy ploos 30% ooff zee Inergy cust vhee yuoo use-a un Aeur Maegeec skeell.'],
226=>['Meend Shuck','Taerget fue-a sooffffers 10...50 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Iff yuoo haefe-a mure-a Inergy thun taerget fue-a, thaet fue-a sooffffers 10...50 mure-a leeghtneeng daemaege-a und is knucked doon. Thees spell haes 25% aermur penetraeshun.','Deaels 10...50 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Iff yuoo haefe-a mure-a Inergy thun taerget fue-a, deaels +10...50 leeghtneeng daemaege-a und cooses knuckdoon. 25% aermur penetraeshun.'],
227=>['Gleemmereeng Maerk','Fur 10 secunds, taerget fue-a und aell fues aedjaecent tu yuoor taerget taeke-a 5...25 daemaege-a iaech secund. Fues useeng aettaeck skeells aere-a Bleended fur 3 secunds. Thees hex inds iff yuoo use-a a skeell thaet taergets thees fue-a.','(10 secunds.) Deaels 5...25 daemaege-a iaech secund tu taerget und aedjaecent fues. Inffleects Bleendness oon fues useeng aettaeck skeells. Inds iff yuoo use-a a skeell thaet taergets thees fue-a.'],
228=>['Thoonderclaep','Creaete-a a maesseefe-a shuckvaefe-a aet taerget fue-a\'s lucaeshun. Deaels 10...50 leeghtneeng daemaege-a tu taerget und aell neaerby fues. Stroock fues aere-a interroopted und sooffffer frum Craecked Aermur und Veaekness fur 5...20 secunds. Thees spell haes 25% aermur penetraeshun.','Deaels 10...50 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Aelsu streekes neaerby fues. Inffleects Craecked Aermur und Veaekness (5...20 secunds). Cooses interroopt. 25% aermur penetraeshun.'],
229=>['Leeghtneeng Oorb','Send oooot a Leeghtneeng Oorb thaet streekes taerget fue-a fur 10...100 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Thees spell haes 25% aermur penetraeshun.','Prujecteele-a: deaels 10...100 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. 25% aermur penetraeshun.'],
230=>['Leeghtneeng Jaefeleen','Send oooot a Leeghtneeng Jaefeleen thaet streekes fur 15...50 leeghtneeng daemaege-a iff it heets. Leeghtneeng Jaefeleen interroopts aettaeckeeng fues. Thees spell haes 25% aermur penetraeshun und streekes aell fues betveee yuoo und yuoor taerget.','Prujecteele-a: deaels 15...50 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Interroopts iff yuoor taerget is aettaeckeeng. 25% aermur penetraeshun. Streekes aell fues betveee yuoo und yuoor taerget.'],
231=>['Shuck','Taerget tuooched fue-a is knucked doon und stroock fur 10...60 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Thees skeell haes 25% aermur penetraeshun.','Deaels 10...60 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Cooses knuck-doon. 25% aermur penetraeshun.'],
232=>['Leeghtneeng Tuooch','Taerget tuooched fue-a und aell aedjaecent fues aere-a stroock fur 10...60 leeghtneeng daemaege-a, aere-a Bleended fur 1...4 secunds, und haefe-a Craecked Aermur fur 1...10 secunds. Thees skeell haes 25% aermur penetraeshun.','Deaels 10...60 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Aelsu heets fues aedjaecent tu taerget fue-a. Inffleects Bleend (1...4 secunds) und Craecked Aermur (1...10 secunds) oon aell stroock fues. 25% aermur penetraeshun.'],
233=>['Svurleeng Oora','Fur 3...7 secunds, yuoo aere-a inchunted veet Svurleeng Oora und haefe-a 1...6 Heaelt regeneraeshun und a 50% chunce-a tu bluck prujecteeles. Iff yuoo aere-a Oofercaest vhee yuoo caest thees spell, aell paerty members in iaershut aere-a aelsu inchunted.','(3...7 secunds.) Geefes 1...6 Heaelt regeneraeshun und a 50% chunce-a tu bluck prujecteeles. Iff Oofercaest, aelsu inchunts paerty members in iaershut.'],
234=>['Deep Freeze-a','Yuoo coose-a a Deep Freeze-a aet taerget fue-a\'s lucaeshun. Aell fues in thees aerea aere-a stroock fur 10...85 culd daemaege-a, und fur 10 secunds, zeey mufe-a 66% slooer.','Aelsu hexes fues in zee aerea ooff yuoor taerget (10 secunds). Zeese-a fues mufe-a 66% slooer. Ineeteeael iffffect: deaels 10...85 culd daemaege-a.'],
235=>['Bloorred Feeseeun','Fur 4...10 secunds, taerget fue-a und aedjaecent fues aere-a hexed veet Bloorred Feeseeun. Vheele-a hexed, thuse-a fues haefe-a a 50% chunce-a tu meess veet aettaecks.','Aelsu hexes fues aedjaecent tu taerget (4...10 secunds). Zeey haefe-a 50% chunce-a tu meess.'],
236=>['Meest Furm','Fur 10...45 secunds, yuoo taeke-a 33% less daemaege-a frum fues under zee iffffect ooff Vaeter Maegeec hexes. Vhenefer yuoo caest un ilementael spell, aell nun-spureet aelleees in iaershut aere-a heaeled fur 50...250% ooff zee Inergy cust ooff zee spell.','(10...45 secunds.) Taeke-a 33% less daemaege-a frum fues hexed veet Vaeter Maegeec. Heaels nun-spureet aelleees in iaershut fur 50...250% ooff zee Inergy cust ooff yuoor ilementael spells. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
237=>['Vaeter Treedent','Send oooot a faest-mufeeng Vaeter Treedent, streekeeng taerget fue-a und up tu 2 aedjaecent fues fur 10...90 culd daemaege-a iff it heets. Iff it heets a mufeeng fue-a, thaet fue-a is knucked doon.','Faest prujecteele-a: deaels 10...90 culd daemaege-a und knucks doon mufeeng fues. Shuuts 2 aeddeeshunael prujecteeles aet aedjaecent fues.'],
238=>['Aermur ooff Meest','Fur 8...20 secunds, yuoo gaeeen +10...40 aermur und mufe-a 33% faester.','(8...20 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +10...40 aermur und mufe-a 33% faester.'],
239=>['Vaerd Aegaeeenst Haerm','Creaete-a a Vaerd Aegaeeenst Haerm aet thees lucaeshun. Fur 5...15 secunds, nun-spureet aelleees in thees aerea haefe-a +1...3 Heaelt regeneraeshun, +12...24 aermur, und un aeddeeshunael +12...24 aermur aegaeeenst ilementael daemaege-a. Thees spell is deesaebled fur 20 secunds.',' (5...15 secunds.) Aelleees in thees vaerd haefe-a +1...3 Heaelt regeneraeshun, +12...24 aermur, und +12...24 aeddeeshunael aermur aegaeeenst ilementael daemaege-a. Spureets aere-a unaeffffected. Thees spell is deesaebled fur 20 secunds.'],
240=>['Smeete-a','Thees aettaeck deaels 10...55 Huly daemaege-a. Iff aettaeckeeng, yuoor taerget taekes un aeddeeshunael 10...35 Huly daemaege-a.','Deaels 10...55 huly daemaege-a. Deaels 10...35 mure-a huly daemaege-a iff taerget is aettaeckeeng.'],
241=>['Leeffe-a Bund','Vheele-a yuoo maeeentaeeen thees inchuntment, vhenefer taerget oozeer aelly taekes daemaege-a frum un aettaeck, haelff zee daemaege-a is redurected tu yuoo. Zee daemaege-a yuoo receeefe-a thees vaey is redooced by 3...30.','Haelff ooff zee daemaege-a taerget aelly taekes frum aettaecks is redurected tu yuoo. Redurected daemaege-a is redooced by 3...30. Cunnut selff-taerget.'],
242=>['Baelthaezaer\'s Spureet','Vheele-a yuoo maeeentaeeen thees inchuntment, taerget aelly gaeeens aedrenaeleene-a und Inergy aeffter taekeeng daemaege-a. (Zee aemuoont ooff aedrenaeleene-a gaeeened increaeses dependeeng oon yuoor runk in Smeeteeng Praeyers.)','Taerget aelly gaeeens aedrenaeleene-a und 1 Inergy vhee taekeeng daemaege-a.'],
243=>['Strengt ooff Hunur','Vheele-a yuoo maeeentaeeen thees inchuntment, taerget aelly deaels 5...25 mure-a daemaege-a in melee-a.','Taerget aelly deaels 5...25 mure-a daemaege-a in melee-a. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
244=>['Leeffe-a Aettoonement','Vheele-a yuoo maeeentaeeen thees inchuntment, taerget aelly deaels 30% less daemaege-a veet aettaecks, boot gaeeens 14...50% mure-a Heaelt vhee heaeled.','Taerget aelly gaeeens 14...50% mure-a Heaelt vhee heaeled. Thees aelly deaels 30% less daemaege-a veet aettaecks.'],
245=>['Prutecteefe-a Spureet','Fur 5...23 secunds, taerget aelly cunnut luse-a mure-a thun 10% maex Heaelt dooe-a tu daemaege-a frum a seengle-a aettaeck oor spell.','(5...23 secunds.) Incumeeng daemaege-a is redooced tu 10% ooff taerget aelly\'s maexeemoom Heaelt. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
246=>['Deefeene-a Interfenshun','Fur 10 secunds, zee next teeme-a taerget aelly receeefes daemaege-a thaet vuoold be-a faetael, zee daemaege-a is negaeted und thaet aelly is heaeled fur 26...240 Heaelt.','(10 secunds.) Negaetes zee next faetael daemaege-a taerget aelly taekes. Negaeshun iffffect: heaels fur 26...240.'],
247=>['Symbul ooff Vraet','Creaete-a a Symbul ooff Vraet aet taerget fue-a\'s lucaeshun. Fur 5 secunds, aedjaecent fues aere-a stroock fur 10...40 huly daemaege-a iaech secund.','Deaels 10...40 huly daemaege-a iaech secund (5 secunds). Heets fues aedjaecent tu taerget fue-a\'s ineeteeael lucaeshun.'],
248=>['Retreebooshun','Vheele-a yuoo maeeentaeeen thees inchuntment, vhenefer taerget aelly taekes aettaeck daemaege-a, thees spell deaels 33% ooff zee daemaege-a baeck tu zee suoorce-a (maexeemoom 5...20 daemaege-a).','Deaels 33% ooff iaech aettaeck\'s daemaege-a (maexeemoom 5...20) baeck tu zee suoorce-a.'],
249=>['Huly Vraet','Fur 10...30 secunds, zee next 1...10 teeme-as taerget oozeer aelly taekes aettaeck daemaege-a, thees spell deaels 66% ooff zee daemaege-a baeck tu zee suoorce-a (maexeemoom 5...50 daemaege-a).','(10...30 secunds.) Deaels 66% ooff iaech aettaeck\'s daemaege-a (maexeemoom 5...50) baeck tu suoorce-a. Inds aeffter deaeleeng daemaege-a 1...10 teeme-as. Cunnut selff-taerget.'],
250=>['Issence-a Bund','Vheele-a yuoo maeeentaeeen thees inchuntment, vhenefer taerget aelly taekes physeecael oor ilementael daemaege-a, yuoo gaeeen 1 Inergy.','Yuoo gaeeen 1 Inergy vhenefer taerget aelly taekes physeecael oor ilementael daemaege-a.'],
251=>['Scuoorge-a Heaeleeng','Fur 30 secunds, ifery teeme-a taerget fue-a is heaeled, zee heaeler taekes 15...80 huly daemaege-a. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(30 secunds.) Vhenefer taerget fue-a is heaeled, zee heaeler taekes 15...80 huly daemaege-a.'],
252=>['Buneesh','Taerget fue-a taekes 20...65 huly daemaege-a. Thees spell dues duooble-a daemaege-a tu soommuned creaetoores.','Deaels 20...65 huly daemaege-a. Deaels duooble-a daemaege-a tu soommuned creaetoores.'],
253=>['Scuoorge-a Saecreeffeece-a','Fur 8...20 secunds, ifery teeme-a taerget fue-a und aedjaecent fues saecreeffeece-a leeffe-a, zeey saecreeffeece-a tveece-a zee nurmael aemuoont.','Aelsu hexes fues aedjaecent tu taerget (8...20 secunds). Duoobles Heaelt saecreeffeece-a.'],
254=>['Feeguruoos Spureet','Fur 30 secunds, iaech teeme-a taerget aelly aettaecks oor caests a spell, thaet aelly is heaeled fur 5...20 Heaelt.','(30 secunds.) Heaels fur 5...20 iaech teeme-a taerget aelly aettaecks oor caests a spell.'],
255=>['Vaetchffool Spureet','Vheele-a yuoo maeeentaeeen thees inchuntment, taerget aelly gaeeens +2 Heaelt regeneraeshun. Thaet aelly is heaeled fur 30...180 Heaelt vhee Vaetchffool Spureet inds.','+2 Heaelt regeneraeshun. Ind iffffect: heaels fur 30...180.'],
256=>['Blessed Oora','Vheele-a yuoo maeeentaeeen thees inchuntment, Munk inchuntments yuoo caest laest 10...35% lunger.','Munk inchuntments yuoo caest laest 10...35% lunger.'],
257=>['Aeegees','Fur 6...15 secunds, aell paerty members veetheen iaershut haefe-a a 50% chunce-a tu bluck aettaecks.','Inchunts aell paerty members veetheen iaershut (6...15 secunds.) 50% chunce-a tu bluck.'],
258=>['Gooaerdeeun','Fur 2...7 secunds, taerget aelly haes a 50% chunce-a tu bluck aettaecks.','(2...7 secunds.) 50% chunce-a tu bluck.'],
259=>['Sheeeld ooff Defflecshun','Fur 3...10 secunds, taerget aelly haes a 75% chunce-a tu bluck aettaecks und gaeeens 15...30 aermur.','(3...10 secunds.) 75% chunce-a tu bluck. +15...30 aermur.'],
260=>['Oora ooff Faeeet','Fur 3 secunds, taerget aelly gaeeens 50...100% mure-a Heaelt vhee heaeled und taekes 5...50% less daemaege-a.','(3 secunds.) Taerget aelly gaeeens 50...100% mure-a Heaelt vhee heaeled und taekes 5...50% less daemaege-a.'],
261=>['Sheeeld ooff Regeneraeshun','Fur 5...13 secunds, taerget aelly gaeeens +3...10 Heaelt regeneraeshun und 20...45 aermur.','(5...13 secunds.) +3...10 Heaelt regeneraeshun und +20...45 aermur.'],
262=>['Sheeeld ooff Joodgment','Fur 8...20 secunds, unyune-a streekeeng taerget aelly veet un aettaeck is knucked doon und sooffffers 5...50 huly daemaege-a.','(8...20 secunds.) Deaels 5...50 huly daemaege-a tu fues aettaeckeeng taerget aelly. Cooses knuck-doon.'],
263=>['Prutecteefe-a Bund','Vheele-a yuoo maeeentaeeen thees inchuntment, taerget aelly cunnut luse-a mure-a thun 5% maex Heaelt dooe-a tu daemaege-a frum a seengle-a aettaeck oor spell. Vhee Prutecteefe-a Bund prefents daemaege-a, yuoo luse-a 6...3 Inergy oor zee spell inds.','Taerget aelly cunnut luse-a mure-a thun 5% maex Heaelt frum a seengle-a aettaeck oor spell. Iaech teeme-a daemaege-a is redooced yuoo luse-a 6...3 Inergy oor thees spell inds.'],
264=>['Paeceeffeesm','Fur 4...8 secunds, taerget fue-a cunnut aettaeck. Thees iffffect inds iff zee taerget taekes daemaege-a.','(4...8 secunds.) Taerget fue-a cunnut aettaeck. Inds iff thees fue-a taekes daemaege-a.'],
265=>['Aemeety','Fur 4...12 secunds, aedjaecent fues cunnut aettaeck. Fur iaech fue-a, Aemeety inds iff thaet fue-a taekes daemaege-a.','(4...12 secunds.) Fues aedjaecent tu yuoo cunnut aettaeck. Inds oon uny fues thaet taeke-a daemaege-a.'],
266=>['Peaece-a und Haermuny','Taerget aelly luses 0...9 cundeeshuns und hexes. Fur 1...3 secunds, cundeeshuns und hexes ixpure-a 90% faester oon thaet aelly. Aell ooff yuoor Smeeteeng Praeyers aere-a deesaebled fur 20 secunds.','Taerget aelly luses 0...9 cundeeshuns und hexes. Cundeeshuns und hexes ixpure-a 90% faester oon thaet aelly (1...3 secunds). Deesaebles yuoor Smeeteeng Praeyers (20 secunds).'],
267=>['Joodge-a\'s Inseeght','Fur 8...20 secunds, taerget aelly\'s aettaecks deael huly daemaege-a und haefe-a +20% aermur penetraeshun.','(8...20 secunds.) Cunferts taerget aelly\'s aettaecks tu huly daemaege-a und aedds +20% aermur penetraeshun.'],
268=>['Unyeeeldeeng Oora','Vheele-a yuoo maeeentaeeen thees inchuntment, yuoor Munk spells heael fur +15...60% mure-a Heaelt. Vhee thees inchuntment inds oone-a rundum oozeer paerty member is resoorrected veet fooll Heaelt und Inergy und telepurted tu yuoor lucaeshun.','Yuoor Munk spells heael fur +15...60% mure-a Heaelt. Ind iffffect: a rundum oozeer paerty member is resoorrected veet fooll Heaelt und Inergy und telepurted tu yuoor lucaeshun.'],
269=>['Maerk ooff Prutecshun','Fur 10 secunds, vhenefer taerget aelly vuoold taeke-a daemaege-a, thaet aelly is heaeled fur thaet aemuoont insteaed, maexeemoom 6...60. Aell yuoor Prutecshun Praeyers aere-a deesaebled fur 5 secunds.','(10 secunds.) Cunferts incumeeng daemaege-a tu heaeleeng (maexeemoom 6...60). Aell yuoor Prutecshun Praeyers aere-a deesaebled (5 secunds).'],
270=>['Leeffe-a Baerreeer','Vheele-a yuoo maeeentaeeen thees inchuntment, daemaege-a deaelt tu taerget oozeer aelly is redooced by 20...50%. Iff yuoor Heaelt is beloo 50% vhee thaet aelly taekes daemaege-a, Leeffe-a Baerreeer inds.','Redooces daemaege-a by 20...50%. Cunnut selff-taerget. Iff yuoor Heaelt is beloo 50% vhee taerget taekes daemaege-a, Leeffe-a Baerreeer inds.'],
271=>['Zeaelut\'s Fure-a','Fur 60 secunds, vhenefer yuoo use-a a skeell thaet taergets un aelly, aell fues aedjaecent tu thaet taerget aere-a stroock fur 5...35 fure-a daemaege-a und yuoo luse-a 1 Inergy.','(60 secunds.) Vhenefer yuoo use-a a skeell oon un aelly, aell fues aedjaecent tu thaet aelly aere-a heet fur 5...35 fure-a daemaege-a. Daemaege-a cust: yuoo luse-a 1 Inergy.'],
272=>['Baelthaezaer\'s Oora','Fur 8 secunds, fues aedjaecent tu taerget aelly taeke-a 10...30 huly daemaege-a iaech secund.','(8 secunds.) Deaels 10...30 huly daemaege-a iaech secund tu fues aedjaecent tu taerget aelly.'],
273=>['Spell Breaeker','Fur 5...17 secunds, taerget aelly cunnut be-a zee taerget ooff inemy spells.','(5...17 secunds.) Taerget aelly cunnut be-a zee taerget ooff inemy spells.'],
274=>['Heaeleeng Seed','Fur 10 secunds, vhenefer taerget oozeer aelly taekes daemaege-a, thaet aelly und aell aedjaecent aelleees gaeeen 3...30 Heaelt.','(10 secunds.) Taerget und aedjaecent aelleees gaeeen 3...30 Heaelt vhenefer thees aelly taekes daemaege-a. Cunnut selff-taerget.'],
275=>['Mend Cundeeshun','Remufe-a oone-a cundeeshun (Pueesun, Deeseaese-a, Bleendness, Daezed, Bleedeeng, Creeppled, Boorneeng, Veaekness, Craecked Aermur, oor Deep Vuoond) frum taerget oozeer aelly. Iff a cundeeshun is remufed, thaet aelly is heaeled fur 5...70 Heaelt.','Remufes oone-a cundeeshun. Remufael iffffect: heaels fur 5...70. Cunnut selff-taerget.'],
276=>['Resture-a Cundeeshun','Remufe-a aell cundeeshuns (Pueesun, Deeseaese-a, Bleendness, Daezed, Bleedeeng, Creeppled, Boorneeng, Veaekness, Craecked Aermur, und Deep Vuoond) frum taerget oozeer aelly. Fur iaech cundeeshun remufed, thaet aelly is heaeled fur 10...70 Heaelt.','Remufes aell cundeeshuns. Remufael iffffect: heaels fur 10...70 fur iaech cundeeshun remufed. Cunnut selff-taerget.'],
277=>['Mend Aeeelment','Remufe-a oone-a cundeeshun (Pueesun, Deeseaese-a, Bleendness, Daezed, Bleedeeng, Creeppled, Boorneeng, Veaekness, Craecked Aermur oor Deep Vuoond) frum taerget aelly. Fur iaech remaeeeneeng cundeeshun, thaet aelly is heaeled fur 5...70 Heaelt.','Remufes a cundeeshun. Remufael iffffect: heaels fur 5...70 fur iaech remaeeeneeng cundeeshun.'],
278=>['Poorge-a Cundeeshuns','Remufe-a aell cundeeshuns (Pueesun, Deeseaese-a, Bleendness, Daezed, Bleedeeng, Creeppled, Boorneeng, Veaekness, Craecked Aermur, und Deep Vuoond) frum taerget aelly.','Remufes aell cundeeshuns.'],
279=>['Deefeene-a Heaeleeng','Heael yuoorselff und paerty members veetheen iaershut fur 15...60 pueents.','Heaels yuoo und paerty members veetheen iaershut fur 15...60.'],
280=>['Heael Aerea','Heael yuoorselff und aell aedjaecent creaetoores fur 30...180 pueents.','Heaels yuoo und aedjaecent aelleees und fues fur 30...180.'],
281=>['Ooreesun ooff Heaeleeng','Heael taerget aelly fur 30...80 Heaelt.','Heaels fur 30...80.'],
282=>['Vurd ooff Heaeleeng','Heael taerget aelly fur 5...100 Heaelt. Heael fur un aeddeeshunael 30...115 Heaelt iff thaet aelly is beloo 50% Heaelt.','Heaels fur 5...100. Heaels fur 30...115 mure-a iff taerget aelly is beloo 50% Heaelt.'],
283=>['Dvaeyna\'s Keess','Heael taerget oozeer aelly fur 20...65 Heaelt und un aeddeeshunael 15...40 Heaelt fur iaech inchuntment oor hex oon thaet aelly.','Heaels fur 20...65. Heaels fur 15...40 mure-a fur iaech inchuntment und hex oon taerget aelly. Cunnut selff-taerget.'],
284=>['Deefeene-a Buun','Vheele-a yuoo maeeentaeeen thees inchuntment, vhenefer yuoo caest a Prutecshun Praeyer oor Deefeene-a Faefur spell thaet taergets un aelly, thaet aelly is heaeled fur 15...60 Heaelt, und yuoo luse-a 1 Inergy.','Vhenefer yuoo caest a Prutecshun Praeyer oor Deefeene-a Faefur spell oon un aelly, thaet aelly is heaeled fur 15...60. Heael cust: yuoo luse-a 1 Inergy.'],
285=>['Heaeleeng Hunds','Fur 10 secunds, vhenefer taerget aelly taekes daemaege-a, thaet aelly is heaeled fur 5...35 Heaelt.','(10 secunds.) Heaels fur 5...35 vhenefer taerget taekes daemaege-a.'],
286=>['Heael Oozeer','Heael taerget oozeer aelly fur 35...180 Heaelt. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Heaels fur 35...180. Cunnut selff-taerget.'],
287=>['Heael Paerty','Heael inture-a paerty fur 30...75 Heaelt.','Heaels inture-a paerty fur 30...75.'],
288=>['Heaeleeng Breeze-a','Fur 15 secunds, taerget aelly gaeeens +4...9 Heaelt regeneraeshun.','(15 secunds.) +4...9 Heaelt regeneraeshun.'],
289=>['Feetael Blesseeng','Vheele-a yuoo maeeentaeeen thees inchuntment, taerget aelly haes +40...200 maexeemoom Heaelt.','+40...200 maexeemoom Heaelt.'],
290=>['Mendeeng','Vheele-a yuoo maeeentaeeen thees inchuntment, taerget aelly gaeeens +1...4 Heaelt regeneraeshun.','+1...4 Heaelt regeneraeshun.'],
291=>['Leefe-a Feecaereeuoosly','Vheele-a yuoo maeeentaeeen thees inchuntment, vhenefer taerget aelly heets a fue-a, yuoo gaeeen 2...17 Heaelt.','Yuoo gaeeen 2...17 Heaelt vhenefer taerget aelly heets a fue-a.'],
292=>['Inffoose-a Heaelt','Luse-a haelff yuoor coorrent Heaelt. Taerget oozeer aelly is heaeled fur 100...136% ooff zee aemuoont yuoo lust.','Heaels fur 100...136% ooff haelff yuoor coorrent Heaelt. Luse-a haelff yuoor coorrent Heaelt. Cunnut selff-taerget.'],
293=>['Seegnet ooff Defushun','Heael taerget aelly fur 20...120 Heaelt.','Heaels fur 20...120.'],
294=>['Seegnet ooff Joodgment','Taerget fue-a is knucked doon. Thaet fue-a und aell aedjaecent fues taeke-a 15...75 huly daemaege-a.','Knucks doon taerget. Deaels 15...75 huly daemaege-a tu taerget und aedjaecent fues.'],
295=>['Poorge-a Seegnet','Remufe-a aell hexes und cundeeshuns frum taerget aelly. Yuoo luse-a 10 Inergy fur iaech hex und iaech cundeeshun remufed.','Remufes aell hexes und cundeeshuns. Remufael cust: 10 Inergy iaech.'],
296=>['Bune-a Seegnet','Taerget fue-a taekes 30...60 huly daemaege-a. Iff taerget fue-a vaes aettaeckeeng, thaet fue-a is knucked doon.','Deaels 30...60 huly daemaege-a. Cooses knuck-doon iff taerget fue-a is aettaeckeeng.'],
297=>['Blessed Seegnet','Fur iaech inchuntment yuoo aere-a maeeentaeeeneeng, yuoo gaeeen 3 Inergy. Yuoo cunnut gaeeen mure-a thun 3...24 Inergy in thees vaey.','Yuoo gaeeen 3 Inergy fur iaech inchuntment yuoo aere-a maeeentaeeeneeng. Yuoo cunnut gaeeen mure-a thun 3...24 Inergy in thees vaey.'],
298=>['Maertyr','Trunsffer aell cundeeshuns und zeeur remaeeeneeng dooraeshuns frum yuoor aelleees tu yuoo.','Trunsffer aell cundeeshuns frum aell aelleees tu yuoo.'],
299=>['Sheeeldeeng Hunds','Fur 8 secunds, daemaege-a und leeffe-a steael receeefed by taerget aelly is redooced by 3...18. Vhee Sheeeldeeng Hunds inds, thaet aelly is heaeled fur 5...50 Heaelt. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(8 secunds.) Redooces incumeeng daemaege-a und leeffe-a steael by 3...18. Ind iffffect: heaels fur 5...50.'],
300=>['Cuntemplaeshun ooff Pooreety','Luse-a aell inchuntments. Fur iaech oone-a lust, yuoo gaeeen 0...80 Heaelt, luse-a oone-a hex, und luse-a oone-a cundeeshun (maexeemoom 1...8 hexes und cundeeshuns).','Yuoo gaeeen 0...80 Heaelt und luse-a oone-a hex und oone-a cundeeshun fur iaech inchuntment oon yuoo (maexeemoom 1...8 hexes und cundeeshuns). Yuoo luse-a aell inchuntments.'],
301=>['Remufe-a Hex','Remufe-a a hex frum taerget aelly.','Remufes a hex frum taerget aelly.'],
302=>['Smeete-a Hex','Remufe-a a hex frum taerget aelly. Iff a hex is remufed, fues in zee aerea sooffffer 10...85 huly daemaege-a.','Remufes a hex frum taerget aelly. Remufael iffffect: deaels 10...85 huly daemaege-a tu fues in zee aerea ooff taerget aelly.'],
303=>['Cunfert Hexes','Remufe-a aell hexes frum taerget oozeer aelly. Fur 8...20 secunds, thaet aelly gaeeens +10 aermur fur iaech Necrumuncer hex thaet vaes remufed.','Remufes aell hexes; +10 aermur fur iaech Necrumuncer hex remufed (8...20 secunds). Cunnut selff-taerget.'],
304=>['Leeght ooff Dvaeyna','Resoorrect aell deaed paerty members in zee aerea. Zeey aere-a retoorned tu leeffe-a veet 25% Heaelt und zeru Inergy.','Resoorrects aell deaed paerty members in zee aerea (25% Heaelt, zeru Inergy).'],
305=>['Resoorrect','Resoorrect taerget paerty member. Taerget paerty member is retoorned tu leeffe-a veet 25% Heaelt und zeru Inergy.','Resoorrects taerget paerty member (25% Heaelt, 0 Inergy).'],
306=>['Reburt','Resoorrect taerget paerty member. Taerget paerty member is retoorned tu leeffe-a veet 25% Heaelt und zeru Inergy, und is telepurted tu yuoor coorrent lucaeshun. Aell ooff taerget\'s skeells aere-a deesaebled fur 10...3 secunds. Thees spell cunsoomes aell ooff yuoor remaeeeneeng Inergy.','Resoorrects taerget paerty member (25% Heaelt, 0 Inergy). Telepurts taerget tu yuoo. Deesaebles taerget\'s skeells (10...3 secunds). Yuoo luse-a aell Inergy.'],
307=>['Refersael ooff Furtoone-a','Fur 8 secunds, zee next teeme-a taerget aelly vuoold taeke-a daemaege-a oor leeffe-a steael, thaet aelly gaeeens thaet aemuoont ooff Heaelt insteaed, maexeemoom 15...80.','(8 secunds.) Cunferts zee next incumeeng daemaege-a oor leeffe-a steael (maexeemoom 15...80) tu heaeleeng.'],
308=>['Sooccur','Vheele-a yuoo maeeentaeeen thees inchuntment, taerget oozeer aelly gaeeens +1 Heaelt und +1 Inergy regeneraeshun, boot yuoo luse-a 1 Inergy iaech teeme-a thaet aelly caests a spell.','+1 Heaelt regeneraeshun und +1 Inergy regeneraeshun. Cunnut selff-taerget. Yuoo luse-a 1 Inergy iaech teeme-a taerget aelly caests a spell.'],
309=>['Huly Feeel','Vheele-a yuoo maeeentaeeen thees inchuntment, uny hex caest oon taerget aelly taekes tveece-a aes lung tu caest. Vhee Huly Feeel inds, oone-a hex is remufed frum taerget aelly.','Duoobles caesteeng teeme-a ooff hexes caest oon taerget aelly. Ind iffffect: remufes a hex.'],
310=>['Deefeene-a Spureet','Fur 1...14 secunds, Munk spells cust yuoo 5 less Inergy tu caest. (Meeneemoom cust: 1 Inergy.)','(1...14 secunds.) Munk spells cust yuoo 5 less Inergy. Meeneemoom cust: 1 Inergy.'],
311=>['Draev Cundeeshuns','Aell negaeteefe-a cundeeshuns aere-a trunsfferred frum taerget oozeer aelly tu yuoorselff. Fur iaech cundeeshun aecqooured, yuoo gaeeen 6...26 Heaelt.','Trunsffers aell cundeeshuns frum taerget aelly tu yuoorselff. Trunsffer iffffect: yuoo gaeeen 6...26 Heaelt fur iaech cundeeshun. Cunnut selff-taerget.'],
312=>['Huly Streeke-a','Tuooched taerget fue-a taekes 10...55 huly daemaege-a. Iff knucked doon, yuoor taerget taekes un aeddeeshunael 10...55 huly daemaege-a.','Deaels 10...55 huly daemaege-a. Deaels 10...55 mure-a huly daemaege-a iff taerget is knucked-doon.'],
313=>['Heaeleeng Tuooch','Heael taerget tuooched aelly fur 20...80 Heaelt. Heaelt gaeeen frum Deefeene-a Faefur is duoobled fur thees spell.','Heaels fur 20...80. Duooble-a Heaelt gaeeen frum Deefeene-a Faefur fur thees spell.'],
314=>['Resture-a Leeffe-a','Tuooch zee budy ooff a faellee paerty member. Taerget paerty member is retoorned tu leeffe-a veet 20...65% Heaelt und 42...90% Inergy.','Resoorrects taerget paerty member (20...65% Heaelt, 42...90% Inergy). Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
315=>['Fengeunce-a','Breeng taerget deaed paerty member baeck tu leeffe-a aet fooll Heaelt und fooll Inergy. Fur 30 secunds, thaet paerty member deaels 25% mure-a daemaege-a. Vhee thees inchuntment inds, taerget paerty member deees. Deaeths vheele-a under zee iffffects ooff thees inchuntment du nut incoor a deaet penaelty.','(30 secunds.) Resoorrects taerget paerty member (fooll Heaelt, fooll Inergy). Thees aelly deaels 25% mure-a daemaege-a und dues nut incoor deaet penaelty. Ind iffffect: thees aelly deees.'],
316=>['"Tu zee Leemeet!"','Fur iaech fue-a veetheen iaershut (maexeemoom 1...6), yuoo gaeeen oone-a streeke-a ooff aedrenaeleene-a. Fur 10...20 secunds, yuoor maexeemoom Heaelt is increaesed by 10...60.','(10...20 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +10...60 maexeemoom Heaelt. Ineeteeael iffffect: yuoo gaeeen oone-a streeke-a ooff aedrenaeleene-a fur iaech fue-a veetheen iaershut (maexeemoom 1...6).'],
317=>['Baettle-a Raege-a','Fur 5...20 secunds, yuoo mufe-a 33% faester und gaeeen duooble-a aedrenaeleene-a frum aettaecks. Baettle-a Raege-a inds iff yuoo use-a uny nun-aedrenael skeells.','(5...20 secunds.) Yuoo mufe-a 33% faester und gaeeen duooble-a aedrenaeleene-a frum yuoor aettaecks. Inds iff yuoo use-a uny nun-aedrenael skeells.'],
318=>['Deffy Paeeen','Fur 20 secunds, yuoo haefe-a un aeddeeshunael 90...300 Heaelt, un aeddeeshunael 20 aermur, und yuoo taeke-a -1...10 less daemaege-a.','(20 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +90...300 maexeemoom Heaelt, +20 aermur, und taeke-a -1...10 less daemaege-a.'],
319=>['Roosh','Fur 8...20 secunds, yuoo mufe-a 25% faester.','(8...20 secunds.) Yuoo mufe-a 25% faester.'],
320=>['Haemstreeng','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoor taerget is Creeppled fur 3...15 secunds, slooeeng hees mufement.','Inffleects Creeppled cundeeshun (3...15 secunds).'],
321=>['Veeld Bloo','Luse-a aell aedrenaeleene-a. Iff it heets, thees aettaeck veell resoolt in a creeteecael heet und uny stunce-a beeeng used by yuoor taerget inds. Thees aettaeck cunnut be-a blucked.','Aelvaeys a creeteecael heet. Remufes a stunce-a. Unbluckaeble-a. Luse-a aell aedrenaeleene-a.'],
322=>['Pooer Aettaeck','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +10...40 daemaege-a.','Deaels +10...40 daemaege-a.'],
323=>['Desperaeshun Bloo','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +10...40 daemaege-a, und yuoor taerget sooffffers frum oone-a ooff zee fullooeeng cundeeshuns: Deep Vuoond (fur 20 secunds), Veaekness (fur 20 secunds), Bleedeeng (fur 25 secunds), oor Creeppled (fur 15 secunds). Aeffter maekeeng a Desperaeshun Bloo, yuoo aere-a knucked doon.','Deaels +10...40 daemaege-a. Inffleects oone-a ooff zee fullooeeng rundum cundeeshuns: Deep Vuoond (20 secunds), Veaekness (20 secunds), Bleedeeng (25 secunds), oor Creeppled (15 secunds). Yuoo aere-a knucked-doon.'],
324=>['Threell ooff Feectury','Iff thees bloo heets, yuoo deael +20...40 daemaege-a. Iff yuoo haefe-a mure-a Heaelt thun taerget fue-a, yuoo gaeeen 1...2 streeke-as ooff aedrenaeleene-a.','Deaels +20...40 daemaege-a. Iff yuoo haefe-a mure-a Heaelt thun yuoor taerget, gaeeen 1...2 aedrenaeleene-a.'],
325=>['Deestraecteeng Bloo','Sveepe-a yuoor veaepun aet zee taerget, deaeleeng nu daemaege-a boot deesroopteeng zee taerget\'s coorrent aecshun (und zee aecshuns ooff fues aedjaecent tu yuoor taerget).','Aelsu aettaecks fues aedjaecent tu yuoor taerget. Interroopts un aecshun. Heets fur nu daemaege-a.'],
326=>['Prutectur\'s Streeke-a','Iff thees aettaeck streekes a mufeeng fue-a, yuoo streeke-a fur 10...40 mure-a daemaege-a.','Deaels +10...40 daemaege-a iff taerget is mufeeng.'],
327=>['Greeffffun\'s Sveep','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +5...20 daemaege-a. Iff thees aettaeck is blucked, yuoor taerget is knucked doon und sooffffers 10...34 daemaege-a.','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Cooses knuck-doon und deaels 10...34 daemaege-a iff blucked.'],
328=>['Poore-a Streeke-a','Iff Poore-a Streeke-a heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +1...30 daemaege-a. Iff yuoo aere-a nut useeng a stunce-a, Poore-a Streeke-a cunnut be-a blucked.','Deaels +1...30 daemaege-a. Unbluckaeble-a unless yuoo aere-a in a stunce-a. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
329=>['Skooll Craeck','Iff it heets, thees aettaeck interroopts zee taerget\'s coorrent aecshun. Iff thaet fue-a vaes caesteeng a spell, thaet fue-a is Daezed fur 15 secunds.','Interroopts un aecshun. Inffleects Daezed cundeeshun (15 secunds) iff taerget is caesteeng a spell.'],
330=>['Cyclune-a Aexe-a','Perffurm a speenneeng aexe-a aettaeck streekeeng fur +4...12 daemaege-a tu aell aedjaecent ooppunents.','Deaels +4...12 daemaege-a tu aell fues aedjaecent tu yuoo.'],
331=>['Haemmer Baesh','Luse-a aell aedrenaeleene-a. Iff Haemmer Baesh heets, yuoor taerget is knucked doon.','Cooses knuck-doon. Luse-a aell aedrenaeleene-a.'],
332=>['Booll\'s Streeke-a','Iff thees aettaeck heets a mufeeng fue-a, yuoo streeke-a fur +5...30 daemaege-a, und yuoor taerget is knucked doon.','Deaels +5...30 daemaege-a und cooses knuck-doon iff taerget fue-a is mufeeng.'],
333=>['"I Veell Aefenge-a Yuoo!"','Fur iaech deaed aelly, yuoo gaeeen 10 secunds ooff +3...7 Heaelt regeneraeshun und yuoor aettaeck speed increaeses by 25%.','Yuoo haefe-a +3...7 Heaelt regeneraeshun und aettaeck 25% faester (10 secunds fur iaech deaed aelly).'],
334=>['Aexe-a Raeke-a','Iff thees aettaeck heets a fue-a sooffffereeng frum a Deep Vuoond, yuoo streeke-a fur +4...16 daemaege-a, und thaet fue-a becumes Creeppled fur 15 secunds.','Deaels +4...16 daemaege-a und inffleects Creeppled cundeeshun (15 secunds) iff taerget fue-a haes a Deep Vuoond.'],
335=>['Cleaefe-a','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +10...40 daemaege-a und heet 1...2 aedjaecent fue-as fur 10...40 slaesheeng daemaege-a.','Deaels +10...40 daemaege-a und heets 1...2 aedjaecent fue-as fur 10...40 slaesheeng daemaege-a.'],
336=>['Ixecooshuner\'s Streeke-a','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +15...45 daemaege-a.','Deaels +15...45 daemaege-a.'],
337=>['Deesmember','Iff it heets, thees aexe-a bloo veell inffleect a Deep Vuoond oon taerget fue-a, looereeng thaet fue-a\'s maexeemoom Heaelt by 20% fur 5...20 secunds.','Inffleects Deep Vuoond cundeeshun (5...20 secunds).'],
338=>['Ifeesceraete-a','Iff Ifeesceraete-a heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +10...45 daemaege-a und inffleect a Deep Vuoond, looereeng yuoor taerget\'s maexeemoom Heaelt by 20% fur 5...20 secunds.','Deaels +10...45 daemaege-a. Inffleects Deep Vuoond cundeeshun (5...20 secunds).'],
339=>['Penetraeteeng Bloo','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +10...25 daemaege-a. Thees aexe-a aettaeck haes 20% aermur penetraeshun.','Deaels +10...25 daemaege-a. 20% aermur penetraeshun.'],
340=>['Deesroopteeng Chup','Iff it heets, thees aettaeck interroopts zee taerget\'s coorrent aecshun. Iff thaet aecshun vaes a skeell, thaet skeell is deesaebled fur un aeddeeshunael 20 secunds.','Interroopts un aecshun. Interroopshun iffffect: interroopted skeell is deesaebled fur +20 secunds.'],
341=>['Sveefft Chup','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +1...20 daemaege-a. Iff Sveefft Chup is blucked, taerget fue-a taekes 1...20 daemaege-a und sooffffers a Deep Vuoond fur 20 secunds.','Deaels +1...20 daemaege-a. Deaels 1...20 daemaege-a und inffleects Deep Vuoond cundeeshun (20 secunds) iff blucked.'],
342=>['Aexe-a Tveest','Iff thees aettaeck heets a fue-a sooffffereeng frum a Deep Vuoond, yuoo streeke-a fur 5...25 mure-a daemaege-a und thaet fue-a sooffffers frum Veaekness fur 20 secunds.','Deaels +5...25 daemaege-a und inffleects Veaekness cundeeshun (20 secunds) iff taerget fue-a haes a Deep Vuoond.'],
343=>['"Fur Greaet Joosteece-a!"','Fur 20 secunds, vhenefer yuoo gaeeen aedrenaeleene-a, yuoo gaeeen 100% mure-a.','(20 secunds.) Yuoo gaeeen 100% mure-a aedrenaeleene-a.'],
344=>['Floorry','Fur 5 secunds, yuoor aettaeck raete-a is increaesed by 33%, boot yuoo deael 25% less daemaege-a.','(5 secunds). Yuoo aettaeck 33% faester. Yuoo du 25% less daemaege-a.'],
345=>['Deffenseefe-a Stunce-a','Fur 1...5 secunds, yuoo haefe-a a 75% chunce-a tu bluck melee-a und prujecteele-a aettaecks. Vhee Deffenseefe-a Stunce-a inds, yuoo gaeeen oone-a streeke-a ooff aedrenaeleene-a fur iaech melee-a aettaeck skeell yuoo haefe-a (maexeemoom 0...4).','(1...5 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a 75% chunce-a tu bluck. Ind iffffect: gaeeen oone-a aedrenaeleene-a fur iaech melee-a aettaeck skeell yuoo haefe-a (maexeemoom 0...4). Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
346=>['Frenzy','Fur 8 secunds, yuoo aettaeck 33% faester boot taeke-a 175...125%daemaege-a.','(8 secunds.) Yuoo aettaeck 33% faester. Yuoo taeke-a 175...125% daemaege-a.'],
347=>['Indoore-a Paeeen','Fur 7...18 secunds yuoo haefe-a un aeddeeshunael 90...300 Heaelt.','(7...18 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +90...300 maexeemoom Heaelt.'],
348=>['"Vaetch Yuoorselff!"','Paerty members veetheen iaershut gaeeen +5...25 aermur fur 10 secunds. Thees shuoot inds aeffter 10 incumeeng aettaecks.','(10 secunds.) Paerty members in iaershut haefe-a +5...25 aermur. Inds aeffter 10 incumeeng aettaecks.'],
349=>['Spreent','Fur 8...14 secunds, yuoo mufe-a 25% faester.','(8...14 secunds.) Yuoo mufe-a 25% faester.'],
350=>['Belly Smaesh','Iff thees aettaeck streekes a fue-a vhu is knucked doon, zee resoolteeng doost cluood veell bleend aedjaecent fues fur 3...7 secunds.','Inffleects Bleendness cundeeshun tu aedjaecent fues (3...7 secunds) iff taerget fue-a is knucked doon.'],
351=>['Meeghty Bloo','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +10...40 daemaege-a.','Deaels +10...40 daemaege-a.'],
352=>['Croosheeng Bloo','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +1...20 daemaege-a. Iff yuoo heet a knucked-doon fue-a yuoo inffleect a Deep Vuoond, looereeng yuoor taerget\'s maexeemoom Heaelt by 20% fur 5...20 secunds.','Deaels +1...20 daemaege-a. Inffleects Deep Vuoond cundeeshun iff taerget fue-a is knucked-doon (5...20 secunds).'],
353=>['Croode-a Sveeng','Aettaeck aell aedjaecent fues. Iaech fue-a yuoo heet is stroock fur +1...20 daemaege-a.','Aettaeck aell aedjaecent fues fur +1...20 daemaege-a.'],
354=>['Iaert Shaeker','Taerget fue-a und aell aedjaecent fues aere-a knucked doon. (50% faeeeloore-a chunce-a veet Haemmer Maestery 4 oor less.)','Knucks doon taerget und aedjaecent fues. 50% faeeeloore-a chunce-a unless Haemmer Maestery 5 oor mure-a.'],
355=>['Defaestaeteeng Haemmer','Iff Defaestaeteeng Haemmer heets, yuoor taerget is knucked doon und sooffffers frum Veaekness fur 5...20 secunds.','Cooses knuck-doon. Inffleects Veaekness cundeeshun (5...20 secunds).'],
356=>['Irreseesteeble-a Bloo','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +5...20 daemaege-a. Iff Irreseesteeble-a Bloo is blucked, yuoor taerget is knucked doon und taekes 5...20 daemaege-a.','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Deaels 5...20 daemaege-a und cooses knuck-doon iff blucked.'],
357=>['Cuoonter Bloo','Iff thees aettaeck heets un aettaeckeeng fue-a, thaet fue-a is knucked doon. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Cooses knuck-doon iff taerget fue-a is aettaeckeeng.'],
358=>['Baeckbreaeker','Iff Baeckbreaeker heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +1...20 daemaege-a und yuoor taerget is knucked doon. Iff yuoo haefe-a 8 Strengt oor heegher, thees knuckdoon laests 4 secunds.','Deaels +1...20 daemaege-a. Cooses knuckdoon. Knuckdoon laests 4 secunds veet Strengt 8 oor heegher.'],
359=>['Heaefy Bloo','Luse-a aell aedrenaeleene-a. Iff thees aettaeck heets a fue-a sooffffereeng frum Veaekness, thaet fue-a is knucked doon und yuoo streeke-a fur +1...30 daemaege-a.','Deaels +1...30 daemaege-a und cooses knuck-doon iff taerget fue-a is Veaekened. Luse-a aell aedrenaeleene-a.'],
360=>['Staeggereeng Bloo','Iff thees haemmer bloo heets, yuoor taerget veell sooffffer frum Veaekness fur 5...20 secunds.','Inffleects Veaekness cundeeshun (5...20 secunds).'],
361=>['Dulyaek Seegnet','Fur 8...20 secunds, yuoo haefe-a +10...40 aermur und cunnut be-a knucked doon, boot yuoor mufement is slooed by 75%.','(8...20 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +10...40 aermur und cunnut be-a knucked-doon. Yuoo mufe-a 75% slooer.'],
362=>['Vaerreeur\'s Coonneeng','Fur 5...11 secunds, yuoor melee-a aettaecks cunnut be-a blucked.','(5...11 secunds.) Yuoor melee-a aettaecks aere-a unbluckaeble-a.'],
363=>['Sheeeld Baesh','Fur 5...11 secunds, vheele-a veeeldeeng a sheeeld, zee next melee-a aettaeck skeell used aegaeeenst yuoo is blucked, yuoor aettaecker is knucked doon, und thaet skeell is deesaebled fur un aeddeeshunael 15 secunds.','(5...11 secunds.) Yuoo bluck zee next melee-a aettaeck skeell. Cooses knuck-doon und +15 secund rechaerge-a. Nu iffffect unless yuoo aere-a veeeldeeng a sheeeld.'],
364=>['"Chaerge-a!"','Aell aelleees veetheen iaershut luse-a zee Creeppled cundeeshun. Fur 5...13 secunds, zeese-a aelleees mufe-a 33% faester.','(5...13 secunds.) Aelleees in iaershut mufe-a 33% faester. Ineeteeael iffffect: zeese-a aelleees luse-a zee Creeppled cundeeshun.'],
365=>['"Feectury Is Meene-a!"','Yuoo gaeeen 10...68 Heaelt und 3...7 Inergy fur iaech cundeeshun sooffffered by taerget fue-a.','Yuoo gaeeen 10...68 Heaelt und 3...7 Inergy fur iaech cundeeshun oon taerget fue-a.'],
366=>['"Feaer Me-a!"','Aell neaerby fues luse-a 2...6 Inergy. Fur 1...15 secunds, yuoor melee-a aettaecks gaeeen +5...30% chunce-a ooff a creeteecael heet aegaeeenst staeshunaery fues.','(1...15 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +5...30% chunce-a ooff a creeteecael heet veet melee-a aettaecks aegaeeenst staeshunaery fues. Ineeteeael iffffect: neaerby fues luse-a 2...6 Inergy.'],
367=>['"Sheeelds Up!"','Fur 5...11 secunds, yuoo und aell paerty members veetheen iaershut gaeeen +60 aermur aegaeeenst incumeeng prujecteele-a aettaecks.','(5...11 secunds.) Paerty members in iaershut haefe-a +60 aermur aegaeeenst prujecteele-a aettaecks.'],
368=>['"I Veell Soorfeefe-a!"','Yuoo gaeeen +3 Heaelt regeneraeshun fur iaech cundeeshun yuoo aere-a sooffffereeng. Thees regeneraeshun ixpures aeffter 5...11 secunds.','(5...11 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +3 Heaelt regeneraeshun fur iaech cundeeshun oon yuoo.'],
370=>['Berserker Stunce-a','Fur 8...14 secunds, yuoo aettaeck 33% faester und gaeeen 100% mure-a aedrenaeleene-a. Berserker Stunce-a inds iff yuoo use-a a skeell.','(8...14 secunds.) Yuoo aettaeck 33% faester und gaeeen 100% mure-a aedrenaeleene-a. Inds iff yuoo use-a a skeell.'],
371=>['Baelunced Stunce-a','Fur 8...20 secunds, yuoo cunnut be-a knucked doon und yuoo du nut sooffffer ixtra daemaege-a frum a creeteecael aettaeck.','(8...20 secunds.) Yuoo cunnut be-a knucked-doon und du nut taeke-a ixtra daemaege-a frum creeteecael heets.'],
372=>['Glaedeeaetur\'s Deffense-a','Fur 5...11 secunds, yuoo haefe-a a 75% chunce-a tu bluck incumeeng aettaecks. Vhenefer yuoo bluck a melee-a aettaeck thees vaey, zee aettaecker sooffffers 5...35 daemaege-a.','(5...11 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a 75% chunce-a tu bluck. Yuoor aettaecker taekes 5...35 daemaege-a vhenefer yuoo bluck a melee-a aettaeck thees vaey.'],
373=>['Defflect Aerroos','Fur 1...6 secunds, yuoo haefe-a a 75% chunce-a tu bluck aettaecks. Iff yuoo bluck a prujecteele-a aettaeck, aedjaecent fues sooffffer frum Bleedeeng fur 5...15 secunds.','(1...6 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a 75% chunce-a tu bluck aettaecks. Aedjaecent fues sooffffer Bleedeeng (5...15 secunds) vhee yuoo bluck a prujecteele-a aettaeck.'],
374=>['Vaerreeur\'s Indoorunce-a','Fur 5...35 secunds, yuoo gaeeen 3 Inergy iaech teeme-a yuoo heet veet a melee-a aettaeck. Vaerreeur\'s Indoorunce-a cunnut raeeese-a yuoor Inergy aebufe-a 10...25.','(5...35 secunds.) Yuoo gaeeen 3 Inergy iaech teeme-a yuoo heet veet a melee-a aettaeck. Nu Inergy gaeeen iff yuoo haefe-a mure-a thun 10...25 Inergy.'],
375=>['Dvaerfee Baettle-a Stunce-a','Fur 5...11 secunds, iff yuoo aere-a veeeldeeng a haemmer, yuoo aettaeck 33% faester, yuoo gaeeen +40 aermur, und yuoor aettaeck skeells interroopt fues vhee zeey heet.','(5...11 secunds.) Yuoo aettaeck 33% faester, yuoo gaeeen +40 aermur, und yuoor aettaeck skeells interroopt aecshuns. Nu iffffect unless yuoo haefe-a a haemmer iqooeepped.'],
376=>['Deesceepleened Stunce-a','Fur 1...4 secunds, yuoo gaeeen +10 aermur und haefe-a a 75% chunce-a tu bluck aettaecks. Deesceepleened Stunce-a inds iff yuoo use-a un aedrenael skeell.','(1...4 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a 75% chunce-a tu bluck und +10 aermur. Inds iff yuoo use-a un aedrenael skeell.'],
377=>['Vaery Stunce-a','Fur 1...6 secunds, yuoo bluck uny aettaeck skeells used aegaeeenst yuoo. Fur iaech sooccessffool bluck, yuoo gaeeen aedrenaeleene-a und 5 Inergy. Vaery Stunce-a inds iff yuoo use-a a skeell.','(1...6 secunds). Yuoo bluck aettaeck skeells. Gaeeen aedrenaeleene-a und 5 Inergy fur iaech bluck. Inds iff yuoo use-a a skeell.'],
378=>['Sheeeld Stunce-a','Fur 1...6 secunds, vheele-a useeng a sheeeld, yuoo haefe-a a 75% chunce-a tu bluck incumeeng aettaecks, und daemaege-a is redooced by 2 fur iaech runk ooff Strengt (maexeemoom 15 daemaege-a redoocshun).','(1...6 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a 75% chunce-a tu bluck. Daemaege-a is redooced by 2 fur iaech runk ooff Strengt (maexeemoom 15 daemaege-a redoocshun). Nu iffffect unless yuoo haefe-a a sheeeld iqooeepped.'],
379=>['Booll\'s Chaerge-a','Fur 1...7 secunds, yuoo mufe-a 50% faester und iff yuoo streeke-a a mufeeng fue-a in melee-a, thaet fue-a is knucked doon. Booll\'s Chaerge-a inds iff yuoo use-a a skeell.','(1...7 secunds.) Yuoo mufe-a 50% faester. Cooses knuck-doon iff yuoo heet a mufeeng fue-a in melee-a. Inds iff yuoo use-a a skeell.'],
380=>['Bunettee\'s Deffense-a','Fur 5...11 secunds, yuoo haefe-a a 75% chunce-a tu bluck melee-a und prujecteele-a aettaecks. Yuoo gaeeen 5 Inergy fur iaech sooccessffool melee-a aettaeck blucked. Bunettee\'s Deffense-a inds iff yuoo use-a a skeell.','(5...11 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a 75% chunce-a tu bluck. Gaeeen 5 Inergy fur iaech melee-a aettaeck blucked. Inds iff yuoo use-a a skeell.'],
381=>['Hoondred Blaedes','Fur 15 secunds, vhenefer yuoo aettaeck veet a svurd, aell aedjaecent fues taeke-a 10...35 slaesheeng daemaege-a.','(15 secunds.) Deaels 10...35 slaesheeng daemaege-a tu aell aedjaecent fues vhenefer yuoo aettaeck veet a svurd.'],
382=>['Sefer Aertery','Iff thees aettaeck heets, zee ooppunent begeens Bleedeeng fur 5...25 secunds, luseeng Heaelt oofer teeme-a.','Inffleects Bleedeeng cundeeshun (5...25 secunds).'],
383=>['Gaelraet Slaesh','Thees aettaeck streekes fur +1...40 daemaege-a iff it heets.','Deaels +1...40 daemaege-a.'],
384=>['Gaesh','Iff thees aettaeck heets a Bleedeeng fue-a, yuoo streeke-a fur 5...20 mure-a daemaege-a und thaet fue-a sooffffers a Deep Vuoond, looereeng thaet fue-a\'s maexeemoom Heaelt by 20% fur 5...20 secunds. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a und inffleects Deep Vuoond cundeeshun (5...20 secunds) iff yuoor taerget is Bleedeeng.'],
385=>['Feenael Throost','Luse-a aell aedrenaeleene-a. Iff Feenael Throost heets, yuoo deael 5...40 mure-a daemaege-a. Thees daemaege-a is duoobled iff yuoor taerget vaes beloo 50% Heaelt.','Deaels +5...40 daemaege-a. Deaels +5...40 mure-a daemaege-a iff taerget fue-a is beloo 50% Heaelt. Luse-a aell aedrenaeleene-a.'],
386=>['Seekeeng Blaede-a','Iff thees aettaeck heets yuoo streeke-a fur +1...20 daemaege-a. Iff Seekeeng Blaede-a is blucked, yuoor taerget begeens Bleedeeng fur 25 secunds und taekes 1...20 daemaege-a.','Deaels +1...20 daemaege-a. Deaels 1...20 daemaege-a und inffleects Bleedeeng cundeeshun (25 secunds) iff blucked.'],
387=>['Reepuste-a','Fur 8 secunds, vheele-a yuoo haefe-a a svurd iqooeepped, yuoo bluck zee next melee-a aettaeck aegaeeenst yuoo und yuoor aettaecker is stroock fur 20...80 daemaege-a.','(8 secunds.) Yuoo bluck zee next melee-a aettaeck und yuoor aettaecker taekes 20...80 daemaege-a. Nu iffffect unless yuoo haefe-a a svurd iqooeepped.'],
388=>['Deaedly Reepuste-a','Fur 8 secunds, vheele-a yuoo haefe-a a svurd iqooeepped, yuoo bluck zee next melee-a aettaeck aegaeeenst yuoo, und yuoor aettaecker is stroock fur 15...90 daemaege-a und begeens Bleedeeng fur 3...25 secunds.','(8 secunds.) Yuoo bluck zee next melee-a aettaeck und yuoor aettaecker taekes 15...90 daemaege-a. Inffleects Bleedeeng cundeeshun (3...25 secunds). Nu iffffect unless yuoo haefe-a a svurd iqooeepped.'],
389=>['Fluooreesh','Aell ooff yuoor aettaeck skeells becume-a rechaerged. Yuoo gaeeen 2...7 Inergy fur iaech skeell rechaerged by Fluooreesh.','Rechaerges yuoor aettaeck skeells. Yuoo gaeeen 2...7 Inergy fur iaech skeell rechaerged.'],
390=>['Saefaege-a Slaesh','Iff thees aettaeck heets, it interroopts taerget fue-a\'s aecshun. Iff thaet aecshun vaes a spell, yuoo deael 1...40 ixtra daemaege-a.','Interroopts un aecshun. Interroopshun iffffect: deaels +1...40 daemaege-a iff aecshun vaes a spell.'],
391=>['Hoonter\'s Shut','Iff Hoonter\'s Shut heets, yuoor taerget begeens Bleedeeng fur 3...25 secunds.','Inffleects Bleedeeng cundeeshun (3...25 secunds).'],
392=>['Peen Doon','Iff Peen Doon heets, yuoor taerget is Creeppled fur 3...15 secunds.','Inffleects Creeppled cundeeshun (3...15 secunds).'],
393=>['Creeppleeng Shut','Iff Creeppleeng Shut heets, yuoor taerget becumes Creeppled fur 4...14 secunds. Thees aettaeck cunnut be-a blucked.','Unbluckaeble-a. Inffleects Creeppled cundeeshun (4...14 secunds).'],
394=>['Pooer Shut','Iff Pooer Shut heets, taerget fue-a taekes 25...50 daemaege-a.','Taerget fue-a taekes 25...50 daemaege-a.'],
395=>['Baerraege-a','Aell yuoor prepaeraeshuns aere-a remufed. Shuut aerroos aet taerget fue-a und up tu 5 fues aedjaecent tu yuoor taerget. Zeese-a aerroos streeke-a fur +5...20 daemaege-a iff zeey heet. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Heets 5 fues aedjaecent tu yuoor taerget. Aell yuoor prepaeraeshuns aere-a remufed.'],
396=>['Dooael Shut','Shuut tvu aerroos seemooltuneuoosly aet taerget fue-a. Zeese-a aerroos deael 25% less daemaege-a. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Yuoo shuut tvu aerroos seemooltuneuoosly aet taerget fue-a. Zeese-a aerroos deael 25% less daemaege-a.'],
397=>['Qooeeck Shut','Shuut un aerroo thaet mufes tveece-a aes faest.','Yuoo shuut un aerroo thaet mufes tveece-a aes faest.'],
398=>['Penetraeteeng Aettaeck','Iff Penetraeteeng Aettaeck heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +5...25 daemaege-a und thees aettaeck haes 10% aermur penetraeshun.','Deaels +5...25 daemaege-a. 10% aermur penetraeshun. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
399=>['Deestraecteeng Shut','Iff Deestraecteeng Shut heets, it interroopts taerget fue-a\'s aecshun boot deaels oonly 1...16 daemaege-a. Iff zee interroopted aecshun vaes a skeell, thaet skeell is deesaebled fur un aeddeeshunael 20 secunds.','Interroopts un aecshun. Interroopshun iffffect: interroopted skeell is deesaebled fur +20 secunds. Heets fur oonly 1...16 daemaege-a.'],
400=>['Preceeseeun Shut','Iff Preceeseeun Shut heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +3...10 daemaege-a. Preceeseeun Shut cunnut be-a blucked. Thees aecshun is iaeseely interroopted.','Deaels +3...10 daemaege-a. Unbluckaeble-a. Iaeseely interroopted.'],
402=>['Determeened Shut','Iff Determeened Shut heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +5...20 daemaege-a. Iff Determeened Shut faeeels tu heet, aell ooff yuoor aettaeck skeells aere-a rechaerged.','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Rechaerges yuoor aettaeck skeells iff it faeeels tu heet.'],
403=>['Caelled Shut','Shuut un aerroo thaet mufes 3 teemes faester und cunnut be-a blucked. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Yuoo shuut un aerroo thaet mufes 3 teemes faester. Unbluckaeble-a.'],
404=>['Pueesun Aerroo','Iff Pueesun Aerroo heets, yuoor taerget becumes Pueesuned fur 5...20 secunds.','Inffleects Pueesuned cundeeshun (5...20 secunds).'],
405=>['Ooaet Shut','Iff Ooaet Shut heets, aell ooff yuoor skeells ixcept Ooaet Shut aere-a rechaerged. Iff it meesses, aell ooff yuoor skeells aere-a deesaebled fur 10...4 secunds. (50% meess chunce-a veet Ixperteese-a 7 oor less.)','Rechaerges aell skeells ixcept Ooaet Shut iff it heets. Deesaebles aell skeells iff it meesses (10...4 secunds). 50% meess chunce-a unless Ixperteese-a 8 oor heegher.'],
406=>['Debeeleetaeteeng Shut','Iff Debeeleetaeteeng Shut heets, yuoor taerget luses 1...10 Inergy.','Cooses 1...10 Inergy luss.'],
407=>['Pueent Blunk Shut','Shuut un aerroo thaet haes haelff zee nurmael runge-a, boot streekes fur +10...40 daemaege-a.','Deaels +10...40 daemaege-a.'],
408=>['Cuncoosseeun Shut','Iff Cuncoosseeun Shut heets vheele-a taerget fue-a is caesteeng a spell, zee spell is interroopted und yuoor taerget is Daezed fur 5...20 secunds. Thees aettaeck deaels oonly 1...16 daemaege-a.','Interroopts a spell. Interroopshun iffffect: inffleects Daezed cundeeshun (5...20 secunds). Heets fur oonly 1...16 daemaege-a.'],
409=>['Pooneesheeng Shut','Iff Pooneesheeng Shut heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +10...20 daemaege-a und yuoor taerget is interroopted.','Deaels +10...20 daemaege-a. Interroopts un aecshun.'],
411=>['Chaerm Uneemael','Chaerm taerget uneemael. Oonce-a chaermed, yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun veell traefel veet yuoo vhenefer yuoo haefe-a Chaerm Uneemael iqooeepped. Yuoo cunnut chaerm un uneemael thaet is mure-a thun 4 lefels aebufe-a yuoo.','Chaerm taerget uneemael. Oonce-a chaermed, yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun veell traefel veet yuoo vhenefer yuoo haefe-a Chaerm Uneemael iqooeepped. Yuoo cunnut chaerm un uneemael thaet is mure-a thun 4 lefels aebufe-a yuoo.'],
412=>['Caell ooff Prutecshun','Fur 120 secunds, yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun haes a 5...20 baese-a daemaege-a redoocshun.','(120 secunds.) Yuoor pet haes 5...20 daemaege-a redoocshun.'],
415=>['Caell ooff Haeste-a','Fur 30 secunds, yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun haes a 33% faester aettaeck speed und mufes 33% faester.','(30 secunds.) Yuoor pet mufes und aettaecks 33% faester.'],
422=>['Refeefe-a Uneemael','Resoorrect aell aelleeed uneemael cumpuneeuns in zee aerea. Zeey cume-a baeck tu leeffe-a veet 10...94% Heaelt.','Resoorrects aell aelleeed pets in zee aerea (10...94% Heaelt). Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
423=>['Symbeeuteec Bund','Fur 120...300 secunds, yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun gaeeens 1...3 Heaelt regeneraeshun, und haelff ooff aell daemaege-a deaelt tu yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun is redurected tu yuoo.','(120...300 secunds.) Yuoor pet haes +1...3 Heaelt regeneraeshun. Haelff ooff aell daemaege-a deaelt tu yuoor pet is redurected tu yuoo.'],
424=>['Throo Durt','Taerget tuooched fue-a und fues aedjaecent tu yuoor taerget becume-a Bleended fur 3...15 secunds.','Inffleects Bleendness cundeeshun (3...15 secunds). Aelsu aeffffects fues aedjaecent tu taerget fue-a.'],
425=>['Dudge-a','Fur 5...11 secunds, yuoo mufe-a 33% faester und haefe-a a 27...75% chunce-a tu bluck incumeeng prujecteeles. Dudge-a inds iff yuoo aettaeck.','(5...11 secunds.) Yuoo mufe-a 33% faester und haefe-a 27...75% chunce-a tu bluck prujecteele-a aettaecks. Inds iff yuoo aettaeck.'],
426=>['Saefaege-a Shut','Iff Saefaege-a Shut heets, yuoor taerget\'s aecshun is interroopted. Iff thaet aecshun vaes a spell, yuoo streeke-a fur +13...28 daemaege-a.','Interroopts un aecshun. Interroopshun iffffect: deaels +13...28 daemaege-a iff aecshun vaes a spell.'],
427=>['Unteedute-a Seegnet','Cleunse-a yuoorselff ooff Pueesun, Deeseaese-a, Bleendness, und oone-a aeddeeshunael cundeeshun.','Remufe-a Pueesun, Deeseaese-a, Bleendness, und oone-a aeddeeshunael cundeeshun frum yuoorselff.'],
428=>['Incendeeaery Aerroos','Shuut aerroos aet taerget fue-a und up tu 2 fue-as neaer yuoor taerget. Thuse-a fues aere-a set oon fure-a fur 1...3 secunds.','Heets 2 fue-as neaer yuoor taerget und inffleects Boorneeng (1...3 secunds).'],
429=>['Melundroo\'s Aerroos','Fur 18 secunds, vhenefer yuoor aerroos heet, zeey coose-a Bleedeeng fur 3...25 secunds, und iff zeey heet a taerget vhu is under un inchuntment, zeey du +8...28 daemaege-a.','(18 secunds.) Yuoor aerroos inffleect Bleedeeng cundeeshun (3...25 secunds) und deael +8...28 daemaege-a tu inchunted fues.'],
430=>['Maerksmun\'s Vaeger','Fur 18 secunds, yuoo gaeeen 5...10 Inergy vhenefer yuoor aerroos heet, boot luse-a 10 Inergy vhenefer yuoor aerroos faeeel tu streeke-a.','(18 secunds.) Gaeeen 5...10 Inergy vhenefer yuoor aerroos heet. Luse-a 10 Inergy vhenefer yuoo faeeel tu heet.'],
431=>['Igneete-a Aerroos','Fur 24 secunds, yuoor aerroos ixplude-a oon cuntaect, deaeleeng 3...18 fure-a daemaege-a tu taerget und aell aedjaecent fues.','(24 secunds.) Yuoor aerroos deael 3...18 fure-a daemaege-a tu taerget und fues aedjaecent tu taerget.'],
432=>['Reaed zee Veend','Fur 24 secunds, yuoor aerroos mufe-a tveece-a aes faest und deael 3...10 ixtra daemaege-a.','(24 secunds.) +3...10 daemaege-a. Yuoor aerroos mufe-a tveece-a aes faest.'],
433=>['Keendle-a Aerroos','Fur 24 secunds, yuoor aerroos deael fure-a daemaege-a und heet fur un aeddeeshunael 3...24 fure-a daemaege-a. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(24 secunds.) +3...24 fure-a daemaege-a. Yuoor aerroos deael fure-a daemaege-a.'],
434=>['Chukeeng Gaes','Fur 1...12 secunds, yuoor aerroos deael 1...8 mure-a daemaege-a und spreaed Chukeeng Gaes tu aell aedjaecent fues oon impaect. Chukeeng Gaes interroopts fues aettempteeng tu caest spells.','(1...12 secunds.) +1...8 daemaege-a. Spreaeds Chukeeng Gaes tu fues aedjaecent tu taerget. Chukeeng Gaes interroopts spells.'],
435=>['Aepply Pueesun','Fur 24 secunds, fues stroock by yuoor physeecael aettaecks becume-a Pueesuned fur 3...15 secunds.','(24 secunds.) Yuoor physeecael aettaecks inffleect Pueesuned cundeeshun (3...15 secunds).'],
436=>['Cumffurt Uneemael','Yuoo heael yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun fur 40...120 Heaelt. Iff yuoor cumpuneeun is deaed, it is resoorrected veet 10...58% Heaelt. Iff yuoo haefe-a Cumffurt Uneemael iqooeepped, yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun veell traefel veet yuoo.','Yuoor pet gaeeens 40...120 Heaelt. Resoorrects yuoor pet (10...58% Heaelt). Iff yuoo haefe-a Cumffurt Uneemael iqooeepped, yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun veell traefel veet yuoo.'],
437=>['Besteeael Puoonce-a','Yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun aettempts a Besteeael Puoonce-a thaet deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Iff zee aettaeck streekes a fue-a vhu is caesteeng a spell, thaet fue-a is knucked doon.','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Cooses knuck-doon iff taerget fue-a is caesteeng a spell.'],
438=>['Maeeemeeng Streeke-a','Yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun aettempts a Maeeemeeng Streeke-a thaet deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Iff thaet aettaeck heets thaet fue-a becumes Creeppled fur 3...15 secunds.','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Inffleects Creeppled cundeeshun (3...15 secunds) oon heet.'],
439=>['Ferael Loonge-a','Yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun aettempts a Ferael Loonge-a thaet deaels +5...35 daemaege-a. Iff zee aettaeck streekes a fue-a vhu is aettaeckeeng, thaet fue-a sooffffers frum Bleedeeng fur 5...25 secunds. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Deaels +5...35 daemaege-a. Inffleects Bleedeeng cundeeshun iff taerget fue-a is aettaeckeeng (5...25 secunds).'],
440=>['Scaefenger Streeke-a','Yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun aettempts a Scaefenger Streeke-a thaet deaels +10...25 daemaege-a. Iff zee aettaeck streekes a fue-a vhu is sooffffereeng frum a cundeeshun, yuoo gaeeen 3...15 Inergy.','Deaels +10...25 daemaege-a. Yuoo gaeeen 3...15 Inergy iff taerget fue-a haes a cundeeshun.'],
441=>['Melundroo\'s Aessoolt','Yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun aettempts a Melundroo\'s Aessoolt thaet deaels +5...20 daemaege-a tu aell neaerby fues.','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a tu neaerby fues.'],
442=>['Feruceeuoos Streeke-a','Yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun aettempts a Feruceeuoos Streeke-a thaet deaels +13...28 daemaege-a. Iff thaet aettaeck heets, yuoo gaeeen aedrenaeleene-a und 3...10 Inergy.','Deaels +13...28 daemaege-a. Yuoo gaeeen aedrenaeleene-a und 3...10 Inergy.'],
443=>['Predaetur\'s Puoonce-a','Yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun aettempts a Predaetur\'s Puoonce-a thaet deaels +5...35 daemaege-a. Iff thaet aettaeck heets, yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun gaeeens 5...50 Heaelt.','Deaels +5...35 daemaege-a. Yuoor pet gaeeens 5...50 Heaelt iff thees aettaeck heets.'],
444=>['Brootael Streeke-a','Yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun aettempts a Brootael Streeke-a thaet deaels +5...35 daemaege-a. Iff thaet aettaeck streekes a fue-a vhuse-a Heaelt is beloo 50%, thaet fue-a taekes un aeddeeshunael +5...35 daemaege-a.','Deaels +5...35 daemaege-a. Deaels +5...35 mure-a daemaege-a iff taerget fue-a is under 50% Heaelt.'],
445=>['Deesroopteeng Loonge-a','Yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun aettempts a Deesroopteeng Loonge-a thaet deaels +1...12 daemaege-a. Iff thaet aettaeck streekes a fue-a useeng a skeell thaet skeell is interroopted und is deesaebled fur un aeddeeshunael 20 secunds. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Deaels +1...12 daemaege-a. Interroopts a skeell. Interroopshun iffffect: interroopted skeell is deesaebled fur +20 secunds.'],
446=>['Trull Ungooent','Fur 13 secunds, yuoo gaeeen +3...10 Heaelt regeneraeshun.','(13 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +3...10 Heaelt regeneraeshun.'],
447=>['Ootyoogh\'s Cry','Fur 10...25 secunds, yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun gaeeens +24 aermur und cunnut be-a blucked. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(10...25 secunds.) Yuoor pet haes +24 aermur und is unbluckaeble-a.'],
448=>['Iscaepe-a','Fur 1...8 secunds, yuoo mufe-a 33% faester und haefe-a a 75% chunce-a tu bluck aettaecks.','(1...8 secunds.) Yuoo mufe-a 33% faester und haefe-a 75% chunce-a tu bluck.'],
449=>['Praecteeced Stunce-a','Fur 20...35 secunds, yuoor prepaeraeshuns rechaerge-a 50% faester und laest 30...300% lunger.','(20...35 secunds.) Yuoor prepaeraeshuns rechaerge-a 50% faester und laest 30...300% lunger.'],
450=>['Vhurleeng Deffense-a','Fur 8...20 secunds, yuoo haefe-a 75% chunce-a tu bluck aettaecks. Vhenefer yuoo bluck a prujecteele-a in thees vaey, aedjaecent fues taeke-a 5...11 daemaege-a.','(8...20 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a 75% chunce-a tu bluck. Deaels 5...11 daemaege-a tu aedjaecent fues vhenefer yuoo bluck a prujecteele-a aettaeck.'],
451=>['Melundroo\'s Reseeleeence-a','Fur 8...20 secunds, yuoo gaeeen +4 Heaelt regeneraeshun und +1 Inergy regeneraeshun fur iaech cundeeshun und hex yuoo aere-a sooffffereeng.','(8...20 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +4 Heaelt regeneraeshun und +1 Inergy regeneraeshun fur iaech cundeeshun und hex oon yuoo.'],
452=>['Dryder\'s Deffenses','Fur 5...11 secunds, yuoo gaeeen 75% chunce-a tu bluck aettaecks und 34...60 aermur aegaeeenst ilementael daemaege-a. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(5...11 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a 75% chunce-a tu bluck und +34...60 aermur aegaeeenst ilementael daemaege-a.'],
453=>['Leeghtneeng Refflexes','Fur 5...11 secunds, yuoo haefe-a a 75% chunce-a tu bluck melee-a und prujecteele-a aettaecks, und yuoo aettaeck 33% faester. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(5...11 secunds.) Yuoo aettaeck 33% faester und haefe-a 75% chunce-a tu bluck.'],
454=>['Teeger\'s Foory','Aell yuoor nun-aettaeck skeells aere-a deesaebled fur 5 secunds. Fur 5...11 secunds, yuoo aettaeck 25% faester.','(5...11 secunds.) Yuoo aettaeck 25% faester. Deesaebles yuoor nun-aettaeck skeells (5 secunds).'],
455=>['Sturm Chaeser','Fur 8...20 secunds, yuoo mufe-a 25% faester, und yuoo gaeeen 1...5 Inergy vhenefer yuoo taeke-a ilementael daemaege-a.','(8...20 secunds.) Yuoo mufe-a 25% faester und gaeeen 1...5 Inergy vhenefer yuoo taeke-a ilementael daemaege-a.'],
456=>['Serpent\'s Qooeeckness','Fur 15...30 secunds, rechaerge-a teemes fur yuoor skeells aere-a redooced by 33%. Serpent\'s Qooeeckness inds iff yuoor Heaelt drups beloo 50%.','(15...30 secunds.) Yuoor skeells rechaerge-a 33% faester. Inds iff yuoor Heaelt drups beloo 50%.'],
457=>['Doost Traep','Vhee Doost Traep is treeggered, ifery secund (fur 5 secunds tutael), aell neaerby fues aere-a Bleended fur 3...8 secunds und taeke-a 10...25 daemaege-a. Vheele-a aecteefaeteeng thees skeell, yuoo aere-a iaeseely interroopted. Doost Traep inds aeffter 90 secunds.','(90 secunds.) Aeffffects neaerby fues. Deaels 10...25 daemaege-a ifery secund (5 secunds). Inffleects Bleendness cundeeshun (3...8 secunds) ifery secund (5 secunds). Iaeseely interroopted.'],
458=>['Baerbed Traep','Vhee Baerbed Traep is treeggered, aell neaerby fues aere-a stroock fur 7...23 peeerceeng daemaege-a, becume-a Creeppled, und begeen Bleedeeng fur 3...25 secunds. Baerbed Traep inds aeffter 90 secunds. Vheele-a aecteefaeteeng thees skeell, yuoo aere-a iaeseely interroopted.','(90 secunds.) Aeffffects neaerby fues. Deaels 7...23 peeerceeng daemaege-a. Inffleects Creeppled und Bleedeeng cundeeshuns (3...25 secunds). Iaeseely interroopted.'],
459=>['Flaeme-a Traep','Vhee Flaeme-a Traep is treeggered, ifery secund (fur 3 secunds tutael), aell neaerby fues aere-a stroock fur 5...20 fure-a daemaege-a und set oon fure-a fur 1...3 secunds. Flaeme-a Traep inds aeffter 90 secunds. Vheele-a aecteefaeteeng thees skeell, yuoo aere-a iaeseely interroopted.','(90 secunds.) Aeffffects neaerby fues. Deaels 5...20 fure-a daemaege-a ifery secund (3 secunds). Inffleects Boorneeng cundeeshun (1...3 secunds). Iaeseely interroopted.'],
460=>['Heaeleeng Spreeng','Fur 10 secunds, aell aedjaecent aelleees aere-a heaeled fur 15...60 ifery 2 secunds. Vheele-a aecteefaeteeng thees skeell, yuoo aere-a iaeseely interroopted.','(10 secunds.) Aeffffects aedjaecent aelleees. Heaels fur 15...60 ifery 2 secunds. Iaeseely interroopted.'],
461=>['Speeke-a Traep','Vhee Speeke-a Traep is treeggered, ifery secund (fur 2 secunds tutael), aell neaerby fues aere-a stroock fur 10...40 peeerceeng daemaege-a, becume-a Creeppled fur 3...25 secunds, und aere-a knucked doon. Speeke-a Traep inds aeffter 90 secunds. Vheele-a aecteefaeteeng thees skeell, yuoo aere-a iaeseely interroopted.','(90 secunds.) Aeffffects neaerby fues. Ifery secund (fur 2 secunds), thees traep deaels 10...40 peeerceeng daemaege-a, cooses knuck-doon, und inffleects Creeppled cundeeshun (3...25 secunds). Iaeseely interroopted.'],
462=>['Veenter','Creaete-a a lefel 1...10 spureet. Fur creaetoores veetheen its runge-a, aell ilementael daemaege-a is culd daemaege-a insteaed. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...240 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...10 spureet (30...240 secund leeffespun). Cunferts ilementael daemaege-a tu culd daemaege-a fur creaetoores in runge-a. Dues nut aeffffect spureets.'],
463=>['Veennooeeng','Creaete-a a lefel 1...10 spureet. Nun-spureet creaetoores veetheen runge-a taeke-a 4 aeddeeshunael daemaege-a vhenefer zeey taeke-a physeecael daemaege-a. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...240 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...10 spureet (30...240 secund leeffespun). Increaese-a physeecael daemaege-a by +4 fur creaetoores in runge-a. Dues nut aeffffect spureets.'],
464=>['Idge-a ooff Ixteencshun','Creaete-a a lefel 1...10 spureet. Iff a nun-spureet creaetoore-a veetheen runge-a deees, Idge-a ooff Ixteencshun deaels 14...50 daemaege-a tu aell creaetoores ooff zee saeme-a type-a thaet aere-a beloo 90% Heaelt und veetheen runge-a ooff zee spureet. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...240 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...10 spureet (30...240 secund leeffespun). Deaels 14...50 daemaege-a tu creaetoores in its runge-a vhenefer a creaetoore-a ooff zee saeme-a type-a deees. Dues nut aeffffect spureets. Nu daemaege-a tu creaetoores aebufe-a 90% Heaelt.'],
465=>['Greaeter Cunfflaegraeshun','Creaete-a a lefel 1...10 spureet. Fur nun-spureet creaetoores veetheen its runge-a, aell physeecael daemaege-a is fure-a daemaege-a insteaed. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...240 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...10 spureet (30...240 secund leeffespun). Cunferts physeecael daemaege-a tu fure-a daemaege-a fur creaetoores in runge-a. Dues nut aeffffect spureets. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
466=>['Cunfflaegraeshun','Creaete-a a lefel 1...10 spureet. Fur nun-spureet creaetoores veetheen its runge-a, aell aerroos thaet heet streeke-a fur fure-a daemaege-a. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...240 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...10 spureet (30...240 secund leeffespun). Aell aerroos deael fure-a daemaege-a fur creaetoores in runge-a. Dues nut aeffffect spureets.'],
467=>['Ferteele-a Seaesun','Creaete-a a lefel 1...10 spureet. Nun-spureet creaetoores veetheen runge-a haefe-a +50...150 maexeemoom Heaelt und gaeeen +8 aermur. Thees spureet deees aeffter 15...90 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...10 spureet (15...90 secund leeffespun). Creaetoores in runge-a haefe-a +50...150 maexeemoom Heaelt und +8 aermur. Dues nut aeffffect spureets.'],
468=>['Symbeeusees','Creaete-a a lefel 1...10 spureet. Fur iaech inchuntment oon a nun-spureet creaetoore-a veetheen runge-a, thaet creaetoore-a haes +27...150 maexeemoom Heaelt. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...240 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...10 spureet (30...240 secund leeffespun). Creaetoores in runge-a haefe-a +27...150 maexeemoom Heaelt fur iaech inchuntment oon zeem. Dues nut aeffffect spureets.'],
469=>['Preemael Ichues','Creaete-a a lefel 1...10 spureet. Fur nun-spureet creaetoores veetheen its runge-a, seegnets cust 10 Inergy tu use-a. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...240 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...10 spureet (30...240 secund leeffespun). Seegnets cust 10 Inergy fur creaetoores in runge-a. Dues nut aeffffect spureets.'],
470=>['Predaetury Seaesun','Creaete-a a lefel 1...10 spureet. Fur nun-spureet creaetoores veetheen its runge-a, aell heaeleeng is redooced by 20%. Iff uny ooff yuoor aettaecks heet, yuoo gaeeen 5 Heaelt. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...240 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...10 spureet (30...240 secund leeffespun). Creaetoores in runge-a receeefe-a 20% less frum heaeleeng. Creaetoores gaeeen 5 Heaelt iaech teeme-a zeey heet veet un aettaeck. Dues nut aeffffect spureets.'],
471=>['Fruzee Sueel','Creaete-a a lefel 1...10 spureet. Nun-spureet creaetoores veetheen its runge-a cunnut aecteefaete-a resoorrecshun skeells. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...180 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...10 spureet (30...180 secund leeffespun). Creaetoores in runge-a cunnut aecteefaete-a resoorrecshun skeells. Dues nut aeffffect spureets.'],
472=>['Faefuraeble-a Veends','Creaete-a a lefel 1...10 spureet. Fur nun-spureet creaetoores veetheen its runge-a, aerroos mufe-a tveece-a aes faest und streeke-a fur +6 daemaege-a. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...240 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...10 spureet (30...240 secund leeffespun). Aerroos mufe-a tveece-a aes faest und heet fur +6 daemaege-a fur creaetoores in runge-a. Dues nut aeffffect spureets.'],
474=>['Inergeezeeng Veend','Creaete-a a lefel 1...6 spureet. Fur nun-spureet creaetoores veetheen its runge-a, aell skeells cust 15 less Inergy (meeneemoom cust 10 Inergy), und skeells rechaerge-a 25% slooer. Thees spureet deees aeffter 1...60 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...6 spureet (1...60 secund leeffespun). Skeells cust 15 less Inergy (meeneemoom cust 10 Inergy) und rechaerge-a 25% slooer fur creaetoores in runge-a. Dues nut aeffffect spureets.'],
475=>['Qooeeckeneeng Zephyr','Creaete-a a lefel 1...10 spureet. Fur nun-spureet creaetoores veetheen its runge-a, aell skeells rechaerge-a tveece-a aes faest und cust 30% mure-a ooff zee baese-a Inergy tu caest. Thees spureet deees aeffter 15...90 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...10 spureet (15...90 secund leeffespun). Skeells cust 30% mure-a Inergy und rechaerge-a tveece-a aes faest fur creaetoores in runge-a. Dues nut aeffffect spureets.'],
476=>['Naetoore-a\'s Renooael','Creaete-a a lefel 1...10 spureet. Fur 30...240 secunds, inchuntments und hexes caest by nun-spureet creaetoores taeke-a tveece-a aes lung tu caest, und it custs tveece-a aes mooch Inergy tu maeeentaeeen inchuntments. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...240 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...10 spureet (30...240 secund leeffespun). Fur creaetoores in runge-a, inchuntments und Hexes taeke-a tveece-a aes lung tu caest und it custs tveece-a aes mooch Inergy tu maeeentaeeen inchuntments. Dues nut aeffffect spureets.'],
477=>['Mooddy Terraeeen','Creaete-a a lefel 1...10 spureet. Nun-spureet creaetoores veetheen its runge-a mufe-a 10% slooer und speed buusts haefe-a nu iffffect. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...180 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...10 spureet (30...180 secund leeffespun). Creaetoores in runge-a haefe-a 10% slooer mufement; aelsu negaetes speed buusts. Dues nut aeffffect spureets.'],
570=>['Maerk ooff Insecooreety','Fur 5...25 secunds, taerget fue-a sooffffers frum -1...5 Heaelt degeneraeshun, und inchuntments und stunces oon thaet fue-a ixpure-a 20...60% faester. Aell ooff yuoor nun-Aessaesseen skeells aere-a deesaebled fur 5 secunds.','(5...25 secunds.) Cooses -1...5 Heaelt degeneraeshun. Inchuntments und stunces ixpure-a 20...60% faester oon taerget fue-a. Deesaebles yuoor nun-Aessaesseen skeells (5 secunds).'],
571=>['Deesroopteeng Daegger','Send oooot a Deesroopteeng Daegger aet taerget fue-a thaet streekes fur 10...35 iaert daemaege-a. Iff thaet fue-a vaes aecteefaeteeng a skeell, thaet skeell is interroopted. Thees spell haes haelff zee nurmael runge-a.','Prujecteele-a: deaels 10...35 iaert daemaege-a. Interroopts a skeell. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
572=>['Deaedly Paeraedux','Aell ooff yuoor aettaeck skeells aere-a deesaebled fur 10 secunds. Fur 5...15 secunds, yuoor Aessaesseen skeells aecteefaete-a und rechaerge-a 33% faester.','(5...15 secunds.) Yuoor Aessaesseen skeells aecteefaete-a und rechaerge-a 33% faester. Deesaebles yuoor aettaeck skeells (10 secunds).'],
763=>['Joondeeced Gaeze-a','Remufe-a un inchuntment frum taerget fue-a. Iff un inchuntment is remufed, fur zee next 1...20 secunds, yuoor next inchuntment spell caests 0...1 secunds faester und custs 1...10 less Inergy.','Remufes un inchuntment frum taerget fue-a. Remufael iffffect: yuoor next inchuntment caests 0...1 secunds faester und custs 1...10 less Inergy. (1...20 secunds)'],
764=>['Vaeeel ooff Duum','Fur 2...6 secunds, aell ooff taerget fue-a\'s aettreebootes aere-a set tu 0.','(2...6 secunds.) Taerget fue-a\'s aettreebootes aere-a 0.'],
766=>['Gaeze-a ooff Cuntempt','Iff taerget fue-a haes mure-a thun 50% Heaelt, thaet fue-a luses aell inchuntments.','Remufes taerget fue-a\'s inchuntments. Nu iffffect unless thees fue-a haes mure-a thun 50% Heaelt.'],
769=>['Feeper\'s Deffense-a','Aell aedjaecent fues aere-a Pueesuned fur 5...20 secunds. Shaedoo Step tu a neaerby lucaeshun durectly aevaey frum yuoor taerget.','Inffleect Pueesuned cundeeshun (5...20 secunds) oon aell aedjaecent fues und Shaedoo Step tu a neaerby lucaeshun durectly aevaey frum yuoor taerget. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
770=>['Retoorn','Aell aedjaecent fues aere-a Creeppled fur 3...8 secunds. Shaedoo Step tu taerget oozeer aelly\'s lucaeshun.','Inffleects Creeppled cundeeshun (3...8 secunds) oon aell fues aedjaecent tu yuoo. Yuoo Shaedoo Step tu taerget aelly\'s lucaeshun. Cunnut selff-taerget.'],
771=>['Oora ooff Deesplaecement','Vhee yuoo caest Oora ooff Deesplaecement, Shaedoo Step tu taerget fue-a. Vhee yuoo stup maeeentaeeeneeng Oora ooff Deesplaecement yuoo retoorn tu yuoor ooreegeenael lucaeshun. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Shaedoo Step tu taerget fue-a. Ind iffffect: retoorn tu yuoor ooreegeenael lucaeshun.'],
772=>['Generuoos Vaes Tsoongraeee','Huld Tsoongraeee\'s aeshes fur up tu 15...60 secunds und gaeeen +50...140 maexeemoom Heaelt. Vhee yuoo drup hees aeshes, yuoo gaeeen 100...280 Heaelt.','(15...60 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +50...140 maexeemoom Heaelt. Drup iffffect: yuoo gaeeen 100...280 Heaelt.'],
773=>['Meeghty Vaes Fureezoon','Huld Fureezoon\'s aeshes fur up tu 15...60 secunds. Vheele-a yuoo huld hees aeshes, yuoo gaeeen +15 aermur und +30 maexeemoom Inergy.','(15...60 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +15 aermur und +30 maexeemoom Inergy.'],
775=>['Deaet Blussum','Moost fulloo un ooffff-hund aettaeck. Iff it heets, Deaet Blussum streekes taerget fue-a fur +20...45 daemaege-a und aell aedjaecent fues taeke-a 20...45 daemaege-a.','Deaels +20...45 daemaege-a. Aelsu aeffffects fues aedjaecent tu taerget fue-a. Moost fulloo un ooffff-hund aettaeck.'],
776=>['Tveesteeng Fungs','Moost fulloo un ooffff-hund aettaeck. Iff it heets, Tveesteeng Fungs streekes fur +10...20 daemaege-a und stroock fue-a sooffffers frum Bleedeeng und Deep Vuoond fur 5...20 secunds.','Deaels +10...20 daemaege-a. Inffleects Bleedeeng und Deep Vuoond cundeeshuns (5...20 secunds). Moost fulloo un ooffff-hund aettaeck.'],
777=>['Hurns ooff zee Oox','Moost fulloo un ooffff-hund aettaeck. Iff it heets, Hurns ooff zee Oox streekes fur +1...11 daemaege-a. Iff stroock fue-a is nut aedjaecent tu uny aelleees, thaet fue-a is knucked doon.','Deaels +1...11 daemaege-a. Cooses knuck-doon iff taerget fue-a is nut aedjaecent tu uny ooff its aelleees. Moost fulloo un ooffff-hund aettaeck.'],
778=>['Faelleeng Speeder','Moost streeke-a a knucked-doon fue-a. Iff it heets, Faelleeng Speeder streekes fur +15...35 daemaege-a und taerget fue-a is Pueesuned fur 5...20 secunds.','Deaels +15...35 daemaege-a. Inffleects Pueesuned cundeeshun (5...20 secunds). Nu iffffect unless taerget fue-a is knucked-doon.'],
779=>['Blaeck Lutoos Streeke-a','Iff it heets, Blaeck Lutoos Streeke-a streekes fur +10...31 daemaege-a. Iff taerget fue-a is sooffffereeng frum a hex, yuoo gaeeen 5...13 Inergy. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Deaels +10...31 daemaege-a. Yuoo gaeeen 5...13 Inergy iff taerget fue-a is hexed. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
780=>['Fux Fungs','Moost fulloo a leaed aettaeck. Fux Fungs cunnut be-a blucked und streekes fur +10...35 daemaege-a iff it heets. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Deaels +10...35 daemaege-a. Unbluckaeble-a. Moost fulloo a leaed aettaeck.'],
781=>['Muebeeoos Streeke-a','Moost fulloo a Dooael Aettaeck. Iff it heets, Muebeeoos Streeke-a streekes fur +10...35 daemaege-a. Iff yuoo streeke-a a fue-a vhuse-a Heaelt is beloo 50%, aell yuoor oozeer aettaeck skeells aere-a rechaerged.','Deaels +10...35 daemaege-a. Rechaerges aell yuoor oozeer aettaeck skeells iff taerget fue-a\'s Heaelt is beloo 50%. Moost fulloo a dooael aettaeck.'],
782=>['Jaegged Streeke-a','Iff Jaegged Streeke-a heets, yuoor taerget sooffffers frum Bleedeeng fur 5...20 secunds.','Inffleects Bleedeeng cundeeshun (5...20 secunds).'],
783=>['Unsoospecteeng Streeke-a','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +19...31 daemaege-a. Iff yuoor taerget vaes aebufe-a 90% Heaelt yuoo deael un aeddeeshunael 15...75 daemaege-a.','Deaels +19...31 daemaege-a. Deaels 15...75 mure-a daemaege-a iff taerget fue-a\'s Heaelt is aebufe-a 90%.'],
784=>['Intungleeng Aesp','Intungleeng Aesp moost fulloo a leaed aettaeck. Taerget fue-a is knucked doon und becumes Pueesuned fur 5...20 secunds.','Cooses knuck-doon. Inffleects Pueesuned cundeeshun (5...20 secunds). Moost fulloo a leaed aettaeck.'],
785=>['Maerk ooff Deaet','Fur 4...10 secunds, taerget fue-a gaeeens 50% less beneffeet frum heaeleeng.','(4...10 secunds.) Taerget fue-a receeefes 50% less frum heaeleeng.'],
786=>['Irun Paelm','Taerget tuooched fue-a sooffffers 5...50 daemaege-a, und iff thaet fue-a is sooffffereeng frum a hex oor cundeeshun thaet fue-a is knucked doon. Irun Paelm cuoonts aes a leaed aettaeck.','Deaels 5...50 daemaege-a. Cooses knuck-doon iff taerget fue-a is hexed oor haes a cundeeshun. Cuoonts aes a leaed aettaeck.'],
787=>['Reseeleeent Veaepun','Fur 3...12 secunds, taerget aelly haes a Reseeleeent Veaepun. Vheele-a sooffffereeng frum a hex oor cundeeshun, thaet aelly gaeeens +1...6 Heaelt regeneraeshun und +24 aermur.','(3...12 secunds.) +1...6 Heaelt regeneraeshun und +24 aermur. Nu iffffect unless taerget aelly is hexed oor haes a cundeeshun.'],
788=>['Bleend Vaes Meengsun','Huld Meengsun\'s aeshes fur up tu 15...60 secunds. Vhee yuoo drup hees aeshes, aell neaerby fues aere-a Bleended fur 3...8 secunds.','(15...60 secunds.) Drup iffffect: inffleects Bleendness cundeeshun (3...8 secunds) oon aell neaerby fues.'],
789=>['Graespeeng Vaes Koooorung','Huld Koooorung\'s aeshes fur up tu 15...60 secunds. Vhee yuoo drup hees aeshes, aell fues in zee aerea aere-a stroock fur 15...75 daemaege-a und knucked doon.','(15...60 secunds.) Drup iffffect: deaels 15...75 daemaege-a und knucks-doon aell fues in zee aerea.'],
790=>['Fengeffool Vaes Khunheee','Huld Khunheee\'s aeshes fur 5...11 secunds. Vhenefer a fue-a streekes yuoo in cumbaet vheele-a yuoo aere-a huldeeng Khunheee\'s aeshes, yuoo steael 10...45 Heaelt frum thaet fue-a. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(5...11 secunds.) Yuoo steael 10...45 Heaelt frum ifery fue-a thaet heets yuoo veet un aettaeck.'],
791=>['Flesh ooff My Flesh','Luse-a haelff yuoor Heaelt. Resoorrect taerget paerty member veet yuoor coorrent Heaelt und 5...20% Inergy.','Resoorrects taerget paerty member (haelff yuoor coorrent Heaelt und 5...20% Inergy). Luse-a haelff yuoor Heaelt.'],
792=>['Spleenter Veaepun','Fur 20 secunds, taerget aelly haes a Spleenter Veaepun. Taerget aelly\'s next 1...5 aettaecks deal 5...50 daemaege-a tu up tu 4 aedjaecent fues.','(20 secunds.) Aettaecks deael 5...50 daemaege-a tu 3 aedjaecent fues. Inds aeffter 1...5 aettaecks.'],
793=>['Veaepun ooff Vaerdeeng','Fur 3...8 secunds, taerget aelly haes a Veaepun ooff Vaerdeeng, grunteeng thaet aelly +2...4 Heaelt regeneraeshun und a 50% chunce-a tu bluck.','(3...8 secunds.) +2...4 Heaelt regeneraeshun. 50% chunce-a tu bluck.'],
794=>['Vaeeeleeng Veaepun','Fur 3...14 secunds, taerget aelly haes a Vaeeeleeng Veaepun. Vhenefer zee Vaeeeleeng Veaepun streekes un aettaeckeeng fue-a, thaet fue-a is interroopted.','(3...14 secunds.) Aettaecks interroopt aettaeckeeng fues.'],
795=>['Neeghtmaere-a Veaepun','Fur 12 secunds, taerget aelly haes a Neeghtmaere-a Veaepun. Taerget aelly\'s next 3 aettaecks aere-a redooced by 10...50 daemaege-a und steael up tu 10...50 Heaelt.','(12 secunds.) Taerget aelly\'s aettaecks steael 10...50 Heaelt boot deael 10...50 less daemaege-a. Inds aeffter 3 aettaecks.'],
799=>['Begooeeleeng Haeze-a','Shaedoo Step tu taerget fue-a. Thaet fue-a becumes Daezed fur 3...9 secunds.','Yuoo Shaedoo Step tu thees fue-a. Inffleects Daezed cundeeshun (3...9 secunds).'],
800=>['Indooreeng Tuxeen','Fur 5 secunds, taerget fue-a sooffffers -1...5 Heaelt degeneraeshun. Iff thaet fue-a is mufeeng vhee Indooreeng Tuxeen vuoold ind, Indooreeng Tuxeen is renooed fur unuzeer 5 secunds.','(5 secunds.) Cooses -1...5 Heaelt degeneraeshun. Renooael: iff taerget fue-a is mufeeng vhee thees hex inds.'],
801=>['Shruood ooff Seelence-a','Aell ooff yuoor spells aere-a deesaebled fur 15 secunds. Fur 1...6 secunds, taerget tuooched fue-a cunnut caest spells.','(1...6 secunds.) Taerget fue-a cunnut caest spells. Yuoor spells aere-a deesaebled fur 15 secunds.'],
802=>['Ixpuse-a Deffenses','Fur 1...11 secunds, taerget fue-a cunnut bluck yuoor aettaecks.','(1...11 secunds.) Taerget fue-a cunnut bluck yuoor aettaecks.'],
803=>['Pooer Leech','Iff taerget fue-a is caesteeng a spell oor chunt, thaet skeell is interroopted und fur 10 secunds, vhenefer thaet fue-a caests a spell, yuoo steael up tu 5...15 Inergy frum thaet fue-a.','Interroopt a spell oor a chunt. Interroopshun iffffect: steael 5...15 Inergy vhenefer taerget fue-a caests a spell (10 secunds).'],
804=>['Aercune-a Lungoour','Fur 1...10 secunds, aell spells caest by zee taerget fue-a coose-a 10 Oofercaest.','(1...10 secunds.) Taerget fue-a\'s spells coose-a 10 Oofercaest.'],
805=>['Uneemaete-a Faempureec Hurrur','Ixplueet neaerest curpse-a tu uneemaete-a a lefel 1...17 Faempureec Hurrur. Vhenefer a Faempureec Hurrur yuoo cuntrul deaels daemaege-a, yuoo gaeeen zee saeme-a aemuoont ooff Heaelt.','Creaetes a lefel 1...17 faempureec hurrur. Yuoo gaeeen Heaelt iqooael tu zee daemaege-a it deaels. Ixplueets a fresh curpse-a.'],
806=>['Coolteest\'s Ferfur','Fur 5 secunds und 3 secunds lunger fur ifery runk ooff Suool Reaepeeng, yuoor Necrumuncer spells cust -1...6 Inergy tu caest, boot yuoo sooffffer frum Bleedeeng fur 10 secunds iaech teeme-a yuoo caest a Necrumuncer spell.','(5 secunds ploos 3 secunds mure-a fur ifery runk ooff Suool Reaepeeng.) Yuoor Necrumuncer spells cust 1...6 less Inergy. Yuoo sooffffer frum Bleedeeng (10 secunds) iaech teeme-a yuoo caest a Necrumuncer spell.'],
808=>['Reaeper\'s Maerk','Fur 30 secunds, taerget fue-a sooffffers -1...5 Heaelt degeneraeshun. Iff thaet fue-a deees vheele-a hexed veet Reaeper\'s Maerk, yuoo gaeeen 5...15 Inergy.','(30 secunds.) Cooses -1...5 Heaelt degeneraeshun. Yuoo gaeeen 5...15 Inergy iff taerget fue-a deees vheele-a sooffffereeng frum thees hex.'],
809=>['Shaetterstune-a','Taerget fue-a is stroock fur 25...100 culd daemaege-a, mufes 66% slooer, und is hexed veet Shaetterstune-a fur 3 secunds. Vhee Shaetterstune-a inds, thaet fue-a und aell neaerby fues aere-a stroock fur 25...100 culd daemaege-a.','(3 secunds.) Ineeteeael iffffect: deaels 25...100 culd daemaege-a und taerget mufes 66% slooer. Ind iffffect: deaels 25...100 culd daemaege-a tu taerget und aell neaerby fues.'],
810=>['Prutectur\'s Deffense-a','Fur 5...11 secunds, aelleees aedjaecent tu yuoo haefe-a a 75% chunce-a tu bluck incumeeng aettaecks. Prutectur\'s Deffense-a inds iff yuoo mufe-a.','(5...11 secunds.) Aelleees aedjaecent tu yuoo haefe-a 75% chunce-a tu bluck. Inds iff yuoo mufe-a.'],
811=>['Roon aes Oone-a','Fur 5...15 secunds, yuoo und yuoor pet roon 25% faester.','(5...15 secunds.) Yuoo und yuoor pet mufe-a 25% faester.'],
812=>['Deffeeunt Vaes Xeenraee-a','Huld Xeenraee-a\'s aeshes fur up tu 15...60 secunds. Vheele-a yuoo huld her aeshes, yuoo cunnut luse-a mure-a thun 20% ooff yuoor maex Heaelt frum a seengle-a heet. Vhee yuoo drup her aeshes, yuoo steael 5...50 Heaelt frum aell neaerby fues.','(15...60 secunds.) Yuoo cunnut luse-a mure-a thun 20% ooff yuoor maex Heaelt frum a seengle-a heet. Drup iffffect: steael 5...50 Heaelt frum neaerby fues.'],
813=>['Lyssa\'s Oora','Fur 10 secunds, yuoo haefe-a +0...5 Inergy regeneraeshun. Thees inchuntment reaeppleees itselff ifery teeme-a yuoo caest a spell oon a fue-a.','(10 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +0...5 Inergy regeneraeshun. Renooael: ifery teeme-a yuoo caest a spell oon un inemy.'],
814=>['Shaedoo Reffooge-a','Fur 6 secunds, yuoo gaeeen 5...10 Heaelt regeneraeshun. Vhee Shaedoo Reffooge-a inds, yuoo gaeeen 40...100 Heaelt iff yuoo aere-a aettaeckeeng.','(6 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +5...10 Heaelt regeneraeshun. Ind iffffect: heaels yuoo fur 40...100 iff yuoo aere-a aettaeckeeng.'],
815=>['Scurpeeun Vure-a','Fur 8...20 secunds, zee next teeme-a yuoo und taerget fue-a aere-a mure-a thun 75\' aepaert, yuoo Shaedoo Step tu thaet fue-a und thaet fue-a is knucked doon. Thees spell haes haelff zee nurmael runge-a.','(8...20 secunds.) Shaedoo Step tu taerget fue-a und coose-a knuck-doon zee next teeme-a thees fue-a is mure-a thun 75\' aevaey frum yuoo.'],
816=>['Murrured Stunce-a','Fur 10...35 secunds, vhenefer taerget fue-a inters a stunce-a, yuoo inter zee saeme-a stunce-a. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(10...35 secunds.) Yuoo inter uny stunce-a used by taerget fue-a.'],
817=>['Deescurd','Iff taerget fue-a is sooffffereeng frum a cundeeshun und under zee iffffects ooff a hex oor un inchuntment, thaet fue-a sooffffers 30...110 daemaege-a.','Deaels 30...110 daemaege-a. Nu iffffect unless taerget fue-a haes a cundeeshun und is ieezeer hexed oor inchunted.'],
818=>['Vell ooff Veaereeness','Ixplueet taerget curpse-a oor saecreeffeece-a 66% heaelt tu creaete-a a Vell ooff Veaereeness fur 10...55 secunds. Inemeees veetheen zee Vell ooff Veaereeness sooffffer -1 Inergy degeneraeshun.','(10...55 secunds.) Fues in thees vell haefe-a -1 Inergy degeneraeshun. Ixplueets a fresh curpse-a oor saecreeffeeces 66% heaelt.'],
819=>['Faempureec Spureet','Steael up tu 15...60 Heaelt frum taerget fue-a. Fur 10 secunds, yuoo haefe-a +5...10 Heaelt regeneraeshun.','Steael 15...60 Heaelt frum taerget fue-a. Yuoo haefe-a +5...10 Heaelt regeneraeshun (10 secunds).'],
820=>['Depraefeety','Fur 5...20 secunds, vhenefer taerget fue-a caests a spell, thaet fue-a und oone-a neaerby fue-a luse-a 1...5 Inergy.','(5...20 secunds.) Cooses 1...5 Inergy luss vhenefer taerget fue-a caests a spell. Oone-a fue-a neaer yuoor taerget aelsu luses Inergy.'],
821=>['Icy Feeens','Taerget fue-a is stroock fur 10...90 culd daemaege-a. Fur 10...35 secunds, iff taerget fue-a deees aell neaerby fues aere-a stroock fur 20...110 culd daemaege-a.','(10...35 secunds.) Deaels 20...110 culd daemaege-a tu neaerby fues iff taerget fue-a deees. Ineeteeael iffffect: deaels 10...90 culd daemaege-a.'],
822=>['Veaekee Knees','Fur 1...16 secunds, taerget fue-a sooffffers -1...4 Heaelt degeneraeshun und taekes 5...20 daemaege-a vheele-a mufeeng.','(1...16 secunds.) Taerget fue-a haes -1...4 Heaelt degeneraeshun und taekes 5...20 daemaege-a vheele-a mufeeng.'],
823=>['Boorneeng Speed','Fur 7 secunds, yuoo aere-a set oon fure-a und mufe-a 30...45% faester. Vhee Boorneeng Speed inds, aell aedjaecent fues aere-a set oon fure-a fur 3...9 secunds.','(7 secunds.) Yuoo mufe-a 30...45% faester. Yuoo sooffffer frum Boorneeng (7 secunds). Ind iffffect: inffleects Boorneeng cundeeshun (3...9 secunds) oon aedjaecent fues.'],
824=>['Laefa Aerroos','Laefa Aerroos fly tooaerd up tu 3 fues neaer yuoor taerget und streeke-a fur 20...65 fure-a daemaege-a iff zeey heet.','Prujecteele-a: deaels 20...65 fure-a daemaege-a. Bunoos iffffect: sends prujecteeles aet 2 oozeer fues neaer yuoor taerget.'],
825=>['Bed ooff Cuaels','Creaete-a a Bed ooff Cuaels aet taerget fue-a\'s lucaeshun. Fur 5 secunds, fues aedjaecent tu taerget fue-a aere-a stroock fur 5...29 fure-a daemaege-a iaech secund. Uny fue-a knucked doon oon zee Bed ooff Cuaels is set oon fure-a fur 3...7 secunds.','Deaels 5...29 fure-a daemaege-a iaech secund (5 secunds) tu lucaeshun ooff taerget fue-a. Heets fues aedjaecent tu yuoor taerget. Inffleects Boorneeng cundeeshun (3...7 secunds) oon knucked doon fues.'],
826=>['Shaedoo Furm','Fur 5...21 secunds, yuoo cunnut be-a zee taerget ooff inemy spells, und yuoo gaeeen 5 daemaege-a redoocshun fur iaech Aessaesseen inchuntment oon yuoo. Yuoo cunnut deael mure-a thun 5...25 daemaege-a veet a seengle-a skeell oor aettaeck. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(5...21 secunds.) Inemy spells cunnut taerget yuoo. Gaeeen 5 daemaege-a redoocshun fur iaech Aessaesseen inchuntment oon yuoo. Yuoo cunnut deael mure-a thun 5...25 daemaege-a veet a seengle-a skeell oor aettaeck.'],
827=>['Seephun Strengt','Fur 5...20 secunds, taerget fue-a deaels -5...50 daemaege-a veet aettaecks und aell ooff yuoor aettaecks aegaeeenst thaet fue-a haefe-a un aeddeeshunael 50% chunce-a ooff beeeng a creeteecael heet.','(5...20 secunds.) Taerget fue-a deaels -5...50 aettaeck daemaege-a. Yuoo haefe-a +50% chunce-a tu lund a creeteecael heet oon thees fue-a.'],
828=>['Feele-a Meeaesma','Taerget fue-a is stroock fur 10...65 culd daemaege-a. Iff sooffffereeng frum a cundeeshun, thaet fue-a is hexed veet Feele-a Meeaesma und sooffffers -1...5 Heaelt degeneraeshun fur 10 secunds.','Cooses -1...5 Heaelt degeneraeshun (10 secunds). Ineeteeael iffffect: deaels 10...65 culd daemaege-a. Hex is oonly aeppleeed iff taerget fue-a haes a cundeeshun.'],
830=>['Raey ooff Joodgment','Infuke-a a Raey ooff Joodgment aet taerget fue-a\'s lucaeshun. Fur 5 secunds, fues aedjaecent tu thaet lucaeshun aere-a stroock fur 10...50 huly daemaege-a und begeen Boorneeng fur 1...3 secunds ifery secund.','Deaels 10...50 huly daemaege-a und inffleects Boorneeng (1...3 secunds) ifery secund (5 secunds). Heets fues aedjaecent tu taerget\'s ineeteeael lucaeshun.'],
831=>['Preemael Raege-a','Fur 1...9 secunds, yuoo aettaeck 33% faester und mufe-a 33% faester, boot yuoo taeke-a 150...125% daemaege-a.','(1...9 secunds.) Yuoo aettaeck 33% faester und mufe-a 33% faester. Yuoo taeke-a 150...125% daemaege-a.'],
832=>['Uneemaete-a Flesh Gulem','Ixplueet neaerest curpse-a tu uneemaete-a a lefel 3...25 Flesh Gulem. Zee Flesh Gulem leaefes 1...4 ixplueetaeble-a curpse-as. Yuoo cun haefe-a oonly oone-a Flesh Gulem aet a teeme-a.','Creaetes a lefel 3...25 flesh gulem vheech leaefes 1...4 fresh curpse-as vhee it deees. Ixplueets a fresh curpse-a. Yuoo cun haefe-a oonly oone-a flesh gulem aet a teeme-a.'],
834=>['Reckless Haeste-a','Fur 6...12 secunds, taerget fue-a und aell aedjaecent fues aere-a hexed veet Reckless Haeste-a. Vheele-a hexed, zeey aettaeck 25% faester boot haefe-a a 50% chunce-a tu meess veet aettaecks.','Aelsu hexes fues aedjaecent tu yuoor taerget (6...12 secunds). Zeese-a fues haefe-a 50% chunce-a tu meess, boot aettaeck 25% faester.'],
835=>['Bluud Bund','Fur 3...12 secunds, taerget fue-a und aell aedjaecent fues aere-a hexed veet Bluud Bund. Vhenefer un aelly heets oone-a ooff zeem veet un aettaeck, thaet aelly gaeeens 5...20 Heaelt. Iff oone-a ooff zeese-a fues deees vheele-a hexed, aell aelleees aedjaecent tu thaet fue-a aere-a heaeled fur 20...100 Heaelt.','Aelsu hexes fues aedjaecent tu yuoor taerget (3...12 secunds). Aelleees heetteeng zeese-a fues gaeeen 5...20 Heaelt. Iff uny ooff zeese-a fues deees vheele-a hexed, aedjaecent aelleees aere-a heaeled fur 20...100.'],
836=>['Reede-a zee Leeghtneeng','Yuoo Reede-a zee Leeghtneeng tu taerget. Aell aedjaecent fues aere-a Bleended fur 1...5 secunds. Iff yuoor taerget is a fue-a, it is stroock fur 10...70 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Thees spell haes 25% aermur penetraeshun.','Deaels 10...70 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. 25% aermur penetraeshun. Bleends aell aedjaecent fues (1...5 secunds). Yuoo instuntly mufe-a tu yuoor taerget. Maey taerget aelleees.'],
837=>['Inergy Buun','Fur 36...60 secunds, Inergy Buun raeeeses zee maexeemoom Heaelt ooff yuoo und taerget aelly by 1...3 fur iaech pueent ooff yuoor respecteefe-a maexeemoom Inergy. Vhee thees inchuntment is furst aeppleeed, yuoo und yuoor taerget gaeeen 1...12 Inergy. Yuoo gaeeen un aeddeeshunael 1 Inergy fur ifery 2 pueents yuoo haefe-a in Inergy Sturaege-a.','(36...60 secunds.) Maexeemoom Heaelt fur yuoo und taerget aelly is increaesed by 1...3 fur iaech pueent ooff maexeemoom Inergy. Ineeteeael iffffect: But gaeeen 1...12 Inergy. Yuoo gaeeen +1 Inergy fur ifery 2 pueents ooff Inergy Sturaege-a.'],
838=>['Dvaeyna\'s Surroo','Fur 30 secunds, taerget aelly und aell neaerby aelleees aere-a inchunted veet Dvaeyna\'s Surroo. Iff un aelly deees vheele-a under zee iffffects ooff Dvaeyna\'s Surroo, yuoor paerty is heaeled fur 5...50.','Inchunts aelleees neaer yuoor taerget (30 secunds). Yuoor paerty is heaeled fur 5...50 vhenefer oone-a ooff zeese-a aelleees deees.'],
839=>['"Retreaet!"','Iff zeere-a aere-a uny deaed aelleees veetheen iaershut, yuoor paerty mufes 33% faester fur 5...11 secunds. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(5...11 secunds.) Paerty members in iaershut mufe-a 33% faester. Nu iffffect unless zeere-a aere-a deaed aelleees veetheen iaershut.'],
840=>['Pueesuned Heaert','Yuoo und aell aedjaecent fues aere-a Pueesuned fur 5...15 secunds.','Inffleects Pueesuned cundeeshun (5...15 secunds) tu aedjaecent fues. Yuoo aere-a aelsu Pueesuned.'],
841=>['Feteed Gruoond','Taerget fue-a is stroock fur 15...65 culd daemaege-a. Iff thaet fue-a is knucked doon, thaet fue-a becumes Pueesuned fur 5...20 secunds.','Deaels 15...65 culd daemaege-a. Inffleects Pueesuned cundeeshun (5...20 secunds) iff taerget fue-a is knucked-doon.'],
842=>['Aerc Leeghtneeng','Taerget fue-a is stroock fur 5...40 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Iff yuoo aere-a Oofercaest, tvu fues neaer yuoor taerget aere-a stroock fur 15...85 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Daemaege-a frum Aerc Leeghtneeng haes 25% aermur penetraeshun.','Deaels 5...40 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Deaels 15...85 leeghtneeng daemaege-a tu tvu neaerby fues iff yuoo aere-a Oofercaest. 25% aermur penetraeshun.'],
843=>['Goost','Fur 5...11 secunds, but yuoo und taerget aelly mufe-a 33% faester. Vhee yuoo caest thees spell, aell fues aedjaecent tu yuoo und yuoor taerget taeke-a 15...70 culd daemaege-a. Fues stroock by Goost vheele-a aettaeckeeng oor mufeeng aere-a knucked doon.','(5...11 secunds.) Yuoo und taerget aelly mufe-a 33% faester. Ineeteeael iffffect: Fues aedjaecent tu yuoo und taerget aelly aere-a stroock fur 15...70 culd daemaege-a. Aettaeckeeng oor mufeeng fues aere-a knucked doon.'],
844=>['Choorneeng Iaert','Creaete-a Choorneeng Iaert aet taerget fue-a\'s lucaeshun. Fur zee next 5 secunds, Choorneeng Iaert streekes fues neaer thaet lucaeshun fur 10...40 iaert daemaege-a iaech secund. Uny fue-a mufeeng faester thun nurmael vhee stroock by Choorneeng Iaert is knucked doon.','Deaels 10...40 iaert daemaege-a iaech secund (5 secunds). Heets fues neaer taerget\'s ineeteeael lucaeshun. Cooses knuck-doon tu fues mufeeng faester thun nurmael.'],
845=>['Leeqooeed Flaeme-a','Taerget fue-a is stroock fur 7...112 fure-a daemaege-a. Iff thaet fue-a is aettaeckeeng oor caesteeng a spell, neaerby fues aere-a aelsu stroock fur 7...112 fure-a daemaege-a.','Deaels 7...112 fure-a daemaege-a. Deaels 7...112 fure-a daemaege-a tu fues neaer yuoor taerget iff thees fue-a is aettaeckeeng oor caesteeng.'],
846=>['Steaem','Taerget fue-a is stroock fur 20...60 culd daemaege-a. Iff taerget fue-a is oon fure-a, Steaem Bleends thaet fue-a fur 5...10 secunds und zeey taeke-a un aeddeeshunael 20...60 fure-a daemaege-a.','Deaels 20...60 culd daemaege-a. Inffleects Bleendness cundeeshun (5...10 secunds) und dues 20...60 fure-a daemaege-a iff taerget fue-a is Boorneeng.'],
847=>['Buun Seegnet','Heael taerget aelly fur 20...80 Heaelt. Yuoor next Heaeleeng oor Prutecshun Praeyer spell thaet taergets un aelly heaels fur un aeddeeshunael 20...100 Heaelt.','Heaels fur 20...80. Yuoor next Heaeleeng oor Prutecshun Praeyer spell thaet taergets un aelly heaels fur +20...100 Heaelt.'],
848=>['Referse-a Hex','Remufe-a oone-a hex frum taerget aelly. Iff a hex vaes remufed in thees vaey, fur 5...10 secunds, zee next teeme-a taerget aelly vuoold taeke-a daemaege-a, thaet daemaege-a is redooced by 5...50.','(5...10 secunds.) Remufes oone-a hex frum taerget aelly. Zee next daemaege-a thees aelly taekes is redooced by 5...50. Nu iffffect unless thees aelly is hexed.'],
849=>['Laeceraeteeng Chup','Iff Laeceraeteeng Chup heets, yuoo deael +5...20 daemaege-a. Iff it streekes a knucked doon fue-a yuoor taerget sooffffers frum Bleedeeng fur 5...20 secunds.','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Inffleects Bleedeeng cundeeshun (5...20 secunds) iff taerget fue-a is knucked-doon.'],
850=>['Feeerce-a Bloo','Iff Feeerce-a Bloo heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +5...20 daemaege-a. Iff taerget fue-a vaes sooffffereeng frum Veaekness, thaet fue-a aelsu sooffffers frum a Deep Vuoond fur 1...8 secunds.','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Inffleects Deep Vuoond (1...8 secunds) iff taerget fue-a is Veaekened.'],
851=>['Soon und Muun Slaesh','Aettaeck taerget fue-a tveece-a. Zeese-a aettaecks cunnut be-a blucked.','Yuoo aettaeck taerget fue-a tveece-a. Unbluckaeble-a.'],
852=>['Spleenter Shut','Iff Spleenter Shut heets, yuoo deael +3...15 daemaege-a. Iff Spleenter Shut is blucked, aell fues in zee aerea ooff yuoor taerget taeke-a 5...65 daemaege-a.','Deaels +3...15 daemaege-a. Deaels 5...65 daemaege-a tu fues in zee aerea iff blucked.'],
853=>['Melundroo\'s Shut','Iff Melundroo\'s Shut heets, yuoor taerget begeens Bleedeeng fur 5...25 secunds. Iff it heets a fue-a thaet is mufeeng oor knucked doon, thaet fue-a taekes +10...25 daemaege-a und is Creeppled fur 5...15 secunds.','Inffleects Bleedeeng (5...25 secunds). Deaels +10...25 daemaege-a und inffleects Creeppled (5...15 secunds) iff taerget fue-a vaes mufeeng oor knucked doon.'],
854=>['Snaere-a','Vhee Snaere-a is treeggered, aell neaerby fues becume-a Creeppled fur 3...15 secunds. Snaere-a inds aeffter 90 secunds. Vheele-a aecteefaeteeng thees skeell, yuoo aere-a iaeseely interroopted.','(90 secunds.) Aeffffects neaerby fues. Inffleects Creeppled cundeeshun (3...15 secunds). Iaeseely interroopted.'],
858=>['Dunceeng Daeggers','Send oooot three-a Dunceeng Daeggers aet taerget fue-a, iaech streekeeng fur 5...35 iaert daemaege-a iff zeey heet. Dunceeng Daeggers haes haelff zee nurmael runge-a. Thees skeell cuoonts aes a leaed aettaeck.','Three-a prujecteeles: iaech deaels 5...35 iaert daemaege-a. Cuoonts aes a leaed aettaeck.'],
859=>['Cunjoore-a Neeghtmaere-a','Fur 2...16 secunds, taerget fue-a sooffffers -8 Heaelt degeneraeshun.','(2...16 secunds.) Cooses -8 Heaelt degeneraeshun.'],
860=>['Seegnet ooff Deesroopshun','Iff taerget fue-a is caesteeng a spell, zee spell is interroopted und thaet fue-a sooffffers 10...51 daemaege-a. Iff thaet fue-a is hexed, Seegnet ooff Deesroopshun cun interroopt uny nun-spell skeells.','Interroopts a spell. Cun interroopt uny skeell iff taerget fue-a is hexed. Interroopshun iffffect: deaels 10...51 daemaege-a.'],
862=>['Raefenuoos Gaeze-a','Deael 20...40 daemaege-a und steael 20...40 Heaelt frum taerget fue-a und aell neaerby fues.','Deaels 20...40 daemaege-a und steaels 20...40 Heaelt frum taerget und neaerby fues.'],
863=>['Oorder ooff Aepustaesy','Fur 5 secunds, vhenefer a paerty member heets a fue-a veet physeecael daemaege-a, thaet fue-a luses oone-a inchuntment. Fur iaech Munk inchuntment remufed, yuoo luse-a 10...3% maexeemoom Heaelt.','Inchunts aell paerty members (5 secunds). Zeese-a paerty members remufe-a oone-a inchuntment vhee zeey deael physeecael daemaege-a. Remufael cust: fur iaech Munk inchuntment, yuoo luse-a 10...3% maexeemoom Heaelt.'],
864=>['Ooppresseefe-a Gaeze-a','Taerget fue-a und aedjaecent fues taeke-a 10...30 shaedoo daemaege-a. Fues aelreaedy sooffffereeng frum a cundeeshun aere-a Pueesuned und Veaekened fur 3...12 secunds.','Deaels 10...30 daemaege-a tu taerget und aedjaecent fues. Inffleects Pueesun und Veaekness (3...12 secunds) oon fues sooffffereeng frum a cundeeshun.'],
865=>['Leeghtneeng Haemmer','Taerget fue-a is stroock fur 10...100 leeghtneeng daemaege-a und aeppleees Craecked Aermur fur 5...20 secunds. Leeghtneeng Haemmer haes 25% aermur penetraeshun.','Deaels 10...100 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Aeppleees Craecked Aermur (5...20 secunds). 25% aermur penetraeshun.'],
866=>['Faepur Blaede-a','Taerget fue-a is stroock fur 15...135 culd daemaege-a. Faepur Blaede-a deaels haelff daemaege-a iff thaet fue-a haes uny inchuntments oon zeem.','Deaels 15...135 culd daemaege-a. Haelff daemaege-a iff taerget fue-a is inchunted.'],
867=>['Heaeleeng Leeght','Heael taerget aelly fur 40...120 Heaelt. Iff yuoor taerget haes un inchuntment, yuoo gaeeen 1...3 Inergy. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Heaels fur 40...120. Yuoo gaeeen 1...3 Inergy iff taerget aelly is inchunted.'],
869=>['"Cooaerd!"','Iff taerget fue-a is mufeeng, thaet fue-a is knucked doon.','Cooses knuck-doon iff taerget fue-a is mufeeng.'],
870=>['Pesteelence-a','Creaete-a a lefel 1...10 spureet. Vhee uny nun-spureet creaetoore-a veetheen its runge-a deees, cundeeshuns oon thaet creaetoore-a spreaed tu uny creaetoore-a in zee aerea aelreaedy sooffffereeng frum a cundeeshun. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...180 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...10 spureet (30...180 secund leeffespun). Vhee uny creaetoore-a in runge-a deees, cundeeshuns oon thees creaetoore-a spreaed tu uny creaetoore-a in zee aerea veet a cundeeshun. Spureets aere-a nut aeffffected.'],
871=>['Shaedoosung','Creaete-a a lefel 1...10 spureet. Thees spureet\'s aettaecks deael 5...20 daemaege-a und coose-a Bleendness fur 1...6 secunds. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...10 spureet (30-secund leeffespun). Its aettaecks deael 5...20 daemaege-a und inffleect Bleendness cundeeshun (1...6 secunds).'],
876=>['Seegnet ooff Shaedoos','Taerget fue-a taekes 5...35 daemaege-a. Iff yuoor taerget vaes Bleended, thaet fue-a sooffffers un aeddeeshunael 15...60 daemaege-a.','Deaels 5...35 daemaege-a. Deaels 15...60 mure-a daemaege-a iff taerget fue-a is Bleended.'],
877=>['Lyssa\'s Baelunce-a','Taerget fue-a luses oone-a inchuntment. Iff yuoo haefe-a mure-a inchuntments thun taerget fue-a, thees skeell haes nu iffffect.','Remufes oone-a inchuntment frum taerget fue-a. Nu iffffect iff yuoo haefe-a mure-a inchuntments thun thees fue-a.'],
878=>['Feeseeuns ooff Regret','Fur 10 secunds, taerget fue-a und aedjaecent fues taeke-a 15...45 daemaege-a vhenefer zeey use-a a skeell und 5...50 aeddeeshunael daemaege-a iff nut under zee iffffects ooff unuzeer Mesmer hex.','Aelsu hexes fues aedjaecent tu taerget (10 secunds). Zeese-a fues taeke-a 15...45 daemaege-a vhenefer zeey use-a a skeell und 5...50 aeddeeshunael daemaege-a iff nut under zee iffffects ooff unuzeer Mesmer hex.'],
879=>['Illooseeun ooff Paeeen','Fur 8 secunds, taerget fue-a haes -3...10 Heaelt degeneraeshun und taekes 3...10 daemaege-a iaech secund. Vhee Illooseeun ooff Paeeen inds, thaet fue-a is heaeled fur 36...120.','(8 secunds.) Cooses -3...10 Heaelt degeneraeshun und taerget fue-a taekes 3...10 daemaege-a iaech secund. Ind iffffect: thaet fue-a is heaeled fur 36...120.'],
880=>['Stulee Speed','Fur 1...10 secunds, spells caest by zee taerget fue-a und aell aedjaecent fues taeke-a 100% lunger tu caest. Spells taergeteeng zeese-a fues thaet aere-a caest by yuoo oor yuoor aelleees taeke-a 50% less teeme-a tu caest.','Aelsu hexes aedjaecent fues (1...10 secunds). Duoobles spell caesteeng teeme-a. Spells caest by yuoo oor yuoor aelleees oon hexed fues haefe-a -50% caesteeng teeme-a. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
881=>['Izeer Seegnet','Iff yuoo haefe-a less thun 5...10 Inergy, gaeeen 10...20 Inergy.','Yuoo gaeeen 10...20 Inergy. Nu iffffect unless yuoo haefe-a less thun 5...10 Inergy.'],
882=>['Seegnet ooff Deesenchuntment','Luse-a aell Inergy. Taerget fue-a luses oone-a inchuntment.','Remufes oone-a inchuntment. Yuoo luse-a aell Inergy.'],
883=>['Fucael Meenureety','Fur 5...20 secunds, taerget fue-a und aell neaerby fues cunnut use-a shuoots oor chunts.','Aelsu hexes fues neaer taerget (5...20 secunds). Zeese-a fues cunnut use-a shuoots oor chunts.'],
884=>['Seaereeng Flaemes','Taerget fue-a und aell neaerby fues aere-a stroock veet Seaereeng Flaemes. Fues aelreaedy oon fure-a vhee thees skeell is caest aere-a stroock fur 10...100 fure-a daemaege-a. Fues nut aelreaedy oon fure-a begeen Boorneeng fur 1...7 secunds.','Heets fues neaer yuoor taerget. Deaels 10...100 fure-a daemaege-a tu fues aelreaedy Boorneeng. Inffleects Boorneeng cundeeshun (1...7 secunds) tu fues nut Boorneeng.'],
885=>['Sheeeld Gooaerdeeun','Fur 2...6 secunds, aell paerty members in iaershut haefe-a a 75% chunce-a tu bluck aettaecks. Iff un aettaeck is blucked, aell aelleees in iaershut aere-a heaeled fur 10...40 Heaelt und Sheeeld Gooaerdeeun inds.','(2...6 secunds). Paerty members in iaershut haefe-a a 75% chunce-a tu bluck aettaecks. Bluck iffffect: Aelleees in iaershut aere-a heaeled fur 10...40 und Sheeeld Gooaerdeeun inds.'],
886=>['Restffool Breeze-a','Fur 8...18 secunds, taerget aelly haes +10 Heaelt regeneraeshun. Thees inchuntment inds iff thaet aelly aettaecks oor uses a skeell.','(8...18 secunds.) +10 Heaelt regeneraeshun. Inds iff taerget aelly aettaecks oor uses a skeell.'],
887=>['Seegnet ooff Rejoofenaeshun','Heael taerget aelly fur 15...75. Iff taerget aelly is caesteeng a spell oor aettaeckeeng, thaet aelly is heaeled fur un aeddeeshunael 15...75 Heaelt.','Heaels fur 15...75. Heaels fur 15...75 mure-a iff taerget aelly is caesteeng a spell oor aettaeckeeng.'],
888=>['Vhurleeng Aexe-a','Iff Vhurleeng Aexe-a heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +5...20 daemaege-a und uny stunce-a beeeng used by yuoor taerget inds. Thees aettaeck cunnut be-a blucked.','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a und remufes a stunce-a. Unbluckaeble-a.'],
889=>['Furceffool Bloo','Iff Furceffool Bloo heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +10...30 daemaege-a und uny stunce-a beeeng used by taerget fue-a inds. Taerget fue-a sooffffers frum Veaekness fur 5...20 secunds. Thees aettaeck cunnut be-a blucked.','Deaels +10...30 daemaege-a. Remufes taerget fue-a\'s stunce-a. Inffleects Veaekness cundeeshun (5...20 secunds). Unbluckaeble-a.'],
891=>['"Nune-a Shaell Paess!"','Aell neaerby fues thaet aere-a mufeeng aere-a knucked doon. Thees skeell rechaerges 1...8 secunds faester fur iaech fue-a knucked doon (maexeemoom 25 secunds).','Knucks doon aell neaerby mufeeng fues. Rechaerges 1...8 secunds faester fur iaech aeffffected fue-a (maexeemoom 25 secunds).'],
892=>['Qooeefereeng Blaede-a','Iff Qooeefereeng Blaede-a heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +10...40 daemaege-a. Iff thees aettaeck heets a mufeeng fue-a, thaet fue-a is Daezed fur 10 secunds. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Deaels +10...40 daemaege-a. Inffleects Daezed cundeeshun (10 secunds) iff taerget fue-a vaes mufeeng.'],
893=>['Seekeeng Aerroos','Fur 3...14 secunds, yuoor aerroos cunnut be-a blucked. Seekeeng Aerroos inds iff yuoo faeeel tu heet.','(3...14 secunds.) Yuoor aerroos aere-a unbluckaeble-a. Inds iff yuoo faeeel tu heet.'],
898=>['Ooferluaed','Fur 5 secunds, taerget fue-a sooffffers -1...3 Heaelt degeneraeshun. Iff taerget fue-a is useeng a skeell, Ooferluaed deaels 15...75 daemaege-a tu thaet fue-a und 75% ooff thaet daemaege-a tu aell aedjaecent fues.','(5 secunds.) Cooses -1...3 Heaelt degeneraeshun. Iff taerget fue-a is useeng a skeell, thaet fue-a taekes 15...75 daemaege-a und aell aedjaecent fues taeke-a 75% ooff thaet daemaege-a.'],
899=>['Imaeges ooff Remurse-a','Fur 5...10 secunds, taerget fue-a sooffffers -1...3 Heaelt degeneraeshun. Iff thaet fue-a vaes aettaeckeeng, thaet fue-a taekes 10...52 daemaege-a.','(5...10 secunds.) Cooses -1...3 Heaelt degeneraeshun. Ineeteeael iffffect: 10...52 daemaege-a iff taerget fue-a is aettaeckeeng.'],
900=>['Shaered Boordee','Fur 5...20 secunds, taerget fue-a und aell fues in zee aerea aettaeck, caest spells, und mufe-a 50% slooer.','Aelsu hexes fues in zee aerea ooff yuoor taerget (5...20 secunds). Zeese-a fues aettaeck, caest spells, und mufe-a 50% slooer.'],
901=>['Suool Beend','Fur 30 secunds, ifery teeme-a taerget fue-a is heaeled, zee heaeler taekes 20...80 daemaege-a. Thees hex inds iff taerget is sooffffereeng frum a Smeeteeng Praeyers hex.','(30 secunds.) Ifery teeme-a taerget fue-a is heaeled, zee heaeler taekes 20...80 daemaege-a. Inds iff taerget is sooffffereeng frum a Smeeteeng Praeyers hex.'],
902=>['Bluud ooff zee Aeggressur','Steael up tu 5...45 Heaelt frum taerget fue-a. Iff thaet fue-a vaes aettaeckeeng, thaet fue-a sooffffers Veaekness fur 3...12 secunds.','Steaels 5...45 Heaelt. Inffleects Veaekness (3...12 secunds) iff taerget fue-a vaes aettaeckeeng.'],
903=>['Icy Preesm','Taerget fue-a is stroock fur 15...75 culd daemaege-a. Iff thaet fue-a haes a Vaeter Maegeec hex, Icy Preesm deaels +15...75 culd daemaege-a tu aell oozeer neaerby fues.','Deaels 15...75 culd daemaege-a. Deaels +15...75 culd daemaege-a tu oozeer neaerby fues iff taerget haes a Vaeter Maegeec hex.'],
904=>['Fooreeuoos Aexe-a','Iff Fooreeuoos Aexe-a heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +5...35 daemaege-a. Iff it is blucked yuoo gaeeen 3 streekes vurt ooff aedrenaeleene-a.','Deaels +5...35 daemaege-a. Geefes yuoo 3 streekes ooff aedrenaeleene-a iff blucked.'],
905=>['Oospeeceeuoos Bloo','Iff Oospeeceeuoos Bloo heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +5...20 daemaege-a und gaeeen 3...8 Inergy. Iff taerget fue-a is sooffffereeng frum Veaekness, thees aettaeck is unbluckaeble-a.','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a und yuoo gaeeen 3...8 Inergy. Unbluckaeble-a iff taerget fue-a is Veaekened.'],
906=>['"Oon Yuoor Knees!"','Luse-a aell aedrenaeleene-a. Iff uny aedjaecent fues aere-a knucked doon, aell ooff yuoor stunces aere-a rechaerged. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Rechaerges aell yuoor stunces iff yuoo aere-a aedjaecent tu a knucked-doon fue-a. Yuoo luse-a aell aedrenaeleene-a.'],
907=>['Draegun Slaesh','Iff Draegun Slaesh heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +10...40 daemaege-a und gaeeen 1...5 streeke-as ooff aedrenaeleene-a.','Deaels +10...40 daemaege-a. Yuoo gaeeen 1...5 streeke-as ooff aedrenaeleene-a iff it heets.'],
908=>['Maerooder\'s Shut','Iff Maerooder\'s Shut heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +25...55 daemaege-a und aell yuoor nun-aettaeck skeells aere-a deesaebled fur 5 secunds.','Deaels +25...55 daemaege-a. Yuoor nun-aettaeck skeells aere-a deesaebled (5 secunds) iff thees aettaeck heets.'],
909=>['Fucoosed Shut','Thees shut mufes three-a teemes faester, cunnut be-a blucked, und streekes fur +10...40 daemaege-a boot aell ooff yuoor oozeer aettaeck skeells aere-a deesaebled fur 8...4 secunds.','Deaels +10...40 daemaege-a. Unbluckaeble-a. Thees shut mufes three-a teemes faester.Yuoor oozeer aettaeck skeells aere-a deesaebled (8...4 secunds).'],
910=>['Spureet Reefft','Oopee a Spureet Reefft aet taerget fue-a\'s lucaeshun. Aeffter 3 secunds, aell aedjaecent fues aere-a stroock fur 25...125 leeghtneeng daemaege-a und sooffffer frum Craecked Aermur fur 1...20 secunds.','Aeffter 3 secunds, aeffffects fues aedjaecent tu taerget\'s ineeteeael lucaeshun. Deaels 25...125 leeghtneeng daemaege-a und inffleects Craecked Aermur (1...20 secunds).'],
911=>['Uneeun','Creaete-a a lefel 1...12 spureet. Vhenefer a nun-spureet aelly in its runge-a taekes daemaege-a oor leeffe-a steael, it is redooced by 15 und zee spureet taekes 15 daemaege-a. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...60 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...12 spureet (30...60 secund leeffespun). Vhenefer a nun-spureet aelly veetheen runge-a taekes daemaege-a oor leeffe-a steael, it is redooced by 15 und zee spureet taekes 15 daemaege-a.'],
913=>['Trunqooeel Vaes Tunaesee','Huld Tunaesee\'s aeshes fur up tu 5...20 secunds. Vheele-a yuoo huld hees aeshes, yuoo haefe-a +10...25 aermur und cunnut be-a interroopted. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(5...20 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +10...25 aermur. Yuoo cunnut be-a interroopted.'],
914=>['Cunsoome-a Suool','Yuoo steael 5...70 Heaelt frum taerget fue-a. Aell husteele-a soommuned creaetoores in iaershut ooff thaet fue-a taeke-a 25...125 daemaege-a.','Steaels 5...70 Heaelt. Deael 25...125 daemaege-a tu husteele-a soommuned creaetoores veetheen iaershut ooff taerget fue-a.'],
915=>['Spureet Leeght','Taerget aelly is heaeled fur 60...180. Iff uny spureets aere-a veetheen iaershut, yuoo dun\'t saecreeffeece-a Heaelt.','Heaels fur 60...180. Yuoo dun\'t saecreeffeece-a Heaelt iff yuoo aere-a veetheen iaershut ooff uny spureets.'],
916=>['Laementaeshun','Fur 5...20 secunds, taerget fue-a und aell neaerby fues sooffffer -0...3 Heaelt degeneraeshun. Vhee thees hex is aeppleeed, zeese-a fues taeke-a 10...50 daemaege-a iff yuoo aere-a veetheen iaershut ooff a spureet oor curpse-a.','Aelsu hexes fues neaer taerget (5...20 secunds). Cooses -0...3 Heaelt degeneraeshun. Ineeteeael iffffect: deaels 10...50 daemaege-a tu zeese-a fues iff yuoo aere-a veetheen iaershut ooff a spureet oor curpse-a.'],
917=>['Rooptoore-a Suool','Taerget aelleeed spureet is destruyed. Aell neaerby inemeees aere-a stroock fur 50...140 leeghtneeng daemaege-a und becume-a bleended fur 3...12 secunds.','Destruys taerget aelleeed spureet. Deaels 50...140 leeghtneeng daemaege-a und inffleects Bleendness cundeeshun (3...12 secunds) tu neaerby fues.'],
918=>['Spureet tu Flesh','Taerget tuooched aelleeed spureet is destruyed. Aell neaerby aelleees aere-a heaeled fur 30...240.','Destruys taerget tuooched aelleeed spureet. Heaels neaerby aelleees fur 30...240.'],
919=>['Spureet Boorn','Taerget fue-a is stroock fur 5...50 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Iff uny spureets aere-a veetheen iaershut, Spureet Boorn cooses Boorneeng fur 1...5 secunds.','Deaels 5...50 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Inffleects Boorneeng cundeeshun (1...5 secunds) iff yuoo aere-a veetheen iaershut ooff a spureet.'],
920=>['Destroocshun','Creaete-a a lefel 1...14 Spureet thaet deees aeffter 30 secunds. Vhee thees Spureet deees, aell fues in zee aerea taeke-a 5...25 daemaege-a fur iaech secund zee Spureet vaes aeleefe-a (maexeemoom 150 daemaege-a).','Creaete-a a lefel 1...14 Spureet thaet deees aeffter 30 secunds. Vhee thees Spureet deees, aell fues in zee aerea taeke-a 5...25 daemaege-a fur iaech secund zee Spureet vaes aeleefe-a (maexeemoom 150 daemaege-a).'],
921=>['Deessununce-a','Creaete-a a lefel 1...12 spureet. Thees spureet deaels 5...20 daemaege-a und unyune-a stroock by its aettaeck is interroopted. Thees spureet deees aeffter 10...25 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...12 spureet (10...25 secund leeffespun). Its aettaecks deael 5...20 daemaege-a und interroopt aecshuns.'],
923=>['Deesenchuntment','Creaete-a a lefel 1...12 spureet. Thees spureet deaels 5...20 daemaege-a und unyune-a stroock by its aettaeck luses oone-a inchuntment. Thees spureet deees aeffter 10...35 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...12 spureet (10...35 secund leeffespun). Its aettaecks deael 5...20 daemaege-a und remufe-a oone-a inchuntment.'],
925=>['Recaell','Vheele-a yuoo maeeentaeeen Recaell, nutheeng haeppens. Vhee Recaell inds, yuoo Shaedoo Step tu zee aelly yuoo taergeted vhee yuoo aecteefaeted thees skeell, und aell ooff yuoor skeells aere-a deesaebled fur 3 secunds.','Ind iffffect: Shaedoo Step tu taerget aelly. Cunnut selff-taerget und deesaebles aell ooff yuoor skeells fur 3 secunds vhee it inds.'],
926=>['Shaerpee Daeggers','Fur 5...30 secunds, yuoor daegger aettaecks coose-a Bleedeeng fur 5...15 secunds.','(5...30 secunds.) Yuoor daegger aettaecks inffleect zee Bleedeeng cundeeshun (5...15 secunds).'],
927=>['Shaemeffool Feaer','Fur 10 secunds, taerget fue-a mufes 10% faester thun nurmael. Fur iaech secund, iff thaet fue-a is mufeeng, thaet fue-a taekes 5...20 daemaege-a.','(10 secunds.) Taerget fue-a taekes 5...20 daemaege-a iaech secund vheele-a mufeeng, boot mufes 10% faester.'],
928=>['Shaedoo Shruood','Fur 3...9 secunds, taerget fue-a cunnut be-a zee taerget ooff inchuntments.','(3...9 secunds.) Taerget fue-a cunnut be-a zee taerget ooff inchuntments.'],
929=>['Shaedoo ooff Haeste-a','Fur 10...40 secunds yuoo mufe-a 15% faester thun nurmael. Vhee Shaedoo ooff Haeste-a inds, yuoo Shaedoo Step tu yuoor ooreegeenael lucaeshun.','(10...40 secunds.) Yuoo mufe-a 15% faester. Ind iffffect: retoorn tu yuoor ooreegeenael lucaeshun.'],
930=>['Oospeeceeuoos Incuntaeshun','Fur 20 secunds, zee next spell yuoo caest is deesaebled fur un aeddeeshunael 10...5 secunds, und yuoo gaeeen 110...200% ooff thaet spell\'s Inergy cust.','(20 secunds.) Yuoor next spell geefes yuoo 110...200% ooff its Inergy cust. Thaet spell taekes 10...5 secunds lunger tu rechaerge-a.'],
931=>['Pooer Retoorn','Iff taerget fue-a is caesteeng a spell oor chunt, thaet skeell is interroopted und taerget fue-a gaeeens 10...5 Inergy.','Interroopts a spell oor chunt. Interroopshun iffffect: taerget fue-a gaeeens 10...5 Inergy.'],
932=>['Cumpleecaete-a','Iff taerget fue-a is useeng a skeell, thaet skeell is interroopted und deesaebled fur taerget fue-a und aell fues in zee aerea fur un aeddeeshunael 5...12 secunds.','Interroopts a skeell. Interroopshun iffffect: deesaebles interroopted skeell (+5...12 secunds) fur taerget fue-a und aell fues in zee aerea.'],
933=>['Shaetter Sturm','Taerget fue-a luses aell inchuntments. Fur iaech inchuntment remufed thees vaey, Shaetter Sturm is deesaebled fur un aeddeeshunael 7 secunds.','Remufes aell inchuntments. Remufael cust: Shaetter Sturm is deesaebled fur +7 secunds fur iaech inchuntment remufed.'],
934=>['Unnaetoorael Seegnet','Taerget fue-a taekes 15...75 daemaege-a. Iff thaet fue-a is under zee iffffects ooff a hex oor inchuntment, fues aedjaecent tu yuoor taerget taeke-a 5...50 daemaege-a. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Deaels 15...75 daemaege-a. Deaels 5...50 daemaege-a tu oozeer aedjaecent fues iff zee taerget is hexed oor inchunted.'],
935=>['Reeseeng Beele-a','Fur 20 secunds, thees hex dues nutheeng. Vhee Reeseeng Beele-a inds, thaet fue-a und aell fues in zee aerea taeke-a 1...6 daemaege-a fur iaech secund Reeseeng Beele-a vaes in iffffect.','(20 secunds.) Ind iffffect: deaels 1...6 daemaege-a fur iaech secund Reeseeng Beele-a vaes in iffffect. Aelsu daemaeges oozeer fues in zee aerea.'],
936=>['Infenum Inchuntments','Taerget fue-a luses oone-a inchuntment. Fur ifery remaeeeneeng inchuntment, taerget fue-a is pueesuned fur 3...10 secunds.','Remufes oone-a inchuntment frum taerget fue-a. Inffleects Pueesuned cundeeshun (3...10 secunds fur iaech remaeeeneeng inchuntment oon thaet fue-a).'],
937=>['Shuckvaefe-a','Aell fues in zee aerea taeke-a 15...60 iaert daemaege-a und aere-a Veaekened fur 1...10 secunds. Neaerby fues aelsu taeke-a +15...60 iaert daemaege-a und haefe-a Craecked Aermur fur 1...10 secunds. Aedjaecent fues sooffffer zee prefeeuoos iffffects, taeke-a +15...60 iaert daemaege-a, und aere-a Bleended fur 1...10 secunds.','Fues in zee aerea taeke-a 15...60 iaert daemaege-a und aere-a Veaekened (1...10 secunds). Neaerby fues aelsu taeke-a +15...60 iaert daemaege-a und haefe-a Craecked Aermur (1...10 secunds). Aedjaecent fues aelsu taeke-a +15...60 iaert daemaege-a und aere-a Bleended (1...10 secunds).'],
938=>['Vaerd ooff Staebeeleety','Creaete-a a Vaerd ooff Staebeeleety aet yuoor coorrent lucaeshun. Fur 10...25 secunds, nun-spureet aelleees cunnut be-a knucked doon. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(10...25 secunds.) Aelleees in thees vaerd cunnut be-a knucked-doon. Aelleeed spureets aere-a nut aeffffected.'],
939=>['Icy Shaeckles','Fur 1...10 secunds, taerget fue-a\'s mufement speed is redooced by 66%. Vheele-a under zee iffffects ooff un inchuntment, thaet fue-a\'s mufement is redooced by 90%.','(1...10 secunds.) Taerget fue-a mufes 66% slooer. Thees fue-a mufes 90% slooer iff inchunted.'],
941=>['Blessed Leeght','Heael taerget aelly fur 10...120 Heaelt und remufe-a oone-a cundeeshun und oone-a hex.','Heaels fur 10...120. Remufes oone-a cundeeshun und oone-a hex.'],
942=>['Veethdraev Hexes','Remufe-a aell hexes frum taerget aelly und aell aedjaecent aelleees. Thees spell taekes un aeddeeshunael 2 secunds tu rechaerge-a fur iaech hex remufed in thees vaey. (50% faeeeloore-a chunce-a veet Deefeene-a Faefur 4 oor less.)','Remufes aell hexes. Aelsu aeffffects aedjaecent aelleees. Remufael cust: +2 secunds rechaerge-a fur iaech hex remufed. 50% faeeeloore-a chunce-a unless Deefeene-a Faefur 5 oor mure-a.'],
943=>['Ixteengooeesh','Remufe-a oone-a cundeeshun frum iaech paerty member. Paerty members releeefed ooff Boorneeng aere-a heaeled fur 10...100 Heaelt.','Aeffffects aell paerty members. Remufes oone-a cundeeshun. Paerty members releeefed ooff Boorneeng aere-a heaeled fur 10...100.'],
944=>['Seegnet ooff Strengt','Yuoor next 1...16 aettaecks deael +5 daemaege-a.','Yuoor aettaecks deael +5 daemaege-a. Inds aeffter 1...16 aettaecks.'],
946=>['Traepper\'s Fucoos','Fur 12...36 secunds, yuoor traep skeells aere-a nut iaeseely interroopteeble-a und yuoor Veelderness Soorfeefael aettreeboote-a is increaesed by 0...4.','(12...36 secunds.) Yuoor traep skeells aere-a nu lunger iaesy tu interroopt. Yuoo gaeeen +0...4 tu yuoor Veelderness Soorfeefael aettreeboote-a.'],
947=>['Braembles','Creaete-a a lefel 1...10 spureet. Nun-spureet creaetoores thaet aere-a knucked doon in its runge-a taeke-a 5 daemaege-a und begeen Bleedeeng fur 5...20 secunds. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...240 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...10 spureet (30...240 secund leeffespun). Knucked-doon creaetoores taeke-a 5 daemaege-a und begeen Bleedeeng (5...20 secunds). Dues nut aeffffect spureets.'],
948=>['Desperaete-a Streeke-a','Iff yuoo haefe-a less thun 50...80% Heaelt, yuoo deael +15...60 daemaege-a. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Deaels +15...60 daemaege-a iff yuoo haefe-a less thun 50...80% Heaelt.'],
949=>['Vaey ooff zee Fux','Fur 10...35 secunds, yuoor next 1...6 aettaecks cunnut be-a blucked.','(10...35 secunds.) Yuoor aettaecks aere-a unbluckaeble-a. Inds aeffter 1...6 aettaecks.'],
950=>['Shaedooy Boordee','Fur 3...15 secunds, taerget fue-a mufes 25% slooer und vheele-a taerget fue-a haes nu oozeer hexes, thaet fue-a haes 20...30 less aermur aegaeeenst yuoor aettaecks.','(3...15 secunds.) Taerget fue-a mufes 25% slooer und haes 20...30 less aermur aegaeeenst yuoor aettaecks. Aermur redoocshun oonly aeffffects thees fue-a vheele-a it haes nu oozeer hexes.'],
951=>['Seephun Speed','Fur 5...15 secunds, taerget fue-a mufes 33% slooer und yuoo mufe-a 33% faester. Thees spell rechaerges 50% faester iff caest oon a mufeeng fue-a.','(5...15 secunds.) Taerget fue-a mufes 33% slooer und yuoo mufe-a 33% faester. Rechaerges 50% faester iff caest oon a mufeeng fue-a.'],
952=>['Deaet\'s Chaerge-a','Shaedoo Step tu taerget fue-a. Iff thaet fue-a haes mure-a Heaelt thun yuoo, yuoo aere-a heaeled fur 65...200.','Yuoo Shaedoo Step tu taerget fue-a. Yuoo aere-a heaeled fur 65...200 iff thees fue-a haes mure-a Heaelt thun yuoo.'],
953=>['Pooer Floox','Iff taerget fue-a is caesteeng a spell oor chunt, thaet skeell is interroopted und fur 4...10 secunds, thaet fue-a haes -2 Inergy degeneraeshun.','Interroopts a spell oor chunt. Interroopshun iffffect: -2 Inergy degeneraeshun (4...10 secunds).'],
954=>['Ixpel Hexes','Remufe-a up tu 2 hexes frum taerget aelly.','Remufes 2 hexes frum taerget aelly.'],
955=>['Reep Inchuntment','Remufe-a 1 inchuntments frum taerget fue-a. Iff un inchuntment vaes remufed, thaet fue-a sooffffers frum Bleedeeng fur 5...25 secunds.','Remufes 1 inchuntments. Remufael iffffect: inffleects Bleedeeng (5...25 secunds).'],
957=>['Spell Sheeeld','Fur 5...20 secunds, vheele-a yuoo aere-a caesteeng spells, fues cunnut taerget yuoo veet spells. Vhee Spell Sheeeld inds, aell yuoor skeells aere-a deesaebled fur 8...4 secunds.','(5...20 secunds.) Vheele-a caesteeng spells, yuoo cunnut be-a zee taerget ooff spells. Ind iffffect: yuoor skeells aere-a deesaebled (8...4 secunds).'],
958=>['Heaeleeng Vheesper','Taerget oozeer aelly is heaeled fur 40...100. Thees spell haes haelff zee nurmael runge-a.','Heaels fur 40...100. Cunnut selff-taerget.'],
959=>['Izeereael Leeght','Taerget aelly is heaeled fur 25...100. Thees spell is iaeseely interroopted. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Heaels fur 25...100. Iaeseely interroopted.'],
960=>['Releaese-a Inchuntments','Luse-a aell inchuntments. Iaech paerty member is heaeled fur 5...35 Heaelt fur iaech Munk inchuntment lust.','Remufes aell ooff yuoor inchuntments. Heaels aell paerty members fur 5...35 fur iaech Munk inchuntment remufed.'],
961=>['Laeceraete-a','Creaete-a a lefel 1...10 spureet. Bleedeeng creaetoores veetheen its runge-a sooffffer -2 Heaelt degeneraeshun. Vhee thees spureet deees, aell nun-spureet creaetoores veetheen its runge-a thaet haefe-a less thun 90% Heaelt begeen Bleedeeng fur 5...25 secunds. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...240 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...10 spureet (30...240 secund leeffespun). Bleedeeng creaetoores in runge-a haefe-a -2 Heaelt degeneraeshun. Ind iffffect: inffleects Bleedeeng cundeeshun (5...25 secunds) oon creaetoores in runge-a thaet haefe-a less thun 90% Heaelt. Dues nut aeffffect spureets.'],
962=>['Spureet Trunsffer','Zee spureet neaerest yuoo luses 5...50 Heaelt. Taerget aelly is heaeled fur 5 fur iaech pueent ooff Heaelt lust.','Zee spureet neaerest yuoo luses 5...50 Heaelt. Heaels taerget aelly fur 5 fur iaech pueent ooff Heaelt lust.'],
963=>['Resturaeshun','Creaete-a a lefel 1...14 spureet. Vhee thees spureet deees, aell paerty members in zee aerea aere-a resoorrected veet 5...50% Heaelt und zeru Inergy. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...14 spureet (30 secund leeffespun). Ind iffffect: resoorrects paerty members in zee aerea veet 5...50% Heaelt und zeru Inergy.'],
964=>['Fengeffool Veaepun','Fur 8 secunds, zee next teeme-a taerget aelly taekes daemaege-a oor leeffe-a steael frum a fue-a, thaet aelly steaels up tu 15...60 Heaelt frum thaet fue-a.','(8 secunds.) Steaels 15...60 Heaelt frum zee next fue-a thaet deaels daemaege-a oor leeffe-a steael tu taerget aelly.'],
973=>['Bleendeeng Pooder','Moost fulloo un ooffff-hund aettaeck. Taerget fue-a und aell aedjaecent fues becume-a Bleended fur 3...15 secunds.','Inffleects Bleendness cundeeshun (3...15 secunds) oon taerget und aedjaecent fues. Moost fulloo un ooffff-hund aettaeck.'],
974=>['Muntees Tuooch','Taerget fue-a becumes Creeppled fur 5...20 secunds. Thees skeell cuoonts aes un ooffff-hund aettaeck.','Inffleects Creeppled cundeeshun (5...20 secunds). Thees skeell cuoonts aes un ooffff-hund aettaeck.'],
975=>['Ixhoosteeng Aessoolt','Moost fulloo a leaed aettaeck. Taerget fue-a\'s aecshun is interroopted. Iff thaet aecshun vaes caesteeng a spell, taerget fue-a sooffffers 10 Oofercaest.','Interroopts un aecshun. Inffleects 10 Oofercaest iff zee interroopted aecshun vaes a spell. Moost fulloo a leaed aettaeck.'],
976=>['Repeaeteeng Streeke-a','Moost fulloo un ooffff-hund aettaeck. Iff it heets, thees aettaeck streekes fur +10...30 daemaege-a. Iff it meesses, it taekes un aeddeeshunael 15 secunds tu rechaerge-a.','Deaels +10...30 daemaege-a. Thees skeell haes +15 secund rechaerge-a teeme-a iff it meesses. Moost fulloo un ooffff-hund aettaeck.'],
977=>['Vaey ooff zee Lutoos','Fur 20 secunds, zee next teeme-a yuoo heet veet a dooael aettaeck skeell, yuoo gaeeen 5...20 Inergy.','(20 secunds.) Yuoo gaeeen 5...20 Inergy zee next teeme-a yuoo heet veet a dooael aettaeck.'],
978=>['Maerk ooff Instaebeeleety','Fur 20 secunds, zee next teeme-a yuoo heet taerget fue-a veet a dooael aettaeck skeell thaet fue-a is knucked doon.','(20 secunds.) Cooses knuck-doon zee next teeme-a yuoo heet taerget fue-a veet a dooael aettaeck.'],
979=>['Meestroost','Fur 6 secunds, zee next spell thaet taerget fue-a caests oon oone-a ooff yuoor aelleees faeeels und deaels 10...80 daemaege-a tu thaet fue-a und 75% ooff thaet daemaege-a tu aell neaerby fues.','(6 secunds.) Zee next spell thaet taerget fue-a caests oon oone-a ooff yuoor aelleees faeeels und deaels 10...80 daemaege-a tu taerget und 75% ooff thaet daemaege-a tu neaerby fues.'],
980=>['Feaest ooff Suools','Destruy aell neaerby aelleees\' spureets. Fur iaech spureet destruyed in thees vaey, aell paerty members aere-a heaeled fur 50...100 Heaelt.','Heaels aell paerty members fur 50...100 fur iaech neaerby aelleeed spureet. Aell neaerby aelleeed spureets aere-a destruyed.'],
981=>['Recooperaeshun','Creaete-a a lefel 1...14 spureet. Nun-spureet aelleees veetheen its runge-a gaeeen +1...3 Heaelt regeneraeshun. Thees spureet deees aeffter 15...45 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...14 spureet (15...45 secund leeffespun). Nun-spureet aelleees veetheen runge-a haefe-a +1...3 Heaelt regeneraeshun.'],
982=>['Shelter','Creaete-a a lefel 1...12 spureet. Nun-spureet aelleees veetheen its runge-a cunnut luse-a mure-a thun 10% maexeemoom Heaelt frum a seengle-a aettaeck. Vhee thees spureet prefents daemaege-a, it luses 75...45 Heaelt. Thees spureet laests 30...60 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...12 spureet (30...60 secund leeffespun). Nun-spureet aelleees veetheen runge-a cunnut luse-a mure-a thun 10% maexeemoom Heaelt frum a seengle-a aettaeck. Daemaege-a prefenshun cust: thees spureet luses 75...45 Heaelt.'],
983=>['Veaepun ooff Shaedoo','Fur 1...7 secunds, taerget aelly haes a Veaepun ooff Shaedoo. Vhenefer thaet aelly is stroock by un aettaeck, thaet aelly\'s aettaecker becumes Bleended fur 5 secunds. Zee next 1...3 teemes thaet aelly heets veet un aettaeck, hees taerget is Bleended fur 5 secunds.','(1...7 secunds.) Inffleects Bleendness cundeeshun (5 secunds) oon unyune-a vhu aettaecks taerget aelly. Taerget aelly\'s next 1...3 aettaecks inffleect Bleendness (5 secunds) iff zeey heet.'],
985=>['Caeltrups','Taerget fue-a und aell fues aedjaecent tu yuoor taerget aere-a Creeppled und Bleedeeng fur 5...15 secunds. Caeltrups haes haelff zee nurmael runge-a.','Inffleects Creeppled und Bleedeeng cundeeshuns (5...15 secunds) oon taerget und aedjaecent fues.'],
986=>['Neene-a Taeeel Streeke-a','Moost fulloo un ooffff-hund aettaeck. Neene-a Taeeel Streeke-a cunnut be-a blucked und streekes fur +15...40 daemaege-a iff it heets.','Deaels +15...40 daemaege-a. Unbluckaeble-a. Moost fulloo un ooffff-hund aettaeck.'],
987=>['Vaey ooff zee Impty Paelm','Fur 5...15 secunds, ooffff-hund und dooael aettaecks cust nu Inergy und rechaerge-a 25...50% faester.','(5...15 secunds.) Yuoor ooffff-hund und dooael aettaecks cust nu Inergy und rechaerge-a 25...50% faester.'],
988=>['Temple-a Streeke-a','Moost fulloo a leaed aettaeck. Iff thees aettaeck heets, taerget fue-a is Daezed und Bleended fur 1...10 secunds, und iff taerget fue-a is caesteeng a spell, thaet fue-a is interroopted.','Interroopts a spell. Inffleects Daezed und Bleendness cundeeshuns (1...10 secunds). Moost fulloo a leaed aettaeck.'],
989=>['Guldee Phueneex Streeke-a','Iff yuoo aere-a nut under zee iffffects ooff un inchuntment, thees skeell meesses. Iff it heets, Guldee Phueneex Streeke-a deaels +10...30 daemaege-a und aell aedjaecent fues taeke-a 10...30 daemaege-a.','Deaels +10...30 daemaege-a tu taerget und deaels 10...30 daemaege-a tu aedjaecent fues. Faeeels iff yuoo aere-a nut inchunted.'],
990=>['Ixpoonge-a Inchuntments','Taerget fue-a luses 1 inchuntment. Aell ooff yuoor oozeer nun-aettaeck skeells aere-a deesaebled fur 8...4 secunds. Fur iaech skeell deesaebled in thees vaey, taerget tuooched fue-a luses 1 aeddeeshunael inchuntment.','Remufes oone-a inchuntment fur iaech nun-aettaeck skeell yuoo haefe-a. Aell yuoor nun-aettaeck skeells aere-a deesaebled (8...4 secunds).'],
991=>['Deny Hexes','Remufe-a oone-a hex frum taerget aelly und oone-a aeddeeshunael hex fur iaech rechaergeeng Deefeene-a Faefur skeell yuoo haefe-a.','Remufes oone-a hex frum taerget aelly und oone-a aeddeeshunael hex fur iaech rechaergeeng Deefeene-a Faefur skeell yuoo haefe-a.'],
992=>['Treeple-a Chup','Aettaeck taerget fue-a und aedjaecent fues. Iaech aettaeck thaet heets deaels +10...40 daemaege-a. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Deaels +10...40 daemaege-a. Aelsu heets aedjaecent fues.'],
993=>['Inraeged Smaesh','Iff Inraeged Smaesh heets, yuoo gaeeen 1...4 streeke-as ooff aedrenaeleene-a. Iff yuoo heet a mufeeng fue-a, yuoo streeke-a fur +10...40 daemaege-a, und yuoor taerget is knucked doon.','Geefes yuoo 1...4 streeke-as ooff aedrenaeleene-a iff yuoo heet. Deaels +10...40 daemaege-a und cooses knuckdoon iff yuoor taerget vaes mufeeng.'],
994=>['Renooeeng Smaesh','Iff Renooeeng Smaesh heets, it deaels +10...40 daemaege-a. Iff yuoo heet a knucked-doon fue-a, yuoo gaeeen 3 Inergy und thees aettaeck rechaerges instuntly.','Deaels +10...40 daemaege-a. Yuoo gaeeen 3 Inergy und thees aettaeck rechaerges instuntly iff taerget fue-a vaes knucked doon.'],
995=>['Teeger Stunce-a','Fur 4...10 secunds, yuoo aettaeck 33% faester. Teeger Stunce-a inds iff uny ooff yuoor aettaecks faeeel tu heet.','(4...10 secunds.) Yuoo aettaeck 33% faester. Inds iff yuoo faeeel tu heet.'],
996=>['Stundeeng Slaesh','Iff it heets, Stundeeng Slaesh deaels +5...20 daemaege-a ploos un aeddeeshunael 5...20 daemaege-a iff yuoo aere-a in a stunce-a.','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Deaels 5...20 mure-a daemaege-a iff yuoo aere-a in a stunce-a.'],
997=>['Faemeene-a','Creaete-a a lefel 1...10 spureet. Vhenefer a nun-spureet creaetoore-a in its runge-a reaeches 0 Inergy, thaet creaetoore-a taekes 20...70 daemaege-a. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...180 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...10 spureet (30...180 secund leeffespun). Deaels 20...70 daemaege-a tu creaetoores in runge-a thaet reaech 0 Inergy. Dues nut aeffffect spureets.'],
1018=>['Creeteecael Iye-a','Fur 10...35 secunds, yuoo haefe-a un aeddeeshunael 3...15% chunce-a tu lund a creeteecael heet vhee aettaeckeeng. Yuoo gaeeen 1 Inergy vhenefer yuoo scure-a a creeteecael heet.','(10...35 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +3...15% chunce-a tu lund a creeteecael heet. Yuoo gaeeen 1 Inergy vhenefer yuoo lund a creeteecael heet.'],
1019=>['Creeteecael Streeke-a','Moost fulloo un ooffff-hund aettaeck. Iff it heets, thees aettaeck streekes fur +10...30 daemaege-a, resoolts in a creeteecael heet, und yuoo gaeeen 1...3 Inergy.','Deaels +10...30 daemaege-a. Ootumaeteec creeteecael heet. Yuoo gaeeen 1...3 Inergy. Moost fulloo un ooffff-hund aettaeck.'],
1020=>['Blaedes ooff Steel','Moost fulloo un ooffff-hund aettaeck. Iff it heets, thees aettaeck streekes fur +5...16 daemaege-a (maexeemoom bunoos 60) fur iaech rechaergeeng daegger aettaeck.','Deaels +5...16 daemaege-a (maexeemoom 60) fur iaech rechaergeeng daegger aettaeck. Moost fulloo un ooffff-hund aettaeck.'],
1021=>['Joongle-a Streeke-a','Moost fulloo a leaed aettaeck. Iff it heets, thees aettaeck streekes fur +10...25 daemaege-a. Iff it heets a fue-a thaet vaes Creeppled, thaet fue-a und aell aedjaecent fues taeke-a 1...31 daemaege-a.','Deaels +10...25 daemaege-a. Deaels 1...31 daemaege-a tu taerget und aedjaecent fues iff taerget fue-a is Creeppled. Moost fulloo a leaed aettaeck.'],
1022=>['Veeld Streeke-a','Moost fulloo a leaed aettaeck. Iff it heets, thees aettaeck streekes fur +10...35 daemaege-a und uny stunce-a beeeng used by taerget fue-a inds. Thees aettaeck cunnut be-a blucked. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Deaels +10...35 daemaege-a. Remufes taerget fue-a\'s stunce-a. Unbluckaeble-a. Moost fulloo a leaed aettaeck.'],
1023=>['Leaepeeng Muntees Steeng','Iff Muntees Steeng heets, taerget fue-a taekes +5...15 daemaege-a. Iff thees aettaeck streekes a mufeeng fue-a, thaet fue-a is Creeppled fur 3...15 secunds.','Deaels +5...15 daemaege-a. Inffleects Creeppled cundeeshun (3...15 secunds) iff taerget fue-a is mufeeng.'],
1024=>['Blaeck Muntees Throost','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +8...20 daemaege-a. Iff taerget fue-a is sooffffereeng frum a hex, thaet fue-a is Creeppled fur 3...15 secunds.','Deaels +8...20 daemaege-a. Inffleects Creeppled cundeeshun (3...15 secunds) iff taerget fue-a is hexed.'],
1025=>['Deesroopteeng Staeb','Iff thees aettaeck heets, it interroopts taerget fue-a\'s aecshun. Iff thaet aecshun vaes a spell, it is deesaebled fur 3...10 secunds.','Interroopts un aecshun. Iff zee interroopted aecshun vaes a spell, it is deesaebled (3...10 secunds).'],
1026=>['Guldee Lutoos Streeke-a','Iff it heets, thees aettaeck streekes fur +5...20 daemaege-a. Iff yuoo aere-a under zee iffffects ooff un inchuntment, yuoo gaeeen 5...8 Inergy. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Yuoo gaeeen 5...8 Inergy iff yuoo aere-a inchunted.'],
1027=>['Creeteecael Deffenses','Fur 4...10 secunds, yuoo haefe-a a 75% chunce-a tu bluck. Creeteecael Deffenses reffreshes ifery teeme-a yuoo lund a creeteecael heet.','(4...10 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a 75% chunce-a tu bluck. Renooael: ifery teeme-a yuoo lund a creeteecael heet.'],
1028=>['Vaey ooff Perffecshun','Fur 60 secunds, vhenefer yuoo sooccessffoolly lund a creeteecael heet, yuoo gaeeen 10...40 Heaelt.','(60 secunds.) Yuoor creeteecael heets heael yuoo fur 10...40.'],
1029=>['Daerk Aepustaesy','Fur 3...17 secunds, ifery teeme-a yuoo sooccessffoolly lund a creeteecael heet, yuoo remufe-a oone-a inchuntment frum yuoor taerget. Iff yuoo remufe-a un inchuntment in thees vaey, yuoo luse-a 10...3 Inergy oor Daerk Aepustaesy inds.','(3...17 secunds.) Yuoor creeteecael heets remufe-a un inchuntment. Remufael cust: luse-a 10...3 Inergy oor Daerk Aepustaesy inds.'],
1030=>['Lucoost\'s Foory','Fur 10...35 secunds, yuoo haefe-a un aeddeeshunael 50% chunce-a tu duooble-a streeke-a vheele-a useeng daeggers.','(10...35 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +50% chunce-a tu duooble-a streeke-a. Nu iffffect unless yuoo aere-a veeeldeeng daeggers.'],
1031=>['Shruood ooff Deestress','Fur 30...60 secunds, iff yuoo aere-a beloo 50% Heaelt, yuoo haefe-a +3...8 Heaelt regeneraeshun und a 75% chunce-a tu bluck aettaecks.','(30...60 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +3...8 Heaelt regeneraeshun und 75% chunce-a tu bluck. Nu iffffect unless yuoor Heaelt is beloo 50%.'],
1032=>['Heaert ooff Shaedoo','Yuoo aere-a heaeled fur 30...150. Shaedoo Step tu a neaerby lucaeshun durectly aevaey frum yuoor taerget.','Yuoo aere-a heaeled fur 30...150 und yuoo Shaedoo Step tu a neaerby lucaeshun durectly aevaey frum yuoor taerget.'],
1033=>['Impaele-a','Moost fulloo a dooael aettaeck. Taerget fue-a is stroock fur 25...100 iaert daemaege-a und sooffffers frum a Deep Vuoond fur 5...20 secunds.','Deaels 25...100 iaert daemaege-a. Inffleects Deep Vuoond cundeeshun (5...20 secunds). Moost fulloo a dooael aettaeck.'],
1034=>['Seepeeng Vuoond','Fur 1...7 secunds, taerget fue-a mufes 33% slooer. Thaet fue-a taekes 5...25 daemaege-a iaech secund vheele-a sooffffereeng frum a cundeeshun.','(1...7 secunds.) Taerget fue-a mufes 33% slooer. Thees fue-a taekes 5...25 daemaege-a iaech secund vheele-a sooffffereeng frum a cundeeshun.'],
1035=>['Aessaesseen\'s Prumeese-a','Fur 5...15 secunds, iff taerget fue-a deees, yuoo gaeeen 5...20 Inergy und aell yuoor skeells aere-a rechaerged.','(5...15 secunds.) Yuoo gaeeen 5...20 Inergy und aell yuoor skeells rechaerge-a iff taerget fue-a deees.'],
1036=>['Seegnet ooff Maeleece-a','Fur iaech cundeeshun sooffffered by taerget fue-a, yuoo luse-a oone-a cundeeshun.','Yuoo luse-a oone-a cundeeshun fur iaech cundeeshun oon taerget fue-a.'],
1037=>['Daerk Iscaepe-a','Fur 5...15 secunds, yuoo mufe-a 25% faester und taeke-a haelff daemaege-a. Daerk Iscaepe-a inds iff yuoo sooccessffoolly heet veet un aettaeck.','(5...15 secunds.) Yuoo mufe-a 25% faester und taeke-a haelff daemaege-a. Inds iff yuoo heet veet un aettaeck.'],
1038=>['Creeppleeng Daegger','Send oooot a Creeppleeng Daegger aet taerget fue-a. Creeppleeng Daegger streekes fur 15...60 iaert daemaege-a iff it heets, und Creepples mufeeng fues fur 3...15 secunds. Thees spell haes haelff zee nurmael runge-a.','Prujecteele-a: deaels 15...60 iaert daemaege-a. Inffleects Creeppled cundeeshun (3...15 secunds) iff taerget fue-a is mufeeng.'],
1040=>['Spureet Vaelk','Shaedoo Step tu taerget spureet.','Shaedoo Step tu taerget Spureet.'],
1041=>['Unseee Foory','Aell aedjaecent fues aere-a Bleended fur 3...10 secunds. Fur 10...30 secunds, yuoo cunnut be-a blucked by Bleended fues.','Inffleects Bleendness cundeeshun oon aedjaecent fues (3...10 secunds). Yuoo cunnut be-a blucked by Bleended fues (10...30 secunds).'],
1042=>['Flaesheeng Blaedes','Fur 5...30 secunds, yuoo haefe-a a 75% chunce-a tu bluck incumeeng aettaecks vheele-a aettaeckeeng. Iff yuoo bluck un aettaeck in thees vaey, yuoor aettaecker taekes 5...20 daemaege-a.','(5...30 secunds.) 75% chunce-a tu bluck vheele-a aettaeckeeng. Bluck iffffect: 5...20 daemaege-a tu yuoor aettaecker.'],
1043=>['Daesh','Fur 3 secunds, yuoo roon 50% faester.','(3 secunds.) Yuoo mufe-a 50% faester.'],
1044=>['Daerk Preesun','Shaedoo Step tu taerget fue-a. Fur 1...6 secunds, thaet fue-a mufes 33% slooer.','Shaedoo Step tu taerget fue-a. Thees fue-a mufes 33% slooer (1...6 secunds).'],
1045=>['Paelm Streeke-a','Taerget tuooched fue-a taekes 10...65 daemaege-a und is Creeppled fur 1...5 secunds. Thees skeell cuoonts aes un ooffff-hund aettaeck. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Deaels 10...65 daemaege-a und inffleects Creeppled cundeeshun (1...5 secunds). Thees skeell cuoonts aes un ooffff-hund aettaeck.'],
1048=>['Refeaeled Inchuntment','Remufe-a un inchuntment frum taerget fue-a und gaeeen 3...15 Inergy. Fur 20 secunds, Refeaeled Inchuntment is replaeced veet zee inchuntment remufed frum taerget fue-a.','Remufes un inchuntment frum taerget fue-a. Remufael iffffects: yuoo gaeeen 3...15 Inergy; thees spell is replaeced veet thaet inchuntment (20 secunds).'],
1049=>['Refeaeled Hex','Remufe-a a hex frum taerget aelly und gaeeen 4...10 Inergy. Fur 20 secunds, Refeaeled Hex is replaeced veet zee hex thaet vaes remufed.','Remufes a hex frum taerget aelly. Remufael iffffects: yuoo gaeeen 4...10 Inergy; thees spell is replaeced veet thaet hex (20 secunds).'],
1052=>['Aeccoomoolaeted Paeeen','Taerget fue-a taekes 15...75 daemaege-a. Iff taerget fue-a is sooffffereeng frum 2 oor mure-a hexes, thaet fue-a sooffffers a Deep Vuoond fur 5...20 secunds.','Deaels 15...75 daemaege-a. Inffleects Deep Vuoond cundeeshun (5...20 secunds) iff taerget fue-a haes 2 oor mure-a hexes. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
1053=>['Psycheec Deestraecshun','Aell ooff yuoor oozeer skeells aere-a deesaebled fur 8 secunds. Iff taerget fue-a is useeng a skeell, thaet skeell is interroopted und deesaebled fur un aeddeeshunael 5...12 secunds.','Interroopts a skeell. Interroopshun iffffect: deesaebles interroopted skeell (+5...12 secunds). Yuoor oozeer skeells aere-a deesaebled (8 secunds).'],
1054=>['Uncestur\'s Feesaege-a','Fur 4...10 secunds, vhenefer taerget aelly is heet by a melee-a aettaeck, aell aedjaecent fues luse-a aell aedrenaeleene-a und 3 Inergy.','(4...10 secunds.) Aell aedjaecent fues luse-a aell aedrenaeleene-a und 3 Inergy vhenefer a melee-a aettaeck heets taerget aelly.'],
1055=>['Recoorreeng Insecooreety','Fur 5 secunds, taerget fue-a sooffffers frum -1...6 Heaelt degeneraeshun. Iff thaet fue-a haes unuzeer hex vhee Recoorreeng Insecooreety vuoold ind, it is reaeppleeed.','(5 secunds.) Cooses -1...6 Heaelt degeneraeshun. Renooael: iff taerget fue-a haes unuzeer hex vhee Recoorreeng Insecooreety vuoold ind.'],
1056=>['Keetaeh\'s Boordee','Fur 6...12 secunds, taerget fue-a mufes 50% slooer. Vhee Keetaeh\'s Boordee inds yuoo gaeeen 10...18 Inergy.','(6...12 secunds.) Taerget fue-a mufes 50% slooer. Ind iffffect: yuoo gaeeen 10...18 Inergy.'],
1057=>['Psycheec Instaebeeleety','Interroopts zee taerget fue-a\'s aecshun. Iff thaet aecshun is a skeell, thaet fue-a und aell neaerby fues aere-a knucked doon fur 2...4 secunds. (50% faeeeloore-a chunce-a veet Faest Caesteeng 4 oor less.)','Interroopts un aecshun. Interroopshun iffffect: iff zee aecshun is a skeell, cooses knuckdoon fur 2...4 secunds oon taerget fue-a und aell neaerby fues. 50% faeeeloore-a chunce-a unless Faest Caesteeng 5 oor heegher.'],
1059=>['Hex Iaeter Seegnet','Taerget tuooched aelly und up tu 2...5 aedjaecent aelleees iaech luse-a oone-a hex. Yuoo gaeeen 1...4 Inergy fur iaech hex remufed thees vaey.','Remufes a hex frum taerget und 2...5 aedjaecent aelleees. Remufael iffffect: yuoo gaeeen 1...4 Inergy fur iaech hex remufed.'],
1061=>['Feedbaeck','Taerget fue-a luses oone-a inchuntment. Iff un inchuntment is remufed in thees vaey, thaet fue-a aelsu luses 4...10 Inergy.','Remufes oone-a inchuntment. Remufael iffffect: taerget fue-a luses 4...10 Inergy.'],
1062=>['Aercune-a Laerceny','Fur 5...35 secunds, oone-a rundum spell is deesaebled fur taerget fue-a und Aercune-a Laerceny is replaeced by thaet spell.','(5...35 secunds.) Deesaebles oone-a rundum spell. Thees skeell becumes thaet spell.'],
1066=>['Spueel Feectur','Fur 3...15 secunds, vhenefer taerget fue-a aettaecks oor caests a spell oon a creaetoore-a veet less Heaelt thaet fue-a luses 25...100 Heaelt.','(3...15 secunds.) Cooses 25...100 Heaelt luss vhenefer taerget fue-a aettaecks oor caests spells oon a creaetoore-a veet less Heaelt.'],
1067=>['Leeffebune-a Streeke-a','Taerget fue-a taekes 12...48 shaedoo daemaege-a. Iff thaet fue-a\'s Heaelt is aebufe-a 50%, yuoo steael up tu 12...48 Heaelt.','Deaels 12...48 daemaege-a. Steaels 12...48 Heaelt iff taerget fue-a\'s Heaelt is aebufe-a 50%.'],
1068=>['Beetter Cheell','Taerget fue-a is stroock fur 15...60 culd daemaege-a. Iff thaet fue-a haed mure-a Heaelt thun yuoo, Beetter Cheell rechaerges instuntly.','Deaels 15...60 culd daemaege-a. Rechaerges instuntly iff taerget fue-a haed mure-a Heaelt thun yuoo.'],
1069=>['Taeste-a ooff Paeeen','Iff taerget fue-a is beloo 50% Heaelt, yuoo gaeeen 30...150 Heaelt.','Heaels yuoo fur 30...150. Nu iffffect unless taerget fue-a is beloo 50% Heaelt.'],
1070=>['Deffeele-a Inchuntments','Taerget fue-a und aell neaerby fues taeke-a 6...60 shaedoo daemaege-a und 4...20 shaedoo daemaege-a fur iaech inchuntment oon zeem.','Deaels 6...60 daemaege-a tu taerget und neaerby fues. Deaels 4...20 mure-a daemaege-a fur iaech inchuntment oon zeem.'],
1071=>['Sheefers ooff Dreaed','Fur 10...40 secunds, vhenefer taerget fue-a is stroock fur culd daemaege-a vheele-a useeng a skeell, thaet fue-a is interroopted und yuoo luse-a 8...3 Inergy oor Sheefers ooff Dreaed inds.','(10...40 secunds.) Culd daemaege-a interroopts taerget fue-a\'s skeells. Interroopshun cust: yuoo luse-a 8...3 Inergy oor thees hex inds.'],
1075=>['Faempureec Svaerm','Faempureec Svaerm steaels up tu 15...60 Heaelt frum up tu three-a fues in zee aerea.','Steaels 15...60 Heaelt. Heets 2 aeddeeshunael fues in zee aerea.'],
1076=>['Bluud Dreenker','Iff yuoor Heaelt is aebufe-a 90%, yuoo begeen Bleedeeng fur 6 secunds. Steael up tu 20...65 Heaelt frum taerget fue-a.','Steaels 20...65 Heaelt. Yuoo begeen Bleedeeng (6 secunds) iff yuoor Heaelt is aebufe-a 90%.'],
1077=>['Faempureec Beete-a','Tuooch taerget fue-a tu steael up tu 29...74 Heaelt.','Steaels 29...74 Heaelt.'],
1078=>['Vaelloo\'s Beete-a','Taerget tuooched fue-a taekes 20...58 daemaege-a.','Deaels 20...58 daemaege-a.'],
1079=>['Inffeebleeng Tuooch','Taerget tuooched fue-a luses 5...65 Heaelt und sooffffers frum Veaekness fur 5...20 secunds.','Cooses 5...65 Heaelt luss. Inffleects Veaekness cundeeshun (5...20 secunds).'],
1081=>['Teeenaeee\'s Veend','Taerget fue-a und aell aedjaecent fues taeke-a 10...40 culd daemaege-a. Boorneeng fues stroock by Teeenaeee\'s Veend taeke-a un aeddeeshunael 40...80 daemaege-a und aere-a interroopted.','Deaels 10...40 culd daemaege-a. Boorneeng fues taeke-a +40...80 daemaege-a und aere-a interroopted. Aelsu streekes aedjaecent.'],
1082=>['Shuck Aerroo','Send oooot a Shuck Aerroo thaet fleees sveefftly tooaerd taerget fue-a, streekeeng fur 5...50 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Iff Shuck Aerroo streekes a fue-a sooffffereeng frum Craecked Aermur, yuoo gaeeen 5 Inergy ploos 1 Inergy fur ifery 2 runks ooff Inergy Sturaege-a. Shuck Aerroo haes 25% aermur penetraeshun.','Raepeed prujecteele-a: deaels 5...50 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Gaeeen 5 Inergy ploos 1 Inergy fur ifery 2 runks ooff Inergy Sturaege-a iff yuoo heet a fue-a sooffffereeng frum Craecked Aermur. 25% aermur penetraeshun.'],
1083=>['Unsteaedy Gruoond','Yuoo creaete-a Unsteaedy Gruoond aet taerget fue-a\'s lucaeshun. Fur 5 secunds, neaerby fues taeke-a 10...40 iaert daemaege-a iaech secund. Aettaeckeeng fues stroock by Unsteaedy Gruoond aere-a knucked doon.','Deaels 10...40 iaert daemaege-a iaech secund (5 secunds) und cooses knuck-doon tu aettaeckeeng fues. Heets fues neaer taerget\'s ineeteeael lucaeshun. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
1084=>['Sleefer Aermur','Fur 5...11 secunds, yuoo haefe-a 25...50% chunce-a tu bluck aettaecks und vhenefer yuoo aere-a zee taerget ooff a husteele-a spell oor aettaeck oone-a neaerby fue-a is stroock fur 5...35 iaert daemaege-a.','(5...11 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a 25...50% chunce-a tu bluck. Deaels 5...35 iaert daemaege-a tu oone-a neaerby fue-a vhenefer yuoo aere-a zee taerget ooff a husteele-a spell oor aettaeck.'],
1085=>['Aesh Blaest','Taerget und aedjaecent fues aere-a stroock fur 35...65 iaert daemaege-a. Boorneeng fues stroock by Aesh Blaest aere-a hexed fur 5 secunds und haefe-a a 20...75% chunce-a tu meess veet aettaecks.','Deaels 35...65 iaert daemaege-a. Boorneeng fues aere-a hexed fur 5 secunds und meess 20...75% ooff aettaecks. Aelsu streekes aedjaecent.'],
1086=>['Draegun\'s Stump','Yuoo infuke-a a Draegun\'s Stump aet taerget fue-a\'s lucaeshun. Aell fues neaer thees lucaeshun aere-a knucked doon und aere-a stroock fur 26...100 iaert daemaege-a.','Deaels 26...100 iaert daemaege-a. Cooses knuck-doon. Aelsu heets fues neaer thees fue-a.'],
1088=>['Secund Veend','Yuoo gaeeen 1 Inergy und 5 Heaelt fur iaech pueent ooff Inergy restreected by Oofercaest. Yuoo luse-a aell inchuntments.','Yuoo gaeeen 1 Inergy und 5 Heaelt fur iaech pueent ooff Oofercaest. Yuoo luse-a aell inchuntments. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
1090=>['Smuldereeng Imbers','Taerget fue-a is stroock fur 10...70 fure-a daemaege-a. Iff yuoo aere-a Oofercaest, thaet fue-a is hexed veet Smuldereeng Imbers fur 3 secunds und taekes 5...25 aeddeeshunael fure-a daemaege-a iaech secund. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Deaels 10...70 fure-a daemaege-a tu taerget. Iff yuoo aere-a Oofercaest, fue-a is hexed fur 3 secunds, taekeeng 5...25 fure-a daemaege-a iaech secund.'],
1091=>['Duooble-a Draegun','Infuke-a zee pooer ooff zee Draegun. Fur 8 secunds, yuoo und taerget aelly aere-a inchunted veet Duooble-a Draegun. Aedjaecent fues aere-a deaelt 10...40 fure-a daemaege-a iaech secund. Aeddeeshunaelly, vhee yuoo oor yuoor aelly use-a skeells thaet taerget a fue-a, thaet fue-a is set oon fure-a fur 1...4 secunds. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(8 secunds.) Inchunts yuoo und taerget aelly. Aedjaecent fues taeke-a 10...40 fure-a daemaege-a iaech secund. Skeells thaet taerget a fue-a aelsu inffleect Boorneeng (1...4 secunds).'],
1093=>['Teeenaeee\'s Heaet','Plaece-a a vaerd ooff Teeenaeee\'s Heaet aet yuoor lucaeshun fur 10...15 secunds. Fues veetheen zee vaerd sooffffer 2...5 heaelt degeneraeshun. Veaekened fues aettaeck 33% slooer. Thees skeell is deesaebled fur 20 secunds. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(10...15 secunds.) Cooses -2...5 heaelt degeneraeshun. Veaekened fues in zee vaerd aettaeck 33% slooer. Deesaebled fur 20 secunds.'],
1094=>['Breaet ooff Fure-a','Creaete-a Breaet ooff Fure-a aet taerget fue-a\'s coorrent lucaeshun. Fur 5 secunds, fues aedjaecent tu thaet lucaeshun aere-a stroock fur 10...40 fure-a daemaege-a iaech secund.','Deaels 10...40 fure-a daemaege-a iaech secund (5 secunds). Heets fues aedjaecent tu taerget\'s ineeteeael lucaeshun.'],
1095=>['Staer Boorst','Taerget tuooched fue-a und aell fues in zee aerea aere-a stroock fur 7...112 fure-a daemaege-a und set oon fure-a fur 1...4 secunds. Fur iaech fue-a yuoo heet, gaeeen 2 Inergy. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Deaels 7...112 fure-a daemaege-a. Inffleects Boorneeng (1...4 secunds). Gaeeen 2 Inergy fur iaech fue-a stroock. Aelsu heets fues in zee aerea. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
1096=>['Glyph ooff Issence-a','Fur 15 secunds, yuoor next spell caests instuntly boot cooses yuoo tu luse-a aell Inergy.','(15 secunds.) Yuoor next spell caests instuntly. Yuoo luse-a aell Inergy.'],
1097=>['Teeenaeee\'s Preesun','Fur 1...8 secunds, taerget fue-a\'s legs aere-a incaesed in ice-a, cooseeng zee fue-a tu mufe-a 66% slooer. Iff thaet fue-a haes Craecked Aermur, zee cheell seeps thruoogh cooseeng 5...9 Heaelt degeneraeshun.','(1...8 secunds.) Taerget fue-a mufes 66% slooer. Fues veet Craecked Aermur haefe-a 5...9 Heaelt degeneraeshun.'],
1098=>['Murrur ooff Ice-a','Shaetter a Murrur ooff Ice-a. Aell fues neaer yuoo und taerget aelly taeke-a 15...70 culd daemaege-a und mufe-a 66% slooer fur 2...6 secunds. Iff yuoo streeke-a a fue-a hexed veet Vaeter Maegeec, Murrur ooff Ice-a rechaerges 50% faester.','Deaels 15...70 culd daemaege-a und sloos fues by 66% (2...6 secunds). Heets fues neaer yuoo und taerget aelly. Rechaerges 50% faester iff it heets a fue-a hexed veet Vaeter Maegeec.'],
1099=>['Teeenaeee\'s Crystaels','Taerget fue-a taekes 20...40 daemaege-a. Iff taerget fue-a haes a Vaeter Maegeec hex, thees spell streekes taerget und neaerby fues fur un aeddeeshunael 20...40 daemaege-a, und neaerby fues aelsu sooffffer Craecked Aermur fur 5...15 secunds.','Deaels 20...40 daemaege-a tu taerget. Deaels +20...40 mure-a daemaege-a und cooses Craecked Aermur (5...15 secunds) neaerby iff thaet fue-a haed a Vaeter Maegeec hex.'],
1113=>['Kureen\'s Vraet','Fur 5 secunds, fues aedjaecent tu zee lucaeshun in vheech zee spell vaes caest taeke-a 8...32 huly daemaege-a iaech secund.','Deaels 8...32 huly daemaege-a iaech secund (5 secunds). Heets fues aedjaecent tu yuoor ineeteeael lucaeshun.'],
1114=>['Spureet Bund','Fur 8 secunds, vhenefer taerget aelly taekes mure-a thun 50 daemaege-a frum zee next 10 aettaecks oor spells, thaet aelly is heaeled fur 30...90 Heaelt.','(8 secunds.) Heaels fur 30...90 vhenefer taerget aelly taekes mure-a thun 50 daemaege-a. Inds aeffter thees aelly taekes daemaege-a frum 10 aettaecks oor spells.'],
1115=>['Aeur ooff Inchuntment','Fur 4...10 secunds, inchuntments caest oon taerget oozeer aelly cust 10 less Inergy (meeneemoom 1 Inergy).','(4...10 secunds.) Inchuntments caest oon taerget aelly cust 10 less Inergy (meeneemoom 1 Inergy). Cunnut selff-taerget.'],
1117=>['Heaefee\'s Deleeght','Heaels yuoo und paerty members veetheen iaershut fur 15...60 pueents.','Heaels yuoo und paerty members veetheen iaershut fur 15...60.'],
1118=>['Heaeleeng Boorst','Taerget aelly is heaeled fur 20...120. Aell paerty members in iaershut ooff yuoor taerget gaeeen Heaelt iqooael tu zee Deefeene-a Faefur bunoos frum thees spell. Yuoor Smeeteeng Praeyers aere-a deesaebled fur 20 secunds.','Heaels fur 20...120. Paerty members in iaershut ooff yuoor taerget gaeeen Heaelt iqooael tu zee Deefeene-a Faefur bunoos. Deesaebles yuoor Smeeteeng Praeyers (20 secunds).'],
1119=>['Kaereee\'s Heaeleeng Curcle-a','Heael yuoorselff und aell aedjaecent creaetoores fur 30...180 pueents.','Heaels yuoo fur 30...180. Aelsu heaels aedjaecent creaetoores.'],
1120=>['Jaemeee\'s Gaeze-a','Heael taerget oozeer aelly fur 35...180 Heaelt. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Heaels fur 35...180. Cunnut selff-taerget.'],
1121=>['Geefft ooff Heaelt','Aell ooff yuoor oozeer Heaeleeng Praeyers skeells aere-a deesaebled fur 10...5 secunds. Taerget oozeer aelly is heaeled fur 15...150 Heaelt.','Heaels fur 15...150. Deesaebles yuoor oozeer Heaeleeng Praeyers skeells (10...5 secunds). Cunnut selff-taerget.'],
1123=>['Leeffe-a Sheaet','Remufe-a 0...2 cundeeshuns frum taerget aelly. Fur 8 secunds, zee next teeme-a thaet aelly vuoold taeke-a daemaege-a oor leeffe-a steael, thaet aelly gaeeens thaet aemuoont ooff Heaelt insteaed (maexeemoom 20...100).','(8 secunds.) Cunferts zee next incumeeng daemaege-a oor leeffe-a steael (maexeemoom 20...100) tu heaeleeng. Ineeteeael iffffect: Remufes 0...2 cundeeshuns.'],
1126=>['Impaetheec Remufael','Yuoo und taerget oozeer aelly luse-a 1 cundeeshun und 1 hex, und aere-a heaeled fur 50.','Remufes oone-a cundeeshun und hex frum taerget aelly und yuoorselff, und heaels fur 50. Cunnut selff-taerget.'],
1128=>['Resoorrecshun Chunt','Resoorrect taerget paerty member veet up tu yuoor coorrent Heaelt und 5...35% Inergy. Thees spell haes haelff zee nurmael runge-a.','Resoorrects taerget paerty member aet yuoor coorrent Heaelt und veet 5...35% Inergy.'],
1129=>['Vurd ooff Censoore-a','Taerget fue-a taekes 30...130 huly daemaege-a. Iff yuoor taerget vaes beloo 50% Heaelt, Vurd ooff Censoore-a taekes 20 aeddeeshunael secunds tu rechaerge-a.','Deaels 30...130 huly daemaege-a. +20 rechaerge-a teeme-a iff taerget fue-a is beloo 50% Heaelt.'],
1130=>['Speaer ooff Leeght','Speaer ooff Leeght fleees tooaerd taerget fue-a und deaels 26...56 huly daemaege-a iff it heets. Speaer ooff Leeght deaels +15...60 daemaege-a iff it heets un aettaeckeeng fue-a.','Prujecteele-a: deaels 26...56 huly daemaege-a. Deaels 15...60 mure-a daemaege-a iff taerget fue-a is aettaeckeeng.'],
1131=>['Stunesuool Streeke-a','Tuooched taerget fue-a taekes 10...55 huly daemaege-a. Iff knucked doon, yuoor taerget taekes un aeddeeshunael 10...55 huly daemaege-a.','Deaels 10...55 huly daemaege-a. Deaels 10...55 mure-a huly daemaege-a iff taerget fue-a is knucked-doon.'],
1133=>['Droonkee Bloo','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +10...40 daemaege-a und yuoor taerget sooffffers frum oone-a ooff zee fullooeeng cundeeshuns: Deep Vuoond (fur 20 secunds), Veaekness (fur 20 secunds), Bleedeeng (fur 25 secunds), oor Creeppled (fur 15 secunds). Aeffter maekeeng a Droonkee Bloo, yuoo aere-a knucked doon.','Deaels +10...40 daemaege-a. Inffleects oone-a ooff zee fullooeeng rundum cundeeshuns: Deep Vuoond (20 secunds), Veaekness (20 secunds), Bleedeeng (25 secunds), oor Creeppled (15 secunds). Yuoo aere-a knucked-doon.'],
1134=>['Lefeeaethun\'s Sveep','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +5...20 daemaege-a. Iff thees aettaeck is blucked, yuoor taerget is knucked doon und sooffffers 10...34 daemaege-a.','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Cooses knuck-doon und deaels 10...34 daemaege-a iff blucked.'],
1135=>['Jaeeezhenjoo Streeke-a','Iff Jaeeezhenjoo Streeke-a heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +1...30 daemaege-a. Iff yuoo aere-a nut useeng a stunce-a, Jaeeezhenjoo Streeke-a cunnut be-a blucked.','Deaels +1...30 daemaege-a. Unbluckaeble-a unless yuoo aere-a in a stunce-a. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
1136=>['Penetraeteeng Chup','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +10...25 daemaege-a. Thees aexe-a aettaeck haes 20% aermur penetraeshun.','Deaels +10...25 daemaege-a. 20% aermur penetraeshun.'],
1137=>['Yetee Smaesh','Luse-a aell aedrenaeleene-a. Aettaeck aell aedjaecent fues. Iff thees aettaeck streekes a fue-a sooffffereeng frum a cundeeshun, thaet fue-a is knucked doon. (50% faeeeloore-a chunce-a veet Haemmer Maestery 4 oor less.)','Aettaeck aell aedjaecent fues. Knucks doon fues sooffffereeng frum a cundeeshun. Yuoo luse-a aell aedrenaeleene-a. 50% faeeeloore-a chunce-a unless Haemmer Maestery is 5 oor mure-a.'],
1141=>['"Yuoo Veell Deee-a!"','Iff taerget fue-a is beloo 90% Heaelt, yuoo gaeeen 1...3 streeke-as ooff aedrenaeleene-a.','Yuoo gaeeen 1...3 streeke-as ooff aedrenaeleene-a. Nu iffffect unless taerget fue-a is under 90% Heaelt.'],
1142=>['Oospeeceeuoos Paerry','Fur 8 secunds, zee next aettaeck aegaeeenst yuoo is blucked. Yuoo gaeeen 1...4 streeke-as ooff aedrenaeleene-a vhee thees stunce-a inds.','(8 secunds.) Blucks oone-a aettaeck. Ind iffffect: yuoo gaeeen 1...4 streeke-as ooff aedrenaeleene-a.'],
1144=>['Seelferveeng Slaesh','Thees aettaeck streekes fur +1...40 daemaege-a iff it heets.','Deaels +1...40 daemaege-a.'],
1146=>['Shufe-a','Taerget tuooched fue-a taekes 15...75 daemaege-a, zeeur stunce-a inds, und zeey aere-a knucked doon.','Taerget tuooched fue-a taekes 15...75 daemaege-a, zeeur stunce-a inds, und zeey aere-a knucked doon.'],
1191=>['Soondereeng Aettaeck','Iff Soondereeng Aettaeck heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +5...25 daemaege-a und thees aettaeck haes 10% aermur penetraeshun.','Deaels +5...25 daemaege-a. 10% aermur penetraeshun. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
1192=>['Zujoon\'s Shut','Shuut un aerroo thaet haes haelff zee nurmael runge-a, boot streekes fur +10...40 daemaege-a.','Deaels +10...40 daemaege-a.'],
1194=>['Predaetury Bund','Fur 5...20 secunds, yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun aettaecks 25% faester und heaels yuoo fur 1...31 Heaelt veet iaech sooccessffool aettaeck.','(5...20 secunds.) Yuoor pet aettaecks 25% faester und yuoo gaeeen 1...31 Heaelt vhenefer yuoor pet maekes a sooccessffool aettaeck.'],
1195=>['Heael aes Oone-a','Fur 15 secunds, yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun steaels 1...20 Heaelt vhenefer it heets veet un aettaeck. Yuoo und yuoor cumpuneeun aere-a but heaeled fur 20...104 Heaelt. Iff yuoor cumpuneeun is deaed, it\'s resoorrected veet 50% Heaelt. Iff yuoo haefe-a thees skeell iqooeepped, yuoor cumpuneeun veell traefel veet yuoo.','(15 secunds.) Yuoor pet\'s aettaecks steael 1...20 Heaelt. Ineeteeael iffffect: heaels yuoo und yuoor pet fur 20...104; resoorrects yuoor pet (50% Heaelt) iff deaed. Iff yuoo haefe-a thees skeell iqooeepped, yuoor pet veell traefel veet yuoo.'],
1196=>['Zujoon\'s Haeste-a','Fur 5...11 secunds, yuoo mufe-a 33% faester und haefe-a a 27...75% chunce-a tu bluck incumeeng prujecteeles. Zujoon\'s Haeste-a inds iff yuoo aettaeck.','(5...11 secunds.) Yuoo mufe-a 33% faester und haefe-a 27...75% chunce-a tu bluck prujecteeles. Inds iff yuoo aettaeck.'],
1197=>['Needleeng Shut','Needleeng Shut streekes fur oonly 10...30 daemaege-a und mufes faester thun nurmael. Iff Needleeng Shut streekes a fue-a beloo 50% Heaelt, Needleeng Shut rechaerges instuntly. Yuoor oozeer aettaeck skeells aere-a deesaebled fur 2 secunds.','Faest-mufeeng aerroo. Deaels 10...30 daemaege-a. Rechaerges instuntly iff taerget fue-a is beloo 50% Heaelt. Yuoor oozeer aettaeck skeells aere-a deesaebled (2 secunds).'],
1198=>['Bruaed Heaed Aerroo','Yuoo shuut a bruaed heaed aerroo thaet mufes slooer thun nurmael. Iff it heets, taerget fue-a is Daezed fur 5...20 secunds, und iff taerget fue-a is caesteeng a spell thaet spell is interroopted.','Sloo-mufeeng aerroo. Interroopts a spell. Inffleects Daezed cundeeshun (5...20 secunds).'],
1199=>['Glaess Aerroos','Fur 10...35 secunds, yuoor aerroos streeke-a fur +6...20 daemaege-a iff zeey heet und coose-a Bleedeeng fur 10...20 secunds iff zeey aere-a Blucked.','(10...35 secunds.) Yuoor aerroos deael +6...20 daemaege-a. Inffleects Bleedeeng cundeeshun iff blucked (10...20 secunds).'],
1200=>['Aercher\'s Seegnet','Fur 1...24 secunds, cundeeshuns yuoo aepply vheele-a veeeldeeng a boo laest 150% lunger.','(1...24 secunds.) Cundeeshuns yuoo aepply vheele-a veeeldeeng a boo laest 150% lunger.'],
1201=>['Saefaege-a Puoonce-a','Yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun aettempts a Saefaege-a Puoonce-a thaet deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Iff zee aettaeck streekes a fue-a vhu is caesteeng a spell, thaet fue-a is knucked doon.','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Cooses knuck-doon iff taerget fue-a is caesteeng a spell.'],
1202=>['Inraeged Loonge-a','Yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun aettempts un Inraeged Loonge-a thaet aeppleees a Deep Vuoond tu taerget fue-a fur 5...20 secunds und deaels +10...50 daemaege-a.','Inffleects Deep Vuoond cundeeshun (5...20 secunds) und deaels +10...50 daemaege-a.'],
1203=>['Besteeael Mooleeng','Yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun aettempts a Besteeael Mooleeng thaet deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Iff zee aettaeck streekes a knucked-doon fue-a, thaet fue-a is Daezed fur 4...10 secunds.','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Inffleects Daezed cundeeshun (4...10 secunds) iff taerget fue-a is knucked-doon.'],
1205=>['Pueesunuoos Beete-a','Yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun aettempts a Pueesunuoos Beete-a thaet Pueesuns taerget fue-a fur 5...20 secunds.','Inffleects Pueesuned cundeeshun (5...20 secunds).'],
1206=>['Puoonce-a','Yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun\'s next aettaeck is a Puoonce-a thaet deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Iff zee aettaeck streekes a mufeeng fue-a, thaet fue-a is knucked doon.','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Cooses knuck-doon iff taerget fue-a is mufeeng.'],
1209=>['Besteeael Foory','Aell yuoor nun-aettaeck skeells aere-a deesaebled fur 5 secunds. Fur 5...11 secunds, yuoo aettaeck 25% faester.','(5...11 secunds.) Yuoo aettaeck 25% faester. Yuoor nun-aettaeck skeells aere-a deesaebled (5 secunds).'],
1211=>['Feeper\'s Nest','Creaete-a a Feeper\'s Nest. Vhee it is treeggered, aell neaerby fues aere-a stroock fur 5...35 peeerceeng daemaege-a und becume-a Pueesuned fur 5...20 secunds. Feeper\'s Nest ixpures aeffter 90 secunds. Thees Traep is iaeseely interroopted.','(90 secunds.) Aeffffects neaerby fues. Deaels 5...35 peeerceeng daemaege-a. Inffleects Pueesuned cundeeshun (5...20 secunds). Iaeseely interroopted.'],
1212=>['Iqooeenux','Creaete-a a lefel 1...10 spureet. Spells caest veetheen its runge-a thaet coose-a Oofercaest coose-a un aeddeeshunael 10 Oofercaest. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...240 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...10 spureet (30...240 secund leeffespun). Oofercaest-cooseeng spells caest veetheen runge-a coose-a un aeddeeshunael 10 Oofercaest.'],
1213=>['Trunqooeeleety','Creaete-a a lefel 1...10 spureet. Inchuntments caest by nun-spureet creaetoores veetheen its runge-a ixpure-a 20...50% faester. Thees spureet deees aeffter 15...120 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...10 spureet (15...120 secund leeffespun). Inchuntments ixpure-a 20...50% faester oon creaetoores in runge-a. Dues nut aeffffect spureets.'],
1215=>['Claemur ooff Suools','Taerget fue-a und aell neaerby fues taeke-a 10...65 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Iff yuoo aere-a veetheen iaershut ooff a spureet oor huldeeng a boondle-a item, yuoo gaeeen 10 Inergy.','Deaels 10...65 leeghtneeng daemaege-a tu taerget und neaerby fues. Yuoo gaeeen 10 Inergy iff yuoo aere-a veetheen iaershut ooff a spureet oor huldeeng a boondle-a item.'],
1217=>['Reetooael Lurd','Fur 5...35 secunds, yuoor Reetooaeleest aettreebootes aere-a buusted by 2...4 fur yuoor next skeell. Iff thaet skeell is a Beendeeng Reetooael, it rechaerges 10...60% faester und Reetooael Lurd rechaerges instuntly.','(5...35 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +2...4 tu aell Reetooaeleest aettreebootes fur yuoor next skeell. Iff thaet skeell is a Beendeeng Reetooael, it rechaerges 10...60% faester und Reetooael Lurd rechaerges instuntly.'],
1218=>['Crooel Vaes Daeushee','Huld Daeushee\'s aeshes fur up tu 15...60 secunds. Vheele-a yuoo huld hees aeshes, aell Reetooaeleest skeells haefe-a 10% aermur penetraeshun. Vhee yuoo drup hees aeshes, aell neaerby fues aere-a stroock fur 15...85 leeghtneeng daemaege-a.','(15...60 secunds.) Yuoor Reetooaeleest skeells haefe-a 10% aermur penetraeshun. Drup iffffect: deaels 15...85 leeghtneeng daemaege-a tu aell neaerby fues. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
1219=>['Prutecteefe-a Vaes Kaeulaeee','Huld Kaeulaeee\'s aeshes fur up tu 15...60 secunds. Vheele-a yuoo huld hees aeshes, yuoo gaeeen 20 aermur. Vhee yuoo drup hees aeshes, aell paerty members aere-a heaeled fur 20...95 Heaelt.','(15...60 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +20 aermur. Drup iffffect: aell paerty members aere-a heaeled fur 20...95. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
1220=>['Aettooned Vaes Sungkaeee','Huld Sungkaeee\'s aeshes fur up tu 45 secunds. Vheele-a yuoo huld her aeshes, yuoor spells und beendeeng reetooaels cust -5...50% ooff zee baese-a Inergy tu caest. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(45 secunds.) Yuoor spells und beendeeng reetooaels cust -5...50% ooff zee baese-a Inergy.'],
1221=>['Reseeleeent Vaes Xeeku','Huld Xeeku\'s aeshes fur up tu 5...20 secunds. Fur iaech hex oor cundeeshun yuoo aere-a sooffffereeng frum vheele-a huldeeng her aeshes, yuoo gaeeen +3 Heaelt regeneraeshun. Vhee yuoo drup her aeshes, yuoo luse-a 1...4 cundeeshuns. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(5...20 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +3 Heaelt regeneraeshun fur iaech hex oor cundeeshun oon yuoo. Drup iffffect: yuoo luse-a 1...4 cundeeshuns.'],
1222=>['Leefely Vaes Naeumeee','Huld Naeumeee\'s aeshes fur up tu 45 secunds. Vhee yuoo drup her aeshes, aell paerty members in zee aerea aere-a resoorrected veet 15...75% Heaelt und zeru Inergy.','(45 secunds.) Drup iffffect: resoorrects paerty members in zee aerea (15...75% Heaelt und zeru Inergy).'],
1223=>['Ungooeeshed Vaes Leengvaeh','Huld Leengvaeh\'s aeshes fur up tu 10...60 secunds. Vheele-a yuoo huld her aeshes, yuoor Reetooaeleest hexes cust 1...5 less inergy und laest 50% lunger. Vhee yuoo drup her aeshes aell yuoor Reetooaeleest hexes aere-a rechaerged.','(10...60 secunds.) Yuoor Reetooaeleest hexes cust 1...5 less inergy und laest 50% lunger. Drup iffffect: aell yuoor Reetooaeleest hexes aere-a rechaerged.'],
1224=>['Draev Spureet','Telepurt taerget aelleeed spureet tu yuoor lucaeshun.','Telepurts taerget aelleeed spureet tu yuoor lucaeshun.'],
1225=>['Chunneled Streeke-a','Taerget fue-a is stroock fur 5...95 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Thaet fue-a is stroock fur un aeddeeshunael 5...35 leeghtneeng daemaege-a iff yuoo aere-a huldeeng un item.','Deaels 5...95 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Deaels 5...35 aeddeeshunael leeghtneeng daemaege-a iff yuoo aere-a huldeeng un item.'],
1226=>['Spureet Buun Streeke-a','Taerget fue-a is stroock fur 20...65 leeghtneeng daemaege-a, und aell spureets yuoo cuntrul veetheen iaershut gaeeen 20...65 Heaelt.','Deaels 20...65 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Spureets yuoo cuntrul veetheen iaershut gaeeen 20...65 Heaelt.'],
1227=>['Issence-a Streeke-a','Taerget fue-a is stroock fur 15...60 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Iff uny spureets aere-a veetheen iaershut, yuoo gaeeen 1...9 Inergy.','Deaels 15...60 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Yuoo gaeeen 1...9 Inergy iff uny spureets aere-a veetheen iaershut.'],
1228=>['Spureet Seephun','Zee spureet clusest tu yuoo luses aell Inergy. Yuoo gaeeen 30...60% ooff thaet Inergy.','Zee spureet clusest tu yuoo luses aell Inergy. Yuoo gaeeen 30...60% ooff thaet Inergy.'],
1229=>['Ixpluseefe-a Groot','Fur 15...60 secunds, vhenefer yuoo creaete-a a creaetoore-a, up tu 5 fues neaer thaet creaetoore-a aere-a stroock fur 20...65 leeghtneeng daemaege-a.','(15...60 secunds.) Deaels 20...65 leeghtneeng daemaege-a iaech teeme-a yuoo creaete-a a creaetoore-a tu 5 fue-as neaer thaet creaetoore-a.'],
1230=>['Buun ooff Creaeshun','Fur 15...60 secunds, vhenefer yuoo creaete-a a creaetoore-a, yuoo gaeeen 5...50 Heaelt und 1...6 Inergy.','(15...60 secunds.) Yuoo gaeeen 5...50 Heaelt und 1...6 Inergy vhenefer yuoo creaete-a a creaetoore-a.'],
1231=>['Spureet Chunneleeng','Fur 12 secunds, yuoo haefe-a +1...6 Inergy regeneraeshun. Vhee yuoo caest thees spell, yuoo gaeeen 3...12 Inergy iff yuoo aere-a veetheen iaershut ooff a spureet.','(12 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +1...6 Inergy regeneraeshun. Ineeteeael iffffect: yuoo gaeeen 3...12 Inergy iff yuoo aere-a veetheen iaershut ooff a spureet.'],
1232=>['Aermur ooff Unffeeleeng','Fur 10...35 secunds, yuoor spureets veetheen iaershut taeke-a 50% less daemaege-a und aere-a immoone-a tu creeteecael heets.','(10...35 secunds.) Yuoor spureets veetheen iaershut taeke-a 50% less daemaege-a und aere-a immoone-a tu creeteecael heets.'],
1233=>['Suutheeng Memureees','Taerget aelly is heaeled fur 10...100 Heaelt. Iff yuoo aere-a huldeeng un item, yuoo gaeeen 3 Inergy.','Heaels fur 10...100. Yuoo gaeeen 3 Inergy iff yuoo aere-a huldeeng un item.'],
1234=>['Mend Budy und Suool','Taerget aelly is heaeled fur 20...115 Heaelt. Thaet aelly luses oone-a cundeeshun fur iaech spureet veetheen iaershut.','Heaels fur 20...115. Remufes oone-a cundeeshun fur iaech spureet veetheen iaershut.'],
1235=>['Doolled Veaepun','Fur 5...20 secunds, taerget fue-a und aell aedjaecent fues cunnut aecheeefe-a a creeteecael heet und deael 3...20 less daemaege-a.','Aelsu hexes fues aedjaecent tu yuoor taerget (5...20 secunds). Remufes aebeeleety tu lund a creeteecael heet. Redooces daemaege-a by 3...20.'],
1236=>['Beendeeng Chaeeens','Fur 3 secunds, taerget fue-a und aell neaerby fues mufe-a 90% slooer und taeke-a 1...30 daemaege-a iaech secund vheele-a mufeeng.','Aelsu hexes fues neaer yuoor taerget (3 secunds). Zeese-a fues mufe-a 90% slooer und taeke-a 1...30 daemaege-a iaech secund vheele-a mufeeng.'],
1237=>['Paeeenffool Bund','Fur 10...20 secunds, taerget fue-a und aell neaerby fues aere-a hexed veet Paeeenffool Bund und taeke-a 8...20 daemaege-a vhenefer heet by a spureet\'s aettaeck.','Aelsu hexes fues neaer yuoor taerget (10...20 secunds). Spureets du 8...20 mure-a daemaege-a aegaeeenst zeese-a fues.'],
1238=>['Seegnet ooff Creaeshun','Yuoo gaeeen 4 Inergy fur ifery soommuned creaetoore-a yuoo cuntrul veetheen iaershut (maexeemoom 3...12 Inergy).','Gaeeen 4 Inergy (maexeemoom 3...12) fur iaech soommuned creaetoore-a yuoo cuntrul veetheen iaershut.'],
1239=>['Seegnet ooff Spureets','Creaete-a 3 lefel 1...12 spureets. Zeese-a spureets deael 5...20 daemaege-a veet aettaecks und deee-a aeffter 60 secunds.','Creaetes 3 lefel 1...12 spureets (60 secund leeffespun). Zeese-a spureets deael 5...20 daemaege-a veet aettaecks.'],
1240=>['Suool Tveesteeng','Fur 5...45 secunds, yuoor Beendeeng Reetooaels cust 15 less Inergy (meeneemoom 5) und rechaerge-a instuntly. Suool Tveesteeng inds aeffter 1...3 Beendeeng Reetooaels.','(5...45 secunds.) Yuoor Beendeeng Reetooaels cust 15 less Inergy (meeneemoom 5) und rechaerge-a instuntly. Inds aeffter 1...3 Beendeeng Reetooaels.'],
1244=>['Ghustly Haeste-a','Fur 5...30 secunds, spells yuoo caest vheele-a veetheen iaershut ooff a spureet rechaerge-a 25% faester.','(5...30 secunds.) Spells yuoo caest rechaerge-a 25% faester. Nu iffffect unless yuoo aere-a veetheen iaershut ooff a spureet.'],
1245=>['Gaeze-a frum Beyund','Taerget fue-a is stroock fur 20...65 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Iff yuoo aere-a veetheen iaershut ooff a spureet, thaet fue-a is Bleended fur 2...6 secunds.','Deaels 20...65 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Inffleects Bleendness cundeeshun fur 2...6 secunds iff yuoo aere-a veetheen iaershut ooff a spureet.'],
1246=>['Uncesturs\' Raege-a','Fur 1 secunds, nutheeng haeppens. Vhee thees skeell inds, aell fues aedjaecent tu taerget aelly taeke-a 5...110 leeghtneeng daemaege-a.','(1 secunds.) Ind Iffffect: deaels 5...110 leeghtneeng daemaege-a tu fues aedjaecent tu taerget aelly.'],
1247=>['Paeeen','Creaete-a a lefel 1...12 spureet. Thees spureet\'s aettaecks deael 5...30 daemaege-a. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...150 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...12 spureet (30...150 secund leeffespun). Its aettaecks deael 5...30 daemaege-a.'],
1249=>['Deesplaecement','Creaete-a a lefel 1...14 spureet. Aell nun-spureet aelleees veetheen its runge-a haefe-a a 75% chunce-a tu bluck incumeeng aettaecks. Ifery teeme-a un aettaeck is blucked in thees vaey, thees spureet taekes 60 daemaege-a. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...60 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...14 spureet (30...60 secund leeffespun). Nun-spureet aelleees veetheen runge-a haefe-a 75% chunce-a tu bluck. Bluck iffffect: thees spureet taekes 60 daemaege-a.'],
1250=>['Preserfaeshun','Creaete-a a lefel 1...14 spureet. Ifery 4 secunds, thees spureet heaels oone-a nun-spureet aelly in zee aerea fur 10...115 Heaelt. Thees spureet deees aeffter 90 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...14 spureet (90 secund leeffespun). Ifery 4 secunds, thees spureet heaels oone-a nun-spureet aelly fur 10...115.'],
1251=>['Leeffe-a','Creaete-a a lefel 1...14 spureet. Vhee thees spureet deees, aell nun-spureet aelleees veetheen its runge-a aere-a heaeled fur 1...7 Heaelt fur iaech secund thees spureet vaes aeleefe-a. Thees spureet deees aeffter 20 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...14 spureet (20 secund leeffespun). Aeffffects nun-spureet aelleees veetheen runge-a. Ind iffffect: heaels fur 1...7 fur iaech secund thees spureet vaes aeleefe-a.'],
1252=>['Iaerthbeend','Creaete-a a lefel 1...14 spureet. Aell nun-spureet fues knucked doon veetheen its runge-a aere-a knucked doon fur aet leaest 3 secunds. Vhenefer thees haeppens, thees spureet luses 50...25 Heaelt. Thees spureet deees aeffter 15...45 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...14 spureet (15...45 secund leeffespun). Uny teeme-a nun-spureet fues veetheen runge-a aere-a knucked-doon, zeey aere-a knucked doon fur aet leaest 3 secunds. Knuck-doon cust: thees spureet luses 50...25 Heaelt.'],
1253=>['Bluudsung','Creaete-a a lefel 1...12 spureet vhu deees aeffter 30...150 secunds. Aettaecks by thaet spureet steael up tu 5...25 Heaelt.','Creaetes a lefel 1...12 spureet (30...150 secund leeffespun). Its aettaecks steael 5...25 Heaelt.'],
1255=>['Vunderloost','Creaete-a a lefel 1...12 spureet. Vhenefer thees spureet\'s aettaeck heets a staeshunaery fue-a, thaet fue-a is knucked doon und zee spureet luses 70...50 Heaelt. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...60 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...12 spureet (30...60 secund leeffespun). Its aettaecks aegaeeenst staeshunaery fues coose-a knuck-doon. Knuck-doon cust: thees spureet luses 70...50 Heaelt.'],
1257=>['Spureet Leeght Veaepun','Fur 10 secunds, taerget aelly gaeeens 5...25 Heaelt per secund und un aeddeeshunael 5...25 Heaelt per secund iff thaet aelly is veetheen iaershut ooff a spureet.','(10 secunds.) Taerget aelly gaeeens 5...25 Heaelt iaech secund. 5...25 mure-a heaeleeng per secund vheele-a veetheen iaershut ooff a spureet.'],
1258=>['Brootael Veaepun','Geefe-a taerget aelly a Brootael Veaepun fur 10...40 secunds. Zee beaerer\'s veaepun streekes fur +5...15 daemaege-a aes lung aes zee beaerer is under nu inchuntments.','(10...40 secunds.) Aettaecks deael +5...15 daemaege-a. Nu iffffect vheele-a taerget aelly is inchunted.'],
1259=>['Gooeeded Veaepun','Fur 4...10 secunds, taerget aelly\'s aettaecks cunnut be-a blucked.','(4...10 secunds.) Aettaecks aere-a unbluckaeble-a.'],
1260=>['Meekness','Fur 5...30 secunds, taerget fue-a und aell fues in zee aerea aettaeck 50% slooer.','Aelsu hexes fues in zee aerea ooff taerget (5...30 secunds). Zeese-a fues aettaeck 50% slooer.'],
1261=>['Freegeed Aermur','Fur 10...25 secunds, yuoo haefe-a +10...40 aermur aegaeeenst physeecael daemaege-a und cunnut be-a set oon fure-a.','(10...25 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +10...40 aermur aegaeeenst physeecael daemaege-a und immooneety tu Boorneeng.'],
1262=>['Heaeleeng Reeng','Heael aedjaecent creaetoores fur 30...180 Heaelt. Zee caester is nut heaeled.','Heaels aedjaecent aelleees und fues fur 30...180. Zee caester is nut heaeled.'],
1263=>['Renoo Leeffe-a','Resoorrect taerget tuooched deaed taerget paerty member veet 50% Heaelt und 5...20% Inergy. Thaet paerty member und aell aelleees veetheen iaershut aere-a heaeled fur 55...130 Heaelt.','Resoorrects taerget paerty member (50% Heaelt und 5...20% Inergy). Heaels aelleees veetheen iaershut fur 55...130.'],
1264=>['Duum','Streeke-a taerget fue-a fur 10...60 leeghtneeng (maexeemoom 135) daemaege-a fur ifery rechaergeeng beendeeng reetooael yuoo haefe-a.','Deaels 10...60 leeghtneeng daemaege-a (maexeemoom 135) fur iaech ooff yuoor rechaergeeng beendeeng reetooaels.'],
1265=>['Veeelder\'s Buun','Heael taerget aelly fur 15...60 pueents. Iff thaet aelly is under zee iffffects ooff a veaepun spell, Veeelder\'s Buun heaels fur un aeddeeshunael 15...75 Heaelt.','Heaels fur 15...60. Heaels fur 15...75 mure-a iff thees aelly is under a Veaepun spell.'],
1266=>['Suutheeng','Creaete-a a lefel 1...12 spureet. Aell fues veetheen its runge-a taeke-a tveece-a aes lung tu booeeld aedrenaeleene-a. Thees spureet deees aeffter 15...45 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...12 spureet (15...45 secund leeffespun). Booeeldeeng aedrenaeleene-a taekes tveece-a aes lung fur fues veetheen runge-a. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
1267=>['Feetael Veaepun','Fur 5...30 secunds, taerget aelly haes a Feetael Veaepun und haes +40...175 maexeemoom Heaelt.','(5...30 secunds.) +40...175 maexeemoom Heaelt.'],
1268=>['Veaepun ooff Qooeeckeneeng','Fur 5...25 secunds, taerget aelly haes a Veaepun ooff Qooeeckeneeng, und spells und beendeeng reetooaels rechaerge-a 33% faester.','(5...25 secunds.) Spells und beendeeng reetooaels rechaerge-a 33% faester.'],
1269=>['Seegnet ooff Raege-a','Taerget fue-a taekes 5...50 huly daemaege-a und +5...10 huly daemaege-a fur iaech aedrenaeleene-a skeell thaet fue-a haes.','Deaels 5...50 huly daemaege-a. Deaels 5...10 mure-a huly daemaege-a fur iaech ooff taerget fue-a\'s aedrenaeleene-a skeells.'],
1333=>['Ixtend Cundeeshuns','Spreaed aell cundeeshuns frum taerget fue-a tu aell fues neaer yuoor taerget. Zee dooraeshuns ooff thuse-a cundeeshuns aere-a increaesed by 5...100% (maexeemoom 30 secunds).','Spreaed aell cundeeshuns frum taerget fue-a tu aell fues neaer yuoor taerget. Thuse-a dooraeshuns ooff thuse-a cundeeshuns aere-a increaesed by 5...100% (maexeemoom 30 secunds).'],
1334=>['Hypuchundreea','Trunsffer aell cundeeshuns frum aell fues in zee aerea tu taerget fue-a. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Trunsffer aell cundeeshuns frum fues in zee aerea tu taerget fue-a.'],
1335=>['Vaestrel\'s Demeese-a','Fur 5 secunds, taerget fue-a is hexed veet Vaestrel\'s Demeese-a. Iaech secund vheele-a hexed, taerget fue-a und aell fues aedjaecent tu thaet fue-a taeke-a 1...10 daemaege-a und un aeddeeshunael 1...10 daemaege-a fur iaech secund thees spell is in iffffect. Thees hex inds premaetoorely iff taerget fue-a uses a skeell.','(5 secunds.) Iaech secund vheele-a hexed, taerget fue-a und aell fues aedjaecent tu thaet fue-a taeke-a 1...10 daemaege-a. Fues taeke-a +1...10 daemaege-a iaech secund thees hex is in iffffect. Inds iaerly iff taerget fue-a uses a skeell.'],
1336=>['Spureetooael Paeeen','Taerget fue-a taekes 15...75 daemaege-a. Aell husteele-a soommuned creaetoores in zee aerea ooff thaet fue-a taeke-a 25...125 daemaege-a. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Deaels 15...75 daemaege-a. Deaels 25...125 daemaege-a tu husteele-a soommuned creaetoores in zee aerea ooff taerget fue-a.'],
1337=>['Draeeen Delooseeuns','Remufe-a oone-a Mesmer hex frum taerget fue-a. Iff a hex vaes remufed in thees vaey, thaet fue-a luses 1...5 Inergy und yuoo gaeeen 4 Inergy fur iaech pueent lust.','Remufes oone-a Mesmer hex frum taerget fue-a. Cooses 1...5 Inergy luss. Yuoo gaeeen 4 Inergy fur iaech pueent lust. Nu iffffect unless a hex vaes remufed.'],
1338=>['Perseestence-a ooff Memury','Fur 5...20 secunds, vhenefer a spell yuoo caest is interroopted, thaet spell is instuntly rechaerged. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(5...20 secunds.) Yuoor interroopted spells rechaerge-a instuntly.'],
1339=>['Symbuls ooff Inspuraeshun','Fur 6...40 secunds, thees skeell becumes zee Ileete-a ooff taerget fue-a. Ileete-a skeells yuoo caest use-a yuoor Faest Caesteeng aettreeboote-a insteaed ooff zeeur nurmael aettreebootes.','(6...40 secunds.) Thees skeell becumes zee Ileete-a ooff taerget fue-a. Ileete-a skeells use-a yuoor Faest Caesteeng aettreeboote-a insteaed ooff zeeur nurmael aettreebootes.'],
1340=>['Symbuleec Celereety','Fur 36...60 secunds, aell ooff yuoor seegnets use-a yuoor Faest Caesteeng aettreeboote-a insteaed ooff zeeur nurmael aettreebootes.','(36...60 secunds.) Yuoor seegnets use-a yuoor Faest Caesteeng aettreeboote-a.'],
1341=>['Froostraeshun','Fur 5...20 secunds, taerget fue-a caests spells 50% slooer und taekes 5...50 daemaege-a vhenefer interroopted. Iff a skeell is interroopted, Froostraeshun deaels duooble-a daemaege-a.','(5...20 secunds.) Cooses 50% slooer spell caesteeng. Taerget fue-a taekes 5...50 daemaege-a vhenefer interroopted. Deaels duooble-a daemaege-a oon skeell interroopt.'],
1342=>['Teaese-a','Iff taerget fue-a is useeng a skeell, thaet fue-a und oozeer fues in zee aerea aere-a interroopted und yuoo steael 0...5 Inergy frum aell fues in zee aerea.','Interroopts a skeell. Interroopshun iffffect: aelsu interroopts oozeer fues in zee aerea, und yuoo steael 0...5 Inergy frum aell fues in zee aerea.'],
1343=>['Izeer Phuntum','Fur 10 secunds, taerget fue-a haes -1 Inergy degeneraeshun. Iff thees hex is remufed premaetoorely, thaet fue-a luses 1...5 Inergy.','(10 secunds.) Cooses -1 Inergy degeneraeshun. Cooses 1...5 Inergy luss iff thees hex inds iaerly.'],
1344=>['Veb ooff Deesroopshun','Interroopt taerget fue-a. Fur 10 secunds, taerget fue-a is hexed veet Veb ooff Deesroopshun. Vhee thees hex inds, thaet fue-a is interroopted aegaeeen.','(10 secunds.) Ineeteeael iffffect: interroopts a skeell. Ind iffffect: interroopts a skeell.'],
1345=>['Inchunter\'s Cunoondroom','Fur 10 secunds, taerget fue-a caests inchuntments 100...200% slooer. Iff taerget fue-a is nut under zee iffffects ooff un inchuntment vhee thees hex is aeppleeed, thaet fue-a taekes 10...100 daemaege-a und aell aedjaecent fues taeke-a 75% ooff thaet daemaege-a.','Cooses 100...200% slooer inchuntment caesteeng (10 secunds). Ineeteeael iffffect: iff taerget fue-a is nut inchunted deaels 10...100 daemaege-a tu taerget und 75% ooff thaet daemaege-a tu aedjaecent fues.'],
1346=>['Seegnet ooff Illooseeuns','Yuoor next 1...3 nun-Illooseeun spells use yuoor Illooseeun aettreeboote-a insteaed ooff their nurmael aettreeboote-a.','Yuoor next 1...3 nun-Illooseeun spells use yuoor Illooseeun aettreeboote-a insteaed ooff their nurmael aettreeboote-a.'],
1347=>['Deeschaerge-a Inchuntment','Remufe-a oone-a inchuntment frum taerget fue-a. Iff thaet fue-a is hexed, thees skeell rechaerges 20...50% faester.','Remufes oone-a inchuntment frum taerget fue-a. 20...50% faester rechaerge-a iff thaet fue-a vaes hexed.'],
1348=>['Hex Iaeter Furtex','Remufe-a a hex frum taerget aelly. Iff a hex is remufed in thees vaey, fues in zee aerea ooff thaet aelly taeke-a 30...90 daemaege-a und luse-a oone-a inchuntment.','Remufes oone-a hex frum taerget aelly. Remufael iffffect: deaels 30...90 daemaege-a und remufes oone-a inchuntment frum fues in zee aerea ooff thees aelly.'],
1349=>['Murrur ooff Deesenchuntment','Remufe-a oone-a inchuntment frum taerget fue-a. Aell ooff thaet fue-a\'s paerty members aelsu luse-a thaet saeme-a inchuntment.','Remufes oone-a inchuntment frum taerget fue-a. Thaet fue-a\'s paerty members aelsu luse-a thees inchuntment.'],
1350=>['Seemple-a Theeefery','Interroopt taerget fue-a\'s aecshun. Iff thaet aecshun vaes a skeell, thaet skeell is deesaebled fur 5...20 secunds, und Seemple-a Theeefery is replaeced by thaet skeell.','Interroopts un aecshun. Interroopshun iffffect: Iff a skeell vaes interroopted, thaet skeell is deesaebled und Seemple-a Theeefery becumes thaet skeell (5...20 secunds).'],
1351=>['Uneemaete-a Shaembleeng Hurrur','Ixplueet neaerest curpse-a tu creaete-a a lefel 1...17 shaembleeng hurrur. Vhee zee shaembleeng hurrur deees, it is replaeced by a lefel 0...15 jaegged hurrur thaet cooses Bleedeeng veet iaech ooff its aettaecks.','Creaetes a lefel 1...17 shaembleeng hurrur. Vhee zee shaembleeng hurrur deees, it is replaeced by a lefel 0...15 jaegged hurrur thaet cooses Bleedeeng veet iaech ooff its aettaecks. Ixplueets a fresh curpse-a.'],
1352=>['Oorder ooff Undeaet','Fur 5 secunds, yuoor meeneeuns deael +3...16 daemaege-a, boot yuoo luse-a 2% ooff yuoor maexeemoom Heaelt vhenefer oone-a ooff yuoor meeneeuns heets veet un aettaeck.','(5 secunds). Yuoor meeneeuns deael +3...16 daemaege-a. Meeneeun heet iffffect: yuoo luse-a 2% ooff yuoor maexeemoom Heaelt.'],
1353=>['Pootreed Flesh','Destruy oone-a ooff yuoor taerget uneemaeted undeaed meeneeuns. Aell fues neaer thaet creaetoore-a aere-a Deeseaesed fur 5...15 secunds.','Destruys oone-a ooff yuoor undeaed serfunts. Inffleects Deeseaesed cundeeshun (5...15 secunds) tu fues neaer thees serfunt.'],
1354=>['Feaest fur zee Deaed','Destruy taerget uneemaeted undeaed aelly. Aell ooff yuoor oozeer uneemaeted undeaed aelleees aere-a heaeled fur 10...100 Heaelt.','Destruys oone-a ooff yuoor undeaed serfunts. Heaels yuoor serfunts fur 10...100.'],
1355=>['Jaegged Bunes','Fur 60 secunds, vhenefer taerget undeaed serfunt deees, it is replaeced by a lefel 0...15 jaegged hurrur thaet cooses Bleedeeng veet iaech ooff its aettaecks.','(60 secunds.) Vhee taerget undeaed serfunt deees, it is replaeced by a lefel 0...15 jaegged hurrur thaet inffleects Bleedeeng veet aettaecks.'],
1356=>['Cuntaegeeun','Fur 60 secunds, vhenefer yuoo sooffffer frum a noo cundeeshun, aell fues in zee aerea sooffffer frum thaet saeme-a cundeeshun und yuoo saecreeffeece-a 10...5% maexeemoom Heaelt.','(60 secunds.) Vhenefer yuoo gaeeen a cundeeshun, aell fues in zee aerea gaeeen thaet saeme-a cundeeshun. Yuoo saecreeffeece-a 10...5% maexeemoom Heaelt iaech teeme-a thees haeppens.'],
1358=>['Ulceruoos Loongs','Fur 10...30 secunds, taerget fue-a und aell neaerby fues sooffffer frum -4 Heaelt degeneraeshun vhee Bleedeeng, und vhenefer zeey use-a a shuoot oor chunt, zeey Bleed fur 5...20 secunds','Aelsu hexes fues neaer yuoor taerget (10...30 secunds). Cooses -4 Heaelt degeneraeshun tu uny ooff zeese-a fues thaet aere-a Bleedeeng. Inffleects Bleedeeng (5...20 secunds) vhenefer zeese-a fues use-a a shuoot oor chunt.'],
1359=>['Paeeen ooff Deesenchuntment','Taerget fue-a luses 1...3 inchuntments. Iff un inchuntment vaes lust in thees vaey, thaet fue-a und aell aedjaecent fues luse-a 10...100 Heaelt.','Taerget fue-a luses 1...3 inchuntments. Remufael iffffect: thaet fue-a und aell aedjaecent fues luse-a 10...100 Heaelt.'],
1360=>['Maerk ooff Foory','Fur 5 secunds, aelleees heetteeng taerget fue-a gaeeen 0...2 streeke-as ooff aedrenaeleene-a. Vhee thees hex inds, thaet fue-a sooffffers frum Craecked Aermur fur 1...15 secunds.','(5 secunds.) Aelleees heetteeng taerget fue-a gaeeen 0...2 streeke-as ooff aedrenaeleene-a. Ind iffffect: inffleects Craecked Aermur (1...15 secunds).'],
1362=>['Curroopt Inchuntment','Remufe-a oone-a inchuntment frum taerget fue-a. Iff un inchuntment is remufed in thees vaey, thaet fue-a sooffffers frum -1...8 Heaelt degeneraeshun fur 10 secunds.','Remufes oone-a inchuntment frum taerget fue-a. Remufael iffffect: -1...8 Heaelt degeneraeshun (10 secunds).'],
1363=>['Seegnet ooff Surroo','Taerget fue-a taekes 15...75 daemaege-a. Iff taerget fue-a is neaer a curpse-a oor haes a deaed pet, thees skeell rechaerges instuntly.','Deaels 15...75 daemaege-a. Rechaerges instuntly iff taerget fue-a is neaer a curpse-a oor haes a deaed pet.'],
1364=>['Seegnet ooff Sooffffereeng','Yuoo sooffffer frum Bleedeeng fur 6 secunds. Zee next Necrumuncer skeell thaet taergets a fue-a cooses Bleedeeng fur 2...16 secunds.','Yuoo Bleed fur 6 secunds. Aeppleees Bleedeeng (2...16 secunds) tu zee taerget ooff yuoor next Necrumuncer skeell.'],
1365=>['Seegnet ooff Lust Suools','Iff taerget fue-a is beloo 50% Heaelt, yuoo gaeeen 10...100 Heaelt und 1...10 Inergy.','Yuoo gaeeen 10...100 Heaelt und 1...10 Inergy iff taerget fue-a is beloo 50% Heaelt.'],
1366=>['Vell ooff Daerkness','Ixplueet neaerest curpse-a oor saecreeffeece-a 66% heaelt tu creaete-a a Vell ooff Daerkness fur 5...50 secunds. Hexed fues veetheen zee Vell ooff Daerkness meess 50% ooff zee teeme-a.','(5...50 secunds.) Hexed fues in thees vell haefe-a 50% chunce-a tu meess. Ixplueets a fresh curpse-a oor saecreeffeeces 66% heaelt.'],
1367=>['Bleendeeng Soorge-a','Taerget fue-a is stroock fur 5...50 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Thaet fue-a und aell aedjaecent fues aere-a Bleended fur 3...8 secunds. Thees spell haes 25% aermur penetraeshun. Iff thees spell streekes un aettaeckeeng fue-a, aell aedjaecent fues aere-a aelsu stroock und thees spell deaels 50% mure-a daemaege-a.','Deaels 5...50 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Inffleects Bleend oon taerget und aedjaecent fues (3...8 secunds). 25% aermur penetraeshun. Iff taerget vaes aettaeckeeng, aelsu heets aedjaecent fues und deaels 50% mure-a daemaege-a.'],
1368=>['Cheelleeng Veends','Taerget fue-a und aell aedjaecent fues aere-a stroock fur 30...60 culd daemaege-a. Fur 10 secunds, zee next Vaeter Maegeec hex taergeteeng a hexed fue-a laests 25...100% lunger.','(10 secunds.) Zee next vaeter hex oon taerget fue-a laests 25...100% lunger. Ineeteeael iffffect: 30...60 culd daemaege-a. Aelsu streekes aedjaecent.'],
1369=>['Leeghtneeng Bult','Send oooot a Leeghtneeng Bult thaet streekes fur 5...50 leeghtneeng daemaege-a iff it heets. Iff Leeghtneeng Bult streekes a mufeeng fue-a, thaet fue-a is stroock fur 5...50 aeddeeshunael leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Thees spell haes 25% aermur penetraeshun.','Prujecteele-a: deaels 5...50 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Deaels 5...50 mure-a leeghtneeng daemaege-a iff taerget fue-a is mufeeng. 25% aermur penetraeshun.'],
1370=>['Sturm Djeenn\'s Haeste-a','Fur 10...25 secunds, yuoo mufe-a 25% faester. Iaech secund thaet yuoo aere-a mufeeng, yuoo luse-a 1 Inergy. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(10...25 secunds.) Yuoo mufe-a 25% faester. Luse-a 1 Inergy iaech secund vheele-a mufeeng.'],
1371=>['Stune-a Streeker','Fur 5...30 secunds, vhenefer yuoo taeke-a oor deael ilementael oor physeecael daemaege-a, thaet daemaege-a is cunferted tu iaert daemaege-a.','(5...30 secunds.) Cunferts ilementael und physeecael daemaege-a yuoo taeke-a oor deael tu iaert daemaege-a.'],
1372=>['Sundsturm','Creaete-a a Sundsturm aet taerget fue-a\'s lucaeshun. Fur 10 secunds, neaerby fues aere-a stroock fur 20...40 iaert daemaege-a iaech secund und aettaeckeeng fues aere-a stroock fur un aeddeeshunael 10...30 iaert daemaege-a iaech secund.','Deaels 20...40 iaert daemaege-a iaech secund (10 secunds). Heets fues neaer taerget fue-a\'s ineeteeael lucaeshun. Heets aettaeckeeng fues fur 10...30 mure-a iaert daemaege-a iaech secund.'],
1373=>['Stune-a Sheaet','Fur 5...20 secunds, yuoo und taerget aelly haefe-a +1...30 aermur und aere-a immoone-a tu creeteecael heets. Vhee yuoo caest thees spell, aell fues neaer yuoo und yuoor taerget taeke-a 15...70 iaert daemaege-a und aere-a Veaekened fur 5...20 secunds.','(5...20 secunds.) Geefes yuoo und taerget aelly +1...30 aermur und immooneety tu creeteecael heets. Ineeteeael iffffect: Fues neaer yuoo und taerget aelly aere-a stroock fur 15...70 iaert daemaege-a und aere-a Veaekened (5...20 secunds).'],
1374=>['Ibun Haevk','Send a prujecteele-a thaet streekes taerget fue-a fur 10...85 iaert daemaege-a und cooses Veaekness fur 5...15 secunds iff it heets.','Prujecteele-a: deaels 10...85 iaert daemaege-a und inffleects Veaekness cundeeshun (5...15 secunds). Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
1375=>['Stunefflesh Oora','Fur 5...15 secunds, daemaege-a yuoo receeefe-a is redooced by 1...31, und yuoo aere-a immoone-a tu creeteecael aettaecks.','(5...15 secunds.) Redooces daemaege-a yuoo taeke-a by 1...31, und yuoo aere-a immoone-a tu creeteecael heets.'],
1376=>['Glyph ooff Resturaeshun','Fur 15 secunds, yuoor next 2 spells heael yuoo fur 30...105 Heaelt, und yuoo aere-a heaeled fur 150...400% ooff zee Inergy cust ooff iaech spell.','(15 secunds.) Yuoor next 2 spells heael yuoo fur 30...105, und yuoo aere-a heaeled fur 150...400% ooff zee Inergy cust ooff iaech spell.'],
1377=>['Izeer Preesm','Fur 3 secunds, aell daemaege-a yuoo taeke-a is redooced by 75%. Vhee Izeer Preesm inds, yuoo gaeeen 5...20 Inergy.','(3 secunds.) Aell daemaege-a yuoo taeke-a is redooced by 75%. Ind iffffect: gaeeen 5...20 Inergy. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
1378=>['Maester ooff Maegeec','Fur 1...61 secunds, aell ooff yuoor ilementael aettreebootes aere-a set tu 8...14, und yuoor ilementael spells retoorn 1 Inergy ploos 30% ooff zeeur cust.','(1...61 secunds). Yuoor ilementael aettreebootes aere-a set tu 8...14 und ilementael spells retoorn 1 Inergy ploos 30% ooff zeeur cust.'],
1379=>['Glooeeng Gaeze-a','Taerget fue-a taekes 5...50 fure-a daemaege-a. Iff thaet fue-a is oon Fure-a, yuoo gaeeen 5 Inergy ploos 1 Inergy fur ifery 2 runks ooff Inergy Sturaege-a.','Deaels 5...50 fure-a daemaege-a. Yuoo gaeeen 5 Inergy ploos 1 Inergy fur ifery 2 runks ooff Inergy Sturaege-a iff taerget fue-a is Boorneeng.'],
1380=>['Saefunnaeh Heaet','Yuoo creaete-a Saefunnaeh Heaet aet taerget fue-a\'s lucaeshun. Fur 5 secunds, aell neaerby fues taeke-a 5...20 fure-a daemaege-a fur iaech secund thees spell haes beee in iffffect.','Deaels 5...20 fure-a daemaege-a fur iaech secund seence-a caesteeng thees spell (5 secunds). Heets fues neaer taerget\'s ineeteeael lucaeshun.'],
1381=>['Flaeme-a Djeenn\'s Haeste-a','Aell aedjaecent fues aere-a stroock fur 15...120 fure-a daemaege-a. Fur 8...14 secunds, yuoo mufe-a 25% faester. Flaeme-a Djeenn\'s Haeste-a rechaerges 50% faester iff a fue-a vaes stroock by thees spell. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(8...14 secunds.) Yuoo mufe-a 25% faester. Ineeteeael iffffect: deaels 15...120 fure-a daemaege-a tu fues aedjaecent tu yuoo. Iff yuoo daemaege-a a fue-a veet thees spell, it rechaerges 50% faester.'],
1382=>['Freezeeng Goost','Iff taerget fue-a is under zee iffffect ooff a Vaeter Maegeec hex, thaet fue-a is stroock fur 20...80 culd daemaege-a. Oozeerveese-a, thaet fue-a mufes 66% slooer fur 1...5 secunds.','Deaels 20...80 culd daemaege-a iff taerget fue-a is hexed veet Vaeter Maegeec. Oozeerveese-a, thees fue-a mufes 66% slooer (1...5 secunds).'],
1390=>['Joodge-a\'s Interfenshun','Fur 10 secunds, zee next teeme-a taerget aelly receeefes daemaege-a thaet vuoold be-a faetael, zee daemaege-a is negaeted und oone-a neaerby fue-a taekes 30...180 huly daemaege-a.','(10 secunds.) Negaetes zee next faetael daemaege-a. Negaeshun iffffect: deaels 30...180 huly daemaege-a tu oone-a fue-a neaer taerget aelly.'],
1391=>['Sooppurteefe-a Spureet','Fur 5...23 secunds, vhenefer taerget aelly taekes daemaege-a vheele-a knucked doon, thaet aelly is heaeled fur 5...50 Heaelt.','(5...23 secunds.) Heaels fur 5...50 vhenefer taerget aelly taekes daemaege-a vheele-a knucked-doon.'],
1392=>['Vaetchffool Heaeleeng','Fur 10 secunds, taerget aelly gaeeens +1...4 Heaelt regeneraeshun. Iff thees skeell inds premaetoorely, thaet aelly gaeeens 30...120 Heaelt.','(10 secunds.) Taerget aelly haes +1...4 Heaelt regeneraeshun und gaeeens 30...120 Heaelt iff thees inchuntment inds iaerly.'],
1393=>['Heaeler\'s Buun','Fur 10...55 secunds. Heaeleeng Praeyers spells caest 50% faester und heael fur 50% mure-a Heaelt.','(10...55 secunds.) Heaeleeng Praeyers spells caest 50% faester und heael fur 50% mure-a.'],
1394=>['Heaeler\'s Cufenunt','Vheele-a yuoo maeeentaeeen thees inchuntment, yuoor Heaeleeng Praeyers spells heael fur 20% less Heaelt, boot cust -1...4 Inergy.','Yuoor Heaeleeng Praeyers spells cust 1...4 less Inergy. Zeese-a spells heael fur 20% less.'],
1395=>['Baelthaezaer\'s Pendooloom','Fur 5...25 secunds, zee next teeme-a taerget aelly vuoold be-a knucked doon by a fue-a, thaet fue-a is knucked doon insteaed.','(5...25 secunds.) Cooses knuck-doon tu zee next fue-a aettempteeng tu knuck-doon taerget aelly. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
1396=>['Vurds ooff Cumffurt','Taerget aelly is heaeled fur 20...65 Heaelt und un aeddeeshunael 20...50 Heaelt iff thaet aelly is sooffffereeng frum a cundeeshun.','Heaels fur 20...65. Heaels fur 20...50 mure-a iff taerget aelly haes a cundeeshun.'],
1397=>['Leeght ooff Deleeferunce-a','Aell paerty members aere-a heaeled fur 5...70 Heaelt.','Heaels inture-a paerty fur 5...70.'],
1398=>['Scuoorge-a Inchuntment','Fur 30 secunds, iaech teeme-a taerget fue-a is zee taerget ooff un inchuntment, zee caester ooff thaet inchuntment taekes 15...75 daemaege-a.','(30 secunds.) Deaels 15...75 daemaege-a tu unyune-a caesteeng un inchuntment oon taerget fue-a.'],
1399=>['Sheeeld ooff Aebsurpshun','Fur 3...7 secunds, daemaege-a receeefed by taerget aelly is redooced by 5 iaech teeme-a thaet aelly is heet vheele-a under zee iffffects ooff thees inchuntment.','(3...7 secunds.) Redooces incumeeng daemaege-a by 5 iaech teeme-a taerget aelly taekes daemaege-a.'],
1400=>['Refersael ooff Daemaege-a','Fur 8 secunds, zee next teeme-a taerget aelly vuoold taeke-a daemaege-a, zee fue-a deaeleeng zee daemaege-a taekes thaet daemaege-a insteaed (maexeemoom 5...75).','(8 secunds.) Negaetes zee next daemaege-a und heets zee suoorce-a fur thaet saeme-a aemuoont (maexeemoom 5...75).'],
1401=>['Mendeeng Tuooch','Tuooched aelly luses tvu cundeeshuns und is heaeled fur 15...60 Heaelt fur iaech cundeeshun remufed in thees vaey.','Remufes tvu cundeeshuns. Heaels fur 15...60 fur iaech cundeeshun remufed. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
1402=>['Creeteecael Chup','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo inffleect +5...20 daemaege-a. Iff thees aettaeck resoolts in a creeteecael heet, taerget fue-a is interroopted.','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Interroopts un aecshun iff yuoo lund a creeteecael heet.'],
1403=>['Aeguneezeeng Chup','Vhee thees aettaeck heets, yuoo deael +5...20 daemaege-a. Iff taerget fue-a is sooffffereeng frum a Deep Vuoond, yuoo interroopt thaet fue-a\'s aecshun.','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Interroopts un aecshun iff taerget fue-a haes a Deep Vuoond.'],
1404=>['Flaeeel','Fur 1...15 secunds, yuoo aettaeck 33% faester boot mufe-a 33% slooer.','(1...15 secunds.) Yuoo aettaeck 33% faester. Yuoo mufe-a 33% slooer.'],
1405=>['Chaergeeng Streeke-a','Fur 1...10 secunds, yuoo roon 33% faester. Yuoor next sooccessffool melee-a heet dues +10...90 daemaege-a und thees stunce-a inds. Thees stunce-a inds iff yuoo use-a a skeell.','(1...10 secunds.) Yuoo mufe-a 33% faester und deael +10...90 daemaege-a veet yuoor next melee-a heet. Inds vhee yuoo heet oor iff yuoo use-a a skeell.'],
1406=>['Heaedboott','Taerget tuooched fue-a taekes 40...100 daemaege-a. Yuoo aere-a Daezed fur 10 secunds.','Deaels 40...100 daemaege-a. Yuoo aere-a Daezed (10 secunds).'],
1407=>['Leeun\'s Cumffurt','Aell ooff yuoor seegnets aere-a deesaebled fur 12 secunds. Yuoo aere-a heaeled fur 50...110 Heaelt, und yuoo gaeeen 0...3 streeke-as ooff aedrenaeleene-a.','Yuoo aere-a heaeled fur 50...110 und gaeeen 0...3 streeke-as ooff aedrenaeleene-a. Deesaebles yuoor seegnets (12 secunds).'],
1408=>['Raege-a ooff zee Ntuooka','Gaeeen 1...7 streeke-as ooff aedrenaeleene-a. Fur 8 secunds, vhenefer yuoo use-a un aedrenael skeell, thaet skeell rechaerges fur 3 secunds.','Yuoo gaeeen 1...7 aedrenaeleene-a. Fur 8 secunds, aedrenael skeells haefe-a a 3 secund rechaerge-a vhee used.'],
1409=>['Mukele-a Smaesh','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +5...20 daemaege-a und gaeeen 2 streeke-as ooff aedrenaeleene-a.','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a und yuoo gaeeen 2 streeke-as ooff aedrenaeleene-a.'],
1410=>['Ooferbeaereeng Smaesh','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo deael +1...20 daemaege-a. Iff taerget fue-a is knucked doon, thaet fue-a is Daezed fur 1...8 secunds.','Deaels +1...20 daemaege-a. Iff taerget fue-a is knucked doon, zeey aere-a Daezed (1...8 secunds).'],
1411=>['Seegnet ooff Staemeena','Yuoo haefe-a +50...300 maexeemoom Heaelt. Thees seegnet inds iff yuoo sooccessffoolly heet veet un aettaeck. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Yuoo haefe-a +50...300 maexeemoom Heaelt. Inds iff yuoo heet veet un aettaeck.'],
1412=>['"Yuoo\'re-a Aell Aelune-a!"','Iff taerget fue-a isn\'t neaer un aelly, thaet fue-a sooffffers frum Creepple-a und Veaekness fur 8 secunds.','Inffleects Creepple-a und Veaekness cundeeshuns (8 secunds). Nu iffffect iff taerget fue-a is neaer oone-a ooff its aelleees.'],
1413=>['Boorst ooff Aeggresseeun','Fur 2...10 secunds, yuoo aettaeck 33% faester. Vhee thees stunce-a inds, yuoo luse-a aell aedrenaeleene-a.','(2...10 secunds.) Yuoo aettaeck 33% faester. Ind iffffect: luse-a aell aedrenaeleene-a.'],
1414=>['Inraegeeng Chaerge-a','Fur 5...15 secunds, yuoo mufe-a 25% faester. Inraegeeng Chaerge-a inds vhee yuoo sooccessffoolly streeke-a a taerget, aet vheech pueent yuoo gaeeen 0...3 streeke-as ooff aedrenaeleene-a iff yuoo heet veet a melee-a aettaeck.','(5...15 secunds.) Yuoo mufe-a 25% faester. Gaeeen +0...3 aedrenaeleene-a oon yuoor next melee-a aettaeck. Inds aeffter yuoor next heet.'],
1415=>['Creeppleeng Slaesh','Iff thees aettaeck heets, taerget fue-a is Creeppled fur 5...15 secunds und begeens Bleedeeng fur 10...25 secunds.','Inffleects Creeppled cundeeshun (5...15 secunds) und Bleedeeng cundeeshun (10...25 secunds).'],
1416=>['Baerbaeruoos Sleece-a','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo deael +5...30 daemaege-a. Iff yuoo aere-a coorrently nut in a stunce-a, yuoo aelsu inffleect Bleedeeng fur 5...15 secunds.','Deaels +5...30 daemaege-a. Inffleects Bleedeeng cundeeshun (5...15 secunds) iff yuoo aere-a nut in a stunce-a. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
1465=>['Prepaered Shut','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +10...25 daemaege-a. Iff yuoo aere-a under zee iffffects ooff a prepaeraeshun, yuoo gaeeen 1...9 Inergy.','Deaels +10...25 daemaege-a. Yuoo gaeeen 1...9 Inergy iff yuoo haefe-a a prepaeraeshun aecteefe-a.'],
1466=>['Boorneeng Aerroo','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +10...30 daemaege-a und coose-a Boorneeng fur 2...8 secunds.','Deaels +10...30 daemaege-a. Inffleects Boorneeng cundeeshun (2...8 secunds).'],
1467=>['Aerceeng Shut','Iff thees aerroo heets, it streekes fur +10...35 daemaege-a. Thees aerroo cunnut be-a blucked, boot it mufes 50% slooer.','Deaels +10...35 daemaege-a. Unbluckaeble-a. Thees aerroo mufes 50% slooer.'],
1468=>['Streeke-a aes Oone-a','Yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun instuntly mufes tu yuoor taerget und cooses Bleedeeng fur 5...15 secunds veet its next aettaeck. Zee next teeme-a yuoo heet veet un aettaeck, taerget fue-a is Creeppled fur 5...15 secunds.','Yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun instuntly mufes tu yuoor taerget und inffleects Bleedeeng (5...15 secunds) veet its next aettaeck. Zee next teeme-a yuoo heet veet un aettaeck, yuoo inffleect Creeppled cundeeshun (5...15 secunds).'],
1469=>['Crussffure-a','Iff thees aettaeck heets taerget fue-a, it deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Iff thaet fue-a is neaer uny ooff yuoor aelleees, thees aettaeck cunnut be-a blucked.','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Unbluckaeble-a iff taerget fue-a is neaer uny ooff yuoor aelleees.'],
1470=>['Baerbed Aerroos','Fur 24 secunds, yuoor aerroos coose-a Bleedeeng fur 3...15 secunds. Yuoo haefe-a -40 aermur vheele-a aecteefaeteeng thees skeell.','(24 secunds.) Yuoor aerroos inffleect Bleedeeng cundeeshun (3...15 secunds). Yuoo haefe-a -40 aermur vheele-a aecteefaeteeng thees skeell.'],
1471=>['Scaefenger\'s Fucoos','Fur 10 secunds, iff yuoo streeke-a a fue-a vhu is sooffffereeng frum a cundeeshun yuoo gaeeen 3...12 Inergy.','(10 secunds.) Yuoo gaeeen 3...12 Inergy iff yuoo streeke-a a fue-a vhu haes a cundeeshun. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
1472=>['Tuxeeceety','Creaete-a a lefel 1...10 spureet. Pueesuned oor Deeseaesed creaetoores veetheen its runge-a sooffffer -2 Heaelt degeneraeshun. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...180 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...10 spureet (30...180 secund leeffespun). Pueesuned oor Deeseaesed creaetoores in runge-a haefe-a -2 Heaelt degeneraeshun.'],
1473=>['Qooeecksund','Creaete-a a lefel 1...10 spureet. Aell nun-spureet creaetoores veetheen its runge-a luse-a 1 Inergy iaech teeme-a zeey aettaeck oor use-a a skeell. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...180 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...10 spureet (30...180 secund leeffespun). Creaetoores luse-a 1 Inergy iaech teeme-a zeey aettaeck oor use-a a skeell. Dues nut aeffffect spureets.'],
1474=>['Sturm\'s Imbraece-a','Fur 10 secunds, yuoo mufe-a 25% faester. Thees stunce-a is reffreshed vhenefer yuoo taeke-a Ilementael daemaege-a.','(10 secunds.) Yuoo mufe-a 25% faester. Renooael: vhenefer yuoo taeke-a ilementael daemaege-a.'],
1475=>['Traepper\'s Speed','Fur 5...30 secunds, yuoor Traeps rechaerge-a 25% faester und aecteefaete-a 25% faester. Thees stunce-a inds iff yuoo sooccessffoolly heet veet un aettaeck.','(5...30 secunds.) Yuoor traeps rechaerge-a 25% faester und aecteefaete-a 25% faester. Inds iff yuoo heet veet un aettaeck.'],
1476=>['Treepvure-a','Vhee Treepvure-a is treeggered, aell neaerby fues aere-a stroock fur 5...20 peeerceeng daemaege-a. Uny Creeppled fues aere-a knucked doon. Treepvure-a inds aeffter 90 secunds. Vheele-a aecteefaeteeng thees skeell, yuoo aere-a iaeseely interroopted.','(90 secunds.) Deaels 5...20 peeerceeng daemaege-a tu neaerby fues. Cooses knuck-doon tu Creeppled fues. Iaeseely interroopted.'],
1478=>['Renooeeng Soorge-a','Fur 8 secunds, taerget fue-a sooffffers 2...12 daemaege-a iaech secund. Vhee thees hex inds, yuoo gaeeen 1...8 Inergy.','(8 secunds.) Deaels 2...12 daemaege-a iaech secund. Ind iffffect: Yuoo gaeeen 1...8 Inergy.'],
1479=>['Ooffffereeng ooff Spureet','Gaeeen 8...17 Inergy. Iff uny spureets aere-a veetheen iaershut, yuoo du nut saecreeffeece-a Heaelt.','Yuoo gaeeen 8...17 Inergy. Yuoo du nut saecreeffeece-a Heaelt iff uny spureets aere-a veetheen iaershut.'],
1480=>['Spureet\'s Geefft','Fur 60 secunds, vhenefer yuoo creaete-a a creaetoore-a, aell aelleees neaer thaet creaetoore-a gaeeen 5...50 Heaelt und luse-a 1 cundeeshun.','(60 secunds.) Vhenefer yuoo creaete-a a creaetoore-a, aell neaerby aelleees gaeeen 5...50 Heaelt und luse-a oone-a cundeeshun.'],
1481=>['Deaet Paect Seegnet','Resoorrect taerget paerty member veet yuoor coorrent Heaelt und 15...100% maexeemoom Inergy. Zee next teeme-a thaet aelly deees veetheen 120 secunds, su du yuoo.','Resoorrects taerget paerty member veet yuoor coorrent Heaelt und 15...100% maexeemoom Inergy. Fur 120 secunds, yuoo deee-a zee next teeme-a thees paerty member deees.'],
1482=>['Reclaeeem Issence-a','Aell ooff yuoor spureets deee-a. Yuoo gaeeen 5...20 Inergy und aell ooff yuoor Beendeeng Reetooaels aere-a rechaerged iff a spureet deeed in thees vaey.','Aell ooff yuoor Spureets deee-a. Iff a Spureet deees in thees vaey, yuoo gaeeen 5...20 Inergy und aell ooff yuoor Beendeeng Reetooaels aere-a rechaerged. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
1483=>['Buneesheeng Streeke-a','Iff it heets, thees aettaeck deaels 10...60 huly daemaege-a. It deaels duooble-a daemaege-a tu soommuned creaetoores. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Deaels 10...60 huly daemaege-a. Deaels duooble-a daemaege-a tu soommuned creaetoores. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
1484=>['Mysteec Sveep','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo deael +3...12 daemaege-a. Iff yuoo aere-a inchunted, thees aettaeck deaels un aeddeeshunael +3...12 daemaege-a.','Deaels +3...12 daemaege-a. Deaels un aeddeeshunael +3...12 daemaege-a iff yuoo aere-a inchunted.'],
1485=>['Iremeete-a\'s Aettaeck','Iff it heets, thees aettaeck deaels +1...10 daemaege-a und remufes a Derfeesh inchuntment. Iff un inchuntment is remufed, yuoo du un aeddeeshunael +1...10 daemaege-a und streeke-a aell aedjaecent fues.','Deaels +1...10 daemaege-a und remufes a Derfeesh inchuntment. Remufael Iffffect: deaels +1...10 mure-a daemaege-a und streekes aell aedjaecent fues.'],
1486=>['Reaep Impooreeteees','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo deael +3...15 daemaege-a. Iaech fue-a yuoo heet luses 1 cundeeshun. Fur iaech fue-a vhu luses a cundeeshun, aell fues aedjaecent tu thaet taerget fue-a taeke-a 10...40 huly daemaege-a.','Deaels +3...15 daemaege-a. Stroock fues luse-a 1 cundeeshun. Remufael Iffffect: Aell fues aedjaecent tu thuse-a stroock taeke-a 10...40 huly daemaege-a.'],
1487=>['Tveen Muun Sveep','Yuoo luse-a 1 Derfeesh inchuntment und gaeeen 10...50 Heaelt. Iff un inchuntment is lust in thees vaey, yuoo cunnut be-a blucked, yuoo streeke-a tveece-a, und yuoo gaeeen un aeddeeshunael 10...70 Heaelt.','Remufe-a 1 ooff yuoor Derfeesh inchuntments. Gaeeen 10...50 Heaelt. Remufael iffffect: unbluckaeble-a, aettaeck tveece-a, und gaeeen 10...70 mure-a Heaelt.'],
1488=>['Feectureeuoos Sveep','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo deael +5...25 daemaege-a. Iff taerget fue-a haes less Heaelt thun yuoo, yuoo gaeeen 30...80 Heaelt.','Deaels +5...25 daemaege-a. Yuoo gaeeen 30...80 Heaelt fur iaech fue-a yuoo heet thaet haes less Heaelt thun yuoo.'],
1489=>['Irreseesteeble-a Sveep','Deael +3...15 daemaege-a und luse-a 1 Derfeesh inchuntment. Iff yuoo luse-a un inchuntment in thees vaey, Irreseesteeble-a Sveep cunnut be-a blucked, remufes a stunce-a, und deaels +3...15 aeddeeshunael daemaege-a.','Deaels +3...15 daemaege-a. Remufe-a 1 ooff yuoor Derfeesh inchuntments. Remufael iffffect: unbluckaeble-a, remufes a stunce-a, deaels +3...15 aeddeeshunael daemaege-a. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
1490=>['Peeuoos Aessoolt','Iff it heets, thees aettaeck deaels +10...20 daemaege-a und remufes 1 Derfeesh inchuntment. Iff a Derfeesh inchuntment vaes remufed, thees skeell rechaerges 75% faester und aedjaecent fues taeke-a 15...40 daemaege-a.','Deaels +10...20 daemaege-a. Remufes 1 ooff yuoor Derfeesh inchuntments. Remufael Iffffect: thees skeell rechaerges 75% faester und aedjaecent fues taeke-a 15...40 daemaege-a.'],
1491=>['Mysteec Tveester','Deaels 10...60 culd daemaege-a tu aell neaerby fues. Iff yuoo aere-a inchunted, thees spell deaels un aeddeeshunael 10...60 culd daemaege-a.','Deaels 10...60 culd daemaege-a tu aell neaerby fues. Deaels 10...60 mure-a culd daemaege-a iff yuoo aere-a inchunted.'],
1493=>['Grent\'s Feengers','Aell neaerby fues aere-a stroock fur 10...40 culd daemaege-a. Fur 30 secunds, yuoor aettaecks deael culd daemaege-a. Vhee thees inchuntment inds, yuoo trunsffer 1...2 cundeeshuns tu aell neaerby fues.','(30 secunds.) Yuoor aettaecks deael culd daemaege-a. Ineeteeael iffffect: heets neaerby fues fur 10...40 culd daemaege-a. Ind iffffect: trunsffers 1...2 cundeeshuns tu aell neaerby fues.'],
1495=>['Oora ooff Thurns','Aell neaerby fues begeen Bleedeeng fur 5...15 secunds. Fur 30 secunds, thees inchuntment dues nutheeng. Vhee thees inchuntment inds, aell neaerby fues aere-a Creeppled fur 3...8 secunds.','(30 secunds.) Ineeteeael iffffect: inffleects Bleedeeng cundeeshun (5...15 secunds) oon neaerby fues. Ind iffffect: inffleects Creeppled cundeeshun (3...8 secunds) oon neaerby fues.'],
1496=>['Baelthaezaer\'s Raege-a','Aell neaerby fues aere-a set oon fure-a fur 1...3 secunds. Fur 20 secunds aefftervaerd, thees inchuntment dues nutheeng. Vhee thees inchuntment inds, yuoo gaeeen 1...2 streeke-as ooff aedrenaeleene-a iff uny fues aere-a veetheen iaershut.','(20 secunds.) Ineeteeael Iffffect: inffleects Boorneeng (1...3 secunds) oon neaerby fues. Ind Iffffect: gaeeen 1...2 streeke-as ooff aedrenaeleene-a iff uny fues aere-a in iaershut.'],
1497=>['Doost Cluaek','Aell neaerby fues aere-a stroock fur 10...40 iaert daemaege-a. Fur 30 secunds, yuoor aettaecks deael iaert daemaege-a. Vhee thees inchuntment inds, aell neaerby fues aere-a Bleended fur 1...4 secunds.','(30 secunds.) Yuoor aettaecks deael iaert daemaege-a. Ineeteeael iffffect: deaels 10...40 iaert daemaege-a tu neaerby fues. Ind iffffect: inffleects Bleendness cundeeshun (1...4 secunds) oon neaerby fues.'],
1498=>['Staeggereeng Furce-a','Aell neaerby fues aere-a stroock fur 10...40 iaert daemaege-a. Fur 30 secunds, yuoor aettaecks deael iaert daemaege-a. Vhee thees inchuntment inds, aell neaerby fues haefe-a Craecked Aermur fur 1...10 secunds. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(30 secunds.) Yuoor aettaecks deael iaert daemaege-a. Ineeteeael iffffect: deaels 10...40 iaert daemaege-a tu neaerby fues. Ind iffffect: inffleects Craecked Aermur (1...10 secunds) oon neaerby fues.'],
1499=>['Peeuoos Renooael','Fur 8 secunds, nutheeng haeppens. Vhee thees inchuntment inds, Peeuoos Renooael is rechaerged und yuoo gaeeen 0...5 Inergy und 0...30 Heaelt.','(8 secunds.) Ind Iffffect: rechaerges itselff und yuoo gaeeen 0...5 Inergy und 0...30 Heaelt.'],
1500=>['Muraege-a Cluaek','Fur 20 secunds, yuoo haefe-a a 40% chunce-a tu bluck und un ixtra 4...10% fur iaech aeddeeshunael inchuntment (maex 80%). Aell neaerby fues aere-a stroock fur 10...40 iaert daemaege-a iaech teeme-a a Derfeesh inchuntment is remufed frum yuoo.','(20 secunds.) 40% chunce-a tu bluck und un ixtra 4...10% fur iaech aeddeeshunael inchuntment. 10...40 iaert daemaege-a tu neaerby fues vhee yuoo luse-a a Derfeesh inchuntment.'],
1502=>['Aercune-a Zeael','Fur 10 secunds, vhenefer yuoo caest a spell, yuoo gaeeen 2 Inergy fur iaech inchuntment oon yuoo (maexeemoom 2...7 Inergy).','(10 secunds.) Yuoo gaeeen 2 Inergy (maexeemoom 2...7) fur iaech inchuntment oon yuoo vhenefer yuoo caest a spell.'],
1503=>['Mysteec Feegur','Fur 20 secunds, ifery teeme-a yuoo sooccessffoolly heet veet un aettaeck, yuoo gaeeen 3...15 Heaelt fur iaech inchuntment oon yuoo (maexeemoom 25 Heaelt).','(20 secunds.) Yuoo gaeeen 3...15 Heaelt (maexeemoom 25) fur iaech inchuntment oon yuoo vhenefer yuoo heet veet un aettaeck.'],
1504=>['Vaetchffool Interfenshun','Fur 60 secunds, zee next teeme-a daemaege-a drups taerget aelly\'s Heaelt beloo 25%, thaet aelly is heaeled fur 50...200 Heaelt.','(60 secunds.) Heaels fur 50...200 zee next teeme-a daemaege-a drups taerget aelly\'s Heaelt beloo 25%.'],
1505=>['Foo ooff Peeety','Fur 20 secunds, yuoo haefe-a +24 aermur und +1...4 Heaelt regeneraeshun. Foo ooff Peeety renoos vhenefer un inchuntment oon yuoo inds.','(20 secunds.) +24 aermur und +1...4 Heaelt regeneraeshun. Renooael: vhenefer un inchuntment oon yuoo inds.'],
1506=>['Feetael Buun','Fur 20 secunds, yuoo haefe-a +40...100 maexeemoom Heaelt. Vhee thees inchuntment inds, yuoo aere-a heaeled fur 75...200 Heaelt.','(20 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +40...100 maexeemoom Heaelt. Ind iffffect: heaels yuoo fur 75...200.'],
1507=>['Heaert ooff Huly Flaeme-a','Aell neaerby fues taeke-a 5...30 huly daemaege-a. Fur 30 secunds aefftervaerd, yuoor aettaecks deael huly daemaege-a. Vhee thees inchuntment inds, aell neaerby fues aere-a set oon fure-a fur 2...5 secunds.','(30 secunds.) Yuoor aettaecks deael huly daemaege-a. Ineeteeael iffffect: deaels 5...30 huly daemaege-a tu neaerby fues. Ind iffffect: inffleects Boorneeng cundeeshun (2...5 secunds) oon neaerby fues.'],
1508=>['Ixtend Inchuntments','Fur 10 secunds, yuoor next Derfeesh inchuntment laests 10...150% lunger. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(10 secunds)Yuoor next Derfeesh inchuntment laests 10...150% lunger.'],
1509=>['Faeeethffool Interfenshun','Iff daemaege-a drups yuoor Heaelt beloo 50%, Faeeethffool Interfenshun inds. Vhee Faeeethffool Interfenshun inds, yuoo aere-a heaeled fur 30...150 Heaelt.','Yuoo gaeeen 30...150 Heaelt zee next teeme-a daemaege-a drups yuoor Heaelt beloo 50%. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
1510=>['Sund Shaerds','Fur 30 secunds, zee next 1...5 teeme-as yuoo heet veet a scyzee, aell oozeer aedjaecent fues taeke-a 10...60 iaert daemaege-a.','(30 secunds.) Deaels 10...60 iaert daemaege-a tu aell oozeer aedjaecent fues vhenefer yuoo heet veet yuoor scyzee. Inds aeffter 1...5 heets.'],
1512=>['Lyssa\'s Haeste-a','Fur 3...15 secunds, yuoor Derfeesh inchuntments rechaerge-a 33% faester. Vhee yuoo aecteefaete-a thees inchuntment, aell aedjaecent fues aere-a interroopted. Vhee thees inchuntment inds, aell aedjaecent fues aere-a interroopted. 50% faeeeloore-a chunce-a unless Veend Praeyers 5 oor heegher.','(3...15 secunds.) Yuoor Derfeesh inchuntments rechaerge-a 33% faester. Ineeteeael Iffffect: interroopts aell aedjaecent fues. Ind Iffffect: interroopts aell aedjaecent fues. (50% faeeeloore-a chunce-a unless Veend Praeyers 5 oor heegher.)'],
1513=>['Gooeedeeng Hunds','Fur 20 secunds, yuoor next 0...3 aettaecks cunnut be-a blucked. Vhee aecteefaeted, thees skeell remufes zee Bleendness cundeeshun.','(20 secunds.) Yuoor next 0...3 aettaecks cunnut be-a blucked. Ineeteeael iffffect: remufes Bleendness.'],
1514=>['Fleeteeng Staebeeleety','Fur 4...10 secunds, yuoo cunnut be-a knucked doon und mufe-a 25% faester. Thees inchuntment inds premaetoorely iff it prefents a knuckdoon.','(4...10 secunds.) Yuoo cunnut be-a knucked doon und mufe-a 25% faester. Inds iff knuckdoon prefented.'],
1515=>['Aermur ooff Suncteety','Aell aedjaecent fues sooffffer frum Veaekness fur 5...15 secunds. Fur 15 secunds, yuoo taeke-a 5...20 less daemaege-a frum fues sooffffereeng frum a cundeeshun.','Inffleects Veaekness cundeeshun oon aell aedjaecent fues (5...15 secunds). Yuoo taeke-a 5...20 less daemaege-a frum fues veet a cundeeshun (15 secunds). Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
1516=>['Mysteec Regeneraeshun','Fur 5...20 secunds, yuoo haefe-a +1...4 Heaelt regeneraeshun fur iaech inchuntment (maexeemoom ooff 8) oon yuoo.','(5...20 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +1...4 Heaelt regeneraeshun fur iaech inchuntment (maexeemoom ooff 8) oon yuoo.'],
1517=>['Foo ooff Seelence-a','Fur 5...10 secunds, yuoo cunnut be-a zee taerget ooff spells, und yuoo cunnut caest spells.','(5...10 secunds.) Spells cunnut taerget yuoo. Yuoo cunnut caest spells.'],
1518=>['Aefaetaer ooff Baelthaezaer','Fur 10...90 secunds, yuoo gaeeen +20 aermur aegaeeenst physeecael daemaege-a, yuoo gaeeen aedrenaeleene-a 25% faester, yuoor aettaecks deael huly daemaege-a, und vhenefer yuoo luse-a a Derfeesh inchuntment, neaerby fues aere-a set oon fure-a fur 1...3 secunds. Thees skeell is deesaebled fur 45 secunds.','(10...90 secunds.) Yuoo gaeeen +20 aermur aegaeeenst physeecael daemaege-a, yuoo gaeeen aedrenaeleene-a 25% faester, yuoor aettaecks deael huly daemaege-a, yuoo inffleect Boorneeng (1...3 secunds) oon neaerby fues vhenefer yuoo luse-a a Derfeesh inchuntment. Thees skeell is deesaebled fur 45 secunds.'],
1519=>['Aefaetaer ooff Dvaeyna','Fur 10...90 secunds, yuoor aettaecks deael huly daemaege-a. Vhenefer yuoo use-a a Derfeesh aettaeck skeell, yuoo luse-a 1 hex. Vhenefer yuoo luse-a a Derfeesh inchuntment, aell aelleees in iaershut aere-a heaeled fur 5...50 Heaelt. Thees skeell is deesaebled fur 45 secunds.','(10...90 secunds.) Deael huly daemaege-a. Yuoo luse-a 1 hex vhenefer yuoo use-a a Derfeesh aettaeck skeell. Heael aelleees in iaershut fur 5...50 Heaelt vhenefer yuoo luse-a a Derfeesh inchuntment. Thees skeell is deesaebled fur 45 secunds.'],
1520=>['Aefaetaer ooff Grent','Fur 10...90 secunds, yuoor scyzee aettaecks deael daerk daemaege-a und steael 0...12 Heaelt. Yuoo aere-a immoone-a tu Deeseaese-a und inffleect Deeseaese-a oon aell aedjaecent fues fur 3 secunds vhenefer yuoo luse-a a Derfeesh inchuntment. Thees skeell is deesaebled fur 45 secunds.','(10...90 secunds.) Yuoor scyzee aettaecks deael daerk daemaege-a und steael 0...12 Heaelt. Yuoo aere-a immoone-a tu Deeseaese-a. Aepply Deeseaese-a tu aell aedjaecent fues (3 secunds) vhee yuoo luse-a a Derfeesh inchuntment. Thees skeell is deesaebled fur 45 secunds.'],
1521=>['Aefaetaer ooff Lyssa','Fur 10...90 secunds, yuoor Derfeesh inchuntments rechaerge-a 50% faester und yuoor aettaecks deael chaeus daemaege-a. Vhenefer yuoo luse-a a Derfeesh inchuntment, steael 1 Inergy frum aell neaerby fues. Thees skeell is deesaebled fur 45 secunds. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(10...90 secunds.) Yuoor Derfeesh inchuntments rechaerge-a 50% faester und deael chaeus daemaege-a veet aettaecks. Steael 1 Inergy frum neaerby fues vhee yuoo luse-a a Derfeesh inchuntment. Thees skeell is deesaebled fur 45 secunds.'],
1522=>['Aefaetaer ooff Melundroo','Fur 10...90 secunds, yuoo haefe-a +150 Heaelt, +30 ilementael aermur, und yuoor aettaecks deael iaert daemaege-a. Vhenefer yuoo luse-a a Derfeesh inchuntment, aell paerty members in iaershut luse-a 1 cundeeshun. Thees skeell is deesaebled fur 45 secunds.','(10...90 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +150 maexeemoom Heaelt, +30 ilementael aermur, und yuoor aettaecks deael iaert daemaege-a. Coore-a 1 cundeeshun frum aell paerty members in iaershut vhenefer yuoo luse-a a Derfeesh inchuntment. Thees skeell is deesaebled fur 45 secunds.'],
1523=>['Medeetaeshun','Luse-a aell aedrenaeleene-a. Fur 20 secunds, yuoo gaeeen 1...4 Inergy ifery teeme-a un inchuntment oon yuoo inds.','(20 secunds.) Luse-a aell aedrenaeleene-a. Gaeeen 1...4 Inergy vhenefer un inchuntment oon yuoo inds. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
1524=>['Iremeete-a\'s Zeael','Yuoo gaeeen 1...3 Inergy fur iaech fue-a veetheen iaershut, maexeemoom 8 Inergy. Fur 10 secunds aefftervaerd, thees inchuntment dues nutheeng. Vhee thees inchuntment inds, yuoo gaeeen 1...3 Inergy fur iaech fue-a veetheen iaershut, maexeemoom 8 Inergy.','(10 secunds.) Ineeteeael iffffect: yuoo gaeeen 1...3 Inergy (maexeemoom 8) fur iaech fue-a in iaershut. Ind iffffect: yuoo gaeeen 1...3 Inergy (maexeemoom 8) fur iaech fue-a in iaershut.'],
1525=>['Naetoorael Heaeleeng','Yuoo aere-a heaeled fur 50...170 Heaelt. Iff yuoo aere-a nut inchunted, thees spell aecteefaetes 50% faester.','Heaels yuoo fur 50...170 Heaelt. Thees skeell aecteefaetes 50% faester iff yuoo aere-a nut inchunted.'],
1526=>['Imbooe-a Heaelt','Taerget oozeer aelly is heaeled fur 5...50% ooff yuoor coorrent Heaelt (maexeemoom 300 Heaelt).','Heaels fur 5...50% ooff yuoor coorrent Heaelt (maexeemoom 300). Cunnut selff-taerget.'],
1527=>['Mysteec Heaeleeng','Yuoo aere-a heaeled fur 5...65 Heaelt. Aelsu heaels aell inchunted paerty members fur 5...65 Heaelt.','Heaels yuoo fur 5...65. Heaels aell inchunted paerty members fur 5...65 Heaelt.'],
1528=>['Dvaeyna\'s Tuooch','Taerget tuooched aelly is heaeled fur 60 Heaelt fur iaech inchuntment oon yuoo (maexeemoom 60...240).','Heaels fur 60 (maexeemoom 60...240) fur iaech inchuntment oon yuoo.'],
1529=>['Peeuoos Resturaeshun','Yuoo gaeeen 80...150 Heaelt und remufe-a 1 Derfeesh inchuntment. Iff un inchuntment vaes remufed in thees vaey, yuoo aelsu luse-a 1...3 hexes.','Gaeeen 80...150 Heaelt und remufe-a 1 Derfeesh inchuntment. Remufael iffffect: luse-a 1...3 hexes.'],
1530=>['Seegnet ooff Peeuoos Leeght','Remufe-a 1 Derfeesh inchuntment. Taerget aelly is heaeled fur 30...150 Heaelt. Iff un inchuntment vaes remufed in thees vaey, thees seegnet rechaerges 75% faester.','Heaels fur 30...150 Heaelt. Remufes 1 ooff yuoor Derfeesh inchuntments. Remufael iffffect: rechaerges 75% faester.'],
1531=>['Inteemeedaeteeng Oora','Fur 60 secunds, yuoo haefe-a +40...100 maex Heaelt und taeke-a 1...10 less daemaege-a frum fues veet less Heaelt thun yuoo.','(60 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +40...100 maex Heaelt und taeke-a -1...10 daemaege-a frum fues veet less Heaelt thun yuoo.'],
1532=>['Mysteec Sundsturm','Creaete-a a Sundsturm aet yuoor lucaeshun thaet laests 3 secunds. Iaech secund, fues neaerby thees lucaeshun taeke-a 10...40 iaert daemaege-a. Aettaeckeeng fues taeke-a un aeddeeshunael 10...20 daemaege-a. Iff yuoo aere-a inchunted vhee yuoo caest thees spell, it laests tveece-a aes lung.','(3 secunds). Deaels 10...40 iaert daemaege-a iaech secund. Deaels un aeddeeshunael 10...20 daemaege-a tu aettaeckeeng fues. Heets fues neaerby yuoor ineeteeael lucaeshun. Laests tveece-a aes lung iff yuoo aere-a inchunted.'],
1533=>['Veends ooff Deesenchuntment','Remufe-a 1 ooff yuoor Derfeesh inchuntments. Iff un inchuntment vaes remufed, aell neaerby fues luse-a 1 inchuntment und taeke-a 20...80 culd daemaege-a.','Remufe-a 1 ooff yuoor Derfeesh inchuntments. Remufael iffffect: aell neaerby fues luse-a 1 inchuntment und taeke-a 20...80 culd daemaege-a.'],
1534=>['Rendeeng Tuooch','Deaels 15...65 culd daemaege-a tu taerget fue-a. Yuoo luse-a 1 Derfeesh inchuntment. Iff un inchuntment vaes remufed, taerget fue-a luses 1 inchuntment und yuoo gaeeen 2 streeke-as ooff aedrenaeleene-a.','Deaels 15...65 culd daemaege-a. Luse-a 1 Derfeesh inchuntment. Remufael iffffect: taerget fue-a luses 1 inchuntment und yuoo gaeeen 2 streeke-as ooff aedrenaeleene-a. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
1535=>['Creeppleeng Sveep','Iff thees aettaeck heets a fue-a, thaet fue-a is Creeppled fur 3...12 secunds. Thees skeell deaels +3...15 ixtra daemaege-a iff thaet fue-a is mufeeng.','(3...12 secunds.) Inffleects Creepple-a cundeeshun. Deaels +3...15 daemaege-a tu mufeeng fues.'],
1536=>['Vuoondeeng Streeke-a','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo du +5...20 daemaege-a, taerget fue-a sooffffers frum Bleedeeng fur 5...20 secunds, und yuoo luse-a 1 Derfeesh inchuntment. Iff un inchuntment vaes remufed, taerget fue-a aelsu sooffffers frum a Deep Vuoond fur 5...20 secunds.','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a und inffleects Bleedeeng cundeeshun (5...20 secunds). Remufe-a 1 Derfeesh inchuntment. Remufael Iffffect: inffleects Deep Vuoond cundeeshun (5...20 secunds).'],
1537=>['Veaeryeeng Streeke-a','Yuoo remufe-a 1 Derfeesh inchuntment. Iff un inchuntment vaes remufed, yuoo inffleect a Deep Vuoond fur 3...10 secunds. Yuoo sooffffer frum Veaekness fur 10 secunds iff un inchuntment is nut remufed.','Remufe-a 1 Derfeesh Inchuntment. Remufael Iffffect: Inffleects Deep Vuoond cundeeshun (3...10 secunds). Yuoo aere-a Veaekened (10 secunds) iff un inchuntment is nut lust.'],
1538=>['Lyssa\'s Aessoolt','Thees aettaeck interroopts un aecshun iff it heets. Iff yuoo aere-a inchunted, uny skeell yuoo interroopt is deesaebled fur un aeddeeshunael 1...10 secunds. Thees aettaeck dues 50% ooff nurmael daemaege-a.','Interroopts un aecshun. Iff yuoo aere-a inchunted, zee interroopted skeell is deesaebled fur un aeddeeshunael 1...10 secunds. Thees aettaeck dues 50% ooff nurmael daemaege-a.'],
1539=>['Cheelleeng Feectury','Iff it heets, thees aettaeck streekes fur +3...15 daemaege-a. Fur iaech fue-a heet vhu haes less Heaelt thun yuoo, thaet fue-a und aell aedjaecent fues aere-a stroock fur 10...30 culd daemaege-a.','Deaels +3...15 daemaege-a. Deaels 10...30 culd daemaege-a tu iaech fue-a heet vhu haes less Heaelt thun yuoo und fues aedjaecent tu thuse-a taergets.'],
1540=>['Cunfeecshun','Fur 10 secunds, yuoo gaeeen +10 aermur iff yuoo haefe-a a cundeeshun und gaeeen 1...3 Heaelt regee fur iaech cundeeshun yuoo aere-a sooffffereeng frum. Vhee thees inchuntment inds, yuoo aere-a coored ooff 1...2 cundeeshuns.','(10 secunds.) Gaeeen +10 aermur vheele-a cundeeshuned. Gaeeen 1...3 Heaelt regeneraeshun fur iaech cundeeshun yuoo haefe-a. Ind Iffffect: remufe-a 1...2 cundeeshuns.'],
1541=>['Inchunted Haeste-a','Fur 7 secunds, yuoo mufe-a 25% faester. Iff thees inchuntment inds premaetoorely, yuoo luse-a 1 cundeeshuns. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(7 secunds.) Yuoo mufe-a 25% faester. Luse-a 1 cundeeshuns iff thees inchuntment inds premaetoorely.'],
1542=>['Peeuoos Cuncentraeshun','Fur 5...20 secunds, yuoo cunnut be-a interroopted, boot iaech teeme-a yuoo vuoold haefe-a beee interroopted, yuoo luse-a 1 Derfeesh inchuntment oor Peeuoos Cuncentraeshun inds.','(5...20 secunds.) Prefents interroopts. Prefenshun cust: yuoo luse-a oone-a Derfeesh inchuntment oor Peeuoos Cuncentraeshun inds.'],
1543=>['Peeuoos Haeste-a','Yuoo remufe-a 1 Derfeesh inchuntment und fur 1...7 secunds yuoo mufe-a 25% faester. Iff un inchuntment vaes remufed yuoo roon 50% faester insteaed.','(1...7 secunds.) Luse-a 1 Derfeesh inchuntment und mufe-a 25% faester. Remufael Iffffect: Roon 50% faester insteaed.'],
1544=>['Vhurleeng Chaerge-a','Fur 1...6 secunds, yuoo mufe-a 33% faester thun nurmael. Zee next teeme-a yuoo streeke-a a fue-a, aell oozeer neaerby fues taeke-a 10...60 culd daemaege-a und thees inchuntment inds.','(1...6 secunds.) Yuoo mufe-a 33% faester. Deael 10...60 culd daemaege-a tu aell oozeer neaerby fues zee next teeme-a yuoo heet a fue-a und thees inchuntment inds.'],
1545=>['Test ooff Faeeet','Deaels 15...75 culd daemaege-a und taekes 1 inchuntment frum taerget fue-a. Iff thaet fue-a vaes nut inchunted, thaet fue-a is Daezed fur 2...6 secunds.','Deaels 15...75 culd daemaege-a und remufes 1 inchuntment. Taerget fue-a is Daezed fur 2...6 secunds iff thaet fue-a vaes nut inchunted.'],
1546=>['Blaezeeng Speaer','Iff thees aettaeck heets, it deaels +5...25 daemaege-a und sets taerget fue-a oon Fure-a fur 1...3 secunds.','Deaels +5...25 daemaege-a. Inffleects Boorneeng cundeeshun (1...3 secunds).'],
1547=>['Meeghty Throo','Yuoor speaer mufes three-a teemes faester. Iff it heets, yuoo deael +10...40 daemaege-a.','Deaels +10...40 daemaege-a. Thees speaer mufes three-a teemes faester.'],
1548=>['Crooel Speaer','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo deael +10...50 daemaege-a. Iff it heets a nun-mufeeng taerget, yuoo inffleect a Deep Vuoond fur 5...20 secunds.','Deaels +10...50 daemaege-a. Inffleects Deep Vuoond cundeeshun (5...20 secunds) iff taerget is nut mufeeng.'],
1549=>['Haerreeer\'s Tuss','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo deael +5...20 daemaege-a. Iff thees aettaeck heets a mufeeng fue-a, it deaels un aeddeeshunael 5...40 daemaege-a.','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Deaels 5...40 mure-a daemaege-a iff taerget is mufeeng.'],
1550=>['Unbluckaeble-a Throo','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo deael +10...40 daemaege-a. Thees aettaeck cunnut be-a blucked.','Deaels +10...40 daemaege-a. Unbluckaeble-a.'],
1551=>['Speaer ooff Leeghtneeng','Streekes aell fues betveee yuoo und yuoor taerget. Iff thees aettaeck heets, it deaels +10...20 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Thees aettaeck haes 25% aermur penetraeshun.','Deaels +10...20 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. 25% aermur penetraeshun. Streekes aell fues betveee yuoo und yuoor taerget.'],
1552=>['Veaeryeeng Speaer','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo deael +10...40 daemaege-a. Yuoo aere-a Veaekened fur 5 secunds.','Deaels +10...40 daemaege-a. Yuoo aere-a Veaekened (5 secunds).'],
1553=>['Unzeem ooff Foory','Fur 10 secunds, aell paerty members veetheen iaershut gaeeen 2...5 streekes ooff aedrenaeleene-a zee next teeme-a zeey use-a un aettaeck skeell.','(10 secunds.) Paerty members in iaershut gaeeen 2...5 aedrenaeleene-a veet zeeur next aettaeck skeell.'],
1554=>['Creeppleeng Unzeem','Fur 10 secunds, zee next aettaeck skeell used by iaech aelly veetheen iaershut cooses Creeppleeng fur 5...15 secunds.','(10 secunds.) Aelleees in iaershut inffleect Creeppled cundeeshun (5...15 secunds) veet zeeur next aettaeck skeell. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
1555=>['Deffenseefe-a Unzeem','Fur 4...10 secunds, iaech paerty member veetheen iaershut haes a 50% chunce-a tu bluck incumeeng aettaecks. Thees chunt inds iff thaet paerty member heets veet un aettaeck skeell.','(4...10 secunds.) Paerty members in iaershut haefe-a 50% chunce-a tu bluck. Inds vhee heetteeng veet un aettaeck skeell.'],
1556=>['Gudspeed','Fur 5...20 secunds, aell aelleees veetheen iaershut mufe-a 25% faester vheele-a under zee iffffects ooff un inchuntment.','(5...20 secunds.) Aelleees in iaershut mufe-a 25% faester vheele-a inchunted.'],
1557=>['Unzeem ooff Flaeme-a','Fur 10 secunds, zee next aettaeck skeell used by iaech paerty member veetheen iaershut aelsu cooses Boorneeng fur 1...5 secunds.','(10 secunds.) Paerty members in iaershut inffleect Boorneeng cundeeshun (1...5 secunds) veet zeeur next aettaeck skeell.'],
1558=>['"Gu fur zee Iyes!"','Fur 10 secunds, zee next teeme-a iaech aelly veetheen iaershut maekes un aettaeck, thaet aettaeck haes un aeddeeshunael 30...100% chunce-a tu creeteecael.','(10 secunds.) Aelleees in iaershut haefe-a +30...100% chunce-a tu lund a creeteecael heet veet zeeur next aettaeck.'],
1559=>['Unzeem ooff Infy','Fur 10 secunds, zee next aettaeck skeell used by iaech aelly veetheen iaershut deaels +10...25 daemaege-a aegaeeenst fues veet mure-a thun 50% Heaelt.','(10 secunds.) Aelleees in iaershut du +10...25 daemaege-a veet zeeur next aettaeck skeell. Daemaege-a bunoos oonly aeppleees tu fues veet mure-a thun 50% Heaelt.'],
1560=>['Sung ooff Pooer','Fur 5...20 secunds, iaech aelly veetheen iaershut gaeeens 4 Inergy regeneraeshun unteel thaet aelly uses a skeell.','(5...20 secunds.) Aelleees in iaershut gaeeen +4 Inergy regeneraeshun. Inds vhee useeng a skeell.'],
1561=>['Zeaeluoos Unzeem','Fur 10 secunds, zee next teeme-a iaech aelly veetheen iaershut uses un aettaeck skeell, thaet aelly gaeeens 1...8 Inergy.','(10 secunds.) Aelleees in iaershut gaeeen 1...8 Inergy veet zeeur next aettaeck skeell.'],
1562=>['Aereea ooff Zeael','Fur 10 secunds, zee next teeme-a iaech aelly veetheen iaershut uses a spell, thaet aelly gaeeens 1...6 Inergy.','(10 secunds.) Aelleees in iaershut gaeeen 1...6 Inergy veet zeeur next spell.'],
1563=>['Lyreec ooff Zeael','Fur 10 secunds, zee next teeme-a iaech aelly veetheen iaershut uses a seegnet, thaet aelly gaeeens 1...8 Inergy.','(10 secunds.) Aelleees in iaershut gaeeen 1...8 Inergy veet zeeur next seegnet.'],
1564=>['Baellaed ooff Resturaeshun','Fur 10 secunds, zee next teeme-a iaech paerty member veetheen iaershut taekes daemaege-a, thaet paerty member gaeeens 15...75 Heaelt.','(10 secunds.) Paerty members in iaershut gaeeen 15...75 Heaelt zee next teeme-a zeey taeke-a daemaege-a.'],
1565=>['Churoos ooff Resturaeshun','Fur 10 secunds, zee next teeme-a iaech aelly veetheen iaershut uses a shuoot oor chunt, thaet aelly is heaeled fur 30...90 Heaelt.','(10 secunds.) Aelleees in iaershut aere-a heaeled fur 30...90 veet zeeur next shuoot oor chunt.'],
1566=>['Aereea ooff Resturaeshun','Fur 10 secunds, zee next teeme-a iaech paerty member veetheen iaershut uses a spell, thaet paerty member gaeeens 30...90 Heaelt.','(10 secunds.) Paerty members in iaershut gaeeen 30...90 Heaelt veet zeeur next spell.'],
1567=>['Sung ooff Cuncentraeshun','Fur 10 secunds, zee next skeell used by iaech aelly veetheen iaershut cunnut be-a interroopted.','(10 secunds.) Aelleees in iaershut aere-a uneenterroopteeble-a veet zeeur next skeell.'],
1568=>['Unzeem ooff Gooeedunce-a','Fur 10 secunds, zee next aettaeck skeell used by iaech paerty member veetheen iaershut cunnut be-a blucked.','(10 secunds.) Paerty members in iaershut aere-a unbluckaeble-a veet zeeur next aettaeck skeell.'],
1569=>['Inergeezeeng Churoos','Fur 10 secunds, zee next shuoot oor chunt used by iaech aelly veetheen iaershut custs 3...7 less Inergy.','(10 secunds.) Zee next shuoot oor chunt custs 3...7 less Inergy fur aelleees in iaershut. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
1570=>['Sung ooff Pooreeffeecaeshun','Fur 20 secunds, zee next 1...6 skeells used by iaech aelly veetheen iaershut remufe-a 1 cundeeshun frum thaet aelly.','(20 secunds.) Aelleees in iaershut luse-a oone-a cundeeshun veet zeeur next 1...6 skeells.'],
1571=>['Hexbreaeker Aereea','Fur 10 secunds, zee next teeme-a iaech aelly veetheen iaershut caests a spell, thaet aelly luses 1 hex.','(10 secunds.) Aelleees in iaershut luse-a oone-a hex veet zeeur next spell.'],
1572=>['"Braece-a Yuoorselff!"','Fur 5...15 secunds, zee next teeme-a taerget oozeer aelly vuoold be-a knucked doon, aell neaerby fues taeke-a 15...75 daemaege-a insteaed.','(5...15 secunds.) Prefents zee next knuck-doon und deaels 15...75 daemaege-a tu aell fues neaer taerget aelly. Cunnut selff-taerget.'],
1573=>['Aeve-a','Iff thees skeell heets a knucked-doon fue-a, thaet fue-a becumes Daezed fur 5...15 secunds.','Inffleects Daezed cundeeshun (5...15 secunds). Nu iffffect unless taerget is knucked-doon.'],
1574=>['Indooreeng Haermuny','Fur 10...35 secunds, chunts und shuoots laest 50% lunger oon taerget nun-spureet aelly.','(10...35 secunds.) Chunts und shuoots laest 50% lunger oon taerget aelly. Cunnut taerget spureets.'],
1575=>['Blaezeeng Feenaele-a','Fur 10...35 secunds, vhenefer a chunt oor shuoot inds oon taerget nun-spureet aelly, aell fues aedjaecent tu thaet aelly aere-a set oon Fure-a fur 1...7 secunds.','(10...35 secunds.) Inffleects Boorneeng cundeeshun (1...7 secunds) tu aedjaecent fues vhenefer a chunt oor shuoot inds oon taerget aelly. Cunnut taerget spureets.'],
1576=>['Boorneeng Reffraeeen','Fur 20 secunds, iff taerget nun-spureet aelly heets a fue-a veet mure-a Heaelt thun thaet aelly, thaet fue-a is set oon Fure-a fur 1...3 secunds. Thees ichu is reaeppleeed ifery teeme-a a chunt oor shuoot inds oon thaet aelly.','(20 secunds.) Inffleects Boorneeng cundeeshun (1...3 secunds) iff taerget aelly heets a fue-a veet mure-a Heaelt. Renooael: Vhenefer a chunt oor shuoot inds oon thaet aelly. Cunnut taerget spureets.'],
1577=>['Feenaele-a ooff Resturaeshun','Fur 10...35 secunds, vhenefer a chunt oor shuoot inds oon taerget nun-spureet aelly, thaet aelly is heaeled fur 15...75 Heaelt.','(10...35 secunds.) Taerget aelly gaeeens 15...75 Heaelt vhenefer a shuoot oor chunt inds oon thaet aelly. Cunnut taerget spureets.'],
1578=>['Mendeeng Reffraeeen','Fur 15 secunds, taerget nun-spureet aelly haes +2...3 Heaelt regeneraeshun. Thees ichu is reaeppleeed ifery teeme-a a chunt oor shuoot inds oon thaet aelly.','(15 secunds.) Taerget aelly haes +2...3 Heaelt regeneraeshun. Renooael: Vhenefer a chunt oor shuoot inds oon thaet aelly. Cunnut taerget spureets.'],
1579=>['Pooreeffyeeng Feenaele-a','Fur 10...35 secunds, taerget nun-spureet aelly luses 1 cundeeshun vhenefer a chunt oor shuoot inds oon thaet aelly.','(10...35 secunds.) Taerget aelly luses oone-a cundeeshun vhenefer a chunt oor shuoot inds oon thaet aelly. Cunnut taerget spureets.'],
1580=>['Blaedetoorn Reffraeeen','Fur 20 secunds, taerget nun-spureet aelly haes a 5...20% chunce-a tu bluck incumeeng aettaecks. Thees ichu is reaeppleeed ifery teeme-a a chunt oor shuoot inds oon thaet aelly.','(20 secunds.) Taerget aelly haes a 5...20% chunce-a tu bluck. Renooael: Vhenefer a chunt oor shuoot inds oon thaet aelly. Cunnut taerget spureets.'],
1581=>['Glooeeng Seegnet','Iff taerget fue-a is Boorneeng, yuoo gaeeen 5...15 Inergy.','Yuoo gaeeen 5...15 Inergy iff taerget fue-a is Boorneeng.'],
1583=>['Leaeder\'s Zeael','Fur iaech neaerby aelly, yuoo gaeeen 2...4 Inergy (maexeemoom 8...12 Inergy).','Yuoo gaeeen 2...4 Inergy (maexeemoom 8...12 Inergy) fur iaech neaerby aelly.'],
1584=>['Leaeder\'s Cumffurt','Yuoo gaeeen 30...75 Heaelt. Fur iaech aelly veetheen iaershut, yuoo aelsu gaeeen +10...20 Heaelt (maexeemoom 140 Heaelt).','Yuoo gaeeen 30...75 Heaelt. Yuoo aelsu gaeeen 10...20 Heaelt (maexeemoom 140) fur iaech aelly in iaershut.'],
1585=>['Seegnet ooff Synergy','Taerget oozeer aelly is heaeled fur 40...100 Heaelt. Iff yuoo aere-a nut under zee iffffects ooff un inchuntment, yuoo aere-a aelsu heaeled fur 40...100 Heaelt.','Heael taerget aelly fur 40...100. Yuoo aere-a aelsu heaeled fur 40...100 iff yuoo aere-a nut inchunted. Cunnut selff-taerget.'],
1586=>['Ungeleec Prutecshun','Fur 10 secunds, uny teeme-a taerget oozeer aelly taekes mure-a thun 250...80 daemaege-a per secund, thaet aelly is heaeled fur uny daemaege-a oofer thaet aemuoont.','(10 secunds.) Iaech secund thaet taerget aelly taekes daemaege-a oofer 250...80, thaet aelly is heaeled fur uny daemaege-a oofer thaet aemuoont. Cunnut selff taerget.'],
1587=>['Ungeleec Bund','Fur 10 secunds, zee next teeme-a un aelly veetheen iaershut vuoold taeke-a faetael daemaege-a, thaet daemaege-a is negaeted und thaet aelly is heaeled fur 20...200 Heaelt. Ungeleec Bund inds oon aell oozeer aelleees.','(10 secunds.) Zee next teeme-a un aelly veetheen iaershut vuoold taeke-a faetael daemaege-a, thaet daemaege-a is negaeted und thaet aelly is heaeled fur 20...200. Inds oon aell oozeer aelleees.'],
1588=>['Cootery Seegnet','Aell paerty members luse-a aell cundeeshuns. Yuoo aere-a set oon Fure-a fur 1 secund fur iaech cundeeshun remufed in thees vaey.','Aell paerty members luse-a aell cundeeshuns. Yuoo begeen Boorneeng (oone-a secund fur iaech cundeeshun remufed).'],
1589=>['"Stund Yuoor Gruoond!"','Fur 5...20 secunds, aell paerty members veetheen iaershut receeefe-a +24 aermur vhee nut mufeeng.','(5...20 secunds.) Paerty members in iaershut gaeeen +24 aermur vhee nut mufeeng.'],
1590=>['"Leaed zee Vaey!"','Taerget aelly mufes 25% faester fur 1...5 secunds fur iaech aelly veetheen iaershut (maexeemoom ooff 30 secunds).','Taerget aelly mufes 25% faester fur 1...5 secunds (maexeemoom ooff 30 secunds) fur iaech aelly in iaershut.'],
1591=>['"Maeke-a Haeste-a!"','Fur 5...20 secunds, taerget oozeer aelly mufes 33% faester. Thees skeell inds iff thaet aelly sooccessffoolly heets veet un aettaeck.','(5...20 secunds.) Taerget aelly mufes 33% faester. Inds iff taerget aelly heets veet un aettaeck. Cunnut selff-taerget.'],
1592=>['"Ve-a Shaell Retoorn!"','Aell paerty members in iaershut aere-a resoorrected veet 25...50% Heaelt und 5...20% Inergy.','Aell paerty members in iaershut aere-a resoorrected (25...50% Heaelt und 5...20% Inergy).'],
1593=>['"Nefer Geefe-a Up!"','Aell aelleees veetheen iaershut und beloo 75% Heaelt gaeeen 1...10 Inergy.','Aelleees in iaershut gaeeen 1...10 Inergy. Oonly aeffffects aelleees beloo 75% Heaelt.'],
1594=>['"Help!"','Taerget nun-spureet aelly gaeeens 15...90 Heaelt. Fur 1...10 secunds, oozeer aelleees\' spells taergeteeng thaet aelly caest 50% faester.','(1...10 secunds.) Taerget nun-spureet aelly gaeeens 15...90 heaelt, aelleeed spells taergeteeng zeem caest 50% faester.'],
1595=>['"Faell Baeck!"','Fur 4...10 secunds, aell aelleees veetheen iaershut gaeeen 5...15 Heaelt per secund vheele-a mufeeng und mufe-a 33% faester. "Faell Baeck!" inds oon un aelly aeffffected by thees shuoot vhee thaet aelly sooccessffoolly heets veet un aettaeck.','(4...10 secunds.) Aelleees in iaershut gaeeen 5...15 Heaelt per secund vheele-a mufeeng und mufe-a 33% faester. Inds fur un aelly iff thaet aelly heets veet un aettaeck.'],
1596=>['"Incumeeng!"','Fur 4...10 secunds, aell aelleees veetheen iaershut mufe-a 33% faester und gaeeen 5...15 Heaelt per secund vheele-a mufeeng.','(4...10 secunds.) Aelleees in iaershut mufe-a 33% faester und gaeeen 5...15 Heaelt per secund vheele-a mufeeng.'],
1597=>['"Zeey\'re-a oon Fure-a!"','Fur 10 secunds, paerty members veetheen iaershut taeke-a 5...35% less daemaege-a frum fues sooffffereeng frum Boorneeng.','(10 secunds.) Paerty members in iaershut taeke-a 5...35% less daemaege-a frum Boorneeng fues.'],
1598=>['"Nefer Soorrender!"','Fur 15 secunds, aell paerty members veetheen iaershut und beloo 75% Heaelt gaeeen +1...5 Heaelt regeneraeshun.','(15 secunds.) Paerty members in iaershut gaeeen +1...5 Heaelt regeneraeshun. Oonly aeffffects paerty members beloo 75% Heaelt.'],
1599=>['"It\'s Joost a Flesh Vuoond."','Taerget oozeer aelly luses aell cundeeshuns. Iff a cundeeshun vaes remufed in thees vaey, thaet aelly mufes 25% faester fur 1...10 secunds.','Remufe-a aell cundeeshuns frum taerget aelly. Thaet aelly mufes 25% faester (1...10 secunds) iff a cundeeshun vaes remufed. Cunnut selff-taerget.'],
1600=>['Baerbed Speaer','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoor taerget begeens Bleedeeng fur 5...20 secunds.','Inffleects Bleedeeng cundeeshun (5...20 secunds).'],
1601=>['Feeceeuoos Aettaeck','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo deael +5...20 daemaege-a. Iff yuoo lund a creeteecael heet veet thees aettaeck, taerget fue-a sooffffers frum a Deep Vuoond fur 5...15 secunds.','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Inffleects Deep Vuoond cundeeshun (5...15 secunds) veet a creeteecael heet.'],
1602=>['Stoonneeng Streeke-a','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo deael +10...50 daemaege-a. Iff it heets a fue-a sooffffereeng frum a cundeeshun, thaet fue-a is aelsu Daezed fur 4...10 secunds.','Deaels +10...50 daemaege-a. Inffleects Daezed cundeeshun (4...10 secunds) iff taerget haes a cundeeshun.'],
1603=>['Merceeless Speaer','Iff thees aettaeck heets a fue-a veet less thun 50% Heaelt, thaet fue-a sooffffers frum a Deep Vuoond fur 5...20 secunds.','Inffleects Deep Vuoond cundeeshun (5...20 secunds). Nu iffffect unless taerget haes less thun 50% Heaelt.'],
1604=>['Deesroopteeng Throo','Iff thees aettaeck heets a fue-a sooffffereeng frum a cundeeshun, thaet fue-a is interroopted.','Interroopts aecshuns. Nu iffffect unless taerget haes a cundeeshun.'],
1605=>['Veeld Throo','Iff thees aettaeck heets, it deaels +5...20 daemaege-a, und uny stunce-a beeeng used by yuoor taerget inds. Thees aettaeck cunnut be-a blucked. Aell ooff yuoor nun-speaer aettaeck skeells aere-a deesaebled fur 3 secunds.','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Unbluckaeble-a. Inds taerget\'s stunce-a.Deesaebles yuoor nun-speaer aettaeck skeells fur 3 secunds.'],
1633=>['Maeleeceeuoos Streeke-a','Iff thees aettaeck heets a fue-a sooffffereeng frum a cundeeshun, yuoo deael +10...30 daemaege-a und thees aettaeck resoolts in a creeteecael heet.','Iff taerget fue-a haes a cundeeshun, thees aettaeck deaels +10...30 daemaege-a und is a creeteecael heet.'],
1634=>['Shaettereeng Aessoolt','Moost fulloo un ooffff-hund aettaeck. Iff it heets, yuoo deael 5...50 daemaege-a und taerget fue-a luses oone-a inchuntment. Thees aettaeck cunnut be-a blucked.','Deaels 5...50 daemaege-a. Remufes oone-a inchuntment. Unbluckaeble-a. Moost fulloo un ooffff-hund aettaeck.'],
1635=>['Guldee Skooll Streeke-a','Iff yuoo aere-a under zee iffffects ooff un inchuntment und thees aettaeck heets, taerget fue-a is Daezed 1...12 secunds.','Inffleects Daezed cundeeshun (1...12 secunds). Nu iffffect unless yuoo aere-a inchunted.'],
1636=>['Blaeck Speeder Streeke-a','Moost streeke-a a hexed fue-a. Iff it heets, thees aettaeck streekes fur +5...20 daemaege-a und taerget fue-a is Pueesuned fur 5...20 secunds.','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Inffleects Pueesuned cundeeshun (5...20 secunds). Moost streeke-a a hexed fue-a.'],
1637=>['Guldee Fux Streeke-a','Iff thees aettaeck heets, taerget fue-a taekes +10...30 daemaege-a. Iff yuoo aere-a under zee iffffects ooff un inchuntment, thees aettaeck cunnut be-a blucked.','Deaels +10...30 daemaege-a. Unbluckaeble-a iff yuoo aere-a inchunted.'],
1638=>['Deaedly Haeste-a','Fur 10...35 secunds, haelff-runged spells caest 5...50% faester und rechaerge-a 5...60% faester.','(10...35 secunds.) Yuoor haelff-runged spells caest 5...50% faester und rechaerge-a 5...60% faester.'],
1639=>['Aessaesseen\'s Remedy','Fur 30 secunds, zee next 1...10 aettaeck skeells yuoo use-a remufe-a oone-a cundeeshun.','(30 secunds.) Yuoor next 1...10 aettaeck skeells iaech remufe-a oone-a cundeeshun.'],
1640=>['Fux\'s Prumeese-a','Fur 5...20 secunds, yuoor daegger aettaecks cunnut be-a blucked. Thees inchuntment inds zee next teeme-a yuoo faeeel tu heet.','(5...20 secunds.) Yuoor daegger aettaecks aere-a unbluckaeble-a. Inds zee next teeme-a yuoo faeeel tu heet.'],
1641=>['Feeegned Neootraeleety','Fur 4...10 secunds, yuoo haefe-a +7 Heaelt regeneraeshun und +80 aermur. Thees inchuntment inds iff yuoo sooccessffoolly heet veet un aettaeck oor use-a a skeell.','(4...10 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +7 Heaelt regeneraeshun und +80 aermur. Inds iff yuoo heet veet un aettaeck oor use-a a skeell.'],
1642=>['Heeddee Caeltrups','Yuoor nun-Aessaesseen skeells aere-a deesaebled fur 3 secunds. Fur 1...10 secunds, taerget fue-a mufes 50% slooer. Vhee thees hex inds thaet fue-a is creeppled fur 1...15 secunds.','(1...10 secunds.) Cooses 50% slooer mufement. Ind iffffect: inffleects Creeppled cundeeshun (1...15 secunds). Yuoor nun-Aessaesseen skeells aere-a deesaebled (3 secunds).'],
1643=>['Aessoolt Inchuntments','Moost fulloo a dooael aettaeck. Taerget fue-a luses aell inchuntments.','Remufes aell inchuntments. Moost fulloo a dooael aettaeck.'],
1644=>['Vaestrel\'s Cullaepse-a','Shaedoo Step tu taerget fue-a. Iff taerget fue-a is nut useeng a skeell, thaet fue-a is knucked doon. Aell ooff yuoor nun-daegger aettaeck skeells aere-a deesaebled fur 10 secunds.','Shaedoo Step tu taerget fue-a. Cooses knuck-doon iff taerget fue-a is nut useeng a skeell. Deesaebles yuoor nun-daegger aettaeck skeells (10 secunds).'],
1645=>['Leefft Inchuntment','Iff taerget tuooched fue-a is knucked doon, thaet fue-a luses oone-a inchuntment.','Remufes oone-a inchuntment.Nu iffffect unless taerget fue-a is knucked-doon.'],
1646=>['Oogoory ooff Deaet','Fur 5...35 secunds, zee next teeme-a daemaege-a vuoold drup taerget fue-a\'s Heaelt beloo 50%, yuoo inffleect a Deep Vuoond fur 5...20 secunds und Shaedoo Step tu thaet fue-a. Thees spell haes haelff zee nurmael runge-a.','(5...35 secunds.) Inffleect Deep Vuoond cundeeshun (5...20 secunds) und Shaedoo Step tu taerget fue-a zee next teeme-a daemaege-a vuoold drup thees fue-a\'s Heaelt beloo 50%. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
1647=>['Seegnet ooff Tuxeec Shuck','Iff taerget fue-a is sooffffereeng frum Pueesun, thaet fue-a taekes 10...100 daemaege-a.','Deaels 10...100 daemaege-a. Nu iffffect unless taerget fue-a is Pueesuned.'],
1648=>['Seegnet ooff Tveeleeght','Fur iaech hex oon taerget fue-a, thaet fue-a luses oone-a inchuntment.','Remufes oone-a inchuntment fur iaech hex oon taerget fue-a.'],
1649=>['Vaey ooff zee Aessaesseen','Fur zee next 20 secunds vheele-a veeeldeeng daeggers, yuoo aettaeck 5...20% faester und haefe-a a +5...35% chunce-a tu lund a creeteecael heet.','(20 secunds.) Vheele-a veeeldeeng daeggers, yuoo aettaeck 5...20% faester und haefe-a +5...35% chunce-a tu lund a creeteecael heet.'],
1650=>['Shaedoo Vaelk','Shaedoo Step tu taerget fue-a. Fur 15 secunds, nutheeng haeppens. Yuoor aettaeck skeells aere-a deesaebled fur 1 secund, und yuoor stunces und inchuntments aere-a deesaebled fur 10 secunds. Vhee thees stunce-a inds, yuoo retoorn tu yuoor ooreegeenael lucaeshun.','(15 secunds.) Shaedoo Step tu taerget fue-a. Ind iffffect: retoorn tu yuoor ooreegeenael lucaeshun. Deesaebles yuoor aettaeck skeells fur 1 secund. Deesaebles yuoor inchuntments und stunces fur 10 secunds.'],
1651=>['Deaet\'s Retreaet','Shaedoo Step tu taerget aelly. Iff yuoo haefe-a less Heaelt thun thaet aelly, yuoo gaeeen 40...130 Heaelt.','Gaeeen 40...130 Heaelt iff yuoo haefe-a less Heaelt thun taerget aelly. Ineeteeael iffffect: Shaedoo Step tu thees aelly. Cunnut selff-taerget.'],
1652=>['Shaedoo Preesun','Shaedoo Step tu taerget fue-a. Fur 1...7 secunds, thaet fue-a mufes 66% slooer.','Shaedoo Step tu taerget fue-a. Thees fue-a mufes 66% slooer (1...7 secunds).'],
1653=>['Svaep','Yuoo und taerget soommuned creaetoore-a Shaedoo Step tu iaech oozeer\'s lucaeshun.','Yuoo und taerget soommuned creaetoore-a Shaedoo Step tu iaech oozeer\'s lucaeshuns.'],
1654=>['Shaedoo Meld','Shaedoo Step tu taerget oozeer aelly. Vhee yuoo stup maeeentaeeeneeng thees inchuntment, yuoo retoorn tu yuoor ooreegeenael lucaeshun.','Shaedoo Step tu taerget aelly. Ind iffffect: retoorn tu yuoor ooreegeenael lucaeshun. Cunnut selff-taerget.'],
1655=>['Preece-a ooff Preede-a','Fur 5 secunds, zee next teeme-a taerget fue-a uses un ileete-a skeell, thaet fue-a luses 3...15 Inergy.','(5 secunds.) Cooses 3...15 Inergy luss zee next teeme-a taerget fue-a uses un ileete-a skeell.'],
1656=>['Aeur ooff Deesenchuntment','Remufe-a oone-a inchuntment frum taerget fue-a und aell neaerby fues. Fur 5...20 secunds, inchuntments ixpure-a 150...300% faester oon thuse-a fues.','Aelsu hexes fues neaer yuoor taerget (5...20 secunds). Remufe-a oone-a inchuntment frum taerget und neaerby fues. Inchuntments ixpure-a 150...300% faester oon thuse-a fues.'],
1657=>['Seegnet ooff Cloomseeness','Iff taerget fue-a is aettaeckeeng, thaet fue-a und aell aedjaecent fues aere-a interroopted und taeke-a 15...60 daemaege-a. Uny fues useeng aettaeck skeells aere-a knucked doon.','Interroopts un aettaeck fur taerget fue-a und aell aedjaecent fues. Interroopshun iffffect: deaels 15...60 daemaege-a; knucks doon fues useeng aettaeck skeells.'],
1658=>['Symbuleec Pustoore-a','Fur 5...20 secunds, zee next seegnet yuoo aecteefaete-a rechaerges 20...80% faester.','(5...20 secunds.) Yuoor next seegnet rechaerges 20...80% faester.'],
1659=>['Tuxeec Cheell','Taerget fue-a is stroock fur 15...75 culd daemaege-a. Iff thaet fue-a is under zee iffffects ooff a hex oor inchuntment, thaet fue-a becumes Pueesuned fur 10...25 secunds.','Deaels 15...75 culd daemaege-a. Inffleects Pueesuned cundeeshun (10...25 secunds) iff taerget fue-a is hexed oor inchunted.'],
1660=>['Vell ooff Seelence-a','Ixplueet taerget curpse-a oor saecreeffeece-a 66% heaelt tu creaete-a a Vell ooff Seelence-a fur 10...30 secunds. Fues veetheen zee vell cunnut use-a shuoots oor chunts und sooffffer -1...4 Heaelt degeneraeshun.','(10...30 secunds.) Fues in thees vell cunnut use-a shuoots und chunts und haefe-a -1...4 Heaelt degeneraeshun. Ixplueets a fresh curpse-a oor saecreeffeeces 66% heaelt.'],
1661=>['Gloostune-a','Send a prujecteele-a thaet streekes fur 5...50 iaert daemaege-a iff it heets. Iff thees spell heets a veaekened fue-a, yuoo gaeeen 5 Inergy ploos 1 Inergy fur ifery 2 runks ooff Inergy Sturaege-a.','Prujecteele-a: deaels 5...50 iaert daemaege-a. Yuoo gaeeen 5 Inergy ploos 1 Inergy fur ifery 2 runks ooff Inergy Sturaege-a iff taerget fue-a is Veaekened.'],
1662=>['Meend Blaest','Taerget fue-a is stroock fur 15...60 fure-a daemaege-a. Iff yuoo haefe-a mure-a Inergy thun taerget fue-a, yuoo gaeeen 1...8 Inergy.','Deaels 15...60 fure-a daemaege-a. Yuoo gaeeen 1...8 Inergy iff yuoo haefe-a mure-a Inergy thun taerget fue-a.'],
1663=>['Ilementael Flaeme-a','Fur 10...35 secunds, vhenefer yuoo aepply un Ilementael hex tu a fue-a, thaet fue-a is set oon fure-a fur 1...5 secunds.','(10...35 secunds.) Inffleects Boorneeng cundeeshun (1...5 secunds) vhenefer yuoo aepply un Ilementael hex tu a taerget.'],
1664=>['Infuke-a Leeghtneeng','Taerget fue-a und up tu tvu oozeer fues neaer yuoor taerget aere-a stroock fur 10...90 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Thees spell haes 25% aermur penetraeshun.','Deaels 10...90 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Heets tvu fues neaer taerget. 25% aermur penetraeshun.'],
1683=>['Penseefe-a Gooaerdeeun','Fur 5...11 secunds, taerget aelly haes a 50% chunce-a tu bluck aettaecks frum inchunted fues.','(5...11 secunds.) 50% chunce-a tu bluck inchunted fues.'],
1684=>['Screebe-a\'s Inseeght','Fur 10...35 secunds, yuoo gaeeen 3 Inergy vhenefer yuoo use-a a seegnet.','(10...35 secunds.) Yuoo gaeeen 3 Inergy vhenefer yuoo use-a a seegnet.'],
1685=>['Huly Haeste-a','Fur 1...60 secunds, yuoor Heaeleeng Praeyers spells caest 50% faester. Thees inchuntment inds iff yuoo caest unuzeer inchuntment.','(1...60 secunds.) Yuoor Heaeleeng Praeyers spells caest 50% faester. Inds iff yuoo caest un inchuntment.'],
1686=>['Gleemmer ooff Leeght','Heael taerget aelly fur 10...115 Heaelt.','Heaels fur 10...115.'],
1687=>['Zeaeluoos Benedeecshun','Heael taerget aelly fur 30...180 Heaelt. Iff taerget vaes beloo 50% Heaelt, yuoo gaeeen 7 Inergy.','Heaels fur 30...180. Yuoo gaeeen 7 Inergy iff taerget aelly vaes beloo 50% Heaelt.'],
1688=>['Deffender\'s Zeael','Fur 10...30 secunds, vhenefer taerget fue-a heets veet un aettaeck, yuoo gaeeen 2 Inergy.','(10...30 secunds.) Yuoo gaeeen 2 Inergy vhenefer taerget fue-a heets veet un aettaeck.'],
1689=>['Seegnet ooff Mysteec Vraet','Taerget fue-a taekes 25 huly daemaege-a fur iaech inchuntment oon yuoo (maexeemoom 30...120 huly daemaege-a).','Deaels 25 huly daemaege-a fur iaech inchuntment oon yuoo (maexeemoom 30...120 huly daemaege-a).'],
1690=>['Seegnet ooff Remufael','Iff taerget aelly is under zee iffffects ooff un inchuntment, thaet aelly luses oone-a hex und oone-a cundeeshun.','Remufes oone-a hex und oone-a cundeeshun. Nu iffffect unless taerget aelly is inchunted.'],
1691=>['Deesmeess Cundeeshun','Remufe-a oone-a cundeeshun frum taerget aelly. Iff thaet aelly is under zee iffffects ooff un inchuntment, thaet aelly is heaeled fur 15...75 Heaelt.','Remufes oone-a cundeeshun. Heaels fur 15...75 iff taerget aelly is inchunted.'],
1692=>['Deefert Hexes','Remufe-a up tu 1...3 hexes frum taerget aelly. Fur iaech hex remufed in thees vaey, thaet aelly luses oone-a cundeeshun und gaeeens 15...75 Heaelt.','Remufes 1...3 hexes. Fur iaech hex remufed, taerget aelly luses oone-a cundeeshun und gaeeens 15...75 Heaelt.'],
1693=>['Cuoonteraettaeck','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +5...35 daemaege-a. Iff yuoo heet un aettaeckeeng fue-a, yuoo gaeeen 2...6 Inergy.','Deaels +5...35 daemaege-a. Yuoo gaeeen 2...6 Inergy iff taerget fue-a is aettaeckeeng.'],
1694=>['Maegehoonter Streeke-a','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +7...25 daemaege-a. Iff yuoor taerget is under zee iffffects ooff un inchuntment, thees aettaeck cunnut be-a blucked.','Deaels +7...25 daemaege-a. Unbluckaeble-a iff taerget fue-a is inchunted.'],
1695=>['Suldeeer\'s Streeke-a','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo deael +10...40 mure-a daemaege-a. Iff yuoo aere-a under zee iffffects ooff a chunt oor shuoot, thees aettaeck cunnut be-a blucked.','Deaels +10...40 daemaege-a. Unbluckaeble-a iff yuoo aere-a under zee iffffects ooff a chunt oor shuoot. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
1696=>['Decaepeetaete-a','Yuoo luse-a aell aedrenaeleene-a und aell Inergy. Thees aettaeck is unbluckaeble-a, yuoo deael +5...80 daemaege-a, und coose-a a Deep Vuoond fur 5...20 secunds. Thees aettaeck is aelvaeys creeteecael und iff fue-a is keelled, neaerby fues aere-a Veaekened fur 8 secunds.','Deaels +5...80 daemaege-a. Inffleects Deep Vuoond cundeeshun (5...20 secunds). Ootumaeteec creeteecael heet. Iff fue-a is keelled, neaerby fues aere-a Veaekened (8 secunds). Yuoo luse-a aell aedrenaeleene-a und Inergy.'],
1697=>['Maegehoonter\'s Smaesh','Iff thees aettaeck heets, taerget fue-a is knucked doon. Iff yuoor taerget is under zee iffffects ooff un inchuntment, thees aettaeck cunnut be-a blucked.','Cooses knuck-doon. Unbluckaeble-a iff taerget fue-a is inchunted.'],
1698=>['Suldeeer\'s Stunce-a','Fur 5...15 secunds, yuoo haefe-a a 75% chunce-a tu bluck. Yuoo aettaeck 33% faester vheele-a under zee iffffects ooff a shuoot oor chunt.','(5...15 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a a 75% chunce-a tu bluck. Yuoo aettaeck 33% faester vheele-a under zee iffffects ooff a shuoot oor chunt.'],
1699=>['Suldeeer\'s Deffense-a','Fur 1...6 secunds, yuoo haefe-a a 75% chunce-a tu bluck aettaecks vheele-a under zee iffffects ooff a shuoot oor chunt. Yuoo gaeeen 1 streeke-a ooff aedrenaeleene-a fur iaech blucked aettaeck.','(1...6 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a 75% chunce-a tu bluck vheele-a under zee iffffects ooff a shuoot oor chunt. Bluck iffffect: gaeeen 1 aedrenaeleene-a.'],
1700=>['Frenzeeed Deffense-a','Fur 8 secunds, yuoo haefe-a a 75% chunce-a tu bluck incumeeng aettaecks, boot taeke-a duooble-a daemaege-a.','(8 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a 75% chunce-a tu bluck. Yuoo taeke-a duooble-a daemaege-a.'],
1701=>['Steaedy Stunce-a','Fur 10 secunds, zee next teeme-a yuoo vuoold be-a knucked doon, yuoo gaeeen 1...4 streeke-as ooff aedrenaeleene-a und 1...7 Inergy insteaed.','(10 secunds.) Zee next teeme-a yuoo vuoold be-a knucked-doon, yuoo gaeeen 1...4 aedrenaeleene-a und 1...7 Inergy insteaed. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
1702=>['Steelffung Slaesh','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo deael +1...31 daemaege-a. Iff yuoo heet a fue-a thaet is knucked doon, yuoo gaeeen 1...5 aedrenaeleene-a.','Deaels +1...31 daemaege-a. Yuoo gaeeen 1...5 aedrenaeleene-a iff taerget fue-a is knucked-doon.'],
1719=>['Screaemeeng Shut','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo deael +10...25 daemaege-a. Iff yuoor taerget is veetheen iaershut, thaet fue-a begeens Bleedeeng fur 5...20 secunds.','Deaels +10...25 daemaege-a. Inffleects Bleedeeng cundeeshun (5...20 secunds) iff taerget fue-a is veetheen iaershut.'],
1720=>['Keee Aerroo','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +5...20 daemaege-a. Iff yuoo lund a creeteecael heet, yuoo deael un aeddeeshunael +5...25 daemaege-a.','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Deaels +5...25 mure-a daemaege-a iff yuoo lund a creeteecael heet.'],
1721=>['Raempaege-a aes Oone-a','Fur 3...15 secunds, but yuoo und yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun aettaeck 33% faester und roon 25% faester.','(3...15 secunds.) Yuoo und yuoor pet aettaeck 33% faester und mufe-a 25% faester. Nu iffffect unless yuoor pet is aeleefe-a.'],
1722=>['Furked Aerroo','Shuut tvu aerroos seemooltuneuoosly aet taerget fue-a. Iff yuoo aere-a under zee iffffects ooff un inchuntment oor hex, yuoo shuut oonly oone-a aerroo.','Yuoo shuut tvu aerroos seemooltuneuoosly. Shuut oonly oone-a aerroo iff yuoo aere-a inchunted oor hexed.'],
1723=>['Deesroopteeng Aeccooraecy','Fur 36 secunds, vhenefer yuoor aerroos creeteecael, zeey aelsu interroopt yuoor taerget. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(36 secunds.) Interroopts un aecshun vhenefer yuoor aerroos creeteecael.'],
1724=>['Ixpert\'s Dextereety','Fur 1...20 secunds, yuoo aettaeck 33% faester und yuoor Maerksmunsheep aettreeboote-a is increaesed by 2.','(1...20 secunds.) Yuoo aettaeck 33% faester und yuoo gaeeen +2 tu yuoor Maerksmunsheep aettreeboote-a.'],
1725=>['Ruaereeng Veends','Creaete-a a lefel 1...10 spureet. Chunts und shuoots cust 1...5 mure-a Inergy. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...180 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...10 spureet (30...180 secund leeffespun). Chunts und shuoots cust 1...5 mure-a Inergy fur creaetoores in runge-a.'],
1726=>['Maegebune-a Shut','Iff thees aettaeck heets, it interroopts taerget fue-a\'s aecshun. Iff thaet aecshun vaes a spell, it is deesaebled fur un aeddeeshunael 10 secunds. Thees aettaeck cunnut be-a blucked.','Interroopts un aecshun. Interroopshun iffffect: un interroopted spell is deesaebled fur +10 secunds. Unbluckaeble-a.'],
1727=>['Naetoorael Streede-a','Fur 1...8 secunds, yuoo roon 33% faester und haefe-a a 50% chunce-a tu bluck incumeeng aettaecks. Naetoorael Streede-a inds iff yuoo becume-a hexed oor inchunted.','(1...8 secunds.) Yuoo mufe-a 33% faester und haefe-a 50% chunce-a tu bluck. Inds iff yuoo becume-a hexed oor inchunted.'],
1728=>['Heket\'s Raempaege-a','Fur 5...11 secunds, yuoo aettaeck 33% faester. Thees stunce-a inds iff yuoo use-a un aettaeck skeell.','(5...11 secunds.) Yuoo aettaeck 33% faester. Inds iff yuoo use-a un aettaeck skeell.'],
1729=>['Smuke-a Traep','Vhee Smuke-a Traep is treeggered, fues in zee aerea aere-a Bleended und Daezed fur 5...10 secunds. Smuke-a Traep inds aeffter 90 secunds. Vheele-a aecteefaeteeng thees skeell, yuoo aere-a iaeseely interroopted.','(90 secunds.) Inffleects Bleended und Daezed cundeeshuns (5...10 secunds) tu fues in zee aerea. Iaeseely interroopted.'],
1730=>['Inffooreeaeteeng Heaet','Creaete-a a lefel 1...10 spureet. Nun-spureet creaetoores veetheen its runge-a gaeeen aedrenaeleene-a tveece-a aes faest. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...120 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...10 spureet (30...120 secund leeffespun). Duoobles aedrenaeleene-a gaeeen fur creaetoores in runge-a.'],
1731=>['Fucael Vaes Sugulun','Fur 60 secunds, aell shuoots und chunts yuoo use-a laest 20...50% lunger.','(60 secunds.) Shuoots und chunts yuoo use-a laest 20...50% lunger.'],
1732=>['Destroocteefe-a Vaes Glaeeefe-a','Huld Glaeeefe-a\'s aeshes fur up tu 30...60 secunds. Vheele-a yuoo huld her aeshes, aell Reetooaeleest skeells haefe-a 20% aermur penetraeshun. Vhee yuoo drup her aeshes, aell fues in zee aerea aere-a stroock fur 15...85 leeghtneeng daemaege-a.','(30...60 secunds.) Yuoor Reetooaeleest skeells haefe-a 20% aermur penetraeshun. Drup iffffect: deaels 15...85 leeghtneeng daemaege-a tu aell fues in zee aerea.'],
1733=>['Veeelder\'s Streeke-a','Taerget fue-a is stroock fur 10...60 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Iff yuoo aere-a under zee iffffects ooff a veaepun spell, yuoo deael un aeddeeshunael 10...50 leeghtneeng daemaege-a.','Deaels 10...60 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Deaels 10...50 mure-a leeghtneeng daemaege-a iff yuoo aere-a under a veaepun spell.'],
1734=>['Gaeze-a ooff Foory','Destruy taerget spureet und creaete-a a lefel 1...14 Spureet ooff Foory. Thees spureet\'s aettaecks deael 5...20 daemaege-a. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...60 secunds.','Destruys a spureet. Creaetes a lefel 1...14 spureet (30...60 secund leeffespun). Its aettaecks deael 5...20 daemaege-a.'],
1736=>['Spureet\'s Strengt','Fur 15...60 secunds, yuoor aettaecks deael 5...35 mure-a daemaege-a vheele-a under zee iffffects ooff a veaepun spell.','(15...60 secunds.) Yuoor aettaecks deael +5...35 daemaege-a iff yuoo aere-a under a veaepun spell.'],
1737=>['Veeelder\'s Zeael','Fur 10...40 secunds, vhenefer yuoo caest a veaepun spell oon un aelly, yuoo gaeeen 1...5 Inergy.','(10...40 secunds.) Yuoo gaeeen 1...5 Inergy vhenefer yuoo caest a veaepun spell.'],
1738=>['Seeght Beyund Seeght','Fur 8...20 secunds, yuoo cunnut be-a Bleended.','(8...20 secunds.) Yuoo aere-a immoone-a tu Bleendness.'],
1739=>['Renooeeng Memureees','Fur 5...20 secunds, vheele-a huldeeng un item, uny veaepun und item spells yuoo caest cust 5...35% less Inergy.','(5...20 secunds.) Yuoor veaepun und item spells cust 5...35% less Inergy. Nu iffffect unless huldeeng un item.'],
1740=>['Veeelder\'s Remedy','Fur 10...30 secunds, vhenefer yuoo caest a veaepun spell oon un aelly, thaet aelly luses 2 cundeeshuns.','(10...30 secunds.) Vhenefer yuoo caest a veaepun spell, zee taergeted aelly luses tvu cundeeshuns.'],
1741=>['Ghustmurrur Leeght','Taerget oozeer aelly is heaeled fur 15...90 Heaelt. Iff yuoo aere-a veetheen iaershut ooff a spureet, yuoo aere-a aelsu heaeled fur 15...90 Heaelt.','Heaels fur 15...90. Yuoo gaeeen 15...90 Heaelt iff yuoo aere-a veetheen iaershut ooff a spureet. Cunnut selff-taerget.'],
1742=>['Seegnet ooff Ghustly Meeght','Fur 5...20 secunds, aell spureets yuoo cuntrul veetheen iaershut aettaeck 33% faester und deael +5...10 daemaege-a.','(5...20 secunds.) Aell spureets yuoo cuntrul veetheen iaershut aettaeck 33% faester und deael +5...10 daemaege-a.'],
1743=>['Seegnet ooff Beendeeng','Yuoo luse-a 200...50 Heaelt und taeke-a cuntrul ooff taerget inemy-cuntrulled spureet. (50% faeeeloore-a chunce-a veet Spaevneeng Pooer 4 oor less.)','Yuoo luse-a 200...50 Heaelt. Gaeeen cuntrul ooff taerget inemy-cuntrulled spureet. 50% faeeeloore-a chunce-a unless Spaevneeng Pooer 5 oor mure-a.'],
1744=>['Caeretaeker\'s Chaerge-a','Taerget fue-a is stroock fur 20...85 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Iff yuoo aere-a huldeeng un item, yuoo gaeeen 7 Inergy und 5...50 Heaelt.','Deaels 20...85 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Yuoo gaeeen 7 Inergy und 5...50 Heaelt iff yuoo aere-a huldeeng un item. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
1745=>['Ungooeesh','Creaete-a a lefel 1...11 spureet. Thees spureet\'s aettaecks deael 5...20 daemaege-a und deael duooble-a daemaege-a tu hexed fues. Thees spureet deees aeffter 15...45 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...11 spureet (15...45 secund leeffespun). Its aettaecks deael 5...20 daemaege-a. Duooble-a daemaege-a tu hexed fues.'],
1747=>['Impooerment','Creaete-a a lefel 1...14 spureet. Aell aelleees veetheen its runge-a huldeeng un item gaeeen 15...45 maexeemoom Heaelt und 10 maexeemoom Inergy. Thees spureet deees aeffter 15...60 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...14 spureet (15...60 secund leeffespun). Aelleees in runge-a huldeeng un item gaeeen 15...45 maexeemoom Heaelt und 10 maexeemoom Inergy.'],
1748=>['Recufery','Creaete-a a lefel 1...14 spureet. Cundeeshuns oon aelleees veetheen runge-a ooff thees spureet ixpure-a 20...50% faester. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...60 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...14 spureet (30...60 secund leeffespun). Cundeeshuns oon aelleees in runge-a ixpure-a 20...50% faester.'],
1749=>['Veaepun ooff Foory','Fur 5...20 secunds, taerget aelly gaeeens 100% mure-a aedrenaeleene-a und 1 Inergy vhenefer thaet aelly sooccessffoolly heets veet un aettaeck.','(5...20 secunds.) 100% mure-a aedrenaeleene-a gaeeen und +1 Inergy vhenefer taerget aelly heets veet un aettaeck.'],
1750=>['Xeenraee-a\'s Veaepun','Fur 8 secunds, zee next teeme-a taerget aelly taekes daemaege-a frum a fue-a thaet daemaege-a is leemeeted tu 5% ooff thaet aelly\'s maex Heaelt und thaet aelly steaels up tu 20...80 Heaelt frum thaet fue-a.','(8 secunds.) Zee next teeme-a taerget aelly taekes daemaege-a frum a fue-a, thaet daemaege-a is leemeeted tu 5% ooff taerget aelly\'s maex Heaelt und thaet aelly steaels up tu 20...80 Heaelt frum thaet fue-a.'],
1751=>['Vaermunger\'s Veaepun','Fur 3...13 secunds, iff taerget aelly aettaecks a fue-a vhu is nut aettaeckeeng, thaet fue-a is interroopted.','(3...13 secunds.) Aettaecks interroopt un aecshun. Dues nut interroopt aettaeckeeng fues.'],
1752=>['Veaepun ooff Remedy','Fur 8 secunds, zee next teeme-a taerget aelly taekes daemaege-a oor leeffe-a steael frum a fue-a, thaet aelly steaels up tu 20...80 Heaelt frum thaet fue-a und luses 2 cundeeshuns.','(8 secunds.) Zee next teeme-a taerget aelly taekes daemaege-a oor leeffe-a steael frum a fue-a, thees aelly steaels 20...80 Heaelt frum thaet fue-a und luses 2 cundeeshuns.'],
1753=>['Rendeeng Sveep','Yuoo deael +5...20 daemaege-a und luse-a 1 Derfeesh inchuntment. Iff un inchuntment vaes lust, yuoo remufe-a un inchuntment frum iaech fue-a yuoo heet.','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Yuoo luse-a 1 Derfeesh inchuntment. Remufael Iffffect: stroock fues luse-a un inchuntment.'],
1754=>['Oonslooght','Fur 3...15 secunds, yuoo aettaeck, mufe-a, und gaeeen aedrenaeleene-a 25% faester.','(3...15 secunds.) Yuoo aettaeck, mufe-a, und gaeeen aedrenaeleene-a 25% faester.'],
1755=>['Mysteec Curroopshun','Aell aedjaecent fues sooffffer frum Deeseaese-a fur 1...10 secunds. Fur 20 secunds, nutheeng haeppens. Deeseaese-a dooraeshun is duoobled iff yuoo aere-a inchunted vhee yuoo aecteefaete-a thees skeell. Vhee thees inchuntment inds, aell paerty members in iaershut aere-a coored ooff Deeseaese-a.','(20 secunds.) Ineeteeael Iffffect: aell aedjaecent fues aere-a Deeseaesed (1...10 secunds). Duooble-a dooraeshun iff yuoo aere-a aelreaedy inchunted. Ind Iffffect: paerty members in iaershut luse-a Deeseaese-a.'],
1756=>['Grent\'s Graesp','Fur 20 secunds, yuoor aettaeck skeells aelsu Creepple-a thaet fue-a fur 1...11 secunds und yuoo trunsffer 1...3 cundeeshuns frum yuoorselff tu thaet fue-a.','(20 secunds.) Inffleect Creepple-a (1...11 secunds) veet yuoor aettaeck skeells und trunsffer 1...3 cundeeshuns.'],
1757=>['Feeel ooff Thurns','Vhee yuoo caest thees inchuntment, aell neaerby fues aere-a stroock fur 5...50 peeerceeng daemaege-a. Fur 5...25 secunds, yuoo taeke-a 5...35% less daemaege-a frum spells.','(5...25 secunds.) Spell daemaege-a is redooced by 5...35%. Ineeteeael iffffect: neaerby fues aere-a stroock fur 5...50 peeerceeng daemaege-a.'],
1758=>['Haerreeer\'s Graesp','Fur 5...20 secunds, aettaecks aegaeeenst mufeeng fues aelsu Creepple-a thuse-a fues fur 2...9 secunds. Vhee yuoo caest thees inchuntment, yuoo aere-a releeefed ooff Creepple-a und 1 oozeer cundeeshun. Thees inchuntment inds aeffter yuoo aepply Creepple-a 1...3 teemes.','(5...20 secunds.) Aettaecks oon mufeeng fues aelsu Creepple-a zeem. Ineeteeael Iffffect: yuoo luse-a Creepple-a und 1 oozeer cundeeshun. Inds aeffter aepplyeeng creepple-a 1...3 teemes.'],
1759=>['Foo ooff Strengt','Fur 15 secunds, vhenefer yuoo aettaeck a fue-a veet yuoor scyzee, yuoo deael 10...25 slaesheeng daemaege-a tu aell aedjaecent fues. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(15 secunds.) Aettaecks veet a scyzee deael 10...25 slaesheeng daemaege-a tu aell aedjaecent fues vhenefer yuoo aettaeck.'],
1760=>['Ibun Doost Oora','Vhee yuoo caest thees inchuntment, aell neaerby fues aere-a Bleended fur 1...7 secunds. Fur 30 secunds, iff yuoo aere-a veeeldeeng un iaert veaepun, yuoor melee-a aettaecks deael +3...30 iaert daemaege-a. Vhee thees inchuntment inds, yuoo aere-a coored ooff Bleendness.','(30 secunds.) Deael +3...30 iaert daemaege-a veet yuoor melee-a aettaecks. Ineeteeael Iffffect: Bleends neaerby fues fur 1...7 secunds. Ind Iffffect: remufes Bleendness. Nu iffffect unless veeeldeeng un iaert veaepun.'],
1761=>['Zeaeluoos Foo','Fur 20 secunds, yuoo haefe-a -2 Inergy regeneraeshun, und yuoo gaeeen 1...6 Inergy ifery teeme-a yuoo heet veet un aettaeck.','(20 secunds.) Yuoo gaeeen 1...6 Inergy iaech teeme-a yuoo heet veet un aettaeck. Yuoo haefe-a -2 Inergy regeneraeshun.'],
1762=>['Heaert ooff Foory','Fur 2...10 secunds, yuoo aettaeck 25% faester.','(2...10 secunds.) Yuoo aettaeck 25% faester.'],
1763=>['Zeaeluoos Renooael','Aell neaerby fues taeke-a 5...30 huly daemaege-a. Fur 5...25 secunds, yuoo haefe-a -1 Inergy regeneraeshun und gaeeen 1 Inergy vhenefer yuoo heet a fue-a. Iff thees inchuntment inds premaetoorely, yuoo gaeeen 1...5 Inergy.','(5...25 secunds.) Ineeteeael iffffect: deaels 5...30 huly daemaege-a tu neaerby fues. Yuoo haefe-a -1 Inergy regeneraeshun und gaeeen 1 Inergy vhee yuoo heet. Gaeeen 1...5 Inergy iff thees inchuntment inds iaerly.'],
1764=>['Aettaecker\'s Inseeght','Fur 3...10 secunds, yuoo haefe-a a 50% chunce-a tu bluck vheele-a aettaeckeeng. Vhee thees inchuntment inds yuoo inffleect Veaekness oon aell aedjaecent fues fur 3...15 secunds. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(3...10 secunds.) Geefes 50% bluck chunce-a vheele-a aettaeckeeng. Ind Iffffect: Cooses Veaekness 3...15 secunds tu aedjaecent fues.'],
1765=>['Rendeeng Oora','Vhee yuoo caest thees inchuntment, aell neaerby fues taeke-a 10...40 culd daemaege-a. Fur 30 secunds, yuoor aettaeck skeells remufe-a inchuntments frum knucked-doon fues. Vhee thees inchuntment inds, neaerby fues aere-a aeffffected by Craecked Aermur fur 1...10 secunds.','(30 secunds.) Yuoor aettaeck skeells remufe-a inchuntments frum knucked-doon fues. Ineeteeael iffffect: Deaels 10...40 culd daemaege-a tu aell neaerby fues. Ind Iffffect: neaerby fues haefe-a Craecked Aermur fur 1...10 secunds.'],
1766=>['Feaezeerffuut Graece-a','Fur 5...20 secunds, yuoo mufe-a 25% faester, und cundeeshuns ixpure-a 50% faester.','(5...20 secunds.) Yuoo mufe-a 25% faester, und cundeeshuns ixpure-a 50% faester.'],
1767=>['Reaeper\'s Sveep','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo Creepple-a yuoor taerget fur 3...15 secunds. Yuoo luse-a 1 Derfeesh inchuntment. Iff un inchuntment vaes remufed, thees aettaeck knucks doon fur 2...3 secunds.','(3...15 secunds.) Cooses Creepple-a. Luse-a 1 Derfeesh inchuntment. Remufael Iffffect: cooses knuckdoon fur 2...3 secunds.'],
1768=>['Haerreeer\'s Haeste-a','Fur 2...8 secunds, yuoo mufe-a 25% faester und deael +3...12 mure-a daemaege-a aegaeeenst mufeeng fues.','(2...8 secunds.) Yuoo mufe-a 25% faester und deael +3...12 daemaege-a tu mufeeng fues.'],
1769=>['Fucoosed Unger','Fur 45 secunds, yuoo gaeeen 0...150% mure-a aedrenaeleene-a.','(45 secunds.) Yuoo gaeeen 0...150% mure-a aedrenaeleene-a.'],
1770=>['Naetoorael Temper','Fur 4...15 secunds, yuoo gaeeen 33% mure-a aedrenaeleene-a vheele-a nut under zee iffffects ooff un inchuntment.','(4...15 secunds.) Yuoo gaeeen 33% mure-a aedrenaeleene-a. Nu iffffect iff yuoo aere-a inchunted.'],
1771=>['Sung ooff Resturaeshun','Fur 10 secunds, zee next teeme-a iaech paerty member veetheen iaershut uses a skeell, thaet paerty member gaeeens 45...110 Heaelt.','(10 secunds.) Paerty members in iaershut gaeeen 45...110 Heaelt veet zeeur next skeell.'],
1772=>['Lyreec ooff Pooreeffeecaeshun','Fur 5...20 secunds, zee next teeme-a iaech aelly veetheen iaershut uses a seegnet, thaet aelly luses 1 cundeeshun.','(5...20 secunds.) Aelleees in iaershut luse-a oone-a cundeeshun veet zeeur next seegnet.'],
1773=>['Suldeeer\'s Foory','Fur 10...35 secunds, iff yuoo aere-a under zee iffffects ooff a chunt oor a shuoot, yuoo aettaeck 33% faester und gaeeen 33% mure-a aedrenaeleene-a, boot yuoo haefe-a -20 aermur.','(10...35 secunds.) Yuoo aettaeck 33% faester und gaeeen 33% mure-a aedrenaeleene-a iff under zee iffffects ooff a shuoot oor chunt. Yuoo haefe-a -20 aermur'],
1774=>['Aeggresseefe-a Reffraeeen','Fur 5...25 secunds, yuoo aettaeck 25% faester boot haefe-a -20 aermur. Thees ichu is reaeppleeed ifery teeme-a a chunt oor shuoot inds oon yuoo. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(5...25 secunds.) Yuoo aettaeck 25% faester. Renooael: vhenefer a chunt oor shuoot inds oon yuoo. Yuoo haefe-a -20 aermur.'],
1775=>['Inergeezeeng Feenaele-a','Fur 10...35 secunds, vhenefer a shuoot oor chunt inds oon taerget nun-spureet aelly, thaet aelly gaeeens 1...2 Inergy.','(10...35 secunds.) Taerget aelly gaeeens 1...2 Inergy vhenefer a shuoot oor chunt inds oon thaet aelly. Cunnut taerget spureets.'],
1776=>['Seegnet ooff Aeggresseeun','Iff yuoo aere-a under zee iffffects ooff a shuoot oor chunt, yuoo gaeeen 2 streeke-as ooff aedrenaeleene-a.','Yuoo gaeeen 2 aedrenaeleene-a iff yuoo aere-a under zee iffffects ooff a shuoot oor chunt.'],
1777=>['Remedy Seegnet','Yuoo luse-a 1 cundeeshun.','Yuoo luse-a oone-a cundeeshun.'],
1778=>['Seegnet ooff Retoorn','Resoorrect taerget paerty member veet 5...20% Heaelt und 1...4% Inergy fur iaech paerty member veetheen iaershut.','Resoorrects taerget paerty member (5...20% Heaelt und 1...4% Inergy fur iaech paerty member in iaershut).'],
1779=>['"Maeke-a Yuoor Teeme-a!"','Yuoo gaeeen 2 streekes ooff aedrenaeleene-a fur iaech paerty member veetheen iaershut (maexeemoom 1...8 aedrenaeleene-a).','Yuoo gaeeen tvu aedrenaeleene-a (maexeemoom 1...8) fur iaech paerty member in iaershut.'],
1780=>['"Cun\'t Tuooch Thees!"','Fur 20 secunds, zee next 1...5 tuooch skeells used aegaeeenst aelleees veetheen iaershut fail.','(20 secunds.) Zee next 1...5 tuooch-runge-a skeells used aegaeeenst aelleees veetheen iaershut fail.'],
1781=>['"Feend Zeeur Veaekness!"','Fur 5...20 secunds, zee next teeme-a taerget aelly aettaecks, thaet aelly deaels +5...50 daemaege-a und inffleects a Deep Vuoond fur 5...20 secunds.','(5...20 secunds.) Taerget aelly deaels +5...50 daemaege-a und inffleects Deep Vuoond cundeeshun (5...20 secunds) veet zee next aettaeck.'],
1782=>['"Zee Pooer Is Yuoors!"','Fur 2...4 secunds, aell aelleees veetheen iaershut gaeeen 1...2 Inergy regeneraeshun. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(2...4 secunds.) Aelleees veetheen iaershut gaeeen 1...2 Inergy regeneraeshun.'],
1783=>['Slaeyer\'s Speaer','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo deael +5...25 daemaege-a. Iff thaet fue-a haes mure-a Heaelt thun yuoo, thaet fue-a sooffffers frum a Deep Vuoond fur 5...20 secunds.','Deaels +5...25 daemaege-a. Inffleects Deep Vuoond cundeeshun (5...20 secunds) iff taerget haes mure-a Heaelt thun yuoo.'],
1784=>['Sveefft Jaefeleen','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo deael +5...20 daemaege-a. Iff yuoo aere-a under zee iffffects ooff un inchuntment, thees speaer fleees tveece-a aes faest und cunnut be-a blucked.','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Thees speaer mufes tveece-a aes faest und is unbluckaeble-a iff yuoo aere-a inchunted.'],
1814=>['Leeghtbreenger\'s Gaeze-a','Taerget demuneec serfunt ooff Aebaeddun taekes 100 huly daemaege-a und is interroopted. Thees skeell streekes oone-a aeddeeshunael fue-a in zee aerea fur iaech runk ooff Leeghtbreenger yuoo haefe-a aettaeeened. Thees skeell is deesaebled fur 15 secunds aeffter it is used.','Taerget demuneec serfunt ooff Aebaeddun taekes 100 huly daemaege-a und is interroopted. Heets oone-a aeddeeshunael fue-a in zee aerea fur iaech runk ooff Leeghtbreenger yuoo haefe-a aettaeeened. Thees skeell is deesaebled (15 secunds).'],
1815=>['Leeghtbreenger Seegnet','Iff yuoo aere-a veetheen zee aerea ooff a demuneec serfunt ooff Aebaeddun, yuoo gaeeen 3...5 streeke-as ooff aedrenaeleene-a und 16...24 Inergy.','Yuoo gaeeen 3...5 streeke-as ooff aedrenaeleene-a und 16...24 Inergy iff yuoo aere-a veetheen zee aerea ooff a demuneec serfunt ooff Aebaeddun.'],
1816=>['Soonspeaer Reburt Seegnet','Resoorrect taerget deaed paerty member aet yuoor lucaeshun veet fooll Heaelt und 10% Inergy fur iaech Soonspeaer runk yuoo haefe-a aettaeeened. Thees seegnet cun oonly be-a used oonce-a per meesseeun unless rechaerged by a muraele-a buust.','Resoorrect taerget deaed paerty member aet yuoor lucaeshun (fooll Heaelt und 10% Inergy fur iaech Soonspeaer runk yuoo haefe-a aettaeeened). Thees seegnet oonly rechaerges vhee yuoo gaeeen a muraele-a buust.'],
1948=>['Shaedoo Sunctooaery','Yuoo aere-a Bleended fur 5 secunds. Fur 10 secunds, yuoo gaeeen +7...10 Heaelt regeneraeshun und +40 aermur.','(10 secunds.) Yuoo gaeeen +7...10 Heaelt regeneraeshun und +40 aermur. Yuoo aere-a Bleend (5 secunds).'],
1949=>['Izeer Neeghtmaere-a','Taerget fue-a luses 5...8 Inergy. Fur iaech pueent ooff Inergy lust in thees vaey, thaet fue-a und aell fues in zee aerea sooffffer -1 Heaelt degeneraeshun fur 10 secunds.','Cooses 5...8 Inergy luss. Taerget und fues in zee aerea haefe-a -1 Heaelt degeneraeshun fur iaech pueent ooff Inergy lust (10 secunds).'],
1950=>['Seegnet ooff Curroopshun','Taerget fue-a und aell neaerby fues taeke-a 20...30 daemaege-a. Fur iaech aeffffected fue-a sooffffereeng frum a cundeeshun oor hex, yuoo gaeeen 2 Inergy (maexeemoom 12...20 Inergy).','Deaels 20...30 daemaege-a tu taerget und neaerby fues. Yuoo gaeeen 2 Inergy (maexeemoom 12...20) fur iaech ooff zeese-a fues veet a cundeeshun oor hex.'],
1951=>['Ilementael Lurd','Fur 40...60 secunds, yuoor ilementael aettreebootes aere-a buusted by 1. Iaech teeme-a yuoo caest a spell, yuoo gaeeen 1 Inergy fur ifery 10 runks ooff Inergy Sturaege-a und aere-a heaeled fur 100...300% ooff zee spell\'s Inergy cust.','(40...60 secunds.) Yuoor ilementael aettreebootes aere-a buusted by 1. Iaech teeme-a yuoo caest a spell, yuoo gaeeen 1 Inergy fur ifery 10 runks ooff Inergy Sturaege-a und aere-a heaeled fur 100...300% ooff zee spell\'s Inergy cust.'],
1952=>['Selffless Spureet','Fur 15...20 secunds, spells yuoo caest thaet taerget unuzeer aelly cust 3 less Inergy.','(15...20 secunds.) Spells yuoo caest thaet taerget unuzeer aelly cust 3 less Inergy.'],
1953=>['Treeple-a Shut','Shuut 3 aerroos seemooltuneuoosly aet taerget fue-a. Zeese-a aerroos deael 40...25% less daemaege-a.','Shuut 3 aerroos seemooltuneuoosly aet taerget fue-a. Zeese-a aerroos deael 40...25% less daemaege-a.'],
1954=>['"Saefe-a Yuoorselfes!"','Fur 4...6 secunds, aell oozeer paerty members gaeeen +100 aermur.','(4...6 secunds.) Aell oozeer paerty members gaeeen +100 aermur.'],
1955=>['Oora ooff Huly Meeght','Fur 45 secunds, yuoo deael 20...25 huly daemaege-a tu aell aedjaecent fues vhenefer yuoo luse-a a Derfeesh inchuntment.','(45 secunds.) Vhenefer yuoo luse-a a Derfeesh inchuntment, aedjaecent fues taeke-a 20...25 huly daemaege-a. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
1957=>['Speaer ooff Foory','Thees aettaeck deaels +30...40 daemaege-a. Iff thees aettaeck heets a fue-a sooffffereeng frum a cundeeshun, yuoo gaeeen 3...6 streeke-as ooff aedrenaeleene-a.','Deaels +30...40 daemaege-a. Gaeeen 3...6 streeke-as ooff aedrenaeleene-a iff yuoo heet a fue-a veet a cundeeshun.'],
1986=>['Faempureec Aessoolt','Moost fulloo un ooffff-hund aettaeck. Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo steael 10...40 Heaelt.','Steaels 10...40 Heaelt iff thees aettaeck heets. Moost fulloo un ooffff-hund aettaeck.'],
1987=>['Lutoos Streeke-a','Moost fulloo a leaed aettaeck. Iff it heets, thees aettaeck streekes fur +10...25 daemaege-a und yuoo gaeeen 5...20 Inergy.','Deaels +10...25 daemaege-a; yuoo gaeeen 5...20 Inergy. Moost fulloo a leaed aettaeck.'],
1988=>['Guldee Fung Streeke-a','Moost fulloo a leaed aettaeck. Iff yuoo aere-a under zee iffffects ooff un inchuntment und thees aettaeck heets, taerget fue-a sooffffers frum a Deep Vuoond fur 5...20 secunds.','Inffleects Deep Vuoond cundeeshun (5...20 secunds) iff yuoo aere-a inchunted. Moost fulloo a leaed aettaeck.'],
1990=>['Faelleeng Lutoos Streeke-a','Moost streeke-a a knucked-doon fue-a. Iff it heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +15...35 daemaege-a und gaeeen 1...12 Inergy.','Deaels +15...35 daemaege-a; yuoo gaeeen 1...12 Inergy. Nu iffffect unless taerget fue-a is knucked-doon.'],
1991=>['Saedeest\'s Seegnet','Yuoo gaeeen 10...45 Heaelt fur iaech cundeeshun oon taerget fue-a.','Yuoo gaeeen 10...45 Heaelt fur iaech cundeeshun oon taerget fue-a.'],
1992=>['Seegnet ooff Deestraecshun','Iff taerget fue-a is caesteeng a spell, thaet spell is interroopted und deesaebled fur 1...5 secunds fur iaech seegnet yuoo haefe-a iqooeepped.','Interroopts a spell. Interroopshun iffffect: taerget fue-a\'s spell is deesaebled fur 1...5 secunds fur iaech seegnet yuoo haefe-a iqooeepped.'],
1993=>['Seegnet ooff Recaell','Fur 6 secunds, yuoo haefe-a -4 Inergy regeneraeshun. Vhee thees iffffect inds, yuoo gaeeen 13...20 Inergy.','(6 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a -4 Inergy regeneraeshun. Ind iffffect: yuoo gaeeen 13...20 Inergy.'],
1994=>['Pooer Luck','Iff taerget fue-a is caesteeng a spell oor chunt, thaet skeell is interroopted und deesaebled fur un aeddeeshunael 5...13 secunds.','Interroopts a spell oor chunt. Interroopshun iffffect: interroopted spell oor chunt is deesaebled fur +5...13 secunds.'],
1995=>['Vaeste-a Nut, Vunt Nut','Iff taerget fue-a is nut caesteeng a spell oor aettaeckeeng, yuoo gaeeen 8...13 Inergy.','Yuoo gaeeen 8...13 Inergy iff taerget fue-a is nut aettaeckeeng oor caesteeng a spell.'],
1996=>['Soom ooff Aell Feaers','Fur 4...12 secunds, taerget fue-a mufes, aettaecks, und caests spells 33% slooer.','(4...12 secunds.) Taerget fue-a mufes, aettaecks, und caests spells 33% slooer.'],
1997=>['Veezeereeng Oora','Fur 5...20 secunds, taerget aelly\'s melee-a aettaecks coose-a Veaekness fur 5...20 secunds.','(5...20 secunds.) Taerget aelly\'s melee-a aettaecks coose-a Veaekness cundeeshun (5...20 secunds.)'],
1998=>['Caecuphuny','Fur 15 secunds, vhenefer taerget fue-a uses a shuoot oor chunt, thaet fue-a taekes 30...105 daemaege-a.','(15 secunds.) Deaels 30...105 daemaege-a vhenefer taerget fue-a uses a shuoot oor chunt.'],
1999=>['Veenter\'s Imbraece-a','Fur 2...6 secunds, taerget fue-a mufes 66% slooer und taekes 5...15 daemaege-a vheele-a mufeeng. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(2...6 secunds.) Taerget fue-a mufes 66% slooer und taekes 5...15 daemaege-a vheele-a mufeeng.'],
2000=>['Iaerzeen Shaeckles','Fur 3 secunds, taerget und aell neaerby fues mufe-a 90% slooer. Vhee Iaerzeen Shaeckles inds, it aeppleees Veaekness fur 5...20 secunds. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(3 secunds.) Taerget und neaerby fues mufe-a 90% slooer. Aeppleees Veaekness fur 5...20 secunds vhee it inds.'],
2001=>['Vaerd ooff Veaekness','Yuoo creaete-a a Vaerd ooff Veaekness aet yuoor coorrent lucaeshun. Fur 5...20 secunds, fues in thees aerea becume-a Veaekened fur 5...20 secunds vhenefer zeey taeke-a ilementael daemaege-a.','(5...20 secunds). Inffleects Veaekened cundeeshun (5...20 secunds) tu uny fues thaet taeke-a ilementael daemaege-a in thees vaerd.'],
2002=>['Glyph ooff Sveefftness','Fur 15 secunds, yuoor next 1...5 spells recharge 25% faester und prujecteeles frum zee aeffffected spells mufe-a 200% faester.','(15 secunds.) Yuoor next 1...5 spells rechaerge-a 25% faester und prujecteeles frum zeem mufe-a 200% faester.'],
2003=>['Coore-a Hex','Remufe-a oone-a hex frum taerget aelly. Iff a hex vaes remufed, thaet aelly is heaeled fur 30...100 Heaelt.','Remufes a hex. Remufael iffffect: heaels fur 30...100. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
2004=>['Smeete-a Cundeeshun','Remufe-a oone-a cundeeshun frum taerget aelly. Iff a cundeeshun vaes remufed, fues in zee aerea taeke-a 10...60 huly daemaege-a.','Remufes a cundeeshun. Remufael iffffect: deaels 10...60 huly daemaege-a tu fues in zee aerea ooff taerget aelly.'],
2005=>['Smeeter\'s Buun','Fur 30 secunds, yuoor Smeeteeng Praeyers haefe-a duooble-a zee Deefeene-a Faefur bunoos.','(30 secunds.) Yuoor Smeeteeng Praeyers haefe-a duooble-a Deefeene-a Faefur heaeleeng bunoos.'],
2006=>['Caesteegaeshun Seegnet','Taerget fue-a taekes 26...56 huly daemaege-a. Iff thaet fue-a vaes aettaeckeeng, yuoo gaeeen 4...14 Inergy.','Deaels 26...56 huly daemaege-a. Yuoo gaeeen 4...14 Inergy iff taerget fue-a is aettaeckeeng. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
2007=>['Pooreeffyeeng Feeel','Vheele-a yuoo maeeentaeeen thees inchuntment, cundeeshuns ixpure-a 5...50% faester oon taerget aelly. Vhee thees inchuntment inds, oone-a cundeeshun is remufed frum thaet aelly.','Cundeeshuns ixpure-a 5...50% faester oon taerget aelly. Ind iffffect: remufes a cundeeshun.'],
2008=>['Poolfereezeeng Smaesh','Iff yuoo heet a knucked-doon fue-a, thaet fue-a sooffffers frum Veaekness und a Deep Vuoond fur 5...20 secunds.','Inffleects Veaekness und Deep Vuoond cundeeshuns (5...20 secunds) iff taerget fue-a is knucked-doon.'],
2009=>['Keee Chup','Iff it heets, thees aettaeck aelvaeys resoolts in a creeteecael heet.','Aelvaeys a creeteecael heet.'],
2010=>['Knee-a Cootter','Iff thees aettaeck heets a Creeppled fue-a, yuoo gaeeen 2...7 Inergy und 1...3 streekes ooff aedrenaeleene-a.','Yuoo gaeeen 2...7 Inergy und 1...3 aedrenaeleene-a iff taerget fue-a is Creeppled.'],
2011=>['Graepple-a','Yuoo und taerget tuooched fue-a aere-a knucked doon. Yuoo luse-a yuoor coorrent stunce-a.','Cooses knuckdoon. Yuoo aere-a aelsu knucked doon. Yuoor coorrent stunce-a inds.'],
2012=>['Raedeeunt Scyzee','Thees aettaeck streekes fur +1 daemaege-a fur iaech pueent ooff Inergy yuoo coorrently haefe-a, maexeemoom 5...30 daemaege-a. Yuoo gaeeen 1...7 Inergy iff thees aettaeck heets.','Deaels +1 daemaege-a (maexeemoom 5...30) fur iaech pueent ooff Inergy yuoo haefe-a. Gaeeen 1...7 Inergy.'],
2013=>['Grent\'s Oora','Fur 20 secunds, yuoo deael 5...25 less daemaege-a und steael 5...25 Heaelt vhenefer yuoo heet veet a scyzee aettaeck. Vhee yuoo caest thees inchuntment yuoo steael 5...25 Heaelt frum aell aedjaecent fues.','(20 secunds.) Yuoo deael 5...25 less daemaege-a und steael 5...25 Heaelt vhee yuoo heet veet a scyzee. Ineeteeael iffffect: steael 5...25 Heaelt frum aell aedjaecent fues.'],
2014=>['Seegnet ooff Peeuoos Restraeeent','Remufe-a 1 Derfeesh inchuntment. Taerget fue-a is Creeppled fur 5...15 secunds. Iff un inchuntment vaes remufed, aell fues in zee aerea ooff yuoor taerget aere-a aelsu Creeppled und thees seegnet rechaerges 75% faester.','Inffleects Creeppled cundeeshun (5...15 secunds). Remufe-a 1 ooff yuoor Derfeesh inchuntments. Remufael iffffect: aelsu cooses Creepple-a tu fues in zee aerea ooff yuoor taerget und rechaerges 75% faester.'],
2015=>['Faermer\'s Scyzee','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo deael +5...20 daemaege-a. Iff yuoo heet mure-a thun oone-a fue-a, thees aettaeck rechaerges instuntly.','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Instunt rechaerge-a iff yuoo heet mure-a thun oone-a fue-a.'],
2016=>['Inergeteec Vaes Lee-a Sa','Huld Lee-a Sa\'s aeshes fur 5...15 secunds. Vheele-a yuoo huld her aeshes, yuoo gaeeen +2 Inergy regeneraeshun. Vhee yuoo drup her aeshes, yuoo gaeeen +1...10 Inergy.','(5...15 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +2 Inergy regeneraeshun. Drup iffffect: yuoo gaeeen +1...10 Inergy.'],
2017=>['Unzeem ooff Veaereeness','Fur 8 secunds, zee next aettaeck skeell used by iaech aelly veetheen iaershut aelsu cooses Veaekness fur 1...16 secunds.','(8 secunds.) Aelleees in iaershut inffleect Veaekness (1...16 secunds) veet zeeur next aettaeck skeell.'],
2018=>['Unzeem ooff Deesroopshun','Fur 1...10 secunds, zee next aettaeck skeell used by iaech aelly veetheen iaershut aelsu interroopts un aecshun.','(1...10 secunds.) Aelleees in iaershut interroopt un aecshun veet zeeur next aettaeck skeell.'],
2051=>['Soommun Spureets','Aell spureets yuoo cuntrul Shaedoo Step tu yuoor lucaeshun, und gaeeen 60...100 Heaelt','Spureets yuoo cuntrul Shaedoo Step tu yuoor lucaeshun und gaeeen 60...100 Heaelt.'],
2052=>['Shaedoo Fung','Shaedoo Step tu taerget fue-a. Fur 10 secunds, thees hex dues nutheeng. Vhee thees hex inds, yuoo retoorn tu yuoor ooreegeenael lucaeshun und thaet fue-a sooffffers frum a Deep Vuoond fur 5...20 secunds.','Shaedoo Step tu taerget fue-a. Ind iffffect aeffter 10 secunds: inffleects Deep Vuoond cundeeshun (5...20 secunds); yuoo retoorn tu yuoor ooreegeenael lucaeshun.'],
2053=>['Caelcoolaeted Reesk','Fur 3...24 secunds, taerget fue-a\'s aettaecks du +10 daemaege-a, boot zeere-a is a 50% chunce-a thaet zee daemaege-a frum iaech aettaeck veell be-a dune-a tu thaet fue-a insteaed. (Maexeemoom 15...100 daemaege-a.)','(3...24 secunds.) Taerget fue-a\'s aettaecks du +10 daemaege-a. Iaech aettaeck haes a 50% chunce-a thaet zee daemaege-a (maexeemoom 15...100) veell be-a dune-a tu thaet fue-a insteaed.'],
2054=>['Shreenkeeng Aermur','Fur 10 secunds, taerget fue-a sooffffers frum -1...4 Heaelt degeneraeshun. Vhee thees hex inds, thaet fue-a haes Craecked Aermur fur 5...20 secunds.','(10 secunds.) Cooses -1...4 Heaelt degeneraeshun. Ind iffffect: inffleects Craecked Aermur cundeeshun (5...20 secunds). Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
2055=>['Uneoorysm','Taerget fue-a regaeeens aell Inergy. Fur iaech pueent ooff Inergy gaeeened in thees vaey, thaet fue-a taekes 1...3 daemaege-a und aell aedjaecent fues luse-a 1 Inergy. (Maexeemoom 1...30 Inergy lust).','Taerget fue-a regaeeens aell Inergy. Fur iaech pueent ooff Inergy gaeeened, taerget taekes 1...3 daemaege-a und aell aedjaecent fues luse-a 1 Inergy (maexeemoom 1...30).'],
2056=>['Vundereeng Iye-a','Fur 4 secunds, zee next teeme-a taerget fue-a aettaecks, thaet aettaeck is interroopted und aell neaerby fues taeke-a 30...110 daemaege-a.','(4 secunds.) Interroopts taerget fue-a\'s next aettaeck. Interroopshun iffffect: 30...110 daemaege-a tu neaerby fues.'],
2057=>['Fuool Feaest','Aell cundeeshuns aere-a trunsfferred frum taerget oozeer aelly tu yuoorselff. Fur iaech cundeeshun aecqooured in thees vaey, yuoo gaeeen 0...45 Heaelt und 2...4 Inergy. Thees skeell rechaerges tveece-a aes faest iff yuoo remufe-a Deeseaese-a frum yuoor taerget.','Trunsffers aell cundeeshuns frum taerget aelly tu yuoorselff. Yuoo gaeeen 0...45 Heaelt und 2...4 Inergy fur iaech cundeeshun trunsfferred. Haelff rechaerge-a iff yuoo remufe-a Deeseaese-a. Cunnut selff-taerget.'],
2058=>['Pootreed Beele-a','Fur 5...25 secunds, taerget fue-a sooffffers -1...3 Heaelt degeneraeshun. Iff thaet fue-a deees vheele-a under zee iffffects ooff thees hex, aell neaerby fues taeke-a 25...85 daemaege-a.','(5...25 secunds.) Cooses -1...3 Heaelt degeneraeshun. Deaels 25...85 daemaege-a tu aell neaerby fues iff taerget fue-a deees.'],
2059=>['Shell Shuck','Taerget fue-a is stroock fur 10...30 leeghtneeng daemaege-a und haes Craecked Aermur fur 5...20 secunds. Thees spell haes 25% aermur penetraeshun. Iff yuoo aere-a Oofercaest, thees spell streekes aedjaecent fues.','Deaels 10...30 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Inffleects Craecked Aermur cundeeshun (5...20 secunds). 25% aermur penetraeshun. Iff Oofercaest, streekes aedjaecent.'],
2060=>['Glyph ooff Immulaeshun','Fur 15 secunds, yuoor next 1...4 spells thaet target a fue-a aelsu cause Boorneeng fur 1...4 secunds.','(15 secunds.) Yuoor next 1...4 spells thaet target a fue-a aelsu inflict Boorneeng cundeeshun (1...4 secunds).'],
2061=>['Paeteeent Spureet','Fur 2 secunds, taerget aelly is inchunted veet Paeteeent Spureet. Unless thees inchuntment inds premaetoorely, thaet aelly is heaeled fur 30...120 Heaelt vhee zee inchuntment inds.','(2 secunds.) Ind iffffect: heaels fur 30...120. Nu iffffect iff inds iaerly.'],
2062=>['Heaeleeng Reebbun','Taerget oozeer aelly is heaeled fur 20...110 Heaelt. Up tu 2 aeddeeshunael aelleees neaer taerget aelly aere-a heaeled fur 10...100 Heaelt.','Heaels fur 20...110. Heaels tvu aeddeeshunael aelleees neaer taerget aelly fur 10...100. Cunnut selff-taerget.'],
2063=>['Oora ooff Staebeeleety','Fur 3...8 secunds, taerget oozeer aelly cunnut be-a knucked doon.','(3...8 secunds.) Taerget aelly cunnut be-a knucked-doon. Cunnut selff-taerget.'],
2064=>['Sputless Meend','Fur 1...15 secunds, taerget oozeer aelly luses a hex ifery 5 secunds.','(1...15 secunds.) Remufes a hex ifery 5 secunds. Cunnut selff-taerget.'],
2065=>['Sputless Suool','Fur 1...15 secunds, taerget oozeer aelly luses a cundeeshun ifery 3 secunds. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(1...15 secunds.) Remufes a cundeeshun ifery 3 secunds. Cunnut selff-taerget.'],
2066=>['Deesaerm','Interroopt taerget fue-a\'s aecshun. Iff thaet aecshun vaes un aettaeck, aell ooff thaet fue-a\'s aettaeck skeells aere-a deesaebled fur 0...3 secunds.','Interroopts taerget fue-a. Interroopshun iffffect: deesaebles thees fue-a\'s aettaeck skeells (0...3 secunds) iff thaet aecshun vaes un aettaeck. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
2067=>['"I Meunt tu Du Thaet!"','Iff yuoo aere-a knucked doon, yuoo gaeeen 1...6 streeke-as ooff aedrenaeleene-a.','Yuoo gaeeen 1...6 streeke-as ooff aedrenaeleene-a iff yuoo aere-a knucked-doon.'],
2068=>['Raepeed Fure-a','Fur 5...25 secunds, yuoo aettaeck 33% faester vheele-a veeeldeeng a boo.','(5...25 secunds.) Yuoo aettaeck 33% faester vheele-a veeeldeeng a boo.'],
2069=>['Slooth Hoonter\'s Shut','Iff thees aettaeck heets, taerget fue-a taekes +10...25 daemaege-a. Iff thaet fue-a is nut useeng a skeell, Slooth Hoonter\'s Shut dues un aeddeeshunael +10...35 daemaege-a.','Deaels +10...25 daemaege-a. Deaels +10...35 mure-a daemaege-a iff taerget fue-a is nut useeng a skeell.'],
2070=>['Oora Sleecer','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo inffleect Bleedeeng fur 5...15 secunds. Iff yuoo aere-a inchunted, yuoo aelsu inffleect Craecked Aermur fur 1...10 secunds.','(5...15 secunds.) Inffleects Bleedeeng cundeeshun. Aelsu inffleects Craecked Aermur (1...10 secunds) iff yuoo aere-a inchunted.'],
2071=>['Zeaeluoos Sveep','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo deael +5...20 daemaege-a. Yuoo gaeeen 3 Inergy und 1 streeke-a ooff aedrenaeleene-a fur iaech fue-a yuoo heet.','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Yuoo gaeeen 3 Inergy und 1 aedrenaeleene-a fur iaech fue-a yuoo heet.'],
2072=>['Poore-a Vaes Lee Meeng','Huld Lee Meeng\'s aeshes fur 5...20 secunds. Vheele-a yuoo huld her aeshes, cundeeshuns oon yuoo ixpure-a 10...50% faester. Vhee yuoo drup her aeshes, aell aelleees veetheen iaershut luse-a 1...4 cundeeshuns.','(5...20 secunds.) Cundeeshuns oon yuoo ixpure-a 10...50% faester. Drup iffffect: remufes 1...4 cundeeshuns frum aelleees in iaershut.'],
2073=>['Veaepun ooff Aeggresseeun','Fur 5...15 secunds, yuoo aettaeck 25% faester.','(5...15 secunds.) Yuoo aettaeck 25% faester.'],
2074=>['Chest Thoomper','Iff thees aettaeck heets a fue-a veet Craecked Aermur, thaet fue-a sooffffers a Deep Vuoond fur 5...20 secunds.','Inffleects Deep Vuoond cundeeshun (5...20 secunds) iff taerget fue-a haes Craecked Aermur.'],
2075=>['Haesty Reffraeeen','Fur 8...20 secunds, taerget aelly mufes 25% faester. Thees ichu is reaeppleeed ifery teeme-a a chunt oor shuoot inds oon thaet aelly.','(8...20 secunds.) Taerget aelly mufes 25% faester. Renooael: ifery teeme-a a chunt oor shuoot inds oon thees aelly.'],
2091=>['Shaedoo Sunctooaery','Yuoo aere-a Bleended fur 5 secunds. Fur 10 secunds, yuoo gaeeen +7...10 Heaelt regeneraeshun und +40 aermur.','(10 secunds.) Yuoo gaeeen +7...10 Heaelt regeneraeshun und +40 aermur. Yuoo aere-a Bleend (5 secunds).'],
2092=>['Izeer Neeghtmaere-a','Taerget fue-a luses 5...8 Inergy. Fur iaech pueent ooff Inergy lust in thees vaey, thaet fue-a und aell fues in zee aerea sooffffer -1 Heaelt degeneraeshun fur 10 secunds.','Cooses 5...8 Inergy luss. Taerget und fues in zee aerea haefe-a -1 Heaelt degeneraeshun fur iaech pueent ooff Inergy lust (10 secunds).'],
2093=>['Seegnet ooff Curroopshun','Taerget fue-a und aell neaerby fues taeke-a 20...30 daemaege-a. Fur iaech aeffffected fue-a sooffffereeng frum a cundeeshun oor hex, yuoo gaeeen 2 Inergy (maexeemoom 12...20 Inergy).','Deaels 20...30 daemaege-a tu taerget und neaerby fues. Yuoo gaeeen 2 Inergy (maexeemoom 12...20) fur iaech ooff zeese-a fues veet a cundeeshun oor hex.'],
2094=>['Ilementael Lurd','Fur 40...60 secunds, yuoor ilementael aettreebootes aere-a buusted by 1. Iaech teeme-a yuoo caest a spell, yuoo gaeeen 1 Inergy fur ifery 10 runks ooff Inergy Sturaege-a und aere-a heaeled fur 100...300% ooff zee spell\'s Inergy cust.','(40...60 secunds.) Yuoor ilementael aettreebootes aere-a buusted by 1. Iaech teeme-a yuoo caest a spell, yuoo gaeeen 1 Inergy fur ifery 10 runks ooff Inergy Sturaege-a und aere-a heaeled fur 100...300% ooff zee spell\'s Inergy cust.'],
2095=>['Selffless Spureet','Fur 15...20 secunds, spells yuoo caest thaet taerget unuzeer aelly cust 3 less Inergy.','(15...20 secunds.) Spells yuoo caest thaet taerget unuzeer aelly cust 3 less Inergy.'],
2096=>['Treeple-a Shut','Shuut 3 aerroos seemooltuneuoosly aet taerget fue-a. Zeese-a aerroos deael 40...25% less daemaege-a.','Shuut 3 aerroos seemooltuneuoosly aet taerget fue-a. Zeese-a aerroos deael 40...25% less daemaege-a.'],
2097=>['"Saefe-a Yuoorselfes!"','Fur 4...6 secunds, aell oozeer paerty members gaeeen +100 aermur.','(4...6 secunds.) Aell oozeer paerty members gaeeen +100 aermur.'],
2098=>['Oora ooff Huly Meeght','Fur 45 secunds, yuoo deael 20...25 huly daemaege-a tu aell aedjaecent fues vhenefer yuoo luse-a a Derfeesh inchuntment.','(45 secunds.) Vhenefer yuoo luse-a a Derfeesh inchuntment, aedjaecent fues taeke-a 20...25 huly daemaege-a. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
2099=>['Speaer ooff Foory','Thees aettaeck deaels +30...40 daemaege-a. Iff thees aettaeck heets a fue-a sooffffereeng frum a cundeeshun, yuoo gaeeen 3...6 streeke-as ooff aedrenaeleene-a.','Deaels +30...40 daemaege-a. Gaeeen 3...6 streeke-as ooff aedrenaeleene-a iff yuoo heet a fue-a veet a cundeeshun.'],
2100=>['Soommun Spureets','Aell spureets yuoo cuntrul Shaedoo Step tu yuoor lucaeshun, und gaeeen 60...100 Heaelt','Spureets yuoo cuntrul Shaedoo Step tu yuoor lucaeshun und gaeeen 60...100 Heaelt.'],
2101=>['Creeteecael Aegeeleety','Fur 4 secunds und 1 secund fur iaech runk ooff Creeteecael Streekes, yuoo aettaeck 33% faester und gaeeen +15...25 aermur. Thees skeell reaeppleees itselff ifery teeme-a yuoo lund a creeteecael heet.','(4 secunds ploos 1 secund fur iaech runk ooff Creeteecael Streekes.) Yuoo aettaeck 33% faester und gaeeen +15...25 aermur. Renooael: ifery teeme-a yuoo lund a creeteecael heet.'],
2102=>['Cry ooff Paeeen','Interroopt taerget fue-a\'s skeell. Iff thaet fue-a vaes sooffffereeng frum a Mesmer hex, thaet fue-a und aell fues in zee aerea taeke-a 25...50 daemaege-a und haefe-a 3...5 Heaelt degeneraeshun fur 10 secunds.','Interroopts a skeell. Iff taerget fue-a haed a Mesmer hex, deaels 25...50 daemaege-a tu taerget und fues in zee aerea und cooses -3...5 Heaelt degeneraeshun (10 secunds).'],
2103=>['Necrusees','Iff taerget fue-a is sooffffereeng frum a cundeeshun oor hex, thaet fue-a sooffffers 60...90 daemaege-a.','Deaels 60...90 daemaege-a iff taerget fue-a haes a cundeeshun oor hex.'],
2104=>['Intenseety','Fur 10 secunds, zee next teeme-a yuoo deael ilementael daemaege-a veet a spell tu a taerget, yuoo deael 60...70% ooff thaet daemaege-a tu aell oozeer fues in zee aerea.','(10 secunds.) Zee next teeme-a yuoo deael ilementael daemaege-a veet a spell, oozeer taergets in zee aerea taeke-a 60...70% ooff thaet daemaege-a.'],
2105=>['Seed ooff Leeffe-a','Fur 2...5 secunds, vhenefer taerget oozeer aelly taekes daemaege-a, aell paerty members aere-a heaeled fur 2 Heaelt fur iaech runk in Deefeene-a Faefur.','(2...5 secunds.) Heaels paerty members fur 2 fur iaech runk in Deefeene-a Faefur vhenefer taerget aelly taekes daemaege-a. Cunnut selff-taerget.'],
2107=>['Vhurlveend Aettaeck','Aettaeck taerget und aedjaecent fues. Iaech aettaeck thaet heets deaels +13...20 daemaege-a.','Aettaecks taerget und aedjaecent fues fur +13...20 daemaege-a.'],
2108=>['Nefer Raempaege-a Aelune-a','Fur 18...25 secunds, yuoo und yuoor pet aettaeck 25% faester und haefe-a +1...3 Heaelt regeneraeshun.','(18...25 secunds.) Yuoo und yuoor pet aettaeck 25% faester und haefe-a +1...3 Heaelt regeneraeshun.'],
2109=>['Iternael Oora','Yuoo haefe-a +100 maex Heaelt. Vhee thees inchuntment inds, aell paerty members in zee aerea aere-a resoorrected veet 40...50% Heaelt und 20...30% Inergy.','Yuoo haefe-a +100 maex Heaelt. Ind iffffect: aell paerty members in zee aerea aere-a resoorrected veet 40...50% Heaelt und 20...30% Inergy.'],
2110=>['Faempureesm','Creaete-a a lefel 4...14 spureet thaet deees aeffter 75...150 secunds. Aettaecks by thees spureet steael up tu 10...20 Heaelt, und yuoo aere-a heaeled fur 10...20 Heaelt.','Creaetes a lefel 4...14 spureet (leeffespun 75...150 secunds). Its aettaecks steael 10...20 Heaelt, und yuoo aere-a heaeled fur 10...20.'],
2112=>['"Zeere-a\'s Nutheeng tu Feaer!"','Fur 4 secunds ploos 1 secund fur ifery 2 runks in Leaedersheep, aell paerty members veetheen iaershut taeke-a 20...35% less daemaege-a. Aeffffected paerty members aere-a heaeled fur 35...60 Heaelt vhee thees shuoot inds.','(4 secunds ploos 1 secund fur ifery 2 runks in Leaedersheep.) Redooces daemaege-a by 20...35% fur paerty members in iaershut. Ind iffffect: heaels fur 35...60 Heaelt.'],
2116=>['Sneaek Aettaeck','Iff thees aettaeck heets, taerget fue-a is Bleended fur 5...8 secunds. Thees aettaeck cuoonts aes a leaed aettaeck.','Inffleects Bleendness (5...8 secunds). Cuoonts aes a leaed aettaeck.'],
2135=>['Traempleeng Oox','Moost fulloo un ooffff-hund aettaeck. Iff it heets, yuoo deael +5...20 daemaege-a. Iff yuoo a heet a Creeppled fue-a, thaet fue-a is knucked doon.','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a; cooses knuck-doon iff taerget fue-a is Creeppled. Moost fulloo un ooffff-hund aettaeck.'],
2136=>['Smuke-a Pooder Deffense-a','Fur 8 secunds, zee next teeme-a yuoo aere-a stroock, yuoo taeke-a haelff daemaege-a und aell aedjaecent fues aere-a Bleended fur 2...6 secunds.','(8 secunds.) Zee next teeme-a yuoo aere-a stroock, yuoo taeke-a haelff daemaege-a und inffleect Bleendness cundeeshun (2...6 secunds) oon aedjaecent fues.'],
2137=>['Cunffooseeng Imaeges','Fur 2...10 secunds, taerget fue-a taekes tveece-a aes lung tu aecteefaete-a nun-aettaeck skeells.','(2...10 secunds.) Taerget fue-a taekes tveece-a aes lung tu aecteefaete-a nun-aettaeck skeells.'],
2138=>['Hexer\'s Feegur','Fur 10 secunds, yuoo haefe-a +1...8 Heaelt regeneraeshun. Hexer\'s Feegur inds iff yuoo caest a nun-hex skeell.','(10 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +1...8 Heaelt regeneraeshun. Inds iff yuoo use-a a nun-hex skeell.'],
2139=>['Maesucheesm','Fur 10...40 secunds, yuoo haefe-a +2 tu yuoor Deaet Maegeec und Suool Reaepeeng aettreebootes und saecreeffeece-a 5...3% ooff yuoor maexeemoom Heaelt vhenefer yuoo caest a spell.','(10...40 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +2 Deaet Maegeec und Suool Reaepeeng. Yuoo saecreeffeece-a 5...3% ooff yuoor maexeemoom Heaelt vhenefer yuoo caest a spell.'],
2140=>['Peeerceeng Traep','Vhee Peeerceeng Traep is treeggered, aell neaerby fues aere-a stroock fur 5...50 peeerceeng daemaege-a. Uny fues veet Craecked Aermur aere-a stroock fur un aeddeeshunael 15...60 daemaege-a. Peeerceeng Traep inds aeffter 90 secunds. Vheele-a aecteefaeteeng thees skeell, yuoo aere-a iaeseely interroopted.','(90 secunds.) Aeffffects neaerby fues. Deaels 5...50 peeerceeng daemaege-a. Deaels 15...60 mure-a daemaege-a tu uny fues veet Craecked Aermur. Iaeseely interroopted.'],
2141=>['Cumpuneeunsheep','Iff yuoo haefe-a less Heaelt thun yuoor pet, yuoo aere-a heaeled fur 30...120 Heaelt. Iff yuoor pet haes less Heaelt thun yuoo, it is heaeled fur 30...120 Heaelt.','Heaels yuoo fur 30...120 iff yuoo haefe-a less Heaelt thun yuoor pet. Heaels yuoor pet fur 30...120 iff it haes less Heaelt thun yuoo.'],
2142=>['Ferael Aeggresseeun','Fur 5...20 secunds, yuoor pet aettaecks 33% faester und deaels 3...10 aeddeeshunael daemaege-a.','(5...20 secunds.) Yuoor pet aettaecks 33% faester und deaels +3...10 daemaege-a.'],
2143=>['Deesroopteeng Shut','Iff thees aettaeck heets, taerget fue-a\'s aecshun is interroopted. Iff thaet aecshun vaes a skeell, yuoo streeke-a fur +10...40 daemaege-a.','Interroopts un aecshun. Interroopshun iffffect: +10...40 daemaege-a iff yuoo interroopt a skeell.'],
2144=>['Fulley','Aell yuoor prepaeraeshuns aere-a remufed. Shuut aerroos aet taerget fue-a und up tu 3 fue-as aedjaecent tu yuoor taerget. Zeese-a aerroos streeke-a fur +1...10 daemaege-a iff zeey heet.','Deaels +1...10 daemaege-a. Heets up tu 3 fues aedjaecent tu yuoor taerget. Aell yuoor prepaeraeshuns aere-a remufed.'],
2145=>['Ixpert Fucoos','Fur 24 secunds, yuoor boo aettaeck skeells cust 1...2 less Inergy und deael 1...10 ixtra daemaege-a.','(24 secunds.) Yuoor boo aettaeck skeells cust 1...2 less Inergy und du +1...10 daemaege-a.'],
2146=>['Peeuoos Foory','Remufe-a 1 Derfeesh inchuntment. Fur 1...7 secunds, yuoo aettaeck 25% faester. Iff un inchuntment vaes remufed, thees stunce-a laests tveece-a aes lung.','(1...7 secunds.) Yuoo aettaeck 25% faester und remufe-a 1 ooff yuoor Derfeesh inchuntments. Remufael iffffect: thees stunce-a laests tveece-a aes lung.'],
2147=>['Creeppleeng Feectury','Iff thees aettaeck heets a fue-a, thaet fue-a is Creeppled fur 3...8 secunds. Iff yuoo haefe-a mure-a Heaelt thun taerget fue-a, aell aedjaecent fues taeke-a 10...30 iaert daemaege-a.','(3...8 secunds.) Creepples taerget fue-a. Iff yuoo haefe-a mure-a Heaelt thun taerget fue-a, aell aedjaecent fues taeke-a 10...30 iaert daemaege-a.'],
2148=>['Soondereeng Veaepun','Fur 4...10 secunds, taerget aelly\'s next 3 aettaecks haefe-a 10% aermur penetraeshun und coose-a Craecked Aermur fur 5...20 secunds.','(4...10 secunds.) Taerget aelly\'s next 3 aettaecks inffleect Craecked Aermur cundeeshun (5...20 secunds) und haefe-a 10% aermur penetraeshun.'],
2149=>['Veaepun ooff Renooael','Fur 5...20 secunds, zee next teeme-a taerget aelly heets veet un aettaeck skeell, thaet aelly gaeeens 1...7 Inergy.','(5...20 secunds.) Taerget aelly gaeeens 1...7 Inergy zee next teeme-a thees aelly heets veet un aettaeck skeell.'],
2150=>['Maeeemeeng Speaer','Iff yuoor aettaeck heets a Bleedeeng fue-a, thaet fue-a is Creeppled fur 5...20 secunds.','Inffleects Creeppled cundeeshun (5...20 secunds) iff taerget fue-a is Bleedeeng.'],
2186=>['Seegnet ooff Deaedly Curroopshun','Taerget fue-a taekes 5...35 daemaege-a fur iaech cundeeshun oon thaet fue-a (maexeemoom 130 daemaege-a).','Deaels 5...35 daemaege-a (maexeemoom 130) fur iaech cundeeshun oon taerget fue-a.'],
2187=>['Vaey ooff zee Maester','Fur 60 secunds, vheele-a huldeeng a nun-daegger veaepun, yuoo haefe-a un aeddeeshunael 3...33% chunce-a tu lund a creeteecael heet.','(60 secunds.) Vheele-a huldeeng a nun-daegger veaepun, yuoo haefe-a +3...33% chunce-a tu lund a creeteecael heet.'],
2188=>['Deffeele-a Deffenses','Fur 5...20 secunds, zee next teeme-a taerget fue-a blucks, thaet fue-a taekes 30...120 daemaege-a.','(5...20 secunds.) Deaels 30...120 daemaege-a zee next teeme-a taerget fue-a blucks.'],
2189=>['Ungurudun\'s Gaeze-a','Steael 10...50 Heaelt frum taerget fue-a. Iff yuoo aere-a sooffffereeng frum a cundeeshun, yuoo gaeeen 3...12 Inergy. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Steaels 10...50 Heaelt. Yuoo gaeeen 3...12 Inergy iff yuoo haefe-a a cundeeshun.'],
2190=>['Maegneteec Soorge-a','Taerget fue-a taekes 15...75 daemaege-a. Iff yuoo aere-a Oofercaest, Maegneteec Soorge-a inchunts aell aelleees in iaershut fur 1...5 secunds tu bluck zee next aettaeck aegaeeenst zeem.','Deaels 15...75 daemaege-a. Iff yuoo aere-a Oofercaest, aelleees in iaershut aere-a inchunted fur 1...5 und bluck zee next aettaeck aegaeeenst zeem.'],
2191=>['Sleeppery Gruoond','Iff taerget oor aedjaecent fues aere-a Bleend oor mufeeng, zeese-a fues aere-a knucked doon. Zeere-a is a 50% chunce-a ooff faeeeloore-a veet Vaeter Maegeec less thun 5.',' Cooses knuck-doon iff thees fue-a is Bleend oor mufeeng. Aeffffects fues aedjaecent tu yuoor taerget. 50% faeeeloore-a chunce-a unless Vaeter Maegeec greaeter thun 4.'],
2192=>['Glooeeng Ice-a','Taerget fue-a is stroock fur 5...50 culd daemaege-a. Iff thaet fue-a is under zee iffffects ooff a Vaeter Maegeec hex, yuoo gaeeen 5 Inergy ploos 1 Inergy fur ifery 2 runks ooff Inergy Sturaege-a.','Deaels 5...50 culd daemaege-a. Yuoo gaeeen 5 Inergy ploos 1 Inergy fur ifery 2 runks ooff Inergy Sturaege-a iff taerget fue-a is hexed veet Vaeter Maegeec.'],
2193=>['Inergy Blaest','Taerget fue-a taekes 1...2 daemaege-a fur iaech pueent ooff Inergy yuoo haefe-a (maexeemoom 130 daemaege-a).','Deaels 1...2 daemaege-a (maexeemoom 130) fur iaech pueent ooff Inergy yuoo haefe-a.'],
2194=>['Deestraecteeng Streeke-a','Iff Deestraecteeng Streeke-a heets, it deaels nu daemaege-a und interroopts taerget fue-a\'s aecshun. Iff taerget fue-a haes Craecked Aermur, thaet skeell is deesaebled fur 30 secunds.','Interroopts un aecshun. Interroopshun iffffect: Deesaebles interroopted skeell (30 secunds) iff taerget fue-a haes Craecked Aermur. Deaels nu daemaege-a.'],
2195=>['Symbuleec Streeke-a','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo deael +12 daemaege-a fur iaech seegnet yuoo haefe-a iqooeepped (maexeemoom 70 daemaege-a).','Deaels +12 daemaege-a (maexeemoom 70) fur iaech seegnet yuoo haefe-a iqooeepped.'],
2196=>['Suldeeer\'s Speed','Fur 3...18 secunds, yuoo mufe-a 15% faester. Yuoo mufe-a un aeddeeshunael 15% faester vheele-a under zee iffffects ooff a chunt oor shuoot.','(3...18 secunds.) Yuoo mufe-a 15% faester und un aeddeeshunael 15% faester vheele-a aeffffected by a chunt oor shuoot.'],
2197=>['Budy Bloo','Iff thees aettaeck heets, taerget fue-a taekes +10...40 daemaege-a. Iff taerget fue-a haes Craecked Aermur, thaet fue-a sooffffers frum a Deep Vuoond fur 0...15 secunds.','Deaels +10...40 daemaege-a. Inffleects Deep Vuoond (0...15 secunds) iff taerget fue-a haes Craecked Aermur.'],
2198=>['Budy Shut','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo deael +5...20 daemaege-a. Iff it heets a fue-a veet Craecked Aermur, yuoo gaeeen 5...10 Inergy.','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Yuoo gaeeen 5...10 Inergy iff taerget fue-a haes Craecked Aermur.'],
2199=>['Pueesun Teep Seegnet','Fur 60 secunds, yuoor next aettaeck aelsu inffleects Pueesun fur 8...15 secunds.','(60 secunds.) Inffleects Pueesuned cundeeshun (8...15 secunds) veet yuoor next aettaeck.'],
2200=>['Seegnet ooff Mysteec Speed','Fur 30 secunds, yuoor next 1...3 selff-taergeteeng inchuntments caest instuntly. Flaesh inchuntments du nut cunsoome-a uses ooff thees skeell.','(30 secunds.) Yuoor next 1...3 selff-taergeted inchuntments caest instuntly. Flaesh inchuntments du nut cunsoome-a uses ooff thees skeell.'],
2201=>['Sheeeld ooff Furce-a','Fur 1...16 secunds, blucks zee next 1 aettaecks aegaeeenst yuoo. Iff un aettaeck is blucked, aell aedjaecent aettaeckeeng fues aere-a knucked doon und sooffffer frum Veaekness fur 5...20 secunds. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(1...16 secunds.) Blucks zee next 1 aettaecks aegaeeenst yuoo. Knucks doon und inffleects Veaekness (5...20 secunds) oon aell aedjaecent aettaeckeeng fues.'],
2202=>['Mendeeng Greep','Taerget aelly is heaeled fur 30...90 Heaelt. Iff thaet aelly is under zee iffffects ooff a veaepun spell, thaet aelly luses oone-a cundeeshun.','Heaels fur 30...90. Remufes oone-a cundeeshun iff taerget aelly is under a Veaepun spell.'],
2203=>['Spureetleech Oora','Fur 5...20 secunds, aell ooff yuoor spureets veetheen iaershut deael 5...20 less daemaege-a und steael 5...20 Heaelt vhee zeey aettaeck.','(5...20 secunds.) Aell ooff yuoor spureets veetheen iaershut deael 5...20 less daemaege-a und steael 5...20 Heaelt vhee zeey aettaeck. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
2204=>['Rejoofenaeshun','Creaete-a a lefel 1...20 spureet. Thees spureet heaels aell paerty members veetheen iaershut fur 3...10 Heaelt iaech secund. Thees spureet luses 3...10 Heaelt fur iaech paerty member heaeled in thees vaey. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...90 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...20 spureet (30...90 secund leeffespun). Heaels paerty members in iaershut fur 3...10 iaech secund. Heaeleeng cust: thees spureet luses 3...10 Heaelt.'],
2205=>['Aeguny','Creaete-a a lefel 1...12 spureet. Thees spureet cooses 3...10 Heaelt luss iaech secund tu fues veetheen iaershut. Thees spureet luses 3...10 Heaelt fur iaech fue-a hoort in thees vaey. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...90 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...12 spureet (30...90 secund leeffespun). Cooses 3...10 Heaelt luss iaech secund tu fues in iaershut. Thees spureet luses 3...10 Heaelt fur iaech fue-a thaet luses Heaelt.'],
2206=>['Ghustly Veaepun','Fur 5...20 secunds, taerget oozeer aelly\'s next aettaeck cunnut be-a blucked.','(5...20 secunds.) Taerget aelly\'s next aettaeck is unbluckaeble-a. Cunnut selff-taerget.'],
2207=>['Inspuraeshunael Speech','Yuoo luse-a aell aedrenaeleene-a und taerget oozeer aelly gaeeens 1...8 streeke-as ooff aedrenaeleene-a.','Taerget aelly gaeeens 1...8 streeke-as ooff aedrenaeleene-a. Cunnut selff-taerget. Yuoo luse-a aell aedrenaeleene-a.'],
2208=>['Boorneeng Sheeeld','Fur 3...9 secunds, vheele-a veeeldeeng a sheeeld, zee next aettaeck skeell used aegaeeenst yuoo is blucked. Iff it vaes a melee-a aettaeck, yuoor aettaecker is set oon fure-a fur 1...6 secunds.','(3...9 secunds.) Blucks zee next aettaeck skeell aegaeeenst yuoo. Inffleects Boorneeng cundeeshun (1...6 secunds) iff it vaes a melee-a aettaeck. Nu iffffect unless yuoo aere-a veeeldeeng a sheeeld.'],
2209=>['Huly Speaer','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo deael +5...20 daemaege-a. Iff it heets a soommuned creaetoore-a, aell neaerby fues taeke-a 15...90 huly daemaege-a, und aere-a set oon fure-a fur 3 secunds.','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Deaels 15...90 huly daemaege-a und inffleects Boorneeng cundeeshun (3 secunds) tu neaerby fues iff yuoo heet a soommuned creaetoore-a.'],
2210=>['Speaer Sveepe-a','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo deael +5...20 daemaege-a und taerget fue-a is Daezed fur 4...10 secunds. Thees aettaeck haes melee-a runge-a.','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a und inffleects Daezed cundeeshun (4...10 secunds). Thees aettaeck haes melee-a runge-a.'],
2211=>['Aelkaer\'s Aelchemeecael Aeceed','Throo Aelkaer\'s Aelchemeecael Aeceed aet taerget fue-a. Taerget und aedjaecent fues aere-a stroock fur 40...50 daemaege-a. Destruyers taeke-a un aeddeeshunael 45...70 daemaege-a und zeey haefe-a Craecked Aermur fur 14...20 secunds.','Prujecteele-a: deaels 40...50 daemaege-a tu taerget und aedjaecent fues. Deaels 45...70 mure-a daemaege-a und inffleects Craecked Aermur cundeeshun (14...20 secunds) tu Destruyers.'],
2212=>['Leeght ooff Deldreemur','Aell fues in zee aerea aere-a stroock fur 55...80 huly daemaege-a. Zee lucaeshun ooff heeddee oobjects aere-a breeeffly indeecaeted oon yuoor Cumpaess. Uny heeddee oobjects in zee aerea aere-a refeaeled.','Deaels 55...80 huly daemaege-a tu fues in zee aerea. Peengs heeddee oobjects veetheen zee aerea oon zee cumpaess.'],
2213=>['Iaer Beete-a','Taerget tuooched fue-a taekes 50...70 peeerceeng daemaege-a und begeens Bleedeeng fur 15...25 secunds.','Deaels 50...70 peeerceeng daemaege-a und Inffleects Bleedeeng cundeeshun (15...25 secunds).'],
2214=>['Loo Bloo','Streeke-a taerget fue-a fur 45...70 daemaege-a. Iff taerget fue-a is knucked doon, thaet fue-a taekes un aeddeeshunael 30...50 daemaege-a und sooffffers frum Craecked Aermur fur 14...20 secunds.','Deaels 45...70 daemaege-a. Deaels 30...50 mure-a daemaege-a und Inffleects Craecked Aermur (14...20 secunds) iff taerget fue-a is knucked-doon.'],
2215=>['Braevleeng Heaedboott','Yuoo heaedboott taerget tuooched fue-a, deaeleeng 45...70 daemaege-a und knuckeeng doon thaet fue-a iff it heets. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Deaels 45...70 daemaege-a; cooses knuck-doon.'],
2216=>['"Dun\'t Treep!"','Fur 3...5 secunds, paerty members veetheen iaershut cunnut be-a knucked doon.','(3...5 secunds.) Prefents knuck-doon; aeffffects paerty members veetheen iaershut.'],
2217=>['"By Urael\'s Haemmer!"','Fur 30 secunds, aell deaed paerty members in iaershut aere-a resoorrected veet fooll Heaelt und Inergy. Resoorrected paerty members deael 25...33% mure-a daemaege-a. Vhee thees iffffect inds, aeffffected paerty members deee-a. Thees skeell dues nut incoor a deaet penaelty.','(30 secunds.) Resoorrect aell deaed paerty members in iaershut veet fooll Heaelt und Inergy. Aeffffected paerty members deael 25...33% mure-a daemaege-a. Aeffffected paerty members deee-a vhee it inds, boot du nut receeefe-a a deaet penaelty.'],
2218=>['Droonkee Maester','Fur 72...90 secunds, yuoor mufement und aettaeck speeds aere-a increaesed by 10...15%. Iff yuoo aere-a droonk vheele-a aecteefaeteeng thees skeell, yuoor mufement und aettaeck speeds aere-a increaesed by 25...33% insteaed.','(72...90 secunds.) Yuoo mufe-a und aettaeck 10...15% faester iff yuoo aere-a nut droonk. Yuoo mufe-a und aettaeck 25...33% faester iff yuoo aere-a droonk.'],
2219=>['Greaet Dvaerff Veaepun','Fur 20 secunds, taerget oozeer aelly\'s veaepun streekes fur +15...20 daemaege-a und haes a 28...40% chunce-a tu coose-a knuck doon. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(20 secunds.) +15...20 veaepun daemaege-a und 28...40% chunce-a tu coose-a knuck-doon veet aettaecks. Cunnut selff-taerget.'],
2220=>['Greaet Dvaerff Aermur','Fur 22...40 secunds, taerget aelly haes +24 aermur, +60 maexeemoom Heaelt, und un aeddeeshunael +24 aermur aegaeeenst Destruyers.','(22...40 secunds.) +24 aermur und +60 maexeemoom Heaelt. Aeddeeshunael +24 aermur aegaeeenst Destruyers. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
2221=>['Breaet ooff zee Greaet Dvaerff','Aell paerty members aere-a releeefed ooff Boorneeng und aere-a heaeled fur 50...60 Heaelt.','Remufes Boorneeng und heaels fur 50...60; aeffffects paerty members.'],
2222=>['Snoo Sturm','Creaete-a a Snoo Sturm aet taerget fue-a\'s lucaeshun. Fur 5 secunds, fues aedjaecent tu thaet lucaeshun aere-a stroock fur 30...40 culd daemaege-a iaech secund.','Deaels 30...40 culd daemaege-a iaech secund (5 secunds). Heets fues aedjaecent tu taerget fue-a\'s ineeteeael lucaeshun.'],
2223=>['Blaeck Pooder Meene-a','Vhee Blaeck Pooder Meene-a is treeggered, aell neaerby fues aere-a stroock fur 20...30 daemaege-a, becume-a Bleended, und begeen Bleedeeng fur 7...10 secunds. Blaeck Pooder Meene-a inds aeffter 90 secunds. Vheele-a aecteefaeteeng thees skeell, yuoo aere-a iaeseely interroopted.','(90 secunds.) Aeffffects neaerby fues. Deaels 20...30 daemaege-a. Inffleects Bleendness und Bleedeeng cundeeshuns (7...10 secunds). Iaeseely interroopted.'],
2224=>['Soommun Moorsaeaet','Soommun a lefel 14...20 Moorsaeaet thaet leefes fur 40...60 secunds und haes Inerfaeteeng Chaerge-a. Oonly 1 Aesoora Soommun cun be-a aecteefe-a aet a teeme-a.','Soommuns a lefel 14...20 Moorsaeaet (40...60 secund leeffespun) thaet haes Inerfaeteeng Chaerge-a. Oonly 1 Aesoora Soommun cun be-a aecteefe-a aet a teeme-a.'],
2225=>['Soommun Rooby Djeenn','Soommun a lefel 14...20 Rooby Djeenn thaet leefes fur 40...60 secunds und haes Immulaete-a. Oonly 1 Aesoora Soommun cun be-a aecteefe-a aet a teeme-a.','Soommuns a lefel 14...20 Rooby Djeenn (40...60 secund leeffespun) thaet haes Immulaete-a. Oonly 1 Aesoora Soommun cun be-a aecteefe-a aet a teeme-a.'],
2226=>['Soommun Ice-a Imp','Soommun a lefel 14...20 Ice-a Imp thaet leefes fur 40...60 secunds und haes Ice-a Speekes. Oonly 1 Aesoora Soommun cun be-a aecteefe-a aet a teeme-a.','Soommuns a lefel 14...20 Ice-a Imp thaet haes Ice-a Speekes (40...60 secund leeffespun). Oonly 1 Aesoora Soommun cun be-a aecteefe-a aet a teeme-a.'],
2227=>['Soommun Naega Shaemun','Soommun a lefel 14...20 Naega Shaemun thaet leefes fur 40...60 secunds und haes Stuneeng. Oonly 1 Aesoora Soommun cun be-a aecteefe-a aet a teeme-a.','Soommuns a lefel 14...20 Naega Shaemun (40...60 secund leeffespun) thaet haes Stuneeng. Oonly 1 Aesoora Soommun cun be-a aecteefe-a aet a teeme-a.'],
2228=>['Defft Streeke-a','Iff thees aettaeck heets, taerget fue-a taekes 18...30 daemaege-a. Iff thaet fue-a haes Craecked Aermur, it begeens Bleedeeng fur 18...30 secunds.','Deaels 18...30 daemaege-a. Inffleects Bleedeeng cundeeshun (18...30 secunds) iff taerget fue-a haes Craecked Aermur.'],
2229=>['Seegnet ooff Inffecshun','Iff taerget fue-a is Bleedeeng, thaet fue-a is Deeseaesed fur 13...20 secunds.','Inffleects Deeseaesed cundeeshun (13...20 secunds) iff taerget fue-a is Bleedeeng.'],
2230=>['Tryptuphun Seegnet','Fur 14...20 secunds, taerget fue-a und aell aedjaecent fues mufe-a und aettaeck 23...40% slooer. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(14...20 secunds.) Taerget und aedjaecent fues mufe-a und aettaeck 23...40% slooer.'],
2231=>['Ibun Baettle-a Stundaerd ooff Cuooraege-a','Yuoo plunt un Ibun Baettle-a Stundaerd ooff Cuooraege-a aet yuoor coorrent lucaeshun. Fur 14...20 secunds, nun-spureet aelleees in thees aerea gaeeen +24 aermur und un aeddeeshunael +24 aermur aegaeeenst Chaerr.','(14...20 secunds.) Aelleees in thees vaerd haefe-a +24 aermur und +24 mure-a aermur aegaeeenst Chaerr. Spureets aere-a unaeffffected.'],
2232=>['Ibun Baettle-a Stundaerd ooff Veesdum','Yuoo plunt un Ibun Baettle-a Stundaerd ooff Veesdum aet yuoor coorrent lucaeshun. Fur 14...20 secunds, nun-spureet aelleees in thees aerea haefe-a a 44...60% chunce-a tu haelfe-a zee rechaerge-a teeme-a ooff spells zeey caest. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(14...20 secunds.) Spells thaet aelleees in thees vaerd caest haefe-a a 44...60% chunce-a tu rechaerge-a 50% faester. Spureets aere-a unaeffffected.'],
2233=>['Ibun Baettle-a Stundaerd ooff Hunur','Yuoo plunt un Ibun Baettle-a Stundaerd ooff Hunur aet yuoor coorrent lucaeshun. Fur 14...20 secunds, nun-spureet aelleees in thees aerea streeke-a fur +8...15 daemaege-a und un aeddeeshunael +7...10 aegaeeenst Chaerr.','(14...20 secunds.) Aelleees in thees vaerd deael +8...15 daemaege-a und +7...10 mure-a daemaege-a aegaeeenst Chaerr. Spureets aere-a unaeffffected.'],
2234=>['Ibun Fungooaerd Sneeper Sooppurt','Taerget fue-a is stroock fur 54...90 peeerceeng daemaege-a und begeens Bleedeeng fur 5...25 secunds. Thees aettaeck haes a 10% chunce-a ooff dueeng un aeddeeshunael 540...900 peeerceeng daemaege-a. Iff thees aettaeck heets a Chaerr it haes a 25% chunce-a ooff dueeng un aeddeeshunael 540...900 peeerceeng daemaege-a. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Deaels 54...90 peeerceeng daemaege-a und inffleects Bleedeeng cundeeshun (5...25 secunds). 10% chunce-a ooff +540...900 peeerceeng daemaege-a. 25% chunce-a ooff +540...900 peeerceeng daemaege-a iff taerget fue-a is a Chaerr.'],
2235=>['Ibun Fungooaerd Aessaesseen Sooppurt','Soommun a lefel 14...20 Ibun Fungooaerd Aessaesseen thaet haes Irun Paelm, Fux Fungs, und Neene-a Taeeel Streeke-a. Thees soommuned Aessaesseen Shaedoo Steps tu taerget fue-a. Iff taerget fue-a is a Chaerr, zee Aessaesseen leefes fur 24...30 secunds. Iff taerget fue-a is nut a Chaerr, zee Aessaesseen leefes fur 12...15 secunds.','Soommuns a lefel 14...20 aessaesseen thaet haes Irun Paelm, Fux Fungs, und Neene-a Taeeel Streeke-a; it Shaedoo Steps tu thees fue-a. Iff thees fue-a is a Chaerr, zee aessaesseen leefes fur 24...30 secunds. Iff thees fue-a is nut a Chaerr, zee aessaesseen leefes fur 12...15 secunds.'],
2236=>['Vell ooff Rooeen','Ixplueet neaerest curpse-a oor saecreeffeece-a 66% heaelt tu creaete-a a Vell ooff Rooeen aet its lucaeshun. Fur 5...30 secunds, vhenefer a fue-a in zee vell taekes physeecael daemaege-a, thaet fue-a haes Craecked Aermur fur 5...20 secunds.','(5...30 secunds.) Inffleects Craecked Aermur cundeeshun (5...20 secunds) tu uny fue-a in zee vell thaet taekes physeecael daemaege-a. Ixplueets a fresh curpse-a oor saecreeffeeces 66% heaelt.'],
2237=>['Aetruphy','Fur 3...7 secunds, taerget fue-a\'s preemaery aettreeboote-a is redooced tu 0.','(3...7 secunds.) Redooces thees fue-a\'s preemaery aettreeboote-a tu 0.'],
2238=>['Speaer ooff Redempshun','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo deael +5...20 daemaege-a. Iff it faeeels tu heet, yuoo luse-a oone-a cundeeshun.','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Iff it faeeels tu heet, yuoo luse-a oone-a cundeeshun.'],
2353=>['"Feeneesh Heem!"','Iff taerget fue-a haes less thun 50% Heaelt, thaet fue-a taekes 44...80 daemaege-a und sooffffers frum Craecked Aermur und a Deep Vuoond fur 12...20 secunds.','Deaels 44...80 daemaege-a und inffleects Craecked Aermur und Deep Vuoond cundeeshuns (12...20 secunds). Nu iffffect unless taerget fue-a haes less thun 50% Heaelt.'],
2354=>['"Dudge-a Thees!"','Fur 16...20 secunds, yuoor next aettaeck cunnut be-a blucked und dues +14...20 daemaege-a.','(16...20 secunds.) Yuoor next aettaeck is unbluckaeble-a und deaels +14...20 daemaege-a.'],
2355=>['"I Aem zee Strungest!"','Yuoor next 5...8 aettaecks du un aeddeeshunael +14...20 daemaege-a.','Yuoor next 5...8 aettaecks deael +14...20 daemaege-a.'],
2356=>['"I Aem Unstuppaeble-a!"','Fur 16...20 secunds, yuoo haefe-a +24 aermur und cunnut be-a knucked doon oor Creeppled.','(16...20 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +24 aermur und cunnut be-a knucked-doon oor Creeppled.'],
2357=>['A Tuooch ooff Gooeele-a','Taerget tuooched fue-a taekes 44...80 daemaege-a. Iff taerget fue-a vaes knucked doon, thaet fue-a cunnut aettaeck fur 5...8 secunds.','Deaels 44...80 daemaege-a. Taerget fue-a cunnut aettaeck (5...8 secunds) iff it vaes knucked-doon.'],
2358=>['"Yuoo Mufe-a Leeke-a a Dvaerff!"','Taerget fue-a is knucked doon und taekes 44...80 daemaege-a. Thaet fue-a is aelsu Creeppled fur 8...15 secunds.','Deaels 44...80 daemaege-a, cooses knuckdoon, und inffleects Creeppled cundeeshun (8...15 secunds).'],
2359=>['"Yuoo Aere-a Aell Veaekleengs!"','Taerget fue-a und fues aedjaecent tu taerget aere-a Veaekened fur 8...12 secunds.','Inffleects Veaekness cundeeshun (8...12 secunds). Aelsu aeffffects aedjaecent fues.'],
2360=>['Feel Nu Paeeen','Fur 30 secunds yuoo haefe-a +2...3 Heaelt regeneraeshun. Iff yuoo aere-a droonk vhee aecteefaeteeng thees skeell, yuoo aelsu haefe-a +200...300 maexeemoom Heaelt.','(30 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +2...3 Heaelt regeneraeshun. Yuoo haefe-a +200...300 maexeemoom Heaelt iff yuoo aere-a droonk vhee aecteefaeteeng thees skeell.'],
2361=>['Cloob ooff a Thuoosund Beaers','Iff thees aettaeck heets, it deaels +6...9 daemaege-a fur iaech aedjaecent fue-a (maexeemoom 60 daemaege-a). Iff taerget fue-a is nun-hoomun it is knucked doon.','Deaels +6...9 daemaege-a fur iaech aedjaecent fue-a (maexeemoom 60 daemaege-a). Cooses knuck-doon iff taerget fue-a is nun-hoomun.'],
2374=>['Ursun Blesseeng','Yuoo luse-a aell iffffects und taeke-a oon zee aespect ooff zee beaer. Fur 60 secunds, yuoo haefe-a 100 aermur und 750...800 Heaelt. Aell yuoor aettreebootes aere-a set tu 0 und beaer aettaecks replaece-a yuoor skeells.','Yuoo luse-a aell iffffects und taeke-a oon zee aespect ooff zee beaer (60 secunds). Aell yuoor aettreebootes aere-a set tu 0 und beaer aettaecks replaece-a yuoor skeells, und yuoo haefe-a 100 aermur und 750...800 Heaelt.'],
2379=>['Fulffee Blesseeng','Yuoo luse-a aell iffffects und taeke-a oon zee aespect ooff zee vulff. Fur 60 secunds, yuoo haefe-a 80 aermur, 660...700 Heaelt, und 2...4 Heaelt regeneraeshun. Aell yuoor aettreebootes aere-a set tu 0 und vulff aettaecks replaece-a yuoor skeells.','Yuoo luse-a aell iffffects und taeke-a oon zee aespect ooff zee vulff (60 secunds). Aell yuoor aettreebootes aere-a set tu 0 und vulff aettaecks replaece-a yuoor skeells, und yuoo haefe-a 80 aermur, 660...700 Heaelt, und 2...4 Heaelt regeneraeshun.'],
2384=>['Raefee Blesseeng','Yuoo luse-a aell iffffects und taeke-a oon zee aespect ooff zee raefee. Fur 60 secunds, yuoo haefe-a 80 aermur, 660...700 Heaelt, und a 20...30% chunce-a tu bluck. Aell yuoor aettreebootes aere-a set tu 0 und raefee aettaecks replaece-a yuoor skeells.','Yuoo luse-a aell iffffects und taeke-a oon zee aespect ooff zee raefee (60 secunds). Aell yuoor aettreebootes aere-a set tu 0 und raefee aettaecks replaece-a yuoor skeells, und yuoo haefe-a 80 aermur, 660...700 Heaelt, und a 20...30% bluck chunce-a.'],
2411=>['Meendbender','Fur 10...16 secunds, yuoo mufe-a 20...33% faester und yuoor spells taeke-a 20% less teeme-a tu caest.','(10...16 secunds.) Yuoo mufe-a 20...33% faester und caest spells 20% faester.'],
2412=>['Smuut Creemeenael','Fur 10...20 secunds, oone-a rundum spell is deesaebled fur taerget fue-a und Smuut Creemeenael is replaeced by thaet spell. Yuoo gaeeen 5...10 Inergy.','(10...20 secunds.) Deesaebles oone-a spell. Thees skeell becumes thaet spell. Yuoo gaeeen 5...10 Inergy.'],
2413=>['Technubaebble-a','Taerget fue-a und aell aedjaecent fues aere-a stroock fur 30...40 daemaege-a. Iff taerget fue-a is nut a buss, thaet fue-a und aell aedjaecent fues aere-a Daezed fur 3...5 secunds.','Deaels 30...40 daemaege-a tu taerget und aedjaecent fues. Inffleects Daezed cundeeshun (3...5 secunds) oon zeese-a fues iff taerget vaes nut a buss.'],
2414=>['Raedeeaeshun Feeeld','Fur 5 secunds, fues in zee aerea haefe-a -4...6 Heaelt degeneraeshun. Vhee zee purtael inds, fues in zee aerea aere-a Deeseaesed fur 12...20 secunds.','(5 secunds.) Cooses -4...6 Heaelt degeneraeshun tu fues in zee aerea. Ind iffffect: inffleects Deeseaese-a cundeeshun (12...20 secunds) tu fues in zee aerea.'],
2415=>['Aesoorun Scun','Fur 9...12 secunds, yuoor aettaecks cunnut meess taerget fue-a. Keelleeng a fue-a hexed veet Aesoorun Scun remufes 5% Deaet Penaelty.','(9...12 secunds.) Yuoo cunnut meess taerget fue-a. Iff yuoo keell thees fue-a, yuoo luse-a 5% Deaet Penaelty.'],
2416=>['Aeur ooff Soopereeureety','Fur 20...30 secunds, yuoo gaeeen a rundum Aesoora beneffeet ifery teeme-a yuoo iaern ixpereeence-a frum keelleeng un inemy.','(20...30 secunds.) Gaeeen a rundum Aesoora beneffeet ifery teeme-a yuoo iaern ixpereeence-a frum keelleeng un inemy.'],
2417=>['Mentael Bluck','Fur 5...11 secunds yuoo haefe-a a 50% chunce-a tu bluck aettaecks. Thees inchuntment is reaeppleeed ifery teeme-a un inemy streekes yuoo.','(5...11 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a 50% chunce-a tu bluck. Renooael: ifery teeme-a un inemy heets yuoo.'],
2418=>['Paeeen Inferter','Fur 6...10 secunds, ifery teeme-a taerget fue-a deaels daemaege-a thaet fue-a taekes 100...140% ooff zee daemaege-a it cooses (maexeemoom 80 daemaege-a).','(6...10 secunds.) Deaels 100...140% ooff zee daemaege-a (maexeemoom 80) baeck tu taerget fue-a iaech teeme-a it dues daemaege-a.'],
2420=>['Ibun Iscaepe-a','Shaedoo Step tu taerget oozeer aelly. Yuoo und thaet aelly aere-a heaeled fur 70...110 Heaelt.','Heaels yuoo und taerget aelly fur 70...110. Ineeteeael iffffect: Shaedoo Step tu thees aelly. Cunnut selff-taerget.'],
2421=>['Veaekness Traep','Vhee Veaekness Traep is treeggered, aell neaerby fues aere-a Veaekened fur 10...20 secunds und taeke-a 24...50 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Aell Chaerr aere-a knucked doon. Veaekness Traep inds aeffter 90 secunds. Vheele-a aecteefaeteeng thees skeell, yuoo aere-a iaeseely interroopted.','(90 secunds.) Aeffffects neaerby fues. Deaels 24...50 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Inffleects Veaekness cundeeshun (10...20 secunds). Knucks-doon Chaerr. Iaeseely interroopted.'],
2422=>['Veends','Creaete-a a lefel 4...10 spureet. Aell fues veetheen its runge-a haefe-a a 15% chunce-a tu meess veet runged aettaecks. Thees spureet deees aeffter 54...90 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 4...10 spureet (54...90 secund leeffespun.) Aeffffects fues veetheen runge-a. 15% chunce-a tu meess veet runged aettaecks.'],
2423=>['Dvaerfee Staebeeleety','Fur 24...30 secunds, yuoor stunces laest 55...100% lunger. Iff yuoo aecteefaeted thees skeell vheele-a droonk, yuoo cunnut be-a knucked doon.','(24...30 secunds.) Yuoor stunces laest 55...100% lunger. Yuoo cunnut be-a knucked-doon iff yuoo aecteefaeted thees skeell vheele-a droonk .'],
2657=>['Caell ooff Haeste-a (PfP)','Fur 30 secunds, yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun haes a 25% faester aettaeck speed und mufes 25% faester.','(30 secunds.) Yuoor pet mufes und aettaecks 25% faester.'],
2734=>['Meend Vraeck (PfP)','Fur 5...40 secunds, vhenefer thees fue-a is zee taerget ooff oone-a ooff yuoor nun-hex Mesmer skeells, thaet fue-a luses 1 Inergy. Iff zee taerget fue-a\'s Inergy drups tu 0, Meend Vraeck inds und thaet fue-a taekes 15...100 daemaege-a.','(5...40 secunds.) Cooses 1 Inergy luss iaech teeme-a fue-a is zee taerget ooff yuoor nun-hex Mesmer skeells. Iff taerget fue-a\'s Inergy drups tu 0, Meend Vraeck inds und thaet fue-a taekes 15...100 daemaege-a. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
2803=>['Meend Freeze-a (PfP)','Taerget fue-a taekes 10...60 culd daemaege-a. Iff yuoo haefe-a mure-a Inergy thun taerget fue-a, thaet fue-a sooffffers un aeddeeshunael 10...60 culd daemaege-a und mufes 90% slooer fur 1...5 secunds. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Deaels 10...60 culd daemaege-a. Iff yuoo haefe-a mure-a Inergy thun taerget fue-a, deaels +10...60 culd daemaege-a und cooses 90% slooer mufement (1...5 secunds). Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
2804=>['Meend Shuck (PfP)','Taerget fue-a sooffffers 10...50 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Iff yuoo haefe-a mure-a Inergy thun taerget fue-a, thaet fue-a sooffffers 10...50 mure-a leeghtneeng daemaege-a und is knucked doon. Thees spell haes 25% aermur penetraeshun.','Deaels 10...50 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Iff yuoo haefe-a mure-a Inergy thun taerget fue-a, deaels +10...50 leeghtneeng daemaege-a und cooses knuckdoon. 25% aermur penetraeshun.'],
2805=>['Meest Furm (PfP)','Fur 10...45 secunds, yuoo taeke-a 33% less daemaege-a frum fues under zee iffffect ooff Vaeter Maegeec hexes. Vhenefer yuoo caest un ilementael spell, aell nun-spureet aelleees in iaershut aere-a heaeled fur 50...250% ooff zee Inergy cust ooff zee spell. Thees spell dues nut heael aelleees aebufe-a 80% Heaelt.','(10...45 secunds.) Taeke-a 33% less daemaege-a frum fues hexed veet Vaeter Maegeec. Heaels nun-spureet aelleees in iaershut fur 50...250% ooff zee Inergy cust ooff yuoor ilementael spells. Dues nut heael aelleees aebufe-a 80% Heaelt.'],
2806=>['Vaerd Aegaeeenst Haerm (PfP)','Creaete-a a Vaerd Aegaeeenst Haerm aet thees lucaeshun. Fur 5...15 secunds, nun-spureet aelleees in thees aerea haefe-a +1...3 Heaelt regeneraeshun, +12...24 aermur, und un aeddeeshunael +12...24 aermur aegaeeenst ilementael daemaege-a. Thees spell is deesaebled fur 30 secunds.',' (5...15 secunds.) Aelleees in thees vaerd haefe-a +1...3 Heaelt regeneraeshun, +12...24 aermur, und +12...24 aeddeeshunael aermur aegaeeenst ilementael daemaege-a. Spureets aere-a unaeffffected. Thees spell is deesaebled fur 30 secunds.'],
2807=>['Reede-a zee Leeghtneeng (PfP)','Yuoo Reede-a zee Leeghtneeng tu taerget. Aell aedjaecent fues aere-a Bleended fur 1...5 secunds. Iff yuoor taerget is a fue-a, it is stroock fur 10...70 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Thees spell haes 25% aermur penetraeshun.','Deaels 10...70 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. 25% aermur penetraeshun. Bleends aell aedjaecent fues (1...5 secunds). Yuoo instuntly mufe-a tu yuoor taerget. Maey taerget aelleees.'],
2808=>['Inraeged Smaesh (PfP)','Iff Inraeged Smaesh heets, yuoo gaeeen 1...3 streeke-as ooff aedrenaeleene-a. Iff yuoo heet a mufeeng fue-a, yuoo streeke-a fur +10...40 daemaege-a, und yuoor taerget is knucked doon.','Geefes yuoo 1...3 streeke-as ooff aedrenaeleene-a iff yuoo heet. Deaels +10...40 daemaege-a und cooses knuckdoon iff yuoor taerget vaes mufeeng.'],
2809=>['Oobseedeeun Flaeme-a (PfP)','Deael 22...92 daemaege-a tu taerget fue-a. Thees spell ignures aermur.','Deaels 22...92 daemaege-a.'],
2857=>['Aeegees (PfP)','Fur 1...3 secunds, taerget oozeer paerty member cunnut be-a zee taerget ooff husteele-a spells, und aettaecks aegaeeenst thees paerty member faeeel.','(1...3 secunds.) Taerget paerty member cunnut be-a taergeted by husteele-a spells. Aettaecks aegaeeenst thees paerty member faeeel. Cunnut selff-taerget.'],
2858=>['"Vaetch Yuoorselff!" (PfP)','Paerty members veetheen iaershut gaeeen +5...25 aermur fur 10 secunds. Thees shuoot inds aeffter 1...3 incumeeng aettaecks.','(10 secunds.) Paerty members in iaershut haefe-a +5...25 aermur. Inds aeffter 1...3 incumeeng aettaecks.'],
2859=>['Inffeeble-a (PfP)','Taerget sooffffers frum Veaekness fur 10...30 secunds.','Inffleects Veaekness cundeeshun (10...30 secunds).'],
2860=>['Izeer Renooael (PfP)','Fur 10 secunds, iaech teeme-a yuoo caest a spell, yuoo gaeeen 1...3 Inergy und 5...20 Heaelt fur iaech inchuntment oon yuoo.','(10 secunds.) Iaech teeme-a yuoo caest a spell, yuoo gaeeen 1...3 Inergy und 5...20 Heaelt fur iaech inchuntment oon yuoo.'],
2861=>['Penetraeteeng Aettaeck (PfP)','Iff Penetraeteeng Aettaeck heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +5...15 daemaege-a und thees aettaeck haes 10% aermur penetraeshun.','Deaels +5...15 daemaege-a. 10% aermur penetraeshun. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
2862=>['Shaedoo Furm (PfP)','Fur 5...15 secunds, aell husteele-a spells thaet taerget yuoo faeeel und aell aettaecks aegaeeenst yuoo meess. Vhee Shaedoo Furm inds, luse-a aell boot 5...50 Heaelt.','(5...15 secunds.) Husteele-a spells taergeteeng yuoo faeeel, und aettaecks aegaeeenst yuoo meess. Ind iffffect: luse-a aell boot 5...50 Heaelt.'],
2863=>['Deescurd (PfP)','Iff taerget fue-a is sooffffereeng frum a cundeeshun und under zee iffffects ooff a hex oor un inchuntment, thaet fue-a sooffffers 30...110 daemaege-a.','Deaels 30...110 daemaege-a. Nu iffffect unless taerget fue-a haes a cundeeshun und is ieezeer hexed oor inchunted.'],
2864=>['Soondereeng Aettaeck (PfP)','Iff Soondereeng Aettaeck heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +5...15 daemaege-a und thees aettaeck haes 10% aermur penetraeshun.','Deaels +5...15 daemaege-a. 10% aermur penetraeshun. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
2866=>['Flesh ooff My Flesh (PfP)','Luse-a haelff yuoor Heaelt. Resoorrect taerget paerty member veet yuoor coorrent Heaelt und 5...20% Inergy.','Resoorrects taerget paerty member (haelff yuoor coorrent Heaelt und 5...20% Inergy). Luse-a haelff yuoor Heaelt.'],
2867=>['Uncesturs\' Raege-a (PfP)','Fur 3 secunds aell fues aedjaecent tu taerget aelly taeke-a 4...50 leeghtneeng daemaege-a iaech secund.','(3 secunds.) Deaels 4...50 leeghtneeng daemaege-a tu fues aedjaecent tu taerget aelly iaech secund.'],
2868=>['Spleenter Veaepun (PfP)','Fur 20 secunds, taerget aelly haes a Spleenter Veaepun. Taerget aelly\'s next 1...5 aettaecks deal 5...40 daemaege-a tu up tu 4 aedjaecent fues.','(20 secunds.) Aettaecks deael 5...40 daemaege-a tu 3 aedjaecent fues. Inds aeffter 1...5 aettaecks.'],
2869=>['Aessaesseen\'s Remedy (PfP)','Fur 30 secunds, zee next 1...10 aettaeck skeells yuoo use-a remufe-a oone-a cundeeshun.','(30 secunds.) Yuoor next 1...10 aettaeck skeells iaech remufe-a oone-a cundeeshun.'],
2871=>['Leeght ooff Deleeferunce-a (PfP)','Aell paerty members aere-a heaeled fur 5...70 Heaelt. Aell yuoor Smeeteeng Praeyers aere-a deesaebled fur 20 secunds.','Heaels inture-a paerty fur 5...70. Deesaebles yuoor Smeeteeng Praeyers (20 secunds).'],
2872=>['Deaet Paect Seegnet (PfP)','Resoorrect taerget paerty member veet yuoor coorrent Heaelt und 15...100% maexeemoom Inergy. Zee next teeme-a thaet aelly deees veetheen 120 secunds, su du yuoo.','Resoorrects taerget paerty member veet yuoor coorrent Heaelt und 15...100% maexeemoom Inergy. Fur 120 secunds, yuoo deee-a zee next teeme-a thees paerty member deees.'],
2875=>['Haerreeer\'s Tuss (PfP)','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo deael +5...20 daemaege-a. Iff thees aettaeck heets a mufeeng fue-a, it deaels un aeddeeshunael 5...40 daemaege-a.','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Deaels 5...40 mure-a daemaege-a iff taerget is mufeeng.'],
2876=>['Deffenseefe-a Unzeem (PfP)','Fur 4...10 secunds, iaech paerty member veetheen iaershut haes a 50% chunce-a tu bluck incumeeng aettaecks. Thees chunt inds iff thaet paerty member heets veet un aettaeck skeell.','(4...10 secunds.) Paerty members in iaershut haefe-a 50% chunce-a tu bluck. Inds vhee heetteeng veet un aettaeck skeell.'],
2877=>['Baellaed ooff Resturaeshun (PfP)','Fur 10 secunds, zee next teeme-a iaech paerty member veetheen iaershut taekes daemaege-a, thaet paerty member gaeeens 15...75 Heaelt.','(10 secunds.) Paerty members in iaershut gaeeen 15...75 Heaelt zee next teeme-a zeey taeke-a daemaege-a.'],
2878=>['Sung ooff Resturaeshun (PfP)','Fur 10 secunds, zee next teeme-a iaech paerty member veetheen iaershut uses a skeell, thaet paerty member gaeeens 45...110 Heaelt.','(10 secunds.) Paerty members in iaershut gaeeen 45...110 Heaelt veet zeeur next skeell.'],
2879=>['"Incumeeng!" (PfP)','Fur 4...10 secunds, aell aelleees veetheen iaershut mufe-a 33% faester und gaeeen 5...15 Heaelt per secund vheele-a mufeeng.','(4...10 secunds.) Aelleees in iaershut mufe-a 33% faester und gaeeen 5...15 Heaelt per secund vheele-a mufeeng.'],
2880=>['"Nefer Soorrender!" (PfP)','Fur 10 secunds, aell paerty members veetheen iaershut und beloo 75% Heaelt gaeeen +1...5 Heaelt regeneraeshun.','(10 secunds.) Paerty members in iaershut gaeeen +1...5 Heaelt regeneraeshun. Oonly aeffffects paerty members beloo 75% Heaelt.'],
2883=>['"Fur Greaet Joosteece-a!" (PfP)','Fur 8 secunds, vhenefer yuoo heet veet un aettaeck, yuoo gaeeen 1 aeddeeshunael streeke-as ooff aedrenaeleene-a.','(8 secunds.) Yuoo gaeeen 1 ixtra streeke-as ooff aedrenaeleene-a vhenefer yuoo heet veet un aettaeck.'],
2884=>['Mysteec Regeneraeshun (PfP)','Fur 5...20 secunds, yuoo haefe-a +1...4 Heaelt regeneraeshun fur iaech inchuntment (maexeemoom ooff 3) oon yuoo.','(5...20 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +1...4 Heaelt regeneraeshun fur iaech inchuntment (maexeemoom ooff 3) oon yuoo.'],
2885=>['Inffeebleeng Bluud (PfP)','Taerget fue-a und aell neaerby fues sooffffer frum Veaekness fur 1...16 secunds. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Inffleects Veaekness cundeeshun (1...16 secunds) oon thees fue-a und neaerby fues.'],
2887=>['Seegnet ooff Joodgment (PfP)','Taerget fue-a is knucked doon. Thaet fue-a und aell aedjaecent fues taeke-a 5...50 huly daemaege-a. Thees seegnet haes haelff zee nurmael runge-a.','Knucks doon taerget. Deaels 5...50 huly daemaege-a tu taerget und aedjaecent fues.'],
2891=>['Unyeeeldeeng Oora (PfP)','Breeng taerget deaed paerty member baeck tu leeffe-a aet fooll Heaelt und fooll Inergy. Iff yuoo stup maeeentaeeeneeng thees inchuntment oor iff thees inchuntment is remufed, thaet paerty member deees und leaefes un ixplueeted curpse-a. Deaeths vheele-a inchunted veet Unyeeeldeeng Oora du nut incoor a deaet penaelty. (50% faeeeloore-a chunce-a veet Deefeene-a Faefur 4 oor less.)','Resoorrects taerget paerty member (fooll Heaelt, fooll Inergy). Ind iffffect: thees aelly deees und leaefes un ixplueeted curpse-a. Dues nut incoor a deaet penaelty. 50% faeeeloore-a chunce-a unless Deefeene-a Faefur 5 oor mure-a.'],
2892=>['Spureet Bund (PfP)','Fur 8 secunds, vhenefer taerget aelly taekes mure-a thun 50 daemaege-a frum zee next 10 aettaecks oor spells, thaet aelly is heaeled fur 30...90 Heaelt.','(8 secunds.) Heaels fur 30...90 vhenefer taerget aelly taekes mure-a thun 50 daemaege-a. Inds aeffter thees aelly taekes daemaege-a frum 10 aettaecks oor spells.'],
2893=>['Veaepun ooff Vaerdeeng (PfP)','Fur 3...8 secunds, taerget aelly haes a Veaepun ooff Vaerdeeng, grunteeng thaet aelly +2...4 Heaelt regeneraeshun und a 50% chunce-a tu bluck. Veaepun ooff Vaerdeeng inds iff thaet aelly aettaecks.','(3...8 secunds.) +2...4 Heaelt regeneraeshun. 50% chunce-a tu bluck. Inds iff taerget aelly aettaecks.'],
2895=>['Smeeter\'s Buun (PfP)','Fur 4 secunds, yuoor Smeeteeng Praeyers haefe-a duooble-a zee Deefeene-a Faefur bunoos.','(4 secunds.) Yuoor Smeeteeng Praeyers haefe-a duooble-a Deefeene-a Faefur heaeleeng bunoos.'],
2925=>['Slooth Hoonter\'s Shut (PfP)','Iff thees aettaeck heets, taerget fue-a taekes +5...15 daemaege-a. Iff thaet fue-a is nut useeng a skeell, Slooth Hoonter\'s Shut dues un aeddeeshunael +5...20 daemaege-a.','Deaels +5...15 daemaege-a. Deaels +5...20 mure-a daemaege-a iff taerget fue-a is nut useeng a skeell.'],
2959=>['Ixpert\'s Dextereety (PfP)','Fur 1...20 secunds, yuoo aettaeck 15% faester und yuoor Maerksmunsheep aettreeboote-a is increaesed by 1.','(1...20 secunds.) Yuoo aettaeck 15% faester und yuoo gaeeen +1 tu yuoor Maerksmunsheep aettreeboote-a.'],
2965=>['Seegnet ooff Spureets (PfP)','Yuoo gaeeen 3...12 Inergy iff yuoo aere-a veetheen iaershut ooff a spureet.','Yuoo gaeeen 3...12 Inergy. Nu iffffect unless yuoo aere-a veetheen iaershut ooff a spureet.'],
2966=>['Seegnet ooff Ghustly Meeght (PfP)','Taerget aelleeed soommuned creaetoore-a\'s aettaecks deael 5...35 mure-a daemaege-a. Aeffter 10 secunds, thaet creaetoore-a is destruyed.','Taerget aelleeed soommuned creaetoore-a deaels +5...35 daemaege-a. Thaet creaetoore-a is destruyed aeffter 10 secunds.'],
2969=>['Reaed zee Veend (PfP)','Fur 24 secunds, yuoor aerroos mufe-a tveece-a aes faest.','(24 secunds.) Yuoor aerroos mufe-a tveece-a aes faest.'],
2998=>['Fraegeeleety (PfP)','Fur 8...20 secunds, taerget und aedjaecent fues taeke-a 5...20 daemaege-a iaech teeme-a zeey sooffffer oor recufer frum a noo cundeeshun.','Aelsu hexes fues aedjaecent tu taerget (8...20 secunds). Zeese-a fues taeke-a 5...20 daemaege-a iaech teeme-a zeey gaeeen oor luse-a a cundeeshun.'],
2999=>['Strengt ooff Hunur (PfP)','Vheele-a yuoo maeeentaeeen thees inchuntment, taerget aelly deaels 1...5 mure-a daemaege-a in melee-a.','Taerget aelly deaels 1...5 mure-a daemaege-a in melee-a. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
3002=>['Vaerreeur\'s Indoorunce-a (PfP)','Fur 5...35 secunds, yuoo gaeeen 3 Inergy iaech teeme-a yuoo heet veet a melee-a aettaeck. Vaerreeur\'s Indoorunce-a cunnut raeeese-a yuoor Inergy aebufe-a 10...25.','(5...35 secunds.) Yuoo gaeeen 3 Inergy iaech teeme-a yuoo heet veet a melee-a aettaeck. Nu Inergy gaeeen iff yuoo haefe-a mure-a thun 10...25 Inergy.'],
3003=>['Aermur ooff Unffeeleeng (PfP)','Fur 10...35 secunds, yuoo haefe-a 10 baese-a daemaege-a redoocshun vheele-a caesteeng beendeeng reetooaels.','(10...35 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a 10 baese-a daemaege-a redoocshun vheele-a caesteeng beendeeng reetooaels.'],
3005=>['Uneeun (PfP)','Creaete-a a lefel 1...8 spureet. Vhenefer a nun-spureet aelly in its runge-a taekes daemaege-a oor leeffe-a steael, it is redooced by 15 und zee spureet taekes 15 daemaege-a. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...60 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...8 spureet (30...60 secund leeffespun). Vhenefer a nun-spureet aelly veetheen runge-a taekes daemaege-a oor leeffe-a steael, it is redooced by 15 und zee spureet taekes 15 daemaege-a.'],
3006=>['Shaedoosung (PfP)','Creaete-a a lefel 1...6 spureet. Thees spureet\'s aettaecks deael 5...20 daemaege-a und coose-a Bleendness fur 1...6 secunds. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...6 spureet (30-secund leeffespun). Its aettaecks deael 5...20 daemaege-a und inffleect Bleendness cundeeshun (1...6 secunds).'],
3007=>['Paeeen (PfP)','Creaete-a a lefel 1...8 spureet. Thees spureet\'s aettaecks deael 5...30 daemaege-a. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...150 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...8 spureet (30...150 secund leeffespun). Its aettaecks deael 5...30 daemaege-a.'],
3008=>['Destroocshun (PfP)','Creaete-a a lefel 1...10 Spureet thaet deees aeffter 30 secunds. Vhee thees Spureet deees, aell fues in zee aerea taeke-a 1...10 daemaege-a fur iaech secund zee Spureet vaes aeleefe-a (maexeemoom ooff 150 daemaege-a). Bork! Bork! Bork!','Creaetes a lefel 1...10 spureet (30 secund leeffespun). Oon deaet, it deaels 1...10 daemaege-a fur iaech secund it vaes aeleefe-a tu aell fues in zee aerea (maexeemoom 150 daemaege-a).'],
3009=>['Suutheeng (PfP)','Creaete-a a lefel 1...8 spureet. Aell fues veetheen its runge-a taeke-a tveece-a aes lung tu booeeld aedrenaeleene-a. Thees spureet deees aeffter 15...45 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...8 spureet (15...45 secund leeffespun). Booeeldeeng aedrenaeleene-a taekes tveece-a aes lung fur fues veetheen runge-a. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
3010=>['Deesplaecement (PfP)','Creaete-a a lefel 1...10 spureet. Aell nun-spureet aelleees veetheen its runge-a haefe-a a 75% chunce-a tu bluck incumeeng aettaecks. Ifery teeme-a un aettaeck is blucked in thees vaey, thees spureet taekes 60 daemaege-a. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...60 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...10 spureet (30...60 secund leeffespun). Nun-spureet aelleees veetheen runge-a haefe-a 75% chunce-a tu bluck. Bluck iffffect: thees spureet taekes 60 daemaege-a.'],
3011=>['Preserfaeshun (PfP)','Creaete-a a lefel 1...10 spureet. Ifery 4 secunds, thees spureet heaels oone-a nun-spureet aelly in zee aerea fur 10...115 Heaelt. Thees spureet deees aeffter 90 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...10 spureet (90 secund leeffespun). Ifery 4 secunds, thees spureet heaels oone-a nun-spureet aelly fur 10...115.'],
3012=>['Leeffe-a (PfP)','Creaete-a a lefel 1...10 spureet. Vhee thees spureet deees, aell nun-spureet aelleees veetheen its runge-a aere-a heaeled fur 1...7 Heaelt fur iaech secund thees spureet vaes aeleefe-a. Thees spureet deees aeffter 20 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...10 spureet (20 secund leeffespun). Aeffffects nun-spureet aelleees veetheen runge-a. Ind iffffect: heaels fur 1...7 fur iaech secund thees spureet vaes aeleefe-a.'],
3013=>['Recooperaeshun (PfP)','Creaete-a a lefel 1...10 spureet. Nun-spureet aelleees veetheen its runge-a gaeeen +1...3 Heaelt regeneraeshun. Thees spureet deees aeffter 15...45 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...10 spureet (15...45 secund leeffespun). Nun-spureet aelleees veetheen runge-a haefe-a +1...3 Heaelt regeneraeshun.'],
3014=>['Deessununce-a (PfP)','Creaete-a a lefel 1...8 spureet. Thees spureet deaels 5...20 daemaege-a und unyune-a stroock by its aettaeck is interroopted. Thees spureet deees aeffter 10...25 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...8 spureet (10...25 secund leeffespun). Its aettaecks deael 5...20 daemaege-a und interroopt aecshuns.'],
3015=>['Iaerthbeend (PfP)','Creaete-a a lefel 1...10 spureet. Aell nun-spureet fues knucked doon veetheen its runge-a aere-a knucked doon fur aet leaest 3 secunds. Vhenefer thees haeppens, thees spureet luses 50...25 Heaelt. Thees spureet deees aeffter 15...45 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...10 spureet (15...45 secund leeffespun). Uny teeme-a nun-spureet fues veetheen runge-a aere-a knucked-doon, zeey aere-a knucked doon fur aet leaest 3 secunds. Knuck-doon cust: thees spureet luses 50...25 Heaelt.'],
3016=>['Shelter (PfP)','Creaete-a a lefel 1...8 spureet. Nun-spureet aelleees veetheen its runge-a cunnut luse-a mure-a thun 10% maexeemoom Heaelt frum a seengle-a aettaeck. Vhee thees spureet prefents daemaege-a, it luses 75...45 Heaelt. Thees spureet laests 30...60 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...8 spureet (30...60 secund leeffespun). Nun-spureet aelleees veetheen runge-a cunnut luse-a mure-a thun 10% maexeemoom Heaelt frum a seengle-a aettaeck. Daemaege-a prefenshun cust: thees spureet luses 75...45 Heaelt.'],
3017=>['Deesenchuntment (PfP)','Creaete-a a lefel 1...8 spureet. Thees spureet deaels 5...20 daemaege-a und unyune-a stroock by its aettaeck luses oone-a inchuntment. Thees spureet deees aeffter 15...40 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...8 spureet (15...40 secund leeffespun). Its aettaecks deael 5...20 daemaege-a und remufe-a oone-a inchuntment.'],
3018=>['Resturaeshun (PfP)','Creaete-a a lefel 1...10 spureet. Vhee thees spureet deees, aell paerty members in zee aerea aere-a resoorrected veet 5...50% Heaelt und zeru Inergy. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...10 spureet (30 secund leeffespun). Ind iffffect: resoorrects paerty members in zee aerea veet 5...50% Heaelt und zeru Inergy.'],
3019=>['Bluudsung (PfP)','Creaete-a a lefel 1...8 spureet vhu deees aeffter 30...150 secunds. Aettaecks by thaet spureet steael up tu 5...25 Heaelt.','Creaetes a lefel 1...8 spureet (30...150 secund leeffespun). Its aettaecks steael 5...25 Heaelt.'],
3020=>['Vunderloost (PfP)','Creaete-a a lefel 1...8 spureet. Vhenefer thees spureet\'s aettaeck heets a staeshunaery fue-a, thaet fue-a is knucked doon und zee spureet luses 70...50 Heaelt. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...60 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...8 spureet (30...60 secund leeffespun). Its aettaecks aegaeeenst staeshunaery fues coose-a knuck-doon. Knuck-doon cust: thees spureet luses 70...50 Heaelt.'],
3021=>['Saefunnaeh Heaet (PfP)','Yuoo creaete-a Saefunnaeh Heaet aet taerget fue-a\'s lucaeshun. Fur 5 secunds, aell neaerby fues taeke-a 5...20 fure-a daemaege-a fur iaech secund thees spell haes beee in iffffect.','Deaels 5...20 fure-a daemaege-a fur iaech secund seence-a caesteeng thees spell (5 secunds). Heets fues neaer taerget\'s ineeteeael lucaeshun.'],
3022=>['Gaeze-a ooff Foory (PfP)','Destruy taerget aelleeed spureet und creaete-a a lefel 1...10 Spureet ooff Foory. Thees spureet\'s aettaecks deael 5...20 daemaege-a. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...60 secunds.','Destruys un aelleeed spureet. Creaetes a lefel 1...10 spureet (30...60 secund leeffespun). Its aettaecks deael 5...20 daemaege-a.'],
3023=>['Ungooeesh (PfP)','Creaete-a a lefel 1...7 spureet. Thees spureet\'s aettaecks deael 5...20 daemaege-a und deael duooble-a daemaege-a tu hexed fues. Thees spureet deees aeffter 15...45 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...7 spureet (15...45 secund leeffespun). Its aettaecks deael 5...20 daemaege-a. Duooble-a daemaege-a tu hexed fues.'],
3024=>['Impooerment (PfP)','Creaete-a a lefel 1...10 spureet. Aell aelleees veetheen its runge-a huldeeng un item gaeeen 15...45 maexeemoom Heaelt und 10 maexeemoom Inergy. Thees spureet deees aeffter 15...60 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...10 spureet (15...60 secund leeffespun). Aelleees in runge-a huldeeng un item gaeeen 15...45 maexeemoom Heaelt und 10 maexeemoom Inergy.'],
3025=>['Recufery (PfP)','Creaete-a a lefel 1...10 spureet. Cundeeshuns oon aelleees veetheen runge-a ooff thees spureet ixpure-a 20...50% faester. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...60 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...10 spureet (30...60 secund leeffespun). Cundeeshuns oon aelleees in runge-a ixpure-a 20...50% faester.'],
3026=>['"Gu fur zee Iyes!" (PfP)','Fur 10 secunds, zee next teeme-a iaech aelly veetheen iaershut maekes un aettaeck, thaet aettaeck haes un aeddeeshunael 30...75% chunce-a tu creeteecael.','(10 secunds.) Aelleees in iaershut haefe-a +30...75% chunce-a tu lund a creeteecael heet veet zeeur next aettaeck.'],
3027=>['"Braece-a Yuoorselff!" (PfP)','Fur 5...15 secunds, zee next teeme-a taerget oozeer aelly vuoold be-a knucked doon, 1 neaerby fue-a taekes 15...90 daemaege-a insteaed.','(5...15 secunds.) Prefents zee next knuck-doon und deaels 15...90 daemaege-a tu oone-a fue-a neaer taerget aelly. Cunnut selff-taerget.'],
3028=>['Blaezeeng Feenaele-a (PfP)','Fur 10...35 secunds, vhenefer a chunt oor shuoot inds oon taerget nun-spureet aelly, aell fues aedjaecent tu thaet aelly aere-a set oon Fure-a fur 1...5 secunds.','(10...35 secunds.) Inffleects Boorneeng cundeeshun (1...5 secunds) tu aedjaecent fues vhenefer a chunt oor shuoot inds oon taerget aelly. Cunnut taerget spureets.'],
3029=>['Blaedetoorn Reffraeeen (PfP)','Fur 20 secunds, taerget nun-spureet aelly haes +10...40 aermur aegaeeenst slaesheeng daemaege-a. Thees ichu is reaeppleeed ifery teeme-a a chunt oor shuoot inds oon thaet aelly.','(20 secunds.) Taerget aelly haes +10...40 aermur aegaeeenst slaesheeng daemaege-a. Renooael: Vhenefer a chunt oor shuoot inds oon thaet aelly. Cunnut taerget spureets.'],
3030=>['Seegnet ooff Retoorn (PfP)','Resoorrect taerget paerty member veet 5...20% Heaelt und 1...4% Inergy fur iaech paerty member veetheen iaershut.','Resoorrects taerget paerty member (5...20% Heaelt und 1...4% Inergy fur iaech paerty member in iaershut).'],
3031=>['"Cun\'t Tuooch Thees!" (PfP)','Fur 20 secunds, zee next 1...5 tuooch skeells used aegaeeenst yuoo fail.','(20 secunds.) Zee next 1...5 tuooch-runge-a skeells used aegaeeenst yuoo fail.'],
3032=>['"Stund Yuoor Gruoond!" (PfP)','Fur 5...20 secunds, aell paerty members veetheen iaershut receeefe-a +24 aermur vhee nut mufeeng. Thees iffffect inds oon un aelly aeffffected by thees shuoot vhee thaet aelly aettaecks.','(5...20 secunds.) Paerty members in iaershut gaeeen +24 aermur vhee nut mufeeng. Inds fur un aelly iff thaet aelly aettaecks.'],
3033=>['"Ve-a Shaell Retoorn!" (PfP)','Fur 10 secunds, vhenefer paerty members veetheen iaershut use-a a resoorrecshun skeell, zeeur faellee aelleees retoorn veet 10...75% mure-a Heaelt und 5...50% mure-a Inergy.','(10 secunds.) Vhenefer paerty members in iaershut use-a a resoorrecshun skeell, zeeur faellee aelleees retoorn veet 10...75% mure-a Heaelt und 5...50% mure-a Inergy.'],
3034=>['"Feend Zeeur Veaekness!" (PfP)','Fur 5...20 secunds, zee next teeme-a taerget aelly creeteecaels, thaet aelly aelsu inffleects a Deep Vuoond fur 5...20 secunds.','(5...20 secunds.) Taerget aelly inffleects Deep Vuoond cundeeshun (5...20 secunds) veet zee next creeteecael heet.'],
3035=>['"Nefer Geefe-a Up!" (PfP)','Aell aelleees veetheen iaershut und beloo 75% Heaelt gaeeen 1...10 Inergy.','Aelleees in iaershut gaeeen 1...10 Inergy. Oonly aeffffects aelleees beloo 75% Heaelt.'],
3036=>['"Help!" (PfP)','Taerget nun-spureet aelly gaeeens 5...50 Heaelt. Fur 1...10 secunds, oozeer aelleees\' spells taergeteeng thaet aelly caest 50% faester.','(1...10 secunds.) Taerget nun-spureet aelly gaeeens 5...50 heaelt, aelleeed spells taergeteeng zeem caest 50% faester.'],
3037=>['"Faell Baeck!" (PfP)','Fur 4...10 secunds, aell aelleees veetheen iaershut gaeeen 5...15 Heaelt per secund vheele-a mufeeng und mufe-a 33% faester. "Faell Baeck!" inds oon un aelly aeffffected by thees shuoot vhee thaet aelly sooccessffoolly heets veet un aettaeck.','(4...10 secunds.) Aelleees in iaershut gaeeen 5...15 Heaelt per secund vheele-a mufeeng und mufe-a 33% faester. Inds fur un aelly iff thaet aelly heets veet un aettaeck.'],
3038=>['Aeguny (PfP)','Creaete-a a lefel 1...8 spureet. Thees spureet cooses 3...10 Heaelt luss iaech secund tu fues veetheen iaershut. Thees spureet luses 3...10 Heaelt fur iaech fue-a hoort in thees vaey. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...90 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...8 spureet (30...90 secund leeffespun). Cooses 3...10 Heaelt luss iaech secund tu fues in iaershut. Thees spureet luses 3...10 Heaelt fur iaech fue-a thaet luses Heaelt.'],
3039=>['Rejoofenaeshun (PfP)','Creaete-a a lefel 1...16 spureet. Thees spureet heaels aell paerty members veetheen iaershut fur 3...10 Heaelt iaech secund. Thees spureet luses 3...10 Heaelt fur iaech paerty member heaeled in thees vaey. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...90 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...16 spureet (30...90 secund leeffespun). Heaels paerty members in iaershut fur 3...10 iaech secund. Heaeleeng cust: thees spureet luses 3...10 Heaelt.'],
3040=>['Unzeem ooff Deesroopshun (PfP)','Fur 1...10 secunds, zee next aettaeck skeell used by iaech aelly veetheen iaershut aelsu interroopts un aecshun.','(1...10 secunds.) Aelleees in iaershut interroopt un aecshun veet zeeur next aettaeck skeell.'],
3045=>['Cumffurt Uneemael (PfP)','Yuoo heael yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun fur 40...120 Heaelt. Iff yuoor cumpuneeun is deaed, it is resoorrected veet 10...58% Heaelt. Iff yuoo haefe-a Cumffurt Uneemael iqooeepped, yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun veell traefel veet yuoo.','Yuoor pet gaeeens 40...120 Heaelt. Resoorrects yuoor pet (10...58% Heaelt). Iff yuoo haefe-a Cumffurt Uneemael iqooeepped, yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun veell traefel veet yuoo.'],
3047=>['Melundroo\'s Aessoolt (PfP)','Yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun aettempts a Melundroo\'s Aessoolt thaet deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Iff thaet aettaeck streekes a fue-a veet un inchuntment, thaet fue-a und aell aedjaecent fues taeke-a +5...35 aeddeeshunael daemaege-a.','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Deaels +5...35 mure-a daemaege-a tu taerget und fues aedjaecent tu taerget iff thees fue-a is inchunted.'],
3048=>['Shruood ooff Deestress (PfP)','Fur 30...60 secunds, iff yuoo aere-a beloo 50% Heaelt, yuoo haefe-a a 75% chunce-a tu bluck aettaecks.','(30...60 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a 75% chunce-a tu bluck. Nu iffffect unless yuoor Heaelt is beloo 50%.'],
3049=>['Unseee Foory (PfP)','Fur 15...60 secunds, yuoo cunnut be-a blucked by Bleended fues.','(15...60 secunds.) Yuoo cunnut be-a blucked by Bleended fues.'],
3050=>['Predaetury Bund (PfP)','Fur 5...20 secunds, sooccessffool aettaecks by yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun heael yuoo fur 1...31 Heaelt.','(5...20 secunds.) Yuoo gaeeen 1...31 Heaelt vhenefer yuoor pet maekes a sooccessffool aettaeck.'],
3051=>['Inraeged Loonge-a (PfP)','Yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun aettempts un Inraeged Loonge-a thaet deaels +3...23 daemaege-a (maexeemoom bunoos 60) fur iaech rechaergeeng Beaest Maestery skeell.','Deaels +3...23 daemaege-a (maexeemoom 60) fur iaech ooff yuoor rechaergeeng Beaest Maestery skeells.'],
3053=>['Seegnet ooff Deaedly Curroopshun (PfP)','Moost fulloo a dooael aettaeck. Taerget fue-a taekes 5...35 daemaege-a fur iaech cundeeshun oon thaet fue-a (maexeemoom 130 daemaege-a).','Deaels 5...35 daemaege-a (maexeemoom 130) fur iaech cundeeshun oon taerget fue-a. Moost fulloo a dooael aettaeck.'],
3054=>['Maesucheesm (PfP)','Fur 30 secunds, yuoo gaeeen 1...3 Inergy vhenefer yuoo saecreeffeece-a Heaelt.','(30 secunds.) Yuoo gaeeen 1...3 Inergy vhenefer yuoo saecreeffeece-a Heaelt.'],
3058=>['Unhuly Feaest (PfP)','Steael up tu 10...65 Heaelt frum up tu 1...4 fues in zee aerea.','Steaels 10...65 Heaelt frum 1...4 fue-as in zee aerea aeruoond yuoo.'],
3059=>['Seegnet ooff Aeguny (PfP)','Yuoo sooffffer frum Bleedeeng fur 25 secunds. Aell neaerby fues taeke-a 10...70 daemaege-a.','Deaels 10...70 daemaege-a tu fues neaer yuoo. Yuoo begeen Bleedeeng (25 secunds).'],
3060=>['Iscaepe-a (PfP)','Fur 1...8 secunds, yuoo mufe-a 33% faester und haefe-a a 75% chunce-a tu bluck aettaecks. Iscaepe-a inds iff yuoo maeke-a a melee-a aettaeck.','(1...8 secunds.) Yuoo mufe-a 33% faester und haefe-a 75% chunce-a tu bluck. Inds iff yuoo maeke-a a melee-a aettaeck.'],
3061=>['Deaet Blussum (PfP)','Moost fulloo un ooffff-hund aettaeck. Iff it heets, Deaet Blussum streekes taerget fue-a fur +20...45 daemaege-a und aell aedjaecent fues taeke-a 20...45 daemaege-a.','Deaels +20...45 daemaege-a. Aelsu aeffffects fues aedjaecent tu taerget fue-a. Moost fulloo un ooffff-hund aettaeck.'],
3062=>['Feenaele-a ooff Resturaeshun (PfP)','Fur 10...35 secunds, zee next 5 teeme-as thaet a chunt oor shuoot inds oon taerget nun-spureet aelly, thaet aelly is heaeled fur 15...75 Heaelt.','(10...35 secunds.) Taerget aelly gaeeens 15...75 Heaelt zee next 5 teeme-as a shuoot oor chunt inds oon thaet aelly. Cunnut taerget spureets.'],
3063=>['Muntra ooff Resulfe-a (PfP)','Fur 5 secunds, yuoo cunnut be-a interroopted, boot iaech teeme-a yuoo vuoold haefe-a beee interroopted, yuoo luse-a 10...4 Inergy oor Muntra ooff Resulfe-a inds.','(5 secunds.) Prefents interroopts aegaeeenst yuoo. Prefenshun cust: luse-a 10...4 Inergy oor Muntra ooff Resulfe-a inds.'],
3141=>['Leeghtneeng Refflexes (PfP)','Fur 5...11 secunds, yuoo haefe-a a 75% chunce-a tu bluck melee-a und prujecteele-a aettaecks, und yuoo aettaeck 33% faester. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(5...11 secunds.) Yuoo aettaeck 33% faester und haefe-a 75% chunce-a tu bluck.'],
3143=>['Renooeeng Smaesh (PfP)','Iff Renooeeng Smaesh heets, it deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Iff yuoo heet a knucked-doon fue-a, yuoo gaeeen 3 Inergy und thees aettaeck rechaerges instuntly.','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a. Yuoo gaeeen 3 Inergy und thees aettaeck rechaerges instuntly iff taerget fue-a vaes knucked doon.'],
3144=>['Heael aes Oone-a (PfP)','Iff yuoo oor yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun aere-a beloo 75% Heaelt, yuoo aere-a but heaeled fur 25...145 Heaelt. Iff yuoor cumpuneeun is deaed, it is resoorrected veet 50% Heaelt.','Heaels yuoo und yuoor pet fur 25...145. Iff yuoor pet is deaed, it is resoorrected veet 50% Heaelt. Nu iffffect iff neeezeer yuoo nur yuoor pet aere-a beloo 75% Heaelt.'],
3145=>['Glaess Aerroos (PfP)','Fur 10...35 secunds, yuoor aerroos streeke-a fur +6...18 daemaege-a iff zeey heet und coose-a Bleedeeng fur 10...20 secunds iff zeey aere-a Blucked.','(10...35 secunds.) Yuoor aerroos deael +6...18 daemaege-a. Inffleects Bleedeeng cundeeshun iff blucked (10...20 secunds).'],
3147=>['Keee Aerroo (PfP)','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +5...15 daemaege-a. Iff yuoo lund a creeteecael heet, yuoo deael un aeddeeshunael +5...30 daemaege-a.','Deaels +5...15 daemaege-a. Deaels +5...30 mure-a daemaege-a iff yuoo lund a creeteecael heet.'],
3148=>['Unzeem ooff Infy (PfP)','Fur 10 secunds, zee next aettaeck skeell used by iaech aelly veetheen iaershut deaels +10...20 daemaege-a aegaeeenst fues veet mure-a thun 50% Heaelt.','(10 secunds.) Aelleees in iaershut du +10...20 daemaege-a veet zeeur next aettaeck skeell. Daemaege-a bunoos oonly aeppleees tu fues veet mure-a thun 50% Heaelt.'],
3149=>['Mendeeng Reffraeeen (PfP)','Fur 15 secunds, yuoo haefe-a +2...3 Heaelt regeneraeshun. Thees ichu is reaeppleeed ifery teeme-a a chunt oor shuoot inds oon yuoo.','(15 secunds.) Yuoo gaeeen +2...3 Heaelt regeneraeshun. Renooael: vhenefer a chunt oor shuoot inds oon yuoo.'],
3151=>['Impaethy (PfP)','Fur 5...15 secunds, vhenefer taerget fue-a aettaecks, thaet fue-a taekes 15...45 daemaege-a.','(5...15 secunds.) Taerget fue-a taekes 15...45 daemaege-a vhenefer it aettaecks.'],
3152=>['Creeppleeng Ungooeesh (PfP)','Fur 5...20 secunds, taerget mufes 50% slooer und sooffffers -2...6 Heaelt degeneraeshun.','(5...20 secunds.) Taerget fue-a mufes 50% slooer und haes -2...6 Heaelt degeneraeshun.'],
3156=>['Suldeeer\'s Stunce-a (PfP)','Fur 4...10 secunds, yuoo aettaeck 33% faester vheele-a under zee iffffects ooff a shuoot oor chunt.','(4...10 secunds.) Yuoo aettaeck 33% faester vheele-a under zee iffffects ooff a shuoot oor chunt.'],
3157=>['Destroocteefe-a Vaes Glaeeefe-a (PfP)','Huld Glaeeefe-a\'s aeshes fur up tu 30...60 secunds. Vheele-a yuoo huld her aeshes, aell Reetooaeleest skeells haefe-a 10% aermur penetraeshun. Vhee yuoo drup her aeshes, aell fues in zee aerea aere-a stroock fur 15...85 leeghtneeng daemaege-a.','(30...60 secunds.) Yuoor Reetooaeleest skeells haefe-a 10% aermur penetraeshun. Drup iffffect: deaels 15...85 leeghtneeng daemaege-a tu aell fues in zee aerea.'],
3179=>['Muntra ooff Seegnets (PfP)','Fur 10...40 secunds, yuoo haefe-a +3 aermur fur iaech seegnet yuoo haefe-a iqooeepped. Vhenefer yuoo use-a a seegnet, yuoo gaeeen 5...60 Heaelt.','(10...40 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +3 aermur fur iaech seegnet. Yuoo gaeeen 5...60 Heaelt iaech teeme-a yuoo use-a a seegnet.'],
3180=>['Shaetter Delooseeuns (PfP)','Remufe-a oone-a Mesmer hex frum taerget fue-a. Iff a hex is remufed, thaet fue-a taekes 15...75 daemaege-a und aell aedjaecent fues taeke-a 75% ooff thaet daemaege-a. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Remufes a Mesmer hex frum taerget fue-a. Remufael iffffect: 15...75 daemaege-a tu taerget und 75% ooff thaet daemaege-a tu aell aedjaecent fues. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
3181=>['Illooseeunaery Veaepunry (PfP)','Fur 30 secunds, yuoor melee-a aettaecks neeezeer heet nur faeeel tu heet. Insteaed, Illooseeunaery Veaepunry deaels 20...60 daemaege-a tu yuoor taergets fur iaech melee-a aettaeck.','(30 secunds.) Deaels 20...60 daemaege-a tu fues in plaece-a ooff oozeer daemaege-a oor iffffects frum melee-a aettaecks. Yuoor melee-a aettaecks neeezeer heet nur faeeel tu heet.'],
3183=>['Meegraeeene-a (PfP)','Fur 4...16 secunds, taerget fue-a sooffffers -1...8 Heaelt degeneraeshun und taekes 100% lunger tu aecteefaete-a skeells.','(4...16 secunds.) Cooses -1...8 Heaelt degeneraeshun und duoobles skeell aecteefaeshun teeme-a.'],
3184=>['Aeccoomoolaeted Paeeen (PfP)','Taerget fue-a taekes 10...35 daemaege-a. Iff taerget fue-a is sooffffereeng frum 2 oor mure-a hexes, thaet fue-a sooffffers a Deep Vuoond fur 5...20 secunds.','Deaels 10...35 daemaege-a. Inffleects Deep Vuoond cundeeshun (5...20 secunds) iff taerget fue-a haes 2 oor mure-a hexes. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
3185=>['Psycheec Instaebeeleety (PfP)','Interroopts zee taerget fue-a\'s aecshun. Iff thaet aecshun is a skeell, thaet fue-a und aell aedjaecent fues aere-a knucked doon fur 2...3 secunds. (50% faeeeloore-a chunce-a veet Faest Caesteeng 4 oor less.)','Interroopts un aecshun. Interroopshun iffffect: iff zee aecshun is a skeell, cooses knuckdoon fur 2...3 secunds oon taerget fue-a und aell aedjaecent fues. 50% faeeeloore-a chunce-a unless Faest Caesteeng 5 oor heegher.'],
3186=>['Shaered Boordee (PfP)','Fur 5...20 secunds, taerget fue-a und aell fues in zee aerea aettaeck, caest spells, und mufe-a 33% slooer.','Aelsu hexes fues in zee aerea ooff yuoor taerget (5...20 secunds). Zeese-a fues aettaeck, caest spells, und mufe-a 33% slooer.'],
3187=>['Stulee Speed (PfP)','Fur 1...10 secunds, spells caest by zee taerget fue-a und aell aedjaecent fues taeke-a 100% lunger tu caest. Spells yuoo caest thaet taerget zeese-a fues taeke-a 50% less teeme-a tu caest. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Aelsu hexes aedjaecent fues (1...10 secunds). Duoobles spell caesteeng teeme-a. Spells yuoo caest oon hexed fues haefe-a -50% caesteeng teeme-a.'],
3188=>['Unnaetoorael Seegnet (PfP)','Taerget fue-a taekes 10...60 daemaege-a. Iff thaet fue-a is under zee iffffects ooff a hex oor inchuntment, fues aedjaecent tu yuoor taerget taeke-a 10...60 daemaege-a. Aell yuoor nun-Mesmer skeells ixcept seegnets aere-a deesaebled fur 10 secunds.','Deaels 10...60 daemaege-a. Deaels 10...60 daemaege-a tu oozeer aedjaecent fues iff zee taerget is hexed oor inchunted. Yuoor nun-Mesmer skeells ixcept seegnets aere-a deesaebled (10 secunds).'],
3189=>['Spureetooael Paeeen (PfP)','Taerget fue-a taekes 5...40 daemaege-a. Aell husteele-a soommuned creaetoores in zee aerea ooff thaet fue-a taeke-a 25...125 daemaege-a. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Deaels 5...40 daemaege-a. Deaels 25...125 daemaege-a tu husteele-a soommuned creaetoores in zee aerea ooff taerget fue-a.'],
3190=>['Froostraeshun (PfP)','Fur 5...20 secunds, taerget fue-a caests spells 50% slooer und taekes 5...50 daemaege-a vhenefer interroopted.','(5...20 secunds.) Cooses 50% slooer spell caesteeng. Taerget fue-a taekes 5...50 daemaege-a vhenefer interroopted. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
3191=>['Meestroost (PfP)','Fur 6 secunds, zee next spell thaet taerget fue-a caests oon oone-a ooff yuoor aelleees faeeels und deaels 10...60 daemaege-a tu thaet fue-a und 75% ooff thaet daemaege-a tu aell neaerby fues.','(6 secunds.) Zee next spell thaet taerget fue-a caests oon oone-a ooff yuoor aelleees faeeels und deaels 10...60 daemaege-a tu taerget und 75% ooff thaet daemaege-a tu neaerby fues.'],
3192=>['Inchunter\'s Cunoondroom (PfP)','Fur 10 secunds, taerget fue-a caests inchuntments 100...200% slooer. Iff taerget fue-a is nut under zee iffffects ooff un inchuntment vhee thees hex is aeppleeed, thaet fue-a taekes 10...100 daemaege-a und aell aedjaecent fues taeke-a 75% ooff thaet daemaege-a.','Cooses 100...200% slooer inchuntment caesteeng (10 secunds). Ineeteeael iffffect: iff taerget fue-a is nut inchunted deaels 10...100 daemaege-a tu taerget und 75% ooff thaet daemaege-a tu aedjaecent fues.'],
3193=>['Seegnet ooff Cloomseeness (PfP)','Iff taerget fue-a is aettaeckeeng, thaet fue-a und aell aedjaecent fues aere-a interroopted und taeke-a 15...60 daemaege-a. Uny fues useeng aettaeck skeells aere-a knucked doon.','Interroopts un aettaeck fur taerget fue-a und aell aedjaecent fues. Interroopshun iffffect: deaels 15...60 daemaege-a; knucks doon fues useeng aettaeck skeells.'],
3194=>['Murrur ooff Deesenchuntment (PfP)','Remufe-a oone-a inchuntment frum taerget fue-a. Aell ooff thaet fue-a\'s paerty members aelsu luse-a thaet saeme-a inchuntment.','Remufes oone-a inchuntment frum taerget fue-a. Thaet fue-a\'s paerty members aelsu luse-a thees inchuntment.'],
3195=>['Vundereeng Iye-a (PfP)','Fur 4 secunds, zee next teeme-a taerget fue-a aettaecks, thaet aettaeck is interroopted und aell neaerby fues taeke-a 10...92 daemaege-a.','(4 secunds.) Interroopts taerget fue-a\'s next aettaeck. Interroopshun iffffect: 10...92 daemaege-a tu neaerby fues.'],
3196=>['Caelcoolaeted Reesk (PfP)','Fur 3...12 secunds, taerget fue-a\'s aettaecks du +10 daemaege-a, boot zeere-a is a 50% chunce-a thaet zee daemaege-a frum iaech aettaeck veell be-a dune-a tu thaet fue-a insteaed. (Maexeemoom 15...60 daemaege-a.)','Taerget fue-a dues +10 daemaege-a veet aettaecks (3...12 secunds). Zeere-a is a 50% chunce-a thaet zee daemaege-a frum iaech aettaeck (maexeemoom 15...60) veell be-a dune-a tu thaet fue-a insteaed. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
3204=>['Deffy Paeeen (PfP)','Fur 20 secunds, yuoo haefe-a un aeddeeshunael 90...300 Heaelt und un aeddeeshunael 20 aermur.','(20 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +90...300 maexeemoom Heaelt und +20 aermur.'],
3232=>['Heael Paerty (PfP)','Heael inture-a paerty fur 30...75 Heaelt.','Heaels inture-a paerty fur 30...75.'],
3233=>['Spueel Feectur (PfP)','Fur 3...15 secunds, vhenefer taerget fue-a aettaecks oor caests a spell oon a creaetoore-a veet less Heaelt thaet fue-a luses 15...75 Heaelt.','(3...15 secunds.) Cooses 15...75 Heaelt luss vhenefer taerget fue-a aettaecks oor caests spells oon a creaetoore-a veet less Heaelt.'],
3234=>['Feeseeuns ooff Regret (PfP)','Fur 10 secunds, taerget fue-a und aedjaecent fues taeke-a 10...30 daemaege-a vhenefer zeey use-a a skeell und 5...40 aeddeeshunael daemaege-a iff nut under zee iffffects ooff unuzeer Mesmer hex.','Aelsu hexes fues aedjaecent tu taerget (10 secunds). Zeese-a fues taeke-a 10...30 daemaege-a vhenefer zeey use-a a skeell und 5...40 aeddeeshunael daemaege-a iff nut under zee iffffects ooff unuzeer Mesmer hex.'],
3251=>['Fux Fungs (PfP)','Moost fulloo a leaed aettaeck. Fux Fungs cunnut be-a blucked und streekes fur +10...25 daemaege-a iff it heets. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Deaels +10...25 daemaege-a. Unbluckaeble-a. Moost fulloo a leaed aettaeck.'],
3252=>['Veeld Streeke-a (PfP)','Moost fulloo a leaed aettaeck. Iff it heets, thees aettaeck streekes fur +10...35 daemaege-a und uny stunce-a beeeng used by taerget fue-a inds. Thees aettaeck cunnut be-a blucked. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Deaels +10...35 daemaege-a. Remufes taerget fue-a\'s stunce-a. Unbluckaeble-a. Moost fulloo a leaed aettaeck.'],
3263=>['Buneesheeng Streeke-a (PfP)','Iff it heets, thees aettaeck deaels 10...60 huly daemaege-a. It deaels duooble-a daemaege-a tu soommuned creaetoores. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Deaels 10...60 huly daemaege-a. Deaels duooble-a daemaege-a tu soommuned creaetoores. Bork! Bork! Bork!'],
3264=>['Tveen Muun Sveep (PfP)','Yuoo luse-a 1 Derfeesh inchuntment und gaeeen 10...20 Heaelt. Iff un inchuntment is lust in thees vaey, yuoo cunnut be-a blucked, yuoo streeke-a tveece-a, veet iaech streeke-a dueeng 25% less daemaege-a thun nurmael, und yuoo gaeeen un aeddeeshunael 10...30 Heaelt.','Remufe-a 1 ooff yuoor Derfeesh inchuntments. Gaeeen 10...20 Heaelt. Remufael iffffect: unbluckaeble-a, aettaeck tveece-a, iaech streeke-a dueeng 25% less daemaege-a, und gaeeen 10...30 mure-a Heaelt.'],
3265=>['Irreseesteeble-a Sveep (PfP)','Deael +3...15 daemaege-a und luse-a 1 Derfeesh inchuntment. Iff yuoo luse-a un inchuntment in thees vaey, Irreseesteeble-a Sveep cunnut be-a blucked und remufes a stunce-a.','Deaels +3...15 daemaege-a. Remufe-a 1 ooff yuoor Derfeesh inchuntments. Remufael iffffect: unbluckaeble-a, remufes a stunce-a.'],
3266=>['Peeuoos Aessoolt (PfP)','Yuoo remufe-a 1 Derfeesh inchuntment. Iff a Derfeesh inchuntment vaes remufed, thees skeell rechaerges 75% faester und aedjaecent fues taeke-a 15...40 daemaege-a.','Remufes 1 ooff yuoor Derfeesh inchuntments. Remufael Iffffect: thees skeell rechaerges 75% faester und aedjaecent fues taeke-a 15...40 daemaege-a.'],
3269=>['Gooeedeeng Hunds (PfP)','Fur 20 secunds, yuoor next 0...3 aettaecks cunnut be-a blucked. Vhee aecteefaeted, thees skeell remufes zee Bleendness cundeeshun.','(20 secunds.) Yuoor next 0...3 aettaecks cunnut be-a blucked. Ineeteeael iffffect: remufes Bleendness.'],
3270=>['Aefaetaer ooff Dvaeyna (PfP)','Fur 10...90 secunds, yuoor aettaecks deael huly daemaege-a. Vhenefer yuoo use-a a Derfeesh aettaeck skeell, yuoo luse-a 1 hex. Vhenefer yuoo luse-a a Derfeesh inchuntment, yuoo aere-a heaeled fur 5...50 Heaelt. Thees skeell is deesaebled fur 45 secunds.','(10...90 secunds.) Deael huly daemaege-a. Yuoo luse-a 1 hex vhenefer yuoo use-a a Derfeesh aettaeck skeell. Heael yuoorselff fur 5...50 Heaelt vhenefer yuoo luse-a a Derfeesh inchuntment. Thees skeell is deesaebled fur 45 secunds.'],
3271=>['Aefaetaer ooff Melundroo (PfP)','Fur 10...90 secunds, yuoo haefe-a +100 Heaelt, +30 ilementael aermur, und yuoor aettaecks deael iaert daemaege-a. Vhenefer yuoo luse-a a Derfeesh inchuntment yuoo luse-a 2 cundeeshuns. Thees skeell is deesaebled fur 45 secunds.','(10...90 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a +100 maexeemoom Heaelt, +30 ilementael aermur, und yuoor aettaecks deael iaert daemaege-a. Coore-a 2 cundeeshuns frum yuoorselff vhenefer yuoo luse-a a Derfeesh inchuntment. Thees skeell is deesaebled fur 45 secunds.'],
3272=>['Mysteec Heaeleeng (PfP)','Yuoo aere-a heaeled fur 5...65 Heaelt. Aelsu heaels aell inchunted paerty members fur 5...65 Heaelt.','Heaels yuoo fur 5...65. Heaels aell inchunted paerty members fur 5...65 Heaelt.'],
3273=>['Seegnet ooff Peeuoos Restraeeent (PfP)','Luse-a 1 Derfeesh inchuntment und Creepple-a taerget fue-a 5...15 secunds. Iff un inchuntment vaes remufed, thees skeell rechaerges 50% faester.','(5...15 secunds.) Creepples taerget fue-a und remufes 1 ooff yuoor Derfeesh inchuntments. Remufael iffffect: rechaerges 50% faester.'],
3289=>['Fefered Dreaems (PfP)','Fur 5...15 secunds, vhenefer taerget fue-a sooffffers frum a noo cundeeshun, aell fues in zee aerea sooffffer frum thaet cundeeshun aes vell.','(5...15 secunds.) Fues in zee aerea aelsu haefe-a uny noo cundeeshuns thaet taerget fue-a aecqooures.'],
3346=>['Oora ooff Thurns (PfP)','Aell neaerby fues begeen Bleedeeng fur 5...15 secunds. Fur 30 secunds, thees inchuntment dues nutheeng. Vhee thees inchuntment inds, aell neaerby fues aere-a Creeppled fur 3...8 secunds.','(30 secunds.) Ineeteeael iffffect: inffleects Bleedeeng cundeeshun (5...15 secunds) oon neaerby fues. Ind iffffect: inffleects Creeppled cundeeshun (3...8 secunds) oon neaerby fues.'],
3347=>['Doost Cluaek (PfP)','Aell neaerby fues aere-a stroock fur 10...40 iaert daemaege-a. Fur 30 secunds, yuoor aettaecks deael iaert daemaege-a. Vhee thees inchuntment inds, aell neaerby fues aere-a Bleended fur 1...4 secunds.','(30 secunds.) Yuoor aettaecks deael iaert daemaege-a. Ineeteeael iffffect: deaels 10...40 iaert daemaege-a tu neaerby fues. Ind iffffect: inffleects Bleendness cundeeshun (1...4 secunds) oon neaerby fues.'],
3348=>['Lyssa\'s Haeste-a (PfP)','Fur 3...15 secunds, yuoor Derfeesh inchuntments rechaerge-a 33% faester. Vhee yuoo aecteefaete-a thees inchuntment, aell aedjaecent fues aere-a interroopted. Vhee thees inchuntment inds, aell aedjaecent fues aere-a interroopted. 50% faeeeloore-a chunce-a unless Veend Praeyers 5 oor heegher.','(3...15 secunds.) Yuoor Derfeesh inchuntments rechaerge-a 33% faester. Ineeteeael Iffffect: interroopts aell aedjaecent fues. Ind Iffffect: interroopts aell aedjaecent fues. (50% faeeeloore-a chunce-a unless Veend Praeyers 5 oor heegher.)'],
3365=>['Oonslooght (PfP)','Fur 2...8 secunds, yuoo aettaeck und gaeeen aedrenaeleene-a 25% faester.','(2...8 secunds.) Yuoo aettaeck und gaeeen aedrenaeleene-a 25% faester.'],
3366=>['Heaert ooff Foory (PfP)','Fur 2...10 secunds, yuoo aettaeck 25% faester.','(2...10 secunds.) Yuoo aettaeck 25% faester.'],
3367=>['Vuoondeeng Streeke-a (PfP)','Iff thees aettaeck heets, taerget fue-a sooffffers frum Bleedeeng fur 5...20 secunds, und yuoo luse-a 1 Derfeesh inchuntment. Iff un inchuntment vaes remufed, taerget fue-a aelsu sooffffers frum a Deep Vuoond fur 5...20 secunds.','Inffleects Bleedeeng cundeeshun (5...20 secunds). Remufes 1 Derfeesh inchuntment. Remufael iffffect: inffleects Deep Vuoond cundeeshun (5...20 secunds).'],
3368=>['Peeuoos Foory (PfP)','Remufe-a 1 Derfeesh inchuntment. Fur 1...5 secunds, yuoo aettaeck 25% faester. Iff un inchuntment vaes remufed, thees stunce-a laests tveece-a aes lung.','(1...5 secunds.) Yuoo aettaeck 25% faester und remufe-a 1 ooff yuoor Derfeesh inchuntments. Remufael iffffect: thees stunce-a laests tveece-a aes lung.'],
3373=>['Illooseeun ooff Haeste-a (PfP)','Fur 5...11 secunds, yuoo mufe-a 33% faester. Vhee Illooseeun ooff Haeste-a inds, yuoo becume-a Creeppled fur 3 secunds.','(5...11 secunds.) Yuoo mufe-a 33% faester. Ind iffffect: yuoo aere-a Creeppled (3 secunds).'],
3374=>['Illooseeun ooff Paeeen (PfP)','Fur 8 secunds, taerget fue-a haes -3...10 Heaelt degeneraeshun und taekes 3...10 daemaege-a iaech secund. Vhee Illooseeun ooff Paeeen inds oor is reaeppleeed, thaet fue-a is heaeled fur 36...120.','(8 secunds.) Cooses -3...10 Heaelt degeneraeshun und taerget fue-a taekes 3...10 daemaege-a iaech secund. Ind iffffect: thaet fue-a is heaeled fur 36...120. Inds iff reaeppleeed.'],
3375=>['Oora ooff Resturaeshun (PfP)','Fur 60 secunds, yuoo gaeeen 0...1 Inergy und aere-a heaeled fur 200...400% ooff zee Inergy cust iaech teeme-a yuoo caest a spell. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(60 secunds.) Yuoo gaeeen 0...1 Inergy und aere-a heaeled fur 200...400% ooff zee Inergy cust iaech teeme-a yuoo caest a spell.'],
3386=>['Veb ooff Deesroopshun (PfP)','Interroopt taerget fue-a. Fur 10 secunds, taerget fue-a is hexed veet Veb ooff Deesroopshun. Vhee thees hex inds, thaet fue-a is interroopted aegaeeen.','(10 secunds.) Ineeteeael iffffect: interroopts a skeell. Ind iffffect: interroopts a skeell.'],
3396=>['Leeghtneeng Haemmer (PfP)','Taerget fue-a is stroock fur 10...100 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. Leeghtneeng Haemmer haes 25% aermur penetraeshun.','Deaels 10...100 leeghtneeng daemaege-a. 25% aermur penetraeshun.'],
3397=>['Ilementael Flaeme-a (PfP)','Fur 5...20 secunds, vhenefer yuoo aepply un Ilementael hex tu a fue-a, thaet fue-a is set oon fure-a fur 1...2 secunds.','(5...20 secunds.) Inffleects Boorneeng cundeeshun (1...2 secunds) vhenefer yuoo aepply un Ilementael hex tu a taerget.'],
3398=>['Sleeppery Gruoond (PfP)','Iff taerget fue-a is Bleend oor mufeeng, thaet fue-a is knucked doon. (50% faeeeloore-a chunce-a veet Vaeter Maegeec 4 oor less.)','Cooses knuck-doon iff thees fue-a is Bleend oor mufeeng. 50% faeeeloore-a chunce-a unless Vaeter Maegeec 5 oor heegher.'],
3422=>['Teeme-a Vaerd','Yuoo creaete-a a Teeme-a Vaerd aet yuoor coorrent lucaeshun. Fur 6...20 secunds, nun-spureet aelleees in thees aerea caest spells 15...20% faester und rechaerge-a skeells 15...20% faester. PfE-a Skeell','(6...20 secunds.) Aelleees in thees vaerd caest spells 15...20% faester und rechaerge-a skeells 15...20% faester. Aelleeed spureets aere-a nut aeffffected. PfE-a Skeell'],
3423=>['Suool Taeker','Fur 3...30 secunds, yuoor aettaecks saecreeffeece-a 15...20 heaelt und deael 15...20 mure-a daemaege-a. PfE-a Skeell','(3...30 secunds.) Aettaecks deael +15...20 daemaege-a und saecreeffeece-a 15...20 heaelt. PfE-a Skeell'],
3424=>['Oofer zee Leemeet','Vheele-a yuoo maeeentaeeen thees inchuntment, yuoor spells caest 20...50% faester und rechaerge-a 40...80% faester, boot yuoo cunteenoouoosly gaeeen Oofercaest. PfE-a Skeell','Spells caest 20...50% faester und rechaerge-a 40...80% faester. Cunteenoouoosly gaeeen Oofercaest vheele-a aecteefe-a. PfE-a Skeell'],
3425=>['Joodgment Streeke-a','Aettaeck taerget und aedjaecent fues. Iaech aettaeck thaet heets deaels +13...30 Huly daemaege-a und knucks doon aettaeckeeng fues. PfE-a Skeell','Aettaecks taerget und aedjaecent fues fur +13...30 Huly daemaege-a. Cooses knuck doon oon aettaeckeeng fues. PfE-a Skeell'],
3426=>['Sefee Veaepuns Stunce-a','Fur 3...20 secunds, yuoor veaepun aettreebootes aere-a increaesed by 1...15 und yuoo aettaeck 33% faester. PfE-a Skeell','(3...20 secunds.) Veaepun aettreebootes aere-a increaesed by 1...15. Yuoo aettaeck 33% faester. PfE-a Skeell'],
3427=>['"Tugezeer aes Oone-a!"','Fur 3...15 secunds, aell paerty members neaer yuoo oor neaer yuoor pet deael +5...15 aeddeeshunael daemaege-a veet aettaecks und gaeeen +1...7 Heaelt regeneraeshun. PfE-a Skeell','(3...15 secunds.) Aell paerty members neaer yuoo oor yuoor pet deael +5...15 daemaege-a und gaeeen +1...7 Heaelt regeneraeshun. PfE-a Skeell'],
3428=>['Shaedoo Zeefft','Shaedoo Step tu taerget fue-a. Fur 5...20 secunds thaet fue-a\'s aettreebootes aere-a redooced by 1...5 und yuoor aettreebootes aere-a increaesed by 1...5. Thees skeell cuoonts aes a Leaed Aettaeck. PfE-a Skeell','Shaedoo Step tu taerget fue-a. Fur 5...20 secunds thaet fue-a\'s aettreebootes aere-a redooced by 1...5 und yuoor aettreebootes aere-a increaesed by 1...5. Cuoonts aes a Leaed Aettaeck. PfE-a Skeell'],
3429=>['Veaepuns ooff Three-a Furges','Fur 3...20 secunds, iaech nun-spureet aelly in iaershut gaeeens zee iffffect ooff a rundum Veaepun Spell. PfE-a Skeell','(3...20 secunds.) Aelleees in iaershut gaeeen zee iffffect ooff a rundum Veaepun Spell. Aelleeed spureets aere-a nut aeffffected. PfE-a Skeell'],
3430=>['Foo ooff Refulooshun','Fur 3...10 secunds, yuoo haefe-a +1...6 inergy regeneraeshun. Thees skeell reaeppleees itselff ifery teeme-a yuoo use-a a nun-Derfeesh skeell. PfE-a Skeell','(3...10 secunds.) Gaeeen +1...6 inergy regeneraeshun. Renooael: vhenefer yuoo use-a a nun-Derfeesh skeell. PfE-a Skeell'],
3431=>['Herueec Reffraeeen','Fur 3...15 secunds, taerget nun-spureet aelly gaeeens +1...3 tu aell aettreebootes. Thees ichu is reaeppleeed ifery teeme-a a chunt oor shuoot inds oon thaet aelly. PfE-a Skeell','(3...15 secunds.) Taerget aelly gaeeens +1...3 tu aell aettreebootes. Renooael: ifery teeme-a a chunt oor shuoot inds oon thees aelly. Cunnut taerget spureets. PfE-a Skeell'],
3437=>['Faermer\'s Scyzee (PfP)','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo deael +5...35 daemaege-a. Iff yuoo heet mure-a thun oone-a fue-a, thees aettaeck rechaerges instuntly.','Deaels +5...35 daemaege-a. Instunt rechaerge-a iff yuoo heet mure-a thun oone-a fue-a.'],
3442=>['Meeghty Throo (PfP)','Yuoor speaer mufes three-a teemes faester. Iff it heets, yuoo deael +10...40 daemaege-a.','Deaels +10...40 daemaege-a. Thees speaer mufes three-a teemes faester.'],
3443=>['Frenzy (PfP)','Fur 8 secunds, yuoo aettaeck 33% faester boot taeke-a 200...150% daemaege-a.','(8 secunds.) Yuoo aettaeck 33% faester. Yuoo taeke-a 200...150% daemaege-a.'],
3444=>['Hoondred Blaedes (PfP)','Fur 15 secunds, vhenefer yuoo aettaeck veet a svurd, aell aedjaecent fues taeke-a 10...30 slaesheeng daemaege-a.','(15 secunds.) Deaels 10...30 slaesheeng daemaege-a tu aell aedjaecent fues vhenefer yuoo aettaeck veet a svurd.'],
3445=>['Naetoore-a\'s Renooael (PfP)','Creaete-a a lefel 1...10 spureet. Fur 30...240 secunds, inchuntments und hexes caest by nun-spureet creaetoores taeke-a 50...75% lunger tu caest, und it custs tveece-a aes mooch Inergy tu maeeentaeeen inchuntments. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...240 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...10 spureet (30...240 secund leeffespun). Fur creaetoores in runge-a, inchuntments und Hexes taeke-a 50...75% lunger tu caest und it custs tveece-a aes mooch Inergy tu maeeentaeeen inchuntments. Dues nut aeffffect spureets.'],
3446=>['Suool Igneeshun','Vheele-a yuoo maeeentaeeen thees inchuntment, redooce-a Oofercaest aet a raete-a ooff 1...2 per secund. Yuoo und aell aedjaecent fues aere-a aeffffleected veet boorneeng vheele-a thees inchuntment is aecteefe-a.','Redooce-a Oofercaest by 1...2 per secund. Yuoo und aell aedjaecent fues aere-a aeffffleected veet boorneeng.'],
3447=>['Vaestrel\'s Vurry (PfP)','Aeffter 3 secunds, taerget fue-a taekes 20...100 daemaege-a und aell aedjaecent fues taeke-a 75% ooff thaet daemaege-a. Iff thaet fue-a sooccessffoolly uses a skeell, Vaestrel\'s Vurry inds premaetoorely und dues nu daemaege-a.','(3 secunds.) Ind iffffect: cooses 20...100 daemaege-a tu taerget und 75% ooff thaet daemaege-a tu aedjaecent fues. Nu iffffect und inds iaerly iff taerget fue-a uses a skeell.'],
3448=>['Peaece-a und Haermuny (PfP)','Taerget aelly luses 0...4 cundeeshuns und hexes. Fur 1...3 secunds, cundeeshuns und hexes ixpure-a 90% faester oon thaet aelly. Aell ooff yuoor Smeeteeng Praeyers aere-a deesaebled fur 20 secunds.','Taerget aelly luses 0...4 cundeeshuns und hexes. Cundeeshuns und hexes ixpure-a 90% faester oon thaet aelly (1...3 secunds). Deesaebles yuoor Smeeteeng Praeyers (20 secunds).'],
3449=>['Prutectur\'s Streeke-a (PfP)','Iff thees aettaeck streekes a mufeeng fue-a, yuoo streeke-a fur 10...40 mure-a daemaege-a.','Deaels +10...40 daemaege-a iff taerget is mufeeng.'],
3450=>['Creeppleeng Shut (PfP)','Iff Creeppleeng Shut heets, yuoor taerget becumes Creeppled fur 4...14 secunds. Thees aettaeck cunnut be-a blucked.','Unbluckaeble-a. Inffleects Creeppled cundeeshun (4...14 secunds).'],
3451=>['Ootyoogh\'s Cry (PfP)','Fur 5...15 secunds, yuoor uneemael cumpuneeun gaeeens +24 aermur und cunnut be-a blucked. Bork! Bork! Bork!','(5...15 secunds.) Yuoor pet haes +24 aermur und is unbluckaeble-a.'],
3452=>['Shaedoo Shruood (PfP)','Fur 2...7 secunds, taerget fue-a cunnut be-a zee taerget ooff inchuntments.','(2...7 secunds.) Taerget fue-a cunnut be-a zee taerget ooff inchuntments.'],
3453=>['Daesh (PfP)','Fur 3 secunds, yuoo roon 50% faester. Ifery 2 pueents in Shaedoo Aerts looers rechaerge-a by 1 secunds (maex 6 secunds).','(3 secunds.) Yuoo mufe-a 50% faester. Ifery 2 pueents in Shaedoo Aerts looers rechaerge-a by 1 secunds (maex 6 secunds).'],
3454=>['Sheeeld Gooaerdeeun (PfP)','Fur 1...4 secunds, aell paerty members in iaershut haefe-a a 75% chunce-a tu bluck aettaecks. Iff un aettaeck is blucked, aell aelleees in iaershut aere-a heaeled fur 10...35 Heaelt und Sheeeld Gooaerdeeun inds.','(1...4 secunds). Paerty members in iaershut haefe-a a 75% chunce-a tu bluck aettaecks. Bluck iffffect: Aelleees in iaershut aere-a heaeled fur 10...35 und Sheeeld Gooaerdeeun inds.'],
3455=>['Oospeeceeuoos Bloo (PfP)','Iff Oospeeceeuoos Bloo heets, yuoo streeke-a fur +5...20 daemaege-a und gaeeen 2...4 Inergy. Iff taerget fue-a is sooffffereeng frum Veaekness, thees aettaeck is unbluckaeble-a.','Deaels +5...20 daemaege-a und yuoo gaeeen 2...4 Inergy. Unbluckaeble-a iff taerget fue-a is Veaekened.'],
3456=>['"Cooaerd!" (PfP)','Iff taerget fue-a is mufeeng, thaet fue-a is knucked doon.','Cooses knuck-doon iff taerget fue-a is mufeeng.'],
3457=>['Prutectur\'s Deffense-a (PfP)','Fur 4...8 secunds, aelleees aedjaecent tu yuoo haefe-a a 75% chunce-a tu bluck incumeeng aettaecks. Prutectur\'s Deffense-a inds iff yuoo mufe-a.','(4...8 secunds.) Aelleees aedjaecent tu yuoo haefe-a 75% chunce-a tu bluck. Inds iff yuoo mufe-a.'],
3458=>['Preemael Raege-a (PfP)','Fur 1...9 secunds, yuoo aettaeck 33% faester und mufe-a 33% faester, boot yuoo taeke-a 200...150% daemaege-a.','(1...9 secunds.) Yuoo aettaeck 33% faester und mufe-a 33% faester. Yuoo taeke-a 200...150% daemaege-a.'],
3459=>['Melundroo\'s Shut (PfP)','Iff Melundroo\'s Shut heets, yuoor taerget begeens Bleedeeng fur 5...25 secunds. Iff it heets a fue-a thaet is mufeeng oor knucked doon, thaet fue-a taekes +10...25 daemaege-a und is Creeppled fur 5...15 secunds.','Inffleects Bleedeeng (5...25 secunds). Deaels +10...25 daemaege-a und inffleects Creeppled (5...15 secunds) iff taerget fue-a vaes mufeeng oor knucked doon.'],
3460=>['Trunqooeeleety (PfP)','Creaete-a a lefel 1...10 spureet. Inchuntments caest by nun-spureet creaetoores veetheen its runge-a ixpure-a 10...30% faester. Thees spureet deees aeffter 15...120 secunds.','Creaetes a lefel 1...10 spureet (15...120 secund leeffespun). Inchuntments ixpure-a 10...30% faester oon creaetoores in runge-a. Dues nut aeffffect spureets.'],
3461=>['Suool Tveesteeng (PfP)','Fur 5...45 secunds, yuoor Beendeeng Reetooaels cust 15 less Inergy (meeneemoom 5) und rechaerge-a 25...50% faester. Suool Tveesteeng inds aeffter 1...3 Beendeeng Reetooaels.','(5...45 secunds.) Yuoor Beendeeng Reetooaels cust 15 less Inergy (meeneemoom 5) und rechaerge-a 25...50% faester. Inds aeffter 1...3 Beendeeng Reetooaels.'],
3462=>['Gooeeded Veaepun (PfP)','Fur 4...10 secunds, taerget aelly\'s aettaecks cunnut be-a blucked.','(4...10 secunds.) Aettaecks aere-a unbluckaeble-a.'],
3463=>['Teaese-a (PfP)','Iff taerget fue-a is useeng a skeell, thaet fue-a und oozeer fues in zee aerea aere-a interroopted und yuoo steael 0...5 Inergy frum aell fues in zee aerea.','Interroopts a skeell. Interroopshun iffffect: aelsu interroopts oozeer fues in zee aerea, und yuoo steael 0...5 Inergy frum aell fues in zee aerea.'],
3464=>['Flaeeel (PfP)','Fur 1...15 secunds, yuoo aettaeck 33% faester boot mufe-a 33% slooer. Inds iff yuoo use-a a runged aettaeck skeell.','(1...15 secunds.) Yuoo aettaeck 33% faester. Inds iff yuoo use-a a runged aettaeck skeell. Yuoo mufe-a 33% slooer.'],
3465=>['Chaergeeng Streeke-a (PfP)','Fur 1...10 secunds, yuoo roon 33% faester. Yuoor next sooccessffool melee-a heet dues +10...80 daemaege-a und thees stunce-a inds. Thees stunce-a inds iff yuoo use-a a skeell.','(1...10 secunds.) Yuoo mufe-a 33% faester und deael +10...80 daemaege-a veet yuoor next melee-a heet. Inds vhee yuoo heet oor iff yuoo use-a a skeell.'],
3466=>['Inffooreeaeteeng Heaet (PfP)','Creaete-a a lefel 1...10 spureet. Nun-spureet creaetoores veetheen its runge-a gaeeen aedrenaeleene-a 33...66% aes faest. Thees spureet deees aeffter 30...120 secunds. Bork! Bork! Bork!','Creaetes a lefel 1...10 spureet (30...120 secund leeffespun). Aedrenaeleene-a gaeeen increaesed by 33...66% fur creaetoores in runge-a.'],
3467=>['Mysteec Curroopshun (PfP)','Aell aedjaecent fues sooffffer frum Deeseaese-a fur 2...6 secunds. Fur 20 secunds, nutheeng haeppens. Deeseaese-a dooraeshun is duoobled iff yuoo aere-a inchunted vhee yuoo aecteefaete-a thees skeell. Vhee thees inchuntment inds, aell paerty members in iaershut aere-a coored ooff Deeseaese-a.','(20 secunds.) Ineeteeael Iffffect: aell aedjaecent fues aere-a Deeseaesed (2...6 secunds). Duooble-a dooraeshun iff yuoo aere-a aelreaedy inchunted. Ind Iffffect: paerty members in iaershut luse-a Deeseaese-a.'],
3468=>['Haerreeer\'s Graesp (PfP)','Fur 5...20 secunds, melee-a aettaecks aegaeeenst mufeeng fues aelsu Creepple-a thuse-a fues fur 2...9 secunds. Vhee yuoo caest thees inchuntment, yuoo aere-a releeefed ooff Creepple-a und 1 oozeer cundeeshun. Thees inchuntment inds aeffter yuoo aepply Creepple-a 1...3 teemes.','(5...20 secunds.) Melee-a aettaecks oon mufeeng fues aelsu Creepple-a zeem. Ineeteeael Iffffect: yuoo luse-a Creepple-a und 1 oozeer cundeeshun. Inds aeffter aepplyeeng creepple-a 1...3 teemes.'],
3469=>['Muraege-a Cluaek (PfP)','Fur 1...7 secunds, yuoo haefe-a a 30...60% chunce-a tu bluck incumeeng aettaecks. Vhee yuoo caest thees inchuntment, aell neaerby fues aere-a stroock fur 10...40 iaert daemaege-a.','(1...7 secunds.) Yuoo haefe-a 30...60% chunce-a tu bluck. Ineeteeael Iffffect: deaels 10...40 iaert daemaege-a tu neaerby fues.'],
3470=>['Fleeteeng Staebeeleety (PfP)','Fur 2...8 secunds, yuoo cunnut be-a knucked doon und mufe-a 25% faester. Thees inchuntment inds premaetoorely iff it prefents a knuckdoon.','(2...8 secunds.) Yuoo cunnut be-a knucked doon und mufe-a 25% faester. Inds iff knuckdoon prefented.'],
3471=>['Peeuoos Resturaeshun (PfP)','Yuoo gaeeen 80...150 Heaelt und remufe-a 1 Derfeesh inchuntment. Iff un inchuntment vaes remufed in thees vaey, yuoo aelsu luse-a 1 hexes.','Gaeeen 80...150 Heaelt und remufe-a 1 Derfeesh inchuntment. Remufael iffffect: luse-a 1 hexes.'],
3472=>['Vhurleeng Chaerge-a (PfP)','Fur 1...6 secunds, yuoo mufe-a 33% faester thun nurmael. Zee next teeme-a yuoo streeke-a a fue-a, aell oozeer neaerby fues taeke-a 10...50 culd daemaege-a und thees inchuntment inds.','(1...6 secunds.) Yuoo mufe-a 33% faester. Deael 10...50 culd daemaege-a tu aell oozeer neaerby fues zee next teeme-a yuoo heet a fue-a und thees inchuntment inds.'],
3473=>['Oora Sleecer (PfP)','Iff thees aettaeck heets, yuoo inffleect Bleedeeng fur 5...15 secunds. Iff yuoo aere-a inchunted, yuoo aelsu inffleect Craecked Aermur fur 1...10 secunds.','(5...15 secunds.) Inffleects Bleedeeng cundeeshun. Aelsu inffleects Craecked Aermur (1...10 secunds) iff yuoo aere-a inchunted.'],
];}
